rulings: ['[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'Because the "search" requires you to find a card with certain characteristics, you don\\\'t have to find the card if you don\\\'t want to.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "The sacrifice of a land is part of the cost of casting Harrow. You can\'t pay this cost more than once to get a multiple effect."}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'The two lands do not count toward your normal one land you can play each turn.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'Because the "search" requires you to find a card with certain characteristics, you don\\\'t have to find the card if you don\\\'t want to.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'The land does not count toward your one per turn limit because it was put onto the battlefield by an effect.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'Because the "search" requires you to find a card with certain characteristics, you don\\\'t have to find the card if you don\\\'t want to.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'Three Visits allows you to search your library for any card with the land type Forest, not just a card with the name Forest.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'If there are multiple attacks in a turn, then you have to pay for each attack.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'If there is more than one Propaganda on the battlefield, the cost is cumulative.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'Paying this cost is not an instant or any other kind of ability, it is an additional cost on the declaration of the attacker.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'The payment is made during the declare attackers step at the same time you are declaring the attacker.\'}, {\'date\': \'2007-02-01\', \'text\': \'In the Two-Headed Giant format, you still only have to pay once per creature.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-02-01\', \'text\': "Unless some effect explicitly says otherwise, a creature that can\'t attack you can still attack a planeswalker you control."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'It only produces one mana even if the land can produce more than one.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'The ability can be activated if the opponent has no lands that produce mana, but the effect will not be able to generate any mana.\'}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "This works even if the opponent\'s lands are tapped. It only checks what kinds of mana can be produced, not if the abilities that produce them are usable right now."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'Fellwar Stone checks the effects of all mana-producing abilities of lands your opponents control, but it doesn\\\'t check their costs. For example, Vivid Crag has the ability "{T}, Remove a charge counter from Vivid Crag: Add one mana of any color." If an opponent controls Vivid Crag and you control Fellwar Stone, you can tap Fellwar Stone for any color of mana. It doesn\\\'t matter whether Vivid Crag has a charge counter on it, and it doesn\\\'t matter whether it\\\'s untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "Fellwar Stone doesn\'t care about any restrictions or riders your opponents\' lands (such as Ancient Ziggurat or Hall of the Bandit Lord) put on the mana they produce. It just cares about colors of mana."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "The colors of mana are white, blue, black, red, and green. Fellwar Stone can\'t be tapped for colorless mana, even if a land an opponent controls could produce colorless mana."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "When determining what colors of mana your opponents\' lands could produce, take into account any applicable replacement effects that would apply to those lands\' mana abilities (such as Contamination\'s effect, for example). If there is more than one, consider them in any possible order."}]', "[{'date': '2004-12-01', 'text': 'You can get just one basic land card if you wish (or even none at all). If you get only one land card, you put it onto the battlefield tapped.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2005-10-01\', \'text\': "If you give double strike to a creature after either first-strike or normal combat damage has been dealt, it won\'t help that creature deal any additional combat damage."}, {\'date\': \'2005-10-01\', \'text\': \'If you give double strike to a creature with first strike after first-strike combat damage has been dealt, that creature will also deal damage during the normal combat damage step.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2005-10-01\', \'text\': "You must target six different creatures. If you can\'t, you can\'t cast Hex. If some of the creatures become illegal targets before the spell resolves, Hex will still destroy the rest of them."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2006-02-01\', \'text\': "This spell isn\'t modal. When it resolves, it will destroy the target if it\'s a creature or an artifact, even if it changed from one to the other between targeting and resolution."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2007-05-01\', \'text\': "A face-down creature has a mana value of 0, so Mistmeadow Skulk doesn\'t have protection from it ."}, {\'date\': \'2007-05-01\', \'text\': "While a spell with X in its cost is on the stack, its mana value takes the chosen value of X into account. Mistmeadow Skulk can be chosen as a target for a Blaze (which has mana cost {X}{R}) if X is 0 or 1, for example, but it can\'t be chosen as a target for a Blaze if X is 2 or more."}, {\'date\': \'2008-05-01\', \'text\': "The protection ability means the following: - Mistmeadow Skulk can\'t be blocked by creatures with mana value 3 or greater. - Mistmeadow Skulk can\'t be enchanted by Auras with mana value 3 or greater. It also can\'t be equipped by Equipment with mana value 3 or greater. - Mistmeadow Skulk can\'t be targeted by spells with mana value 3 or greater. It also can\'t be targeted by abilities from sources with mana value 3 or greater. - All damage that would be dealt to Mistmeadow Skulk by sources with mana value 3 or greater is prevented."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2007-05-01\', \'text\': "Creatures with reach (such as Giant Spider) don\'t actually have flying, so they can\'t block this."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2007-09-16\', \'text\': "The controller of the countered spell doesn\'t choose how many cards to draw until the relevant ability resolves. The player may draw 0, 1, or 2 cards. They choose the number before drawing any cards."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "If multiple effects modify your hand size, apply them in timestamp order. For example, if you put Null Profusion (an enchantment that says your maximum hand size is two) onto the battlefield and then put Reliquary Tower onto the battlefield, you\'ll have no maximum hand size. However, if those permanents enter the battlefield in the opposite order, your maximum hand size would be two."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': \'Exotic Orchard checks the effects of all mana-producing abilities of lands your opponents control, but it doesn\\\'t check their costs. For example, Vivid Crag has the ability "{T}, Remove a charge counter from Vivid Crag: Add one mana of any color." If an opponent controls Vivid Crag and you control Exotic Orchard, you can tap Exotic Orchard for any color of mana. It doesn\\\'t matter whether Vivid Crag has a charge counter on it, and it doesn\\\'t matter whether it\\\'s untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "Exotic Orchard doesn\'t care about any restrictions or riders your opponents\' lands (such as Ancient Ziggurat or Hall of the Bandit Lord) put on the mana they produce. It just cares about colors of mana."}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': \'Lands that produce mana based only on what other lands "could produce" won\\\'t help each other unless some other land allows one of them to actually produce some type of mana. For example, if you control an Exotic Orchard and your opponent controls an Exotic Orchard and a Reflecting Pool, none of those lands would produce mana if their mana abilities were activated. On the other hand, if you control a Forest and an Exotic Orchard, and your opponent controls an Exotic Orchard and a Reflecting Pool, then each of those lands can be tapped to produce {G}. Your opponent\\\'s Exotic Orchard can produce {G} because you control a Forest. Your Exotic Orchard and your opponent\\\'s Reflecting Pool can each produce {G} because your opponent\\\'s Exotic Orchard can produce {G}.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "The colors of mana are white, blue, black, red, and green. Exotic Orchard can\'t be tapped for colorless mana, even if a land an opponent controls could produce colorless mana."}, {\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "When determining what colors of mana your opponents\' lands could produce, Exotic Orchard takes into account any applicable replacement effects that would apply to those lands\' mana abilities (such as Contamination\'s effect, for example). If there are more than one, consider them in any possible order."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "As this is entering the battlefield, it checks for lands that are already on the battlefield. It won\'t see lands that are entering the battlefield at the same time (due to Warp World, for example)."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "This checks for lands you control with the land type Island or Swamp, not for lands named Island or Swamp. The lands it checks for don\'t have to be basic lands. For example, if you control Blood Crypt (a nonbasic land with the land types Swamp and Mountain), Drowned Catacomb will enter the battlefield untapped."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "As this is entering the battlefield, it checks for lands that are already on the battlefield. It won\'t see lands that are entering the battlefield at the same time (due to Warp World, for example)."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "This checks for lands you control with the land type Swamp or Mountain, not for lands named Swamp or Mountain. The lands it checks for don\'t have to be basic lands. For example, if you control Stomping Ground (a nonbasic land with the land types Mountain and Forest), Dragonskull Summit will enter the battlefield untapped."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'If you control more than one Oracle of Mul Daya, the effects of their first abilities are cumulative. If you control two, for example, you can play three lands on your turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'If you play your first land of the turn from the top of your library, and the new top card is another land card, you can play that one too.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "Oracle of Mul Daya doesn\'t change the times when you can play a land card from the top of your library. You can play a land only during your main phase when you have priority and the stack is empty. Doing so counts as one of your land plays for the turn."}, {\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': "If the top card of your library changes while you\'re casting a spell, playing a land, or activating an ability, the new top card won\'t be revealed until you finish doing so."}, {\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': "The top card of your library isn\'t in your hand, so you can\'t suspend it, cycle it, discard it, or activate any of its activated abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': \'When playing with the top card of your library revealed, if an effect tells you to draw several cards, reveal each one before you draw it.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2010-03-01\', \'text\': "The landfall ability triggers whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. It triggers whenever you play a land, as well as whenever a spell or ability (such as Rampant Growth) causes you to put a land onto the battlefield under your control. It will even trigger when a spell or ability causes another player to put a land onto the battlefield under your control (as can happen with Yavimaya Dryad\'s ability, for example)."}, {\'date\': \'2010-03-01\', \'text\': \'When a land enters the battlefield under your control, each landfall ability of the permanents you control will trigger. You can put them on the stack in any order. The last ability you put on the stack will be the first one that resolves.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': \'A permanent card is an artifact, creature, enchantment, land, or planeswalker card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': "If a card in your graveyard has no mana symbols in its upper right corner (because it\'s a land card, for example), its mana value is 0."}, {\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': \'If the mana cost of a card in your graveyard includes {X}, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': \'The mana value of a card in your graveyard is determined solely by the mana symbols printed in its upper right corner. The mana value is the total amount of mana in that cost, regardless of color. For example, a card with mana cost {3}{U}{U} has mana value 5.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-01-22\', \'text\': \'Multiple instances of deathtouch or lifelink on the same creature are redundant.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-01-22\', \'text\': "Vault of the Archangel\'s last ability affects only creatures you control when that ability resolves. It won\'t affect creatures that come under your control later in the turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': \'A card with Phyrexian mana symbols in its mana cost is each color that appears in that mana cost, regardless of how that cost may have been paid.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': \'As you cast a spell or activate an activated ability with one or more Phyrexian mana symbols in its cost, you choose how to pay for each Phyrexian mana symbol at the same time you would choose modes or choose a value for X.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "If you\'re at 1 life or less, you can\'t pay 2 life."}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': "Phyrexian mana is not a new color. Players can\'t add Phyrexian mana to their mana pools."}, {\'date\': \'2011-06-01\', \'text\': \'To calculate the mana value of a card with Phyrexian mana symbols in its cost, count each Phyrexian mana symbol as 1.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'An ability that triggers "Whenever you proliferate" triggers even if you chose no permanents or players while doing so.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "If a permanent ever has both +1/+1 counters and -1/-1 counters on it at the same time, they\'re removed in pairs as a state-based action so that the permanent has only one of those kinds of counters on it."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "If a player or permanent has more than one kind of counter on it, and you choose for it to get additional counters, it must get one of each kind of counter it already has. You can\'t have it get just one kind of counter it already has and not the others."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "Players can respond to a spell or ability whose effect includes proliferating. Once that spell or ability starts to resolve, however, and its controller chooses which permanents and players will get new counters, it\'s too late for anyone to respond."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "To proliferate, you can choose any permanent that has a counter, including ones controlled by opponents. You can choose any player who has a counter, including opponents. You can\'t choose cards in any zone other than the battlefield, even if they have counters on them."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'You don\\\'t have to choose every permanent or player that has a counter, only the ones you want to add another counter to. Since "any number" includes zero, you don\\\'t have to choose any permanents at all, and you don\\\'t have to choose any players at all.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "A creature controlled by an opponent that deals combat damage to another opponent will cause Edric\'s ability to trigger. The creature\'s controller chooses whether to draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': \'When a creature you control deals combat damage to one of your opponents, you may draw a card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-01-19\', \'text\': \'Edric, Spymaster of Trest is banned as a commander in Duel Commander format, but it may be part of your deck.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': \'A permanent card is a card with one or more of the following card types: artifact, creature, enchantment, land, or planeswalker.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "If the permanent is an illegal target by the time Chaos Warp tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will occur. No library will be shuffled and no card will be revealed."}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "If the revealed card is a permanent card but can\'t enter the battlefield (perhaps because it\'s an Aura with nothing to enchant), it remains on top of that library."}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': \'If the revealed card is not a permanent card, it remains on top of that library.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "The owner of a token is the player under whose control the token was put onto the battlefield. If a token is shuffled into a player\'s library this way, that player shuffles before revealing the top card of that library."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': \'Specifically, if The Mimeoplasm enters the battlefield as a copy of a creature card that enters the battlefield with a number of +1/+1 counters, The Mimeoplasm will enter the battlefield with those +1/+1 counters and +1/+1 counters equal to the power of the other exiled card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': \'The two creature cards may come from the same graveyard or different graveyards.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': \'Treat The Mimeoplasm as though it were the creature card it\\\'s copying entering the battlefield. Any "As [this card] enters the battlefield," "[This card] enters the battlefield with," and "When [this card] enters the battlefield" abilities of that creature card will work.\'}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': "You can\'t choose to exile just one creature card."}, {\'date\': \'2011-09-22\', \'text\': \'You choose which one The Mimeoplasm is copying and which one determines how many +1/+1 counters are placed on The Mimeoplasm as The Mimeoplasm enters the battlefield.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2012-05-01\', \'text\': \'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as its value.\'}, {\'date\': \'2012-05-01\', \'text\': \'If there are no nonland cards left in that library, the opponent will exile all cards from their library, and Stolen Goods will finish resolving.\'}, {\'date\': \'2012-05-01\', \'text\': "If you can\'t cast the nonland card (perhaps because there are no legal targets available) or if you choose not to cast it, it will remain exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2012-05-01\', \'text\': \'If you cast a card "without paying its mana cost," you can\\\'t pay any alternative costs. You can pay additional costs, such as kicker costs. If the card has mandatory additional costs, you must pay those.\'}, {\'date\': \'2012-05-01\', \'text\': \'You cast the card from exile. Each land card exiled this way will remain exiled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2012-05-01\', \'text\': \'You must follow the normal timing restrictions of the exiled card.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2012-06-01\', \'text\': "Gaining control of a creature doesn\'t cause you to gain control of any Auras or Equipment attached to it. However, if you gain control of a creature enchanted by an Aura with totem armor and that creature would be destroyed that turn, instead the Aura will be destroyed and the creature will survive."}, {\'date\': \'2012-06-01\', \'text\': \'Mass Mutiny can target untapped creatures.\'}, {\'date\': \'2012-06-01\', \'text\': \'The phrase "up to one" was inadvertently omitted from Mass Mutiny\\\'s rules text. The card has received errata to correct this.\'}, {\'date\': \'2012-06-01\', \'text\': "You can cast Mass Mutiny even if an opponent doesn\'t control any creatures. You simply won\'t choose a target for that opponent."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2012-06-01\', \'text\': "If you cast a card without paying its mana cost, you can\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs, such as evoke or the alternative cost provided by the morph ability. If it has {X} in its mana cost, X must be 0. However, you can pay optional additional costs, such as kicker, and you must still pay mandatory additional costs, such as the one on Fling."}, {\'date\': \'2012-06-01\', \'text\': "If you cast a permanent spell this way, it will enter the battlefield under your control when it resolves. If you cast an instant or sorcery spell this way, that card will be put into its owner\'s graveyard when it resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2012-06-01\', \'text\': \'The nonland card you cast via the triggered ability is cast as part of the resolution of that ability. Timing restrictions based on the card\\\'s type are ignored. Other restrictions, such as "Cast [this card] only during an opponent\\\'s turn," are not.\'}]', "[{'date': '2013-01-24', 'text': 'All Rats you control have deathtouch while Ogre Slumlord is on the battlefield, not just the ones created by Ogre Slumlord.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2013-01-24\', \'text\': \'If a card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as its value.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-01-24\', \'text\': "If an instant or sorcery card you cast this way goes to a zone other than exile or a graveyard, perhaps because one of its abilities says to put it into its owner\'s hand, it won\'t be exiled. This is true even if the card would be put into a graveyard later that turn."}, {\'date\': \'2013-01-24\', \'text\': \'If an instant or sorcery card you cast this way is countered, it will still be exiled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-01-24\', \'text\': "If you can\'t cast one of the target instant or sorcery cards, perhaps because there are no legal targets available, or if you choose not to cast one, it will remain in its owner\'s graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2013-01-24\', \'text\': \'If you cast a card "without paying its mana cost," you can\\\'t pay alternative costs such as overload costs. You can pay additional costs such as kicker costs. If the card has mandatory additional costs, you must pay those.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-01-24\', \'text\': "If you cast an instant or sorcery spell with cipher this way, you may exile the card encoded on a creature you control. If you can\'t, or if you choose not to, the card will end up exiled but not encoded on a creature."}, {\'date\': \'2013-01-24\', \'text\': \'When casting an instant or sorcery card this way, ignore timing restrictions based on the card\\\'s type. Other timing restrictions, such as "Cast [this card] only during combat," must be followed.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-01-24\', \'text\': \'You can choose a number of targets up to the number of opponents you have, one target per opponent.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-01-24\', \'text\': \'You cast the cards one at a time, choosing modes, targets and so on. The last card you cast will be the first one to resolve.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': "If the countered spell had {X} in its mana cost, include the value chosen for that X when determining how much mana to add to your pool. For example, if you counter a spell that costs {X}{R} with X equal to 5, you\'ll add six mana to your mana pool."}, {\'date\': \'2013-04-15\', \'text\': \'Your precombat main phase is the main phase that happens immediately after your draw step, not any other main phase.\'}]', "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'If this land enters the battlefield and you control no other lands, its ability will force you to return it to your hand.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': \'If you choose the second mode, permanents that come under your control later in the turn will not have indestructible.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': "Planeswalkers with indestructible will still have loyalty counters removed from them as they are dealt damage. If planeswalker with indestructible has no loyalty counters, it will still be put into its owner\'s graveyard, as the rule that does this doesn\'t destroy the planeswalker."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "Scry appears on some spells and abilities with one or more targets. If all of the spell or ability\'s targets are illegal when it tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won\'t scry."}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': \'When you scry, you may put all the cards you look at back on top of your library, you may put all of those cards on the bottom of your library, or you may put some of those cards on top and the rest of them on the bottom.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': \'You choose how to order cards returned to your library after scrying no matter where you put them.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "You perform the actions stated on a card in sequence. For some spells and abilities, that means you\'ll scry last. For others, that means you\'ll scry and then perform other actions."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "Activating the second ability of Whirler Rogue after a creature has become blocked won\'t cause it to become unblocked."}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "You may tap any two untapped artifacts you control, including artifact creatures that haven\'t been under your control continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "You must discard exactly one land card to cast Magmatic Insight. You can\'t cast it without discarding a land card, and you can\'t discard additional cards."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': \'Like most lands, each land in this cycle is colorless. The damage dealt to you is dealt by a colorless source.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-06-22\', \'text\': "The damage dealt to you is part of the second mana ability. It doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "A card with devoid is just colorless. It\'s not colorless and the colors of mana in its mana cost."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'Cards with devoid use frames that are variations of the transparent frame traditionally used for Eldrazi. The top part of the card features some color over a background based on the texture of the hedrons that once imprisoned the Eldrazi. This coloration is intended to aid deckbuilding and game play.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'Devoid works in all zones, not just on the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'Eldrazi Scions are similar to Eldrazi Spawn, seen in the Zendikar block. Note that Eldrazi Scions are 1/1, not 0/1.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'Eldrazi and Scion are each separate creature types. Anything that affects Eldrazi will affect these tokens, for example.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "Face-down cards in exile are grouped using two criteria: what caused them to be exiled face down and when they were exiled face down. If you want to put a face-down card in exile into its owner\'s graveyard, you must first choose one of these groups and then choose a card from within that group at random. For example, say an artifact causes your opponent to exile their hand of three cards face down. Then on a later turn, that artifact causes your opponent to exile another two cards face down. If you use Wasteland Strangler to put one of those cards into their graveyard, you would pick the first or second pile and put a card chosen at random from that pile into the graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "If a card loses devoid, it will still be colorless. This is because effects that change an object\'s color (like the one created by devoid) are considered before the object loses devoid."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "If a replacement effect will cause cards that would be put into a graveyard from anywhere to be exiled instead (such as the one created by Anafenza, the Foremost), you can still put an exiled card into its opponent\'s graveyard. The card becomes a new object and remains in exile. In this situation, you can\'t use a single exiled card if required to put more than one exiled card into the graveyard. Conversely, you could use the same card in this situation if two separate spells or abilities each required you to put a single exiled card into its owner\'s graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "If a spell or ability requires that you put more than one exiled card into the graveyard, you may choose cards owned by different opponents. Each card chosen will be put into its owner\'s graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "Once you announce that you\'re activating this ability, players can\'t respond until after you have paid its costs and completed activating it. Specifically, no one can try to remove the card from exile to stop you from activating the ability."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "Other cards and abilities can give a card with devoid color. If that happens, it\'s just the new color, not that color and colorless."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "Sacrificing an Eldrazi Scion creature token to add {C} to your mana pool is a mana ability. It doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "Some instants and sorceries that create Eldrazi Scions require targets. If all targets for such a spell have become illegal by the time that spell tries to resolve, the spell won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won\'t get any Eldrazi Scions."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "You can\'t look at face-down cards in exile unless an effect allows you to."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "Cards that are face down in exile have no characteristics. Such cards can\'t be put onto the battlefield with Oblivion Sower\'s ability."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "Oblivion Sower\'s ability allows you to put any land cards the player owns from exile onto the battlefield, regardless of how those cards were exiled."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'A landfall ability triggers whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. It triggers whenever you play a land, as well as whenever a spell or ability puts a land onto the battlefield under your control.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "If Omnath dies at the same time as any other Elementals you control, Omnath\'s last ability will trigger for each of them (and once for itself)."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "If the ability has an additional or replacement effect that depends on the land having a certain basic land type, the ability will check that land\'s type as the ability resolves. If, at that time, the land that entered the battlefield is no longer on the battlefield, use its types when it left the battlefield to determine what happens."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "Omanth doesn\'t have the land type Locus."}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'When a land enters the battlefield under your control, each landfall ability of the permanents you control will trigger. You can put them on the stack in any order. The last ability you put on the stack will be the first one to resolve.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'Even though these lands have basic land types, they are not basic lands because "basic" doesn\\\'t appear on their type line. Notably, controlling two or more of them won\\\'t allow others to enter the battlefield untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'However, because these cards have basic land types, effects that specify a basic land type without also specifying that the land be basic can affect them. For example, a spell or ability that reads "Destroy target Forest" can target Canopy Vista, while one that reads "Destroy target basic Forest" cannot.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'If one of these lands enters the battlefield at the same time as any number of basic lands, those other lands are not counted when determining if this land enters the battlefield tapped or untapped.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'If a spell with a converge ability is copied, no mana was spent to cast the copy, so the number of colors of mana spent to cast the spell will be zero. The number of colors spent to cast the original spell is not copied.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'If there are any alternative or additional costs to cast a spell with a converge ability, the mana spent to pay those costs will count. For example, if an effect makes sorcery spells cost {1} more to cast, you could pay {W}{U}{B}{R} to cast Radiant Flames and deal 4 damage to each creature.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'If you cast a spell with converge without spending any mana to cast it (perhaps because an effect allowed you to cast it without paying its mana cost), then the number of colors spent to cast it will be zero.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': \'The maximum number of colors of mana you can spend to cast a spell is five. Colorless is not a color. Note that the cost of a spell with converge may limit how many colors of mana you can spend.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-08-25\', \'text\': "Unless a spell or ability allows you to, you can\'t choose to pay more mana for a spell with a converge ability just to spend more colors of mana. Likewise, if a spell or ability reduces the amount of mana it costs you to cast a spell with converge, you can\'t ignore that cost reduction in order to spend more colors of mana."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': "If Mizzix\'s Mastery exiled multiple cards, you may cast the copies in any order. The last copy you cast will be the first one to resolve."}, {\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': \'If the copy has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': \'If you cast a spell "without paying its mana cost," you can\\\'t pay any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs, such as kicker costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': "If you don\'t cast one of the copies (perhaps because there are no legal targets available or you don\'t want to), the copy will cease to exist."}, {\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': "Mizzix\'s Mastery is still on the stack as it resolves. If you pay the overload cost, Mizzix\'s Mastery won\'t copy itself."}, {\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': \'The cards remain exiled no matter what happens to the copies.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': \'The copies are created and cast during the resolution of Mizzix\\\'s Mastery. You can\\\'t wait to cast them later in the turn. Timing restrictions based on the copy\\\'s type are ignored. Other restrictions (such as "Cast [this spell] only during combat") are not.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "Because a spell with overload doesn\'t target when its overload cost is paid, it may affect permanents with hexproof or with protection from the appropriate color."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': \'If you are instructed to cast a spell with overload "without paying its mana cost," you can\\\'t choose to pay its overload cost instead.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "If you don\'t pay the overload cost of a spell with overload, that spell will have a single target. If you pay the overload cost, the spell won\'t have any targets."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying (such as an overload cost), add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': "Skullwinder\'s enters-the-battlefield ability targets only the card in your graveyard. If that card is an illegal target as the ability tries to resolve, the ability won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. No cards will be returned to any player\'s hand."}, {\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': \'You choose the opponent as the ability is resolving. You may choose an opponent with no cards in their graveyard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-06-10\', \'text\': "Skullwinder\'s enters-the-battlefield ability targets only the card in your graveyard. If that card is an illegal target as the ability tries to resolve, the ability won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. No cards will be returned to any player\'s hand."}, {\'date\': \'2022-06-10\', \'text\': \'The chosen opponent gets to choose which card to return from their graveyard to their hand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-06-10\', \'text\': "You choose the target card as you put Skullwinder\'s triggered ability on the stack, but you don\'t choose an opponent until after you have returned the card to your hand."}, {\'date\': \'2022-06-10\', \'text\': \'You may choose an opponent with no cards in their graveyard. In that case, they will not get to return anything.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': \'If you cast a commander from your hand, the additional cost based on the number of times you\\\'ve cast it from your command zone (sometimes referred to as the "commander tax") doesn\\\'t apply. Additionally, that casting won\\\'t add to the tax if you later cast the commander from the command zone.\'}, {\'date\': \'2015-11-04\', \'text\': "If your commander isn\'t in the command zone (or you\'re not playing Commander) as the last ability resolves, nothing happens."}, {\'date\': \'2016-11-08\', \'text\': "If you have two commanders with the partner ability in the command zone, Command Beacon\'s effect puts one of your choice into your hand, not both."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you cast a commander from your hand, the commander tax doesn\'t apply. Additionally, that casting won\'t add to commander tax if you later cast the commander from the command zone."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you have two commanders with the partner ability in the command zone, Command Beacon\'s effect puts one of your choice into your hand, not both."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander isn\'t in the command zone (or you don\'t have a commander) as the last ability resolves, nothing happens."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "Because you consider only the characteristics of a double-faced card\'s front face while it\'s not on the battlefield, the types of its back face won\'t be counted for delirium."}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "If one of those creatures was enchanted, its Aura won\'t be put into a player\'s graveyard until after Descend upon the Sinful has finished resolving. If the controller of Descend upon the Sinful owned the Aura, it won\'t be in the graveyard in time to be counted for the delirium ability."}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "If you have three non-sorcery card types among cards in your graveyard at the time Descend upon the Sinful resolves, you won\'t get an Angel token. Descend upon the Sinful isn\'t put into your graveyard until after it\'s finished resolving."}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "In some rare cases, you can have a token or a copy of a spell in your graveyard at the moment that an object\'s delirium ability counts the card types among cards in your graveyard, before that token or copy ceases to exist. Because tokens and copies of spells are not cards, even if they are copies of cards, their types will never be counted."}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': \'The card types in Magic are artifact, creature, enchantment, instant, land, planeswalker, sorcery, and tribal (a card type that appears on some older cards). Supertypes (such as legendary and basic) and subtypes (such as Human and Equipment) are not counted.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "The number of card types matters, not the number of cards. For example, Wicker Witch (an artifact creature) along with Catalog (an instant) and Chaplain\'s Blessing (a sorcery) will enable delirium."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-04-08\', \'text\': "If multiple land cards are put into your graveyard at once, Crawling Sensation\'s last ability triggers only once. This could happen because an effect (such as that of Crawling Sensation\'s first ability) put them there from your library at once, or because they were destroyed at the same time (such as two land creatures that were dealt lethal combat damage)."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-06-08\', \'text\': \'You draw two cards and discard two cards all while Faithless Looting is resolving. Nothing can happen between the two, and no player may choose to take actions.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'"Flashback [cost]" means "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost" and "If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-07-13\', \'text\': \'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-07-13\', \'text\': \'If you cast a card "without paying its mana cost," you can\\\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs, such as emerge costs. You can, however, pay additional costs, such as escalate costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-07-13\', \'text\': "If you cast an instant or sorcery card this way, it goes to its owner\'s graveyard as normal. It doesn\'t return to exile."}, {\'date\': \'2016-07-13\', \'text\': "If you cast the card this way, it will resolve before the spell that caused Mind\'s Dilation\'s ability to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2016-07-13\', \'text\': \'If you cast the exiled card, you do so as part of the resolution of Mind\\\'s Dilation\\\'s ability. You can\\\'t wait to cast it later in the turn. Timing permissions based on the card\\\'s type are ignored, but other restrictions (such as "Cast [this card] only during combat") are not.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-07-13\', \'text\': "If you don\'t cast the card, perhaps because you choose not to or because it\'s a land card, it remains exiled."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': \'Abilities that trigger whenever you "become the monarch" trigger only if you aren\\\'t already the monarch. For example, if you are already the monarch as Custodi Lich enters the battlefield, its last ability won\\\'t trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': \'Being the monarch carries two inherent triggered abilities. "At the beginning of the monarch\\\'s end step, that player draws a card" and "Whenever a creature deals combat damage to the monarch, its controller becomes the monarch."\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': \'If the triggered ability that causes the monarch to draw a card goes on the stack, and a different player becomes the monarch before that ability resolves, the first player will still draw the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': \'The game starts with no monarch. Once an effect makes one player the monarch, the game will have exactly one monarch from that point forward.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "The last ability of Queen Marchesa (long may she reign) checks to see if an opponent is the monarch as your upkeep begins. If no opponent is the monarch, Queen Marchesa\'s (long may she reign) ability won\'t trigger at all. Queen Marchesa\'s (long may she reign) ability will also check to see if an opponent is the monarch as it tries to resolve. If no opponent is the monarch at that time, Queen Marchesa\'s (long may she reign) ability will have no effect."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': \'Casting the exiled card follows the normal rules for casting that card. You must pay its costs, and you must follow all applicable timing rules. For example, if you exile a creature card this way, you must wait until your main phase to cast it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "If you don\'t cast the card, it will remain in exile."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': "If you exile a land card this way, you can\'t play it."}, {\'date\': \'2016-08-23\', \'text\': \'The card exiled by the second mode is exiled face up.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "Attacking with a goaded creature doesn\'t cause it to stop being goaded. If there is an additional combat phase that turn, or if another player gains control of it before it stops being goaded, it must attack again if able."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "Being goaded isn\'t an ability the creature has. Once it\'s been goaded, it must attack as detailed above even if it loses all abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "If a creature you control has been goaded by multiple opponents, it must attack one of your opponents that hasn\'t goaded it, as that fulfills the maximum number of goad requirements. If a creature you control has been goaded by each of your opponents, the creature must attack an opponent (rather than a planeswalker or battle), but you choose which opponent it attacks."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "If the creature doesn\'t meet any of the above exceptions and can attack, it must attack a player other than the controller of the spell or ability that goaded it if able. If the creature can\'t attack any of those players but could otherwise attack, it must attack a planeswalker an opponent controls, a battle an opponent controls, or a player who goaded it."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "If, during a player\'s declare attackers step, a creature that player controls that\'s been goaded is tapped, is affected by a spell or ability that says it can\'t attack, or hasn\'t been under that player\'s control continuously since the turn began (and doesn\'t have haste), then it doesn\'t attack. If there\'s a cost associated with having a creature attack a player, its controller isn\'t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to attack that player."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "You can activate Perpetual Timepiece\'s second ability with no targets just to shuffle your library. If you choose any targets and they all become illegal targets, the ability won\'t resolve and you won\'t shuffle your library."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'An effect that instructs you to "cast" a card doesn\\\'t allow you to play lands.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Casting the card causes it to leave exile. You can\'t cast it multiple times."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "Gonti doesn\'t change when you can cast the exiled card. For example, if you exile a creature card without flash, you can cast it only during your main phase when the stack is empty."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'If you leave the game, the card remains exiled face down indefinitely. No player may look at it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "You may look at and cast that card (and spend mana as though it were mana of any type to do so) even if Gonti leaves the battlefield. If another player gains control of Gonti, that player can\'t look at or cast the card, and you still can."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "You pay the costs for the exiled card if you cast it. You may pay alternative costs such as emerge rather than the card\'s mana cost."}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "The six types of mana are white, blue, black, red, green, and colorless. Snow mana is not a type of mana. Gonti, Lord of Luxury won\'t let you pay a snow cost using mana produced by a nonsnow source."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'If a creature has been dealt damage, that damage remains marked on it until the cleanup step. If Aetherborn Marauder takes counters from a creature that has been dealt damage, that creature will be destroyed if the damage is now lethal.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "You choose which counters to move as Aetherborn Marauder\'s triggered ability resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'You may choose to move zero +1/+1 counters.\'}, {\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': \'You may move +1/+1 counters from any number of other permanents you control, not just from one.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2016-11-08\', \'text\': "Causing an opponent to lose the game after you\'ve announced that you\'re casting a spell with undaunted and determined its total cost won\'t cause you to have to pay more mana."}, {\'date\': \'2016-11-08\', \'text\': "Effects that reduce what you pay to cast a spell don\'t affect its mana value."}, {\'date\': \'2016-11-08\', \'text\': "You can\'t cast Curtains\' Call without two creatures to target. If one becomes an illegal target after you\'ve cast Curtains\' Call, the other will still be destroyed."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "A card\'s mana value is determined solely by the mana symbols printed in its upper right corner. The mana value is the total amount of mana in that cost, regardless of color. For example, a card with mana cost {1}{U}{U} has mana value 3. Ignore any alternative costs, additional costs, cost increases, or cost reductions that could apply to it. A card with no mana cost has a mana value of 0."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "Any triggered abilities that trigger while performing the Expertise spell\'s first effect won\'t be put onto the stack until after you\'re done casting your free spell. They\'re put onto the stack at the same time as any abilities that triggered while casting that spell regardless of the order in which those abilities triggered."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'Effects that allow you to "cast" a card don\\\'t allow you to play a land card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "If the Expertise spell you cast has any targets, and those targets become illegal before the spell resolves, the spell doesn\'t resolve and none of its effects happen. You won\'t get to cast a free spell."}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'If you cast a card "without paying its mana cost," you can\\\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs, such as emerge costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, such as that of Cathartic Reunion, you must pay those to cast the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': \'The card that you cast may be an artifact or creature that was returned to your hand by this spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-02-09\', \'text\': "While you\'re casting your free spell, the Expertise spell is still on the stack. It will be put into its owner\'s graveyard after the free spell is cast. The free spell can\'t target the Expertise card in your graveyard. It can target the Expertise spell on the stack, but the Expertise spell will become an illegal target before the free spell resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': \'The mana value of a split card is determined by the combined mana cost of its two halves. If an expertise spell allows you to cast a split card, you may cast either half or, if that split card has fuse, both halves.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-03-14\', \'text\': "Explore\'s effect allows you to play an additional land during your main phase. Doing so follows the normal timing rules for playing lands. In particular, you don\'t get to play a land as Explore resolves; Explore fully resolves first and you draw a card, perhaps a land you\'ll play later."}, {\'date\': \'2017-03-14\', \'text\': "If you somehow manage to cast Explore when it\'s not your turn, you\'ll draw a card when it resolves, but you won\'t be able to play a land that turn."}, {\'date\': \'2017-03-14\', \'text\': "The effects of multiple Explores in the same turn are cumulative. They\'re also cumulative with other effects that let you play additional lands, such as the one from Urban Evolution."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-03-14\', \'text\': \'Two Goblin Electromancers will make instant and sorcery spells you cast cost {2} less to cast, and so on.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "Goblin Electromancer\'s effect reduces only generic mana in the spell\'s total cost."}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "A spell with aftermath cast from a graveyard will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, it\'s countered, or it leaves the stack in some other way."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "All split cards have two card faces on a single card, and you put a split card onto the stack with only the half you\'re casting. The characteristics of the half of the card you didn\'t cast are ignored while the spell is on the stack. For example, if an effect prevents you from casting green spells, you can cast Destined of Destined // Lead, but not Lead."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': \'Each split card has two names. If an effect instructs you to choose a card name, you may choose one, but not both.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "Each split card is a single card. For example, if you discard one, you\'ve discarded one card, not two. If an effect counts the number of instant and sorcery cards in your graveyard, Destined // Lead counts once, not twice."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "If another effect allows you to cast a split card with aftermath from a graveyard, you may cast either half. If you cast the half that has aftermath, you\'ll exile the card if it would leave the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "If another effect allows you to cast a split card with aftermath from any zone other than a graveyard, you can\'t cast the half with aftermath."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "If you cast the first half of a split card with aftermath during your turn, you\'ll have priority immediately after it resolves. You can cast the half with aftermath from your graveyard before any player can take any other action if it\'s legal for you to do so."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "Split cards with aftermath have a new frame treatment—the half you can cast from your hand is oriented the same as other cards you\'d cast from your hand, while the half you can cast from your graveyard is a traditional split card half. This frame treatment is for your convenience and has no rules significance."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "While not on the stack, the characteristics of a split card are the combination of its two halves. For example, Destined // Lead is a green and black card, it is both an instant card and a sorcery card, and its mana value is 6. This means that if an effect allows you to cast a card with mana value 2 from your hand, you can\'t cast Destined. This is a change from the previous rules for split cards."}, {\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "You don\'t have to choose the same value for X while casting Earth as you did while casting Heaven."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "Once you\'ve started to cast a spell with aftermath from your graveyard, the card is immediately moved to the stack. Opponents can\'t try to stop the ability by exiling the card with an effect such as that of Crook of Condemnation."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "Desert is a land subtype with no special meaning. It doesn\'t grant the land an intrinsic mana ability. Other cards may care about which lands are Deserts."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "Dunes of the Dead\'s second ability doesn\'t allow you to sacrifice it whenever you\'d like. You must find another way to get Dunes of the Dead into the graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "If you sacrifice Dunes of the Dead to pay the activation cost of an ability, you\'ll create the Zombie token before that activated ability resolves."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "Desert is a land subtype with no special meaning. It doesn\'t grant the land an intrinsic mana ability. Other cards may care about which lands are Deserts."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': \'If a Desert has an ability with a cost of "Sacrifice a Desert," you can sacrifice that Desert to pay the cost for its own ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': \'The sacrificed Desert will be in your graveyard to be exiled by the last ability of Scavenger Grounds.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "Desert is a land subtype with no special meaning. It doesn\'t grant the land an intrinsic mana ability. Other cards may care about which lands are Deserts."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': \'If a Desert has an ability with a cost of "Sacrifice a Desert," you can sacrifice that Desert to pay the cost for its own ability.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-04-18\', \'text\': "Desert is a land subtype with no special meaning. It doesn\'t grant the land an intrinsic mana ability. Other cards may care about which lands are Deserts."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "Ramunap Excavator doesn\'t allow you to activate activated abilities (such as cycling) of land cards in your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': "Ramunap Excavator doesn\'t change the times when you can play those land cards. You can still play only one land per turn, and only during your main phase when you have priority and the stack is empty."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-07-14\', \'text\': \'When Hour of Promise checks the number of Deserts you control, it includes any Deserts you found earlier with Hour of Promise.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': \'There are many important moments in the story, but the most crucial—called "story spotlights"—are shown on cards. These cards have the Planeswalker symbol in their text box; this symbol has no effect on gameplay. You can read more about these events in the official Magic fiction at http://www.mtgstory.com.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "Auras attached to the exiled permanent will be put into their owners\' graveyards. Any Equipment will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled permanent will cease to exist."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': \'Hostage Taker has received errata to prevent it from targeting itself. The correct Oracle wording appears above.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "If Hostage Taker leaves the battlefield before its triggered ability resolves, the target permanent won\'t be exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "If a token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won\'t return to the battlefield. You can\'t cast it."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "If it\'s still in exile, the exiled card returns to the battlefield immediately after Hostage Taker leaves the battlefield. Nothing happens between the two events, including state-based actions."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "In a multiplayer game, if Hostage Taker\'s owner leaves the game while the card is still exiled and another player owns that card, the exiled card will return to the battlefield under its owner\'s control. Because the one-shot effect that returns the card isn\'t an ability that goes on the stack, it won\'t cease to exist along with the leaving player\'s spells and abilities on the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "In a multiplayer game, if a player leaves the game, all cards that player owns leave as well. If you leave the game, any spell or permanent cards you control from Hostage Taker\'s ability are exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "Once you begin to cast the exiled card, it\'s considered a new object. You\'ll control that spell and the permanent that spell becomes even if Hostage Taker leaves the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "Captain Lannery Storm\'s last ability triggers whenever you sacrifice a Treasure for any reason, not just to activate a Treasure\'s mana ability."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "If you sacrifice Treasures to cast Captain Lannery Storm, its last ability won\'t trigger for those Treasures."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': \'You can activate the mana ability of a Treasure even if you have nothing to spend that mana on.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "For example, if you have 13 life, you\'ll lose 5 life."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "If a player has 1 life, that player loses 1 life. If each player has 0 life after that, the game\'s a draw."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, each player loses a third of the team\'s life total rounded up. For example, if a team has 13 life, each player on that team loses 5 life and the team loses 10 life total."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "If a creature with trample you control would deal combat damage to a blocking creature while you control Angrath\'s Marauders, you must assign its unmodified damage. For example, a 3/3 creature with trample blocked by a 2/2 creature can have at most 1 damage assigned to the defending player. It will then deal 4 damage to the blocking creature and 2 damage to the defending player."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "If an effect such as that of Chandra\'s Pyrohelix asks you to divide damage among targets, you must divide the unmodified damage before doubling it."}, {\'date\': \'2017-09-29\', \'text\': "If you control a second Angrath\'s Marauders, damage dealt by sources you control will be multiplied by 4. If you control a third, it will be multiplied by 8, and so on."}]', "[{'date': '2017-09-29', 'text': 'You can target and gain control of an untapped creature this way.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': \'A nonland permanent card is an artifact, creature, enchantment, or planeswalker card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "Genesis Hydra\'s first ability will resolve before Genesis Hydra does. Notably, if you put an Aura card onto the battlefield this way, it can\'t enchant Genesis Hydra."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': \'If "the rest" is zero cards, either because X was 0 or because X was 1 and that card was put onto the battlefield, the library is still shuffled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "If a card in a player\'s library has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0."}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': \'If you have fewer than X cards in your library, you reveal all of them.\'}, {\'date\': \'2017-11-17\', \'text\': "If you put an Aura onto the battlefield this way, you choose what it enchants as it enters the battlefield. This doesn\'t target any permanent or player, but it must be able to enchant that permanent or player. For example, you could put a green Aura onto the battlefield enchanting a creature with hexproof controlled by an opponent, but not one with protection from green."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "Casting an exiled card causes it to leave exile. You can\'t cast it multiple times."}, {\'date\': \'2018-01-19\', \'text\': "The effect of Dire Fleet Daredevil doesn\'t change when you can cast the exiled card. For example, if you exile a sorcery card, you can cast it only during your main phase when the stack is empty."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-03-16\', \'text\': "If a creature enters the battlefield under your control and gains haste, but then loses it before attacking, it won\'t be able to attack that turn. This means that you can\'t use one Swiftfoot Boots to allow two new creatures to attack in the same turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "A chapter ability doesn\'t trigger if a lore counter is put on a Saga that already had a number of lore counters greater than or equal to that chapter\'s number. For example, the third lore counter put on a Saga causes the III chapter ability to trigger, but I and II won\'t trigger again."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "As a Saga enters the battlefield, its controller puts a lore counter on it. As your precombat main phase begins (immediately after your draw step), you put another lore counter on each Saga you control. Putting a lore counter on a Saga in either of these ways doesn\'t use the stack."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "Each symbol on the left of a Saga\'s text box represents a chapter ability. A chapter ability is a triggered ability that triggers when a lore counter that is put on the Saga causes the number of lore counters on the Saga to become equal to or greater than the ability\'s chapter number. Chapter abilities are put onto the stack and may be responded to."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "If counters are removed from a Saga, the appropriate chapter abilities will trigger again when the Saga receives lore counters. Removing lore counters won\'t cause a previous chapter ability to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': \'If multiple chapter abilities trigger at the same time, their controller puts them on the stack in any order. If any of them require targets, those targets are chosen as you put the abilities on the stack, before any of those abilities resolve.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "Once a chapter ability has triggered, the ability on the stack won\'t be affected if the Saga gains or loses counters, or if it leaves the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2018-04-27\', \'text\': "Once the number of lore counters on a Saga is greater than or equal to the greatest number among its chapter abilities—in the Dominaria set, this is always three—the Saga\'s controller sacrifices it as soon as its chapter ability has left the stack, most likely by resolving or being countered. This state-based action doesn\'t use the stack."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Guttersnipe\'s triggered ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, Guttersnipe\'s ability causes the opposing team to lose 4 life."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If multiple land cards are put into your graveyard at once, Turntimber Sower\'s first ability triggers only once. This could happen because an effect put them there from your library at once, or because they were destroyed at the same time (such as two land creatures that were dealt lethal combat damage), for example."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'If the exiled card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'If the opponent exiles their entire library without exiling an instant or sorcery card, that player stops exiling cards, and the exiled cards are put into their library in a random order.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'If you cast a card "without paying its mana cost," you can\\\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, such as that of Tormenting Voice, those must be paid to cast the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If you don\'t cast the exiled instant or sorcery card, it\'s put on the bottom of that library with the other cards."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'If you wish to cast the exiled card, you must cast it while Chaos Wand\\\'s ability is resolving. You can\\\'t cast it later in the turn. A spell cast this way may be cast at a time you normally wouldn\\\'t be able to cast a spell of that type, but other restrictions (such as "Cast this spell only during combat") are enforced.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "The opponent stops exiling cards as soon as they exile any instant or sorcery card. You don\'t choose which card type to look for."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "A spell cast using jump-start will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, it\'s countered, or it leaves the stack in some other way."}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "If a card with jump-start is put into your graveyard during your turn, you\'ll be able to cast it right away if it\'s legal to do so, before an opponent can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "If an effect allows you to pay an alternative cost rather than a spell\'s mana cost, you may pay that alternative cost when you jump-start a spell. You\'ll still discard a card as an additional cost to cast it."}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions when casting a spell with jump-start, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using jump-start only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "Electrostatic Field\'s triggered ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered."}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, Electrostatic Field\'s triggered ability causes the opposing team to lose 2 life."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "Lands you control won\'t lose any other abilities they had. They also won\'t gain or lose any land types."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "Murmuring Mystic\'s triggered ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': \'An effect that instructs you to "cast" a card doesn\\\'t allow you to play lands.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "Casting an exiled card causes it to leave exile. You can\'t cast it multiple times."}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "In a multiplayer game, if a player leaves the game, all cards that player owns leave as well. If you leave the game, any spells or permanents you control from Thief of Sanity\'s effect are exiled, and any of the face-down exiled cards remain face down indefinitely. No player may look at them."}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "Thief of Sanity\'s effect doesn\'t change when you can cast the exiled card. For example, if you exile a sorcery card, you can cast it only during your main phase when the stack is empty."}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "You can still cast the exiled card if Thief of Sanity leaves the battlefield or leaves your control. If another player gains control of Thief of Sanity, that player can\'t cast the exiled card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': \'If a spell or ability causes you to put cards into your hand without specifically using the word "draw," Niv-Mizzet\\\'s first triggered ability won\\\'t trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "If an effect instructs you to draw multiple cards, Niv-Mizzet\'s first triggered ability triggers that many times. You choose targets for those abilities after you\'ve drawn all of the cards."}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "Niv-Mizzet\'s second triggered ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered. This causes its first triggered ability to trigger, and that also resolves before the spell."}, {\'date\': \'2018-10-05\', \'text\': "Players can cast spells and activate abilities after Niv-Mizzet\'s second triggered ability resolves but before the spell that caused it to trigger does. Notably, the card you draw may be able to counter that spell."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "Activating the second ability of Rogue\'s Passage after a creature has become blocked won\'t cause that creature to become unblocked."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': \'If a creature somehow loses all of its +1/+1 counters, it can adapt again and get more +1/+1 counters.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': "Pteramander\'s activated ability can\'t reduce itself to less than {U} to activate."}, {\'date\': \'2019-01-25\', \'text\': "You can always activate an ability that will cause a creature to adapt. As that ability resolves, if the creature has a +1/+1 counter on it for any reason, you simply won\'t put any +1/+1 counters on it."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "A creature with 0 toughness doesn\'t die immediately. Rather, the creature dies the next time a player would receive priority. This means that any creatures whose toughness becomes 0 as Massacre Girl\'s enters-the-battlefield ability resolves will remain on the battlefield until just after the delayed triggered ability has been created."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "Creatures that die while Massacre Girl\'s triggered ability is still on the stack won\'t cause its delayed triggered ability to trigger since that delayed triggered ability hasn\'t been created yet."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "If more than one creature dies at once, Massacre Girl\'s delayed triggered ability triggers that many times."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "Massacre Girl\'s enters-the-battlefield triggered ability and its delayed triggered ability each affect only creatures on the battlefield at the time that those abilities resolve. Creatures that enter the battlefield or become creatures later in the turn won\'t get -1/-1 unless the delayed triggered ability triggers and resolves again later."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "Once Massacre Girl\'s enters-the-battlefield ability has triggered, it doesn\'t matter whether Massacre Girl remains on the battlefield. The delayed triggered ability will be created as the enters-the-battlefield ability resolves. "}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "A split card that\'s an instant and a sorcery card may be the target of Finale of Promise twice. However, once you cast that card once, it can\'t be cast a second time."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': \'As Finale of Promise resolves, first you cast the target instant card and/or the target sorcery card in either order. Then, if X is 10 or more, you copy each of those twice and put the copies on the stack in any order. The copies will resolve before the original spells.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': \'If a spell has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "If the spell has damage divided as it was cast, the division can\'t be changed (although the targets receiving that damage still can). The same is true of spells that distribute counters."}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': \'If the spell that\\\'s copied is modal (that is, it says "Choose one—" or the like), the copies will have the same mode or modes. You can\\\'t choose different ones.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': \'If you cast a card "without paying its mana cost," you can\\\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, such as that of Spark Harvest, you must pay those to cast the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': \'The copies that Finale of Promise creates are created on the stack, so they\\\'re not "cast." Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won\\\'t trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-05-03\', \'text\': "You can\'t choose to pay any additional costs for the copies. However, effects based on any additional costs that were paid for the original spell are copied as though those same costs were paid for the copy too."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "If an effect modifies how many +1/+1 counters you put on Nantuko Cultivator, the number of cards you draw isn\'t modified. Likewise, if an effect modifies how many cards you draw, the number of +1/+1 counters you put on Nantuko Cultivator won\'t be modified."}, {\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "You discard, put counters, and draw all while Nantuko Cultivator\'s ability is resolving. Nothing can happen between the three, and no player may choose to take actions."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "While resolving Springbloom Druid\'s triggered ability, you can\'t sacrifice multiple lands to search for more than two basic land cards."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': \'Although the Ninja is attacking, it was never declared as an attacking creature (for purposes of abilities that trigger whenever a creature attacks, for example).\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "Any cards you don\'t cast will remain in exile."}, {\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "As you activate a ninjutsu ability, you reveal the Ninja card in your hand and return the attacking creature. The Ninja isn\'t put onto the battlefield until the ability resolves. If it leaves your hand before then, it won\'t enter the battlefield at all."}, {\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "Casting an exiled card causes it to leave exile. You can\'t cast it multiple times."}, {\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "Fallen Shinobi\'s triggered ability doesn\'t change when you can play the exiled cards. For example, if a sorcery card is exiled, you can cast it only during your main phase when the stack is empty. If a land card is exiled, you can play it only during your main phase and only if you have an available land play remaining."}, {\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': \'If a creature in combat has first strike or double strike, you can activate the ninjutsu ability during the first-strike combat damage step. The Ninja will deal combat damage during the regular combat damage step, even if it has first strike.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "The creature with ninjutsu enters the battlefield attacking the same player or planeswalker that the returned creature was attacking. This is a rule specific to ninjutsu; in other cases, when a creature is put onto the battlefield attacking, that creature\'s controller chooses which player or planeswalker it\'s attacking."}, {\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': "The ninjutsu ability can be activated during the declare blockers step, combat damage step, or end of combat step. If you wait until after the declare blockers step, because all combat damage is dealt at once, the Ninja won\'t normally deal combat damage."}, {\'date\': \'2019-06-14\', \'text\': \'The ninjutsu ability can be activated only after blockers have been declared. Before then, attacking creatures are neither blocked nor unblocked.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-08-23\', \'text\': "If Scaretiller becomes tapped while casting a spell or activating an ability, that spell or ability resolves after Scaretiller\'s triggered ability has resolved."}, {\'date\': \'2019-08-23\', \'text\': "Neither mode of Scaretiller\'s ability counts as playing a land. It can put a land card onto the battlefield even if you\'ve already played your land for the turn, and even if it\'s not your turn."}, {\'date\': \'2019-08-23\', \'text\': "Scaretiller\'s ability is a triggered ability, not an activated ability. It doesn\'t allow you to tap it whenever you want; rather, you need some other way of tapping it, such as by attacking."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-08-23\', \'text\': "If a creature you control but don\'t own dies at the same time that its owner leaves the game, Thieving Amalgam\'s last ability triggers. No player loses 2 life, but you gain 2 life."}, {\'date\': \'2019-08-23\', \'text\': "If a creature you control but don\'t own dies at the same time that your life total becomes 0 or less, you lose the game before Thieving Amalgam\'s last ability can save you."}, {\'date\': \'2019-08-23\', \'text\': "In a multiplayer game, if a player leaves the game, all cards that player owns leave as well. If you leave the game, the creatures you manifested with Thieving Amalgam\'s triggered ability are exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2019-08-23\', \'text\': "In the Commander variant, you can produce mana that isn\'t of your commander\'s color identity if an effect lets you produce mana of that color or mana of any color, even though those symbols can\'t appear on cards in your deck. You may be able to turn a manifested creature card face up this way if it\'s not the same colors as your commander."}, {\'date\': \'2019-08-23\', \'text\': "Your opponents can\'t look at the card they own that you manifested."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-08-23\', \'text\': "You can activate Idol of Oblivion\'s first ability even if the token you\'ve created was created before Idol of Oblivion entered the battlefield or if the token has left the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-08-23\', \'text\': \'A permanent card is an artifact, creature, enchantment, land, or planeswalker card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-08-23\', \'text\': \'If a card in a graveyard has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-08-23\', \'text\': "If the target card is an illegal target by the time Sevinne\'s Reclamation tries to resolve, the spell doesn\'t resolve. You won\'t copy it if you cast it from a graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2019-08-23\', \'text\': "If you cast Sevinne\'s Reclamation from your graveyard, any abilities that trigger as the permanent card returns to the battlefield will resolve before the copy of Sevinne\'s Reclamation resolves but after new targets for the copy have been chosen."}, {\'date\': \'2019-08-23\', \'text\': \'The copy that Sevinne\\\'s Reclamation creates is created on the stack, so it\\\'s not "cast." Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won\\\'t trigger. The copy wasn\\\'t cast from a graveyard, so it won\\\'t make another copy of itself.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'"Flashback [cost]" means "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost" and "If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}]', "[{'date': '2019-08-23', 'text': 'If one or more creatures you control deal combat damage to players at the same time that lethal damage is dealt to Ohran Frostfang, its ability triggers for each of those creatures.'}, {'date': '2019-08-23', 'text': 'Snow is a supertype, not a card type. It has no rules meaning or function by itself, but other cards and abilities may refer to it.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Casting an exiled card causes it to leave exile. You can\'t cast it multiple times."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Escape to the Wilds doesn\'t change when you can play the exiled cards. For example, if you exile a sorcery card, you can cast it only during your main phase when the stack is empty. If you exile a land card, you can play it only during your main phase and only if you have an available land play remaining."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If you don\'t play a card exiled this way, it remains in exile."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "The additional land that you play doesn\'t have to be from among the exiled cards."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If Midnight Clock leaves the battlefield while its last ability is on the stack, it won\'t be exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Midnight Clock\'s first triggered ability triggers at the beginning of each upkeep, not just your upkeep. In a Two-Headed Giant game, an ability that triggers at the beginning of each upkeep rather than each player\'s upkeep triggers only once during each team\'s upkeep."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "Midnight Clock\'s last ability triggers after one or more counters are put onto it if it had fewer than twelve counters on it before those counters were put on it and it has twelve or more counters on it after."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You can activate Midnight Clock\'s mana ability to pay the cost of its second ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'As the first mode is performed, first the player whose turn it is chooses a card in hand without revealing it, then each other player in turn order does the same. Then all the chosen cards are discarded at the same time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'As the third mode is performed, first the player whose turn it chooses a creature they control, then each other player in turn order does the same, knowing the choices made before them. Then all the chosen creatures are sacrificed at the same time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'For each chosen mode, perform that mode in its entirety before continuing on to the next chosen mode in the order printed.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "If you really want, you can choose zero modes for Rankle\'s triggered ability, but carefully consider the hidden costs in not entertaining someone titled Master of Pranks."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, Rankle\'s second mode causes each team to lose 1 life twice."}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': \'You can choose a mode even if some or all players will be unaffected.\'}, {\'date\': \'2019-10-04\', \'text\': "You can\'t choose a mode more than once."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-01-24\', \'text\': "The second mode of Heliod\'s Intervention causes the player to gain one amount of life equal to twice X. It doesn\'t cause the player to gain X life then gain X life again."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Once you announce that you\'re activating the last ability of Bonders\' Enclave, no player may take actions until you\'ve finished activating it. Notably, opponents can\'t try to change whether you control a creature with power 4 or greater."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Once you\'ve activated the last ability of Bonders\' Enclave, it doesn\'t check again at any point whether you control a creature with power 4 or greater."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Shiny Impetus causes you to create a Treasure token, not the attacking creature\'s controller."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "Attacking with a goaded creature doesn\'t cause it to stop being goaded. If there is an additional combat phase that turn, or if another player gains control of it before it stops being goaded, it must attack again if able."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "Being goaded isn\'t an ability the creature has. Once it\'s been goaded, it must attack as detailed above even if it loses all abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "If a creature you control has been goaded by multiple opponents, it must attack one of your opponents that hasn\'t goaded it, as that fulfills the maximum number of goad requirements. If a creature you control has been goaded by each of your opponents, the creature must attack an opponent (rather than a planeswalker or battle), but you choose which opponent it attacks."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "If the creature doesn\'t meet any of the above exceptions and can attack, it must attack a player other than the controller of the spell or ability that goaded it if able. If the creature can\'t attack any of those players but could otherwise attack, it must attack a planeswalker an opponent controls, a battle an opponent controls, or a player who goaded it."}, {\'date\': \'2023-06-30\', \'text\': "If, during a player\'s declare attackers step, a creature that player controls that\'s been goaded is tapped, is affected by a spell or ability that says it can\'t attack, or hasn\'t been under that player\'s control continuously since the turn began (and doesn\'t have haste), then it doesn\'t attack. If there\'s a cost associated with having a creature attack a player, its controller isn\'t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to attack that player."}]', "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'A creature with a “partner with” ability can’t partner with any creature other than its designated partner. Losing a partner ability during the game doesn’t cause either to cease to be your commander.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Both commanders start in the command zone, and the remaining 98 cards of your deck are shuffled to become your library.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If the target player is an illegal target by the time Ukkima’s last ability tries to resolve, the ability won’t resolve. You won’t gain any life.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If your Commander deck has two commanders, you can only include cards whose own color identities are also found in your commanders’ combined color identities. If Haldan and Pako are your commanders, your deck may contain cards with blue, red, and/or green in their color identity, but not cards with white or black.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If your life total is brought to 0 or less at the same time that Ukkima is dealt lethal damage, you lose the game before the last ability goes on the stack.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Note that the target player searches their library (which may be affected by effects such as that of Stranglehold) and that the card they find is revealed, even though these words aren’t included in the ability’s reminder text.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Once the game begins, your two commanders are tracked separately. If you cast one, you won’t have to pay an additional {2} the first time you cast the other. A player loses the game after having been dealt 21 damage from one of them, not from both of them combined. Command Beacon’s effect puts one into your hand from the command zone, not both.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'The second ability represented by the “partner with [name]” keyword modifies the rules for deck construction in the Commander variant and has no function outside of that variant. If a legendary creature card with “partner with [name]” is designated as your commander, the named legendary creature card can also be designated as your commander.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'The triggered ability of the “partner with” keyword still triggers in a Commander game. If your other commander has somehow ended up in your library, you can find it. You can also target another player who might have that card in their library.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'Use Ukkima’s power as it last existed on the battlefield to determine how much damage it deals and how much life you gain. If that number is negative, it deals no damage and you gain no life.'}, {'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': '“Partner with [name]” represents two abilities. The first is a triggered ability: “When this permanent enters the battlefield, target player may search their library for a card named [name], reveal it, put it into their hand, then shuffle their library.”'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "For spells with {X} in their mana costs, use the value chosen for X to determine the spell\'s mana value."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': \'Some cards with cycling have an ability that triggers when you cycle them, and some cards have an ability that triggers whenever you cycle any card. These triggered abilities resolve before you draw from the cycling ability.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "Triggered abilities from cycling a card and the cycling ability itself aren\'t spells. Effects that interact with spells (such as that of Cancel) won\'t affect them."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "You can choose 0 as the value of X in Shark Typhoon\'s cycling cost. The last ability will trigger, and you\'ll create a 0/0 blue Shark creature token with flying. Unless something else is raising its toughness, the Shark will then immediately die."}, {\'date\': \'2020-04-17\', \'text\': "You can cycle a card even if it has a triggered ability from cycling that won\'t have a legal target. This is because the cycling ability and the triggered ability are separate. This also means that if either ability is countered (with Disallow, for example), the other ability will still resolve."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Ghostly Pilferer\'s first ability triggers during your untap step, but it\'s put onto the stack at the same time as abilities that trigger at the beginning of your upkeep step. Even though the ability triggered first, you may order it before or after other abilities you control that are put onto the stack at this time."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Once Ghostly Pilferer has been blocked, activating its last ability doesn\'t cause it to become unblocked."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'Players can cast spells and activate abilities after the second triggered ability resolves but before the spell that caused it to trigger does.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "While resolving Ghostly Pilferer\'s first ability, you can\'t pay more than {2} to draw more than one card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': \'As the triggered ability resolves, first the next opponent in turn order chooses a creature they control, then each other opponent in turn order does the same knowing the choices made before them. Then all the chosen creatures are sacrificed at the same time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "If you haven\'t gained life by the time your end step begins, the triggered ability won\'t trigger at all."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "The triggered ability looks at whether you\'ve gained life in the turn, even if Witch of the Moors wasn\'t on the battlefield when you gained life. It doesn\'t care if you also lost life, even if you lost more life than you gained."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "The triggered ability triggers just once, no matter how much life you\'ve gained."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "You don\'t have to choose a target creature card at all. If you do and the target card is an illegal target by the time the ability tries to resolve, the ability won\'t resolve. Your opponents won\'t sacrifice creatures."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If a creature enters the battlefield under your control and gains haste, but then loses it before attacking, it won\'t be able to attack that turn. This means that you can\'t use one Lightning Greaves to allow two new creatures to attack in the same turn."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "You can\'t simply unequip Equipment from a creature. If Lightning Greaves is attached to the only creature you control, you won\'t be able to attach other equipment to it (or target it with anything else) until you have another creature onto which you can move Lightning Greaves."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'Because the votes are cast in turn order, each player will know the votes of players who voted beforehand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Each player must vote for one of the candidate permanents. They can\'t abstain."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'In the unusual case that no permanents have any votes, nothing is exiled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'No player votes until the spell or ability resolves. Any responses to that spell or ability must be made without knowing the outcome of the vote.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'None of the candidate permanents are targeted. Players may vote for a permanent with protection from white, for example.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': \'Players can\\\'t do anything after they finishing voting but before the "winning" permanent or permanents are exiled.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "A landfall ability doesn\'t trigger if a permanent already on the battlefield becomes a land."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': \'A landfall ability triggers whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control for any reason. It triggers whenever you play a land, as well as whenever a spell or ability puts a land onto the battlefield under your control.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "If Scute Swarm leaves the battlefield before its triggered ability resolves, the token will still enter the battlefield as a copy of Scute Swarm, using Scute Swarm\'s copiable values from when it was last on the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "The token copy will have Scute Swarm\'s ability. It will also be able to create copies of itself."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "The token copy won\'t copy counters or damage marked on Scute Swarm, nor will it copy other effects that have changed Scute Swarm\'s power, toughness, types, color, and so on. Normally, this means the token will simply be a Scute Swarm, but if any copy effects have affected the original Scute Swarm, the token will take those into account."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': \'Whenever a land enters the battlefield under your control, each landfall ability of the permanents you control will trigger. You can put them on the stack in any order. The last ability you put on the stack will be the first one to resolve.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "An ability that triggers whenever you play a land won\'t trigger an additional time."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "Ancient Greenwarden allows you to play a modal double-faced card\'s land face, but not a nonland face."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "Ancient Greenwarden doesn\'t allow you to activate abilities (such as cycling) of land cards in your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "Ancient Greenwarden doesn\'t change the times when you can play those lands. You can still play only one land per turn, and only during your main phase when you have priority and the stack is empty."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "Ancient Greenwarden\'s effect doesn\'t copy the triggered ability; it causes the ability to trigger twice. Any choices made as you put the ability onto the stack, such as modes and targets, are made separately for each instance of the ability. Any choices made on resolution, such as whether to put counters on a permanent, are also made individually."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': \'Ancient Greenwarden\\\'s third ability affects a land\\\'s own enters-the-battlefield triggered abilities as well as other triggered abilities that trigger when that land enters the battlefield, such as landfall abilities. Such triggered abilities start with "when" or "whenever."\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': \'If a land entering the battlefield at the same time as Ancient Greenwarden (including Ancient Greenwarden itself if an effect causes it to be a land) causes a triggered ability of a permanent you control to trigger, that ability triggers an additional time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': \'If you control two Ancient Greenwardens, a land entering the battlefield causes abilities to trigger three times, not four. A third Ancient Greenwarden causes abilities to trigger four times, a fourth causes abilities to trigger five times, and so on.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': \'Look at each permanent as it exists on the battlefield, taking into account continuous effects, to determine whether any triggered abilities will trigger multiple times. For example, if you control Ashaya, Soul of the Wild, a nontoken creature entering the battlefield will cause any appropriate abilities to trigger an additional time.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': \'Replacement effects are unaffected by Ancient Greenwarden\\\'s third ability. This includes any abilities that apply "as [this land] enters the battlefield" and any ability that says the land enters the battlefield with counters.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': \'The trigger event doesn\\\'t have to specifically refer to "lands." For example, an ability that triggers "whenever a creature enters the battlefield under your control" would trigger twice if the entering land is also a creature.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "Kaza\'s cost reduction can reduce only generic mana in a spell\'s cost. It can\'t reduce colored mana requirements."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions (such as that of Kaza\'s activated ability). The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': \'An ability that triggers when a player casts a kicked spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger, but after targets have been chosen for that spell. It resolves even if that spell is countered.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "If the Equipment can\'t be attached to Thieving Skydiver, most likely because Thieving Skydiver has left the battlefield before its triggered ability resolves, the Equipment remains attached to whatever it\'s currently attached to or remains unattached if attached to nothing."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "If you copy a kicked spell, the copy is also kicked. If a card or token enters the battlefield as a copy of a permanent that\'s already on the battlefield, the new permanent isn\'t kicked, even if the original was."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "If you put a permanent with a kicker ability onto the battlefield without casting it, you can\'t kick it."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': \'Kicker represents an optional additional cost that you may choose to pay as you cast the spell. A spell cast with that additional cost paid is "kicked."\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "Some instant or sorcery spells require alternative or additional targets if they\'re kicked. You ignore these targeting requirements if those spells aren\'t kicked, and you can\'t kick those spells unless you can choose the appropriate targets. On the other hand, you can kick a permanent spell even if you won\'t be able to choose targets for an enters-the-battlefield ability of that permanent once the spell resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "The control-change effect of Thieving Skydiver lasts indefinitely. It doesn\'t wear off during the cleanup step, and it doesn\'t expire if Thieving Skydiver leaves the battlefield. In a multiplayer game, it does expire if you leave the game."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "Thieving Skydiver\'s ability can target an artifact you already control. You\'ll attach it to Thieving Skydiver if it\'s an Equipment."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "To determine a spell\'s total cost, start with the mana cost (or an alternative cost if another card\'s effect allows you to pay one instead), add any cost increases (such as kicker), then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "You can\'t pay a kicker cost more than once."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': \'Card types that can appear on cards in a graveyard include artifact, creature, enchantment, instant, land, planeswalker, and sorcery. Legendary, basic, and snow are supertypes, not card types; Vampire and Rogue are subtypes, not card types.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "Nighthawk Scavenger counts card types, not cards. If the only card in your opponents\' graveyards is a single artifact creature card, Nighthawk Scavenger will be 3/3. If the only cards in those graveyards are ten artifact cards and ten creature cards, Nighthawk Scavenger will still be 3/3."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "The ability that defines Nighthawk Scavenger\'s power applies in all zones, not just the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': \'If a permanent on the battlefield has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "If the target permanent is an illegal target by the time Feed the Swarm tries to resolve, the spell doesn\'t resolve. You don\'t lose any life. If the target is legal but not destroyed (most likely because it has indestructible), you do lose life."}, {\'date\': \'2020-09-25\', \'text\': "The amount of life you lose is determined by the permanent\'s mana value as it last existed on the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Even though the player who was dealt damage chooses the target for Bladegriff Prototype\'s ability, you are the controller of the ability."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If an opponent dealt damage by Bladegriff Prototype leaves the game before the triggered ability goes on the stack (most likely because that player\'s life total was reduced to 0 or less in combat), you choose another opponent to choose the target permanent."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Humble Defector\'s ability can be activated any time during your turn, including in response to a spell or ability."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If Humble Defector is controlled by a player other than its owner, and its controller leaves the game, the effect giving that player control of Humble Defector ends. Humble Defector will return to the control of the player still in the game who most recently controlled it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If Humble Defector isn\'t on the battlefield as its ability resolves, but the target player is still a legal target, the ability will resolve. You\'ll draw two cards, even though the player doesn\'t gain control of Humble Defector."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If Humble Defector\'s owner leaves the game, Humble Defector humbly leaves the game along with that player."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If Path of Ancestry\'s last ability produces two mana (most likely due to Mana Reflection), spending those two mana to cast creature spells that share a creature type with your commander will cause two abilities to trigger. Each of those abilities will cause you to scry 1. You won\'t scry 2. This is true whether you spend the mana on one creature spell or two."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you cast your commander with mana from Path of Ancestry, and your commander hasn\'t somehow lost all of its creature types while on the stack, you\'ll scry 1."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have a commander, Path of Ancestry\'s ability produces no mana."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander has no creature types, it can\'t share a creature type with any spell that you cast."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander is a card that has no colors in its color identity, Path of Ancestry\'s ability produces no mana. It doesn\'t produce {C}."}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "If you have two commanders, the last ability adds one mana of any color in their combined color identities. When you spend that mana on a creature spell that shares a creature type with either of your commanders, you\'ll scry 1."}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "Your commander\'s creature types are checked immediately after you cast a creature spell spending mana from Path of Ancestry\'s last ability. They aren\'t set before the game begins, and they may not be the same types your commander had when you activated that ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you copy a spell, Volcanic Torrent won\'t count the copy. However, if an effect instructs you to copy a card and then cast the copy, it will be counted by Volcanic Torrent."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "The value of X is calculated as Volcanic Torrent resolves. It will include Volcanic Torrent, spells you cast in response to Volcanic Torrent, and spells you cast prior to casting Volcanic Torrent, even if those spells haven\'t resolved yet. For example, say the first spell you cast in a turn has cascade and that cascade ability causes you to cast Volcanic Torrent. Then Volcanic Torrent\'s cascade ability causes you to cast another spell. When Volcanic Torrent resolves, X will be 3."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "A spell\'s mana value is determined only by its mana cost. Ignore any alternative costs, additional costs, cost increases, or cost reductions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'Cascade triggers when you cast the spell, meaning that it resolves before that spell. If you end up casting the exiled card, it will go on the stack above the spell with cascade.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "Due to a 2021 rules change to cascade, not only do you stop exiling cards if you exile a nonland card with lesser mana value than the spell with cascade, but the resulting spell you cast must also have lesser mana value. Previously, in cases where a card\'s mana value differed from the resulting spell, such as with some modal double-faced cards or cards with an Adventure, you could cast a spell with a higher mana value than the exiled card."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If a spell with cascade is countered, the cascade ability will still resolve normally.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If you cast a card "without paying its mana cost," you can\\\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those to cast the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'The mana value of a split card is determined by the combined mana cost of its two halves. If cascade allows you to cast a split card, you may cast either half but not both halves.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'When the cascade ability resolves, you must exile cards. The only optional part of the ability is whether or not you cast the last card exiled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'You exile the cards face up. All players will be able to see them.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have a commander, Arcane Signet\'s ability produces no mana."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you have two commanders, the ability adds one mana of any color in their combined color identities.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander is a card that has no colors in its color identity, Arcane Signet\'s ability produces no mana. It doesn\'t produce {C}."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If you don\'t have a commander, Command Tower\'s ability produces no mana."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'If you have two commanders, the ability adds one mana of any color in their combined color identities.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If your commander is a card that has no colors in its color identity, Command Tower\'s ability produces no mana. It doesn\'t produce {C}."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Each token must attack the appropriate player if able.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Exiling the card with encore is a cost to activate the ability. Once you announce that you\'re activating it, no player may take actions until you\'ve finished. They can\'t try to remove the card from your graveyard to stop you from paying the cost."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If one of the tokens can\'t attack for any reason (such as being tapped), then it doesn\'t attack. If there\'s a cost associated with having it attack, you aren\'t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn\'t have to attack in that case either."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If one of the tokens somehow is under another player\'s control as the delayed triggered ability resolves, you can\'t sacrifice that token. It remains on the battlefield indefinitely, even if you regain control of it later."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Opponents who have left the game aren\'t counted when determining how many tokens to create."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "The tokens copy only what\'s on the original card. Effects that modified that creature when it was previously on the battlefield won\'t be copied."}, {\'date\': \'2023-07-28\', \'text\': "If an effect stops a token from attacking a specific player, that token can attack any player, planeswalker, or battle, or not attack at all. If the effect stops the token from attacking a specific player unless a cost is paid, you don\'t have to pay that cost unless you want to attack that player."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-02-05\', \'text\': "Because exiling a card with foretell from your hand is a special action, you can do so any time you have priority during your turn, including in response to spells and abilities. Once you announce you\'re taking the action, no other player can respond by trying to remove the card from your hand."}, {\'date\': \'2021-02-05\', \'text\': "Casting a foretold card from exile follows the timing rules for that card. If you foretell an instant card, you can cast it as soon as the next player\'s turn. In most cases, if you foretell a card that isn\'t an instant (or doesn\'t have flash), you\'ll have to wait until your next turn to cast it."}, {\'date\': \'2021-02-05\', \'text\': "If you\'re casting a foretold card from exile for its foretell cost, you can\'t choose to cast it for any other alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs, such as kicker costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, those must be paid to cast the spell."}, {\'date\': \'2021-02-05\', \'text\': "The cost reduction applies only to generic mana in the costs of spells you cast from anywhere other than your hand. It can\'t reduce requirements of a specific color of mana."}, {\'date\': \'2021-02-05\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions (such as that of Sage of the Beyond). The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Because delve isn\'t an alternative cost, it can be used in conjunction with alternative costs, such as flashback. It can also be used to pay for additional costs that include generic mana."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Delve doesn\'t change a spell\'s mana cost or mana value. For example, Treasure Cruise\'s mana value is 8 even if you exiled three cards to cast it."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You can exile cards to pay only for generic mana, and you can\'t exile more cards than the generic mana requirement of a spell with delve. For example, you can\'t exile more than seven cards from your graveyard to cast Treasure Cruise unless an effect has increased its cost."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Path to Exile tries to resolve, the spell won\'t resolve. The creature\'s controller won\'t search for a basic land card."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "The controller of the exiled creature isn\'t required to search their library for a basic land. If that player doesn\'t, the player won\'t shuffle their library."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Pongify tries to resolve, the spell won\'t resolve. No player creates an Ape token. If the target is legal but not destroyed (most likely because it has indestructible), its controller does create an Ape token."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'"Flashback [cost]" means "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost" and "If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'Activating the ability with X = 0 will cause all creatures you control to become 0/0 and be put into the graveyard.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'Changeling applies in all zones, not just the battlefield.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "Mirror Entity\'s ability overwrites any effects that previously set a creature\'s base power and/or toughness. Any existing effects or counters that raise or lower a creature\'s power and/or toughness continue to apply to the creature\'s newly-set power and toughness."}]', "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'An ability that triggers when a player casts a spell resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger, but after targets have been chosen for that spell. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': "If you can\'t cast a card, perhaps because there are no legal targets available, or if you choose not to cast it, it will be put into your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'If you cast a card "without paying its mana cost," you can\\\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those to cast the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'When casting an instant or sorcery card this way, ignore timing restrictions based on the card\\\'s type. Other timing restrictions, such as "Cast [this card] only during combat," must be followed.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-03-19\', \'text\': \'You cast the cards one at a time, choosing modes, targets, and so on. The last card you cast will be the first one to resolve.\'}]', "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If you choose to shuffle your library, that includes the three cards you just looked at and put back on top of it.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "Breena\'s triggered ability will trigger even if you control no creatures."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'If the attacking player is one of your opponents and has less life than the player being attacked, then the condition is satisfied.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'You choose which creature to put +1/+1 counters on as the ability is resolving. Once you make the choice, no player may take actions until the counters are placed.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "Dazzling Sphinx\'s triggered ability lets you cast the exiled card during the resolution of the ability. It doesn\'t allow you to wait and cast the card later."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'If the exiled instant or sorcery card has an {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of {X}.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'You may choose not to cast the instant or sorcery card that you exiled. In that case, it will be put on the bottom of the library with the rest of the exiled cards.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "Even after the ability resolves, you may choose to not pay life rather than pay mana cost of the next spell you cast that turn. However, if you do this, you won\'t have the opportunity to pay life for any other spells you cast that turn (unless you activate the ability again)."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'If the next spell you cast has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X if you pay life rather than pay its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'If you cast a spell for another cost "rather than pay its mana cost," you can\\\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, such as that of Draconic Intervention, those must be paid to cast the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "Marshland Bloodcaster\'s ability affects the next spell you cast after the ability has resolved. If you cast any spells in response to the ability, those spells are cast as normal."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "If the target creature\'s power is greater than 3 as Access Tunnel\'s second ability tries to resolve, the ability doesn\'t resolve. However, if instead the creature\'s power is raised above 3 after the ability resolves, it still can\'t be blocked that turn."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "Once a creature with power 3 or less has been blocked, Access Tunnel\'s second ability won\'t cause it to become unblocked."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "If you play a card this way, it leaves exile and becomes a new object. If it returns to exile later in the turn, you can\'t play it again."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "You must follow the normal timing permissions and restrictions for the exiled card. If it\'s a land, you can\'t play it unless you have land plays available."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "You\'ll still pay all costs for a spell cast this way, including additional costs. You may also pay alternative costs if any are available."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "You can choose to add either {B} or {G} for each permanent destroyed. You aren\'t limited to one color."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \' Each magecraft ability has a different effect, although they all have the same trigger condition, whenever you cast or copy an instant or sorcery spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': " For example, if you control Archmage Emeritus and cast an instant or sorcery spell, Archmage Emeritus\'s magecraft ability will trigger and you will draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \' If an effect creates a copy of an instant or sorcery spell, this will also cause the magecraft ability to trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \' If an effect creates multiple copies of an instant or sorcery spell, magecraft abilities trigger once for each copy created by the effect.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \' Some effects instruct you to copy an instant or sorcery card in a zone other than the stack. These copies do not cause magecraft abilities to trigger. However, most effects that do this also allow you to cast the copy, and casting the copy will cause magecraft abilities to trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "If a player casts a spell that targets multiple permanents their opponent controls with ward, each of those ward abilities will trigger. If that player doesn\'t pay for all of them, the spell will be countered."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \' Each magecraft ability has a different effect, although they all have the same trigger condition, whenever you cast or copy an instant or sorcery spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': " For example, if you control Archmage Emeritus and cast an instant or sorcery spell, Archmage Emeritus\'s magecraft ability will trigger and you will draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \' If an effect creates a copy of an instant or sorcery spell, this will also cause the magecraft ability to trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \' If an effect creates multiple copies of an instant or sorcery spell, magecraft abilities trigger once for each copy created by the effect.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \' Some effects instruct you to copy an instant or sorcery card in a zone other than the stack. These copies do not cause magecraft abilities to trigger. However, most effects that do this also allow you to cast the copy, and casting the copy will cause magecraft abilities to trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'If you somehow control two Veyrans (which would be poetic), you casting an instant or sorcery spell causes abilities to trigger three times. A third Veyran (less poetic) causes abilities to trigger four times, and so on.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "Veyran\'s effect doesn\'t copy the triggered ability; it just causes the ability to trigger again. Any choices you make as you put the ability on the stack, such as modes and targets, are made separately for each instance of the ability. Any choices made on resolution are also made individually."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "Veyran, Voice of Duality\'s last ability causes each of your magecraft abilities, including Veyran\'s own, to trigger an additional time."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \' Each magecraft ability has a different effect, although they all have the same trigger condition, whenever you cast or copy an instant or sorcery spell.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': " For example, if you control Archmage Emeritus and cast an instant or sorcery spell, Archmage Emeritus\'s magecraft ability will trigger and you will draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \' If an effect creates a copy of an instant or sorcery spell, this will also cause the magecraft ability to trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \' If an effect creates multiple copies of an instant or sorcery spell, magecraft abilities trigger once for each copy created by the effect.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \' Some effects instruct you to copy an instant or sorcery card in a zone other than the stack. These copies do not cause magecraft abilities to trigger. However, most effects that do this also allow you to cast the copy, and casting the copy will cause magecraft abilities to trigger.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \' If a land card with an appropriate subtype is entering the battlefield from your hand at the same time as one of these lands, you may reveal the other land to have the "Snarl" enter untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \' If an effect instructs you to put one of these lands onto the battlefield tapped, it will still enter the battlefield tapped even if you reveal a land card from your hand.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \' The "Snarl" itself doesn\\\'t have any land subtypes. You can\\\'t reveal one to satisfy the ability of another.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': " You may reveal any land card with either or both of the appropriate subtypes. It doesn\'t have to be a basic land card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \' If an effect increases or decreases the cost of spells you cast, that cost increase or decrease is applied to the alternative cost you chose to pay. In that case, the cost was still paid for the purposes of the effect, even if you paid more or less for it when it was cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \' If you choose to pay one alternative cost, you can\\\'t pay any other alternative costs. For example, if an effect lets you cast a "Mastery" spell "without paying its mana cost," you can\\\'t also choose to pay its given alternative cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \' If you copy a "Mastery" spell and the alternative cost was paid, the copy will resolve as though the cost was paid.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \' In a multiplayer game, you choose which opponent takes the prescribed action as the spell resolves.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \' The mana value of a spell on the stack is determined by its mana cost, not any alternative costs you used to pay for it.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'An ability that triggers "whenever you gain life" triggers just once for each life-gaining event, no matter how much life you gain.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'Each creature with lifelink dealing combat damage causes a separate life-gaining event. For example, if two creatures you control with lifelink deal combat damage at the same time, a "whenever you gain life" ability will trigger twice. However, if a single creature you control with lifelink deals combat damage to multiple creatures, players, and/or planeswalkers at the same time (perhaps because it has trample or was blocked by more than one creature), the ability will trigger only once.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'If you gain an amount of life "for each" of something, that life is gained as one event and the ability will trigger only once.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'You may only pay {B} once for each life gain event.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied creature will trigger when Cursed Mirror enters the battlefield. Any "As [this creature] enters the battlefield" or "[This creature] enters the battlefield with" abilities of the copied creature will also work.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "Cursed Mirror copies exactly what was printed on the original creature (unless that creature is copying something else or is a token; see below). It doesn\'t copy whether that creature is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or any Auras or Equipment attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its types, color, power and toughness, and so on."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "If Cursed Mirror somehow enters the battlefield at the same time as a creature, it can\'t become a copy of that creature. You may choose only a creature that\'s already on the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'If something else becomes a copy of Cursed Mirror while Cursed Mirror is a copy of a creature, the duration of the effect is not copied. The new copy will still be a creature (with haste) after Cursed Mirror stops being a copy at the end of the turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'If the copied creature has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "If the copied creature is a token, Cursed Mirror copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that created the token. Copying a token doesn\'t make Cursed Mirror a token. Similarly, if Cursed Mirror itself is a token, copying a nontoken permanent doesn\'t make it stop being a token."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'If the copied creature is copying something else, then Cursed Mirror enters the battlefield as a copy of whatever that creature is copying.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'While it is copying a creature, Cursed Mirror does not have "{T}: Add {R}" (unless the creature it\\\'s copying also has that ability).\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': \'Cards exiled are always exiled face up unless specified otherwise by the effect that exiled it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "If you choose to play the exiled card this turn, you must still pay all costs and follow all timing restrictions required by that card. If it\'s a land, you can\'t play it unless you have a land play available."}, {\'date\': \'2021-04-16\', \'text\': "If you don\'t play the exiled card, it remains exiled. It won\'t be available to be played on future turns."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "Creating a Clue token this way isn\'t the same thing as investigating. Notably, an ability that triggers whenever you investigate won\'t trigger because you created a Clue token due to this replacement effect. If the original token creation was because you investigated once, those abilities will still each trigger once, no matter how many Clue tokens you end up creating."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "If you control eighteen Academy Manufactors (I don\'t know, you figure it out) and would create some number of Clue, Food, or Treasure tokens, you will instead create 129,140,163 times that many Clue tokens, 129,140,163 times that many Food tokens, and 129,140,163 times that many Treasure tokens."}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If you control one Academy Manufactor and would create some number of Clue, Food, or Treasure tokens, you will instead create that many Clue tokens, that many Food tokens, and that many Treasure tokens.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'If you control two Academy Manufactors and would create some number of Clue, Food, or Treasure tokens, you will instead create three times that many Clue tokens, three times that many Food tokens, and three times that many Treasure tokens.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': \'The card types that can appear in a graveyard are artifact, creature, enchantment, instant, land, planeswalker, sorcery, and tribal. Legendary, basic, and snow are supertypes, not card types; Kavu and Equipment are subtypes, not card types.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-06-18\', \'text\': "Unholy Heat checks your graveyard as it resolves to determine if it deals 2 or 6 damage. At that time, Unholy Heat isn\'t in the graveyard yet."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-07-23\', \'text\': "If a player casts a spell that targets multiple permanents their opponent controls with ward, each of those ward abilities will trigger. If that player doesn\'t pay for all of them, the spell will be countered."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "You don\'t have to choose the land card you will return to your hand until after you have milled three cards."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \' "Flashback [cost]" means "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost" and "If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \' A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': " If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': " To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \' You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': " You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "A copy is created even if the spell that caused Galvanic Iteration\'s ability to trigger has been countered by the time that ability resolves. The copy resolves before the original spell."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Galvanic Iteration\'s ability will copy any instant or sorcery spell, not just one with targets."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "If the spell that\'s copied has an X whose value was determined as it was cast, the copy has the same value of X."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'If the spell that\\\'s copied is modal (that is, it says "Choose one —" or the like), the copy will have the same mode or modes. You can\\\'t choose different ones.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'If you resolve one Galvanic Iteration after another (or cast the same one with flashback), the second Galvanic Iteration will be copied. That copy and spell each resolve, creating two delayed triggered abilities. The next spell you cast after that will be copied twice. If that spell is also a Galvanic Iteration, the following spell will be copied three times, and so on.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'The copy that Galvanic Iteration\\\'s ability creates is created on the stack, so it\\\'s not "cast." Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won\\\'t trigger.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "The copy will have the same targets as the spell it\'s copying unless you choose new ones. You may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. The new targets must be legal."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "You can\'t choose to pay any additional costs for the copy. However, effects based on any additional costs that were paid for the original spell are copied as though those same costs were paid for the copy too."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \' "Flashback [cost]" means "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost" and "If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack."\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \' A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': " If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': " To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \' You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': " You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Only you get to look at the exiled card. Its owner doesn\'t get to know what it is while it is in exile unless you tell them."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "You don\'t have to disclose which card you exiled and which card you put on the bottom of the library. For example, if your opponent knows what the top card of their library is and you cast Siphon Insight, you don\'t have to tell them where you put that card."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'You may play the card even if it is a land.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'You must still follow all normal timing rules to play a card exiled with Siphon Insight.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'After you pay the {2}{R} cost one or more times, a second ability triggers and you choose the targets for it. Players may respond to the new ability at that point. As that ability resolves, Bloodthirsty Adversary gets its counters and the target cards are exiled.\'}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': "Copies cast this way are cast during the resolution of the ability. You don\'t have to follow normal timing requirements and you can\'t wait and cast them later."}, {\'date\': \'2021-09-24\', \'text\': \'Whether or not you cast the copies this way, the original cards will remain in exile.\'}]', "[{'date': '2021-09-24', 'text': 'If you cast Electric Revelation using flashback, you must still pay its additional cost of discarding a card.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2021-11-19\', \'text\': "You must pay all costs to play cards exiled this way, and you must follow all normal timing permissions and restrictions. For example, if you play a land this way, you may do so only during your main phase while the stack is empty and only if you haven\'t yet played a land (unless another effect allows you to play additional lands)."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-02-18\', \'text\': \'Although the Ninja is attacking, it was never declared as an attacking creature (for purposes of abilities that trigger whenever a creature attacks, for example).\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-02-18\', \'text\': "As you activate a ninjutsu ability, you reveal the Ninja card in your hand and return the attacking creature. The Ninja card stays revealed and isn\'t put onto the battlefield until the ability resolves. If it leaves your hand before then, it won\'t enter the battlefield at all."}, {\'date\': \'2022-02-18\', \'text\': \'If a creature in combat has first strike or double strike, you can activate the ninjutsu ability during the first-strike combat damage step. The Ninja will deal combat damage during the regular combat damage step, even if it has first strike.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-02-18\', \'text\': \'If you cast a spell with {X} in its mana cost this way, the only legal choice for X is 0.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-02-18\', \'text\': \'Puff of smoke not included.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-02-18\', \'text\': "The creature with ninjutsu enters the battlefield attacking the same player or planeswalker that the returned creature was attacking. This is a rule specific to ninjutsu; in other cases, when a creature is put onto the battlefield attacking, that creature\'s controller chooses which player or planeswalker it\'s attacking."}, {\'date\': \'2022-02-18\', \'text\': "The ninjutsu ability can be activated during the declare blockers step, combat damage step, or end of combat step. In most cases (see below), if you wait until the combatdamage step or end of combat step, it will be after combat damage has been dealt, so the Ninja won\'t deal combat damage."}, {\'date\': \'2022-02-18\', \'text\': \'The ninjutsu ability can be activated only after blockers have been declared. Before then, attacking creatures are neither blocked nor unblocked.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-02-18\', \'text\': \'You may only cast a spell this way by paying the appropriate amount of life. You may not pay its normal cost and may not pay any other alternative costs. You may still pay for additional costs, such as kicker costs. If the spell has mandatory additional costs, you must pay those.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-02-18\', \'text\': \'You must follow all normal timing rules when casting a spell or playing a land this way. For example, you cannot normally play a land card this way if you have already played a land this turn.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "If Arcane Bombardment leaves the battlefield, the exiled cards remain in exile. If it returns to the battlefield or you play another copy of it, you won\'t get to cast copies of the cards previously exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': \'If you cast a spell with {X} in its cost without paying its mana cost, you must choose 0 for X.\'}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "If you\'ve already cast an instant or sorcery spell the turn that Arcane Bombardment enters the battlefield, it won\'t trigger until you cast an instant or sorcery spell on a later turn."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "The spell that caused Arcane Bombardment\'s ability to trigger is normally still on the stack while that ability resolves. That spell won\'t be among the cards in your graveyard when you exile an instant or sorcery from it at random."}, {\'date\': \'2022-04-29\', \'text\': "You cast the desired copies as the triggered ability resolves. You don\'t get to cast them later in the turn. You choose the order of copies as you cast them."}]', "[{'date': '2022-04-29', 'text': 'If the card was both a land and a creature (such as Dryad Arbor), you will create both a Rogue token and a Treasure token.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2022-09-09\', \'text\': "A split card in your graveyard only counts once for Haughty Djinn\'s power, even if it\'s both an instant and a sorcery."}, {\'date\': \'2022-09-09\', \'text\': "The ability that defines Haughty Djinn\'s power functions in all zones."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-09-09\', \'text\': "Hazezon doesn\'t allow you to activate abilities (such as cycling) of land cards in your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2022-09-09\', \'text\': "Hazezon doesn\'t change the times when you can play those land cards. You can still play only one land per turn, and only during your main phase when you have priority and the stack is empty."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Activating a card\'s unearth ability isn\'t the same as casting that card. The unearth ability is put on the stack, but the card is not. Spells and abilities that interact with activated abilities (such as Defabricate\'s second mode) will interact with unearth, but spells and abilities that interact with spells (such as Scatter Ray) will not."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "At the beginning of the next end step, a permanent returned to the battlefield with unearth is exiled. This is a delayed triggered ability, and it can be countered by effects such as Defabricate that counter triggered abilities. If the ability is countered, the permanent will stay on the battlefield and the delayed triggered ability won\'t trigger again. However, the replacement effect will still exile the permanent if it eventually leaves the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If a permanent returned to the battlefield with unearth would leave the battlefield for any reason, it\'s exiled instead—unless the spell or ability that\'s causing the permanent to leave the battlefield is actually trying to exile it! In that case, it succeeds at exiling it. If that spell or ability later returns the card to the battlefield (as Static Net might, for example), the permanent card will return to the battlefield as a new object with no relation to its previous existence. The unearth effects will no longer apply to it."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If you activate a card\'s unearth ability but that card is removed from your graveyard before the ability resolves, that unearth ability will do nothing as it resolves."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Perennial Behemoth doesn\'t allow you to activate abilities (such as cycling) of land cards in your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "Perennial Behemoth doesn\'t change the times when you can play those land cards. You can still play only one land per turn, and only during your main phase when you have priority and the stack is empty."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': \'Unearth grants haste to the permanent that\\\'s returned to the battlefield (even if it\\\'s not a creature card). However, neither of the "exile" abilities is granted to that permanent. If that permanent loses all its abilities, it will still be exiled at the beginning of the next end step, and if it would leave the battlefield, it is still exiled instead.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "If the targeted land is an illegal target by the time Demolition Field\'s ability resolves, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. Neither player will get to search for a basic land card."}, {\'date\': \'2022-10-14\', \'text\': "The target land\'s controller gets to search for a basic land card even if that land wasn\'t destroyed by Demolition Field\'s ability. This may happen because the land has indestructible."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2022-12-08\', \'text\': \'You must choose a legal target for each target required by Decimate. However, if a permanent has multiple card types, it may be chosen as the target for more than one instance of the word "target." For example, you could cast Decimate targeting an artifact creature, an enchantment, and a land.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "If one of these lands enters the battlefield at the same time as one or more other lands (due to Oblivion Sower or Warp World, perhaps), it doesn\'t take those lands into consideration when determining how many other lands you control."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'If one of these lands enters the battlefield under your control and you control zero, one, or two other lands, it enters the battlefield untapped. If you control three or more other lands, however, it enters the battlefield tapped.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': "If one of these lands enters the battlefield at the same time as one or more other lands (due to Oblivion Sower or Warp World, perhaps), it doesn\'t take those lands into consideration when determining how many other lands you control."}, {\'date\': \'2023-02-04\', \'text\': \'If one of these lands enters the battlefield under your control and you control zero, one, or two other lands, it enters the battlefield untapped. If you control three or more other lands, it enters the battlefield tapped.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2023-10-13\', \'text\': \'"Flashback [cost]" means "You may cast this card from your graveyard by paying [cost] rather than paying its mana cost" and "If the flashback cost was paid, exile this card instead of putting it anywhere else any time it would leave the stack."\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-10-13\', \'text\': \'A spell cast using flashback will always be exiled afterward, whether it resolves, is countered, or leaves the stack in some other way.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-10-13\', \'text\': "If a card with flashback is put into your graveyard during your turn, you can cast it if it\'s legal to do so before any other player can take any actions."}, {\'date\': \'2023-10-13\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost (such as a flashback cost) you\'re paying, add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell is determined only by its mana cost, no matter what the total cost to cast the spell was."}, {\'date\': \'2023-10-13\', \'text\': \'You can cast a spell using flashback even if it was somehow put into your graveyard without having been cast.\'}, {\'date\': \'2023-10-13\', \'text\': "You must still follow any timing restrictions and permissions, including those based on the card\'s type. For instance, you can cast a sorcery using flashback only when you could normally cast a sorcery."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "Because a spell with overload doesn\'t target when its overload cost is paid, it may affect permanents with hexproof or with protection from the appropriate color."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': \'If you are instructed to cast a spell with overload "without paying its mana cost," you can\\\'t choose to pay its overload cost instead.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "If you don\'t pay the overload cost of a spell with overload, that spell will have a single target. If you pay the overload cost, the spell won\'t have any targets."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you\'re paying (such as an overload cost), add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "The amount of life you gain from extort is based on the total amount of life lost, not necessarily the number of opponents you have. For example, if your opponent\'s life total can\'t change (perhaps because that player controls Platinum Emperion), you won\'t gain any life."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': "The extort ability doesn\'t target any player."}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': \'The extort ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. The ability resolves even if that spell is countered.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-01-12\', \'text\': \'You may pay {W/B} a maximum of one time for each extort triggered ability. You decide whether to pay when the ability resolves.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'Cards exiled with suspend are exiled face up.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'Due to a recent rules change to suspend, you are no longer required to cast the suspended card as the second triggered ability of suspend resolves. Instead, as the second triggered ability resolves, you may cast the card. Timing permissions based on the card’s type are ignored. If you don’t cast the card, it remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it’s no longer suspended.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': "Exiling a card with suspend isn\'t casting that card. This action doesn\'t use the stack and can\'t be responded to."}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'If an effect refers to a "suspended card," that means a card that (1) has suspend, (2) is in exile, and (3) has one or more time counters on it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': "If the first triggered ability of suspend (the one that removes time counters) is countered, no time counter is removed. The ability will trigger again at the beginning of the card\'s owner\'s next upkeep."}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': "If the second triggered ability is countered, the card can\'t be cast. It remains exiled with no time counters on it, and it\'s no longer suspended."}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': "If the spell requires any targets, those targets are chosen when the spell is finally cast, not when it\'s exiled."}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'If you cast a card "without paying its mana cost," such as with suspend, you can\\\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those if you want to cast the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': \'Suspend is a keyword that represents three abilities. The first is a static ability that allows you to exile the card from your hand with the specified number of time counters (the number before the dash) on it by paying its suspend cost (listed after the dash). The second is a triggered ability that removes a time counter from the suspended card at the beginning of each of your upkeeps. The third is a triggered ability that gives you the option to cast the card when the last time counter is removed.\'}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': "The mana value of a spell cast without paying its mana cost is determined by its mana cost, even though that cost wasn\'t paid."}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': "When the last time counter is removed, the second triggered ability of suspend (the one that lets you cast the card) triggers. It doesn\'t matter why the last time counter was removed or what effect removed it."}, {\'date\': \'2024-02-02\', \'text\': "You can exile a card in your hand using suspend any time you could cast that card. Consider its card type, any effects that modify when you could cast it (such as flash) and any other effects that stop you from casting it (such as from Meddling Mage\'s ability) to determine if and when you can do this. Whether you could actually complete all steps in casting the card is irrelevant. For example, you can exile a card with suspend that has no mana cost or that requires a target even if no legal targets are available at that time."}]', "[{'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'A card, spell, or permanent is an outlaw if it has the Assassin, Mercenary, Pirate, Rogue, or Warlock creature type. It doesn’t matter if it has more than one of those creature types; as long as it has at least one, it’s an outlaw.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'After an escaped spell resolves, it returns to its owner’s graveyard if it’s not a permanent spell. If it is a permanent spell, it enters the battlefield and will return to its owner’s graveyard if it dies later. Perhaps it will escape again—good underworld security is so hard to come by these days.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'Escape’s permission doesn’t change when you may cast the spell from your graveyard.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'If a card has multiple abilities giving you permission to cast it, such as two escape abilities or an escape ability and a flashback ability, you choose which one to apply. The others have no effect.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'If a card with escape is put into your graveyard during your turn, you’ll be able to cast it right away if it’s legal to do so, before an opponent can take any actions.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'If an ability refers to an outlaw or whether a player controls an outlaw, it’s referring only to permanents with one or more of the creature types specified above. Notably, it’s not referring to any spell or card not on the battlefield. However, other abilities may refer to an “outlaw spell” or “outlaw card” in a zone other than the battlefield. Those abilities refer to spells and cards with one or more of the specified creature types.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'If you cast a spell with its escape permission, you can’t choose to apply any other alternative costs or to cast it without paying its mana cost. If it has any additional costs, you must pay those.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'Once you begin casting a spell with escape, it immediately moves to the stack. Players can’t take any other actions until you’re done casting the spell.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'Outlaw is not a creature type. If an effect asks you to choose a creature type, you can’t choose outlaw.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'To determine the total cost of a spell, start with the mana cost or alternative cost you’re paying (such as an escape cost), add any cost increases, then apply any cost reductions. The mana value of the spell remains unchanged, no matter what the total cost to cast it was and no matter whether an alternative cost was paid.'}]", "[{'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'A card, spell, or permanent is an outlaw if it has the Assassin, Mercenary, Pirate, Rogue, or Warlock creature type. It doesn’t matter if it has more than one of those creature types; as long as it has at least one, it’s an outlaw.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'If a Treasure you control is already a creature when Vihaan’s second ability resolves and you choose to apply its effect to all Treasures you control, that effect will overwrite any previous effects that set that creature’s power and toughness to specific numbers. Effects that otherwise modify its power and toughness will still apply no matter when they took effect. The same is true for +1/+1 counters.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'If an ability refers to an outlaw or whether a player controls an outlaw, it’s referring only to permanents with one or more of the creature types specified above. Notably, it’s not referring to any spell or card not on the battlefield. However, other abilities may refer to an “outlaw spell” or “outlaw card” in a zone other than the battlefield. Those abilities refer to spells and cards with one or more of the specified creature types.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'Outlaw is not a creature type. If an effect asks you to choose a creature type, you can’t choose outlaw.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'Treasures you control will keep any abilities they previously had while they’re creatures.'}]", "[{'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'A card, spell, or permanent is an outlaw if it has the Assassin, Mercenary, Pirate, Rogue, or Warlock creature type. It doesn’t matter if it has more than one of those creature types; as long as it has at least one, it’s an outlaw.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'If a creature leaves the battlefield while the ability granted to it by Dead Before Sunrise is still on the stack, use that creature’s power as it last existed on the battlefield to determine how much damage to deal.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'If an ability refers to an outlaw or whether a player controls an outlaw, it’s referring only to permanents with one or more of the creature types specified above. Notably, it’s not referring to any spell or card not on the battlefield. However, other abilities may refer to an “outlaw spell” or “outlaw card” in a zone other than the battlefield. Those abilities refer to spells and cards with one or more of the specified creature types.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'Outlaw is not a creature type. If an effect asks you to choose a creature type, you can’t choose outlaw.'}]", "[{'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'A card, spell, or permanent is an outlaw if it has the Assassin, Mercenary, Pirate, Rogue, or Warlock creature type. It doesn’t matter if it has more than one of those creature types; as long as it has at least one, it’s an outlaw.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'If an ability refers to an outlaw or whether a player controls an outlaw, it’s referring only to permanents with one or more of the creature types specified above. Notably, it’s not referring to any spell or card not on the battlefield. However, other abilities may refer to an “outlaw spell” or “outlaw card” in a zone other than the battlefield. Those abilities refer to spells and cards with one or more of the specified creature types.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'Outlaw is not a creature type. If an effect asks you to choose a creature type, you can’t choose outlaw.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'You may spend the two mana added by the ability granted by Discreet Retreat on the same spell or activated ability or two different spells and/or activated abilities.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': '“Outlaw sources” include any objects with at least one of the Assassin, Mercenary, Pirate, Rogue, or Warlock creature types. This means you could spend the mana to activate the ability of an outlaw creature you control or an outlaw card in your hand or graveyard, for example.'}]", "[{'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'A card, spell, or permanent is an outlaw if it has the Assassin, Mercenary, Pirate, Rogue, or Warlock creature type. It doesn’t matter if it has more than one of those creature types; as long as it has at least one, it’s an outlaw.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'If an ability refers to an outlaw or whether a player controls an outlaw, it’s referring only to permanents with one or more of the creature types specified above. Notably, it’s not referring to any spell or card not on the battlefield. However, other abilities may refer to an “outlaw spell” or “outlaw card” in a zone other than the battlefield. Those abilities refer to spells and cards with one or more of the specified creature types.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'Outlaw is not a creature type. If an effect asks you to choose a creature type, you can’t choose outlaw.'}]", "[{'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'A copy of a spell can be countered like any other spell, but it must be countered individually. Countering a spell with storm won’t affect the copies.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'Crackling Spellslinger’s second ability triggers if you cast it from any zone. It doesn’t trigger if you put Crackling Spellslinger onto the battlefield without casting it.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'Spells cast from zones other than a player’s hand and spells that were countered or otherwise failed to resolve are counted by the storm ability.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'The copies of a spell with storm created by its storm ability are put directly onto the stack. They aren’t cast and won’t be counted by other spells with storm cast later in the turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'A copy of a spell can be countered like any other spell, but it must be countered individually. Countering a spell with storm won’t affect the copies.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'Spells cast from zones other than a player’s hand and spells that were countered or otherwise failed to resolve are counted by the storm ability.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'The copies of Elemental Eruption created by its storm ability are put directly onto the stack. They aren’t cast and won’t be counted by other spells with storm cast later in the turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'A creature that’s both a Plant and a Treefolk gets only +2/+0 from Kirri’s first ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'A permanent card is an artifact, battle, creature, enchantment, land, or planeswalker card.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'Each token must attack the appropriate player if able.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'Exiling the card with encore is a cost to activate the ability. Once you announce that you’re activating it, no player may take actions until you’ve finished. They can’t try to remove the card from your graveyard to stop you from paying the cost.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'If an effect stops a token from attacking a specific player, that token can attack any player, planeswalker, or battle, or not attack at all. If the effect stops the token from attacking a specific player unless a cost is paid, you don’t have to pay that cost unless you want to attack that player.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'If one of the tokens can’t attack for any reason (such as being tapped), then it doesn’t attack. If there’s a cost associated with having it attack, you aren’t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn’t have to attack in that case either.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'If one of the tokens somehow is under another player’s control as the delayed triggered ability resolves, you can’t sacrifice that token. It remains on the battlefield indefinitely, even if you regain control of it later.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'If the mana cost of a card in your graveyard includes {X}, X is 0 for the purpose of determining its mana value.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'If you return an Aura this way, you choose what the Aura will enchant just before it enters the battlefield. An Aura returning to the battlefield this way doesn’t target the player or permanent it will enchant, so permanents or players with hexproof may be chosen; however, the chosen recipient must be able to legally be enchanted by the Aura, so a player or permanent with protection from one of the Aura’s qualities can’t be chosen this way. If there’s nothing legal for the Aura to enchant, it stays in the graveyard.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'Opponents who have left the game aren’t counted when determining how many tokens to create.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'The tokens copy only what’s on the original card. Effects that modified that creature when it was previously on the battlefield won’t be copied.'}]", "[{'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'A retrace card cast from your graveyard follows the normal timing rules for its card type.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'Casting a card by using its retrace ability works just like casting any other spell, with two exceptions: You’re casting it from your graveyard rather than your hand, and you must discard a land card in addition to any other costs.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'If the active player casts a spell that has retrace, that player may cast that card again after it resolves, before another player can remove the card from the graveyard. The active player has priority after the spell resolves, so they can immediately cast a new spell. Since casting a card with retrace from the graveyard moves that card onto the stack, no one else would have the chance to affect it while it’s still in the graveyard.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'When a retrace spell you cast from your graveyard resolves, fails to resolve, or is countered, it’s put back into your graveyard. You may use the retrace ability to cast it again.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'You pay all costs and follow all normal timing rules for cards played from exile this way. For example, if an exiled card is a land card, you may play it only during your main phase while the stack is empty.'}]", "[{'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'A spell’s mana value is determined only by its mana cost. Ignore any alternative costs, additional costs, cost increases, or cost reductions.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'Cascade triggers when you cast the spell, meaning that it resolves before that spell. If you end up casting the exiled card, it will go on the stack above the spell with cascade.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'Due to a 2021 rules change to cascade, not only do you stop exiling cards if you exile a nonland card with lesser mana value than the spell with cascade, but the resulting spell you cast must also have lesser mana value. Previously, in cases where a card’s mana value differed from the resulting spell, such as with some modal double-faced cards or cards with an Adventure, you could cast a spell with a higher mana value than the exiled card.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'If a spell with cascade is countered, the cascade ability will still resolve normally.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'If the card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'If you cast a spell “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the spell has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those to cast the card.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'The ability that defines Smoldering Stagecoach’s power works in all zones, not just the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'The mana value of a split card is determined by the combined mana cost of its two halves. If cascade allows you to cast a split card, you may cast either half but not both halves (unless the card has fuse).'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'When the cascade ability resolves, you must exile cards. The only optional part of the ability is whether you cast the last card exiled.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'You exile the cards face up. All players will be able to see them.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': '“Cascade” means “When you cast this spell, exile cards from the top of your library until you exile a nonland card whose mana value is less than this spell’s mana value. You may cast that card without paying its mana cost if the resulting spell’s mana value is less than this spell’s mana value. Then put all cards exiled this way that weren’t cast on the bottom of your library in a random order.”'}]", "[{'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'Although the Ninja is attacking, it was never declared as an attacking creature (for purposes of abilities that trigger whenever a creature attacks, for example).'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'As you activate a ninjutsu ability, you reveal the Ninja card in your hand and return the attacking creature to its owner’s hand. The Ninja card stays revealed and isn’t put onto the battlefield until the ability resolves. If it leaves your hand before then, it won’t enter the battlefield at all.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'If a creature in combat has first strike or double strike, you can activate the ninjutsu ability during the first-strike combat damage step. The Ninja will deal combat damage during the regular combat damage step, even if it has first strike.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'The creature with ninjutsu enters the battlefield attacking the same player, planeswalker, or battle that the returned creature was attacking. This is a rule specific to ninjutsu; in other cases, when a creature is put onto the battlefield attacking, that creature’s controller chooses which player, planeswalker, or battle it’s attacking.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'The ninjutsu ability can be activated during the declare blockers step, combat damage step, or end of combat step. In most cases (see below), if you wait until the combat damage step or end of combat step, it will be after combat damage has been dealt, so the Ninja won’t deal combat damage.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'The ninjutsu ability can be activated only after blockers have been declared. Before then, attacking creatures are neither blocked nor unblocked.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'Your opponents can’t look at the card they own that you manifested.'}]", "[{'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'Any cards you don’t cast this way will remain in exile.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'If a spell you cast has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'If you cast a spell “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs, such as kicker costs. If the spell has any mandatory additional costs, those must be paid to cast the spell.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'You cast the spells one at a time as Villainous Wealth is resolving, choosing modes, targets, and so on. The last spell you cast will be the first one to resolve. Ignore timing restrictions based on the spells’ types. Other timing restrictions, such as “Cast [this spell] only during combat,” must be followed.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'You choose which spells (if any) to cast as Villainous Wealth resolves. If you do, you do so as part of the resolution of Villainous Wealth. You can’t wait to cast them later in the turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'Any change to a land’s type or abilities gained by a land can affect the types of mana a land can produce.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'Cactus Preserve doesn’t care about any restrictions or riders your lands put on the mana they produce, such as that of Bucolic Ranch or the ability granted by Discreet Retreat. It just produces one mana of the appropriate type, with no restrictions or riders.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'Cactus Preserve’s second ability checks the effects of all mana-producing abilities of lands you control, but it doesn’t check their costs or legality. For example, Spire of Industry says “{T}, Pay 1 life: Add one mana of any color. Activate only if you control an artifact.” If you control Spire of Industry and Cactus Preserve, you can tap Cactus Preserve for any color of mana. It doesn’t matter whether you control an artifact, whether you can pay 1 life, or whether Spire of Industry is untapped.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'Desert is a land subtype with no special meaning. It doesn’t grant the land an intrinsic mana ability. Other cards may care about which lands are Deserts.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'If Cactus Preserve becomes a creature but you haven’t controlled it continuously since your most recent turn began, you won’t be able to activate its mana ability or attack with it that turn.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'It doesn’t matter where your commander is (or commanders are, if you have more than one because of the partner ability or similar). The value of X will be calculated using your commander’s current characteristics. (Mana value typically doesn’t change, but your commander may become a copy of something else.)'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'The types of mana are white, blue, black, red, green, and colorless.'}]", "[{'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'Bounty Board’s last ability looks for any bounty counter on any creature, not just one from that Bounty Board. For example, say players A and B each control a Bounty Board and player C controls a creature with a bounty counter on it (no matter how that bounty counter got there). When that creature dies, the ability each Bounty Board will trigger. Each of those abilities will cause players A and B to draw a card and gain 2 life, for a total of two cards and 4 life for each of them. Player C is left only with a creature to mourn and revenge on their mind.'}]", "[{'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'Exiling a card using its plot ability is a special action. Once you announce you’re taking that action, no other player can respond by trying to remove that card from your hand.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'If a plotted card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'If you’re casting a plotted card from exile without paying its mana cost, you can’t choose to cast it for any other alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs, such as kicker costs. If the plotted card has any mandatory additional costs, those must still be paid to cast the spell.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'Lock and Load will count any other instant and sorcery spells you’ve cast this turn. It doesn’t matter if the other spells resolved, didn’t resolve, were countered, or are still on the stack.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'Plot abilities are written “Plot [cost],” which means “Any time you have priority during your main phase while the stack is empty, you may pay [cost] and exile this card from your hand. It becomes plotted.”'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'You can’t cast a plotted card on the same turn it became plotted. On any future turn, you may cast that card from exile without paying its mana cost during your main phase while the stack is empty.'}]", "[{'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'Exiling a card using its plot ability is a special action. Once you announce you’re taking that action, no other player can respond by trying to remove that card from your hand.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'If a plotted card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'If you’re casting a plotted card from exile without paying its mana cost, you can’t choose to cast it for any other alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs, such as kicker costs. If the plotted card has any mandatory additional costs, those must still be paid to cast the spell.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'Plot abilities are written “Plot [cost],” which means “Any time you have priority during your main phase while the stack is empty, you may pay [cost] and exile this card from your hand. It becomes plotted.”'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'Pyretic Charge affects only creatures you control at the time it resolves. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn and noncreature permanents that become creatures later in the turn won’t get +1/+0 for each card discarded this way.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'You can’t cast a plotted card on the same turn it became plotted. On any future turn, you may cast that card from exile without paying its mana cost during your main phase while the stack is empty.'}]", "[{'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'Felix’s last ability affects only triggered abilities whose trigger conditions refer specifically to damage being dealt. It does not affect triggered abilities that would trigger because of the results of that damage. For example, if you control Felix as well as an Ajani’s Pridemate (“Whenever you gain life, put a +1/+1 counter on Ajani’s Pridemate”) and a creature you control with lifelink deals combat damage to a player, the triggered ability of Ajani’s Pridemate will still trigger only once.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'Felix’s last ability doesn’t copy the triggered ability; it just causes the ability to trigger an additional time. Any choices made as you put the ability onto the stack, such as modes and targets, are made separately for each instance of the ability. Any choices made on resolution, such as whether to put counters on a permanent, are also made individually.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'If you somehow control two Felixes, a creature you control dealing combat damage to a player causes abilities of permanents you control to trigger three times. A third Felix causes such abilities to trigger four times, a fourth causes such abilities to trigger five times, and so on.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'Replacement effects are unaffected by Felix’s last ability. For example, if Charging Tuskodon (“If Charging Tuskodon would deal combat damage to a player, it deals double that damage to that player instead”) deals combat damage to a player, Felix’s ability won’t cause the damage it deals to be doubled an additional time.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'Triggered abilities use the word “when,” “whenever,” or “at.” They’re often written as “[Trigger condition], [effect].” Some keyword abilities are triggered abilities and will have “when,” “whenever,” or “at the beginning of” in their reminder text.'}]", "[{'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'If a creature with an encoded card deals combat damage to more than one player simultaneously (perhaps because some of the combat damage was redirected), the triggered ability will trigger once for each player it deals combat damage to. Each ability will create a copy of the exiled card and allow you to cast it.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'If another player gains control of the creature, that player will control the triggered ability. That player will create a copy of the encoded card and may cast it.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'If the creature leaves the battlefield, the exiled card will no longer be encoded on any creature. It will stay exiled.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'If the spell with cipher doesn’t resolve, none of its effects will happen, including cipher. The card will go to its owner’s graveyard and won’t be encoded on a creature.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'If the spell you cast has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'If you cast a spell “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs, such as kicker costs. If the spell has any mandatory additional costs, those must be paid to cast the spell.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'If you choose not to cast the copy, or you can’t cast it (perhaps because there are no legal targets available), the copy will cease to exist the next time state-based actions are performed. You won’t get a chance to cast the copy at a later time.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'The copy of the card with cipher is created in and cast from exile.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'The exiled card with cipher grants a triggered ability to the creature it’s encoded on. If that creature loses that ability and subsequently deals combat damage to a player, the triggered ability won’t trigger. However, the exiled card will continue to be encoded on that creature.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'The spell with cipher is encoded on the creature as part of that spell’s resolution, just after the spell’s other effects. That card goes directly from the stack to exile. It never goes to the graveyard.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'You can choose only a creature to encode the card onto.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'You cast the copy of the card with cipher during the resolution of the triggered ability. Ignore timing restrictions based on the card’s type.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'You choose the creature as the spell resolves. The cipher ability doesn’t target that creature.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'You choose whether to cast the target instant or sorcery card as Arcane Heist resolves. If you do, you do so as part of the resolution of Arcane Heist. You can’t wait to cast it later in the turn. Timing restrictions based on the card’s types are ignored.'}]", "[{'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'If a creature you control has a mana ability with {T} in the cost, activating that ability while casting a spell with convoke will result in the creature being tapped before you pay the spell’s costs. You won’t be able to tap it again for convoke. Similarly, if you sacrifice a creature to activate a mana ability while casting a spell with convoke, that creature won’t be on the battlefield when you pay the spell’s costs, so you won’t be able to tap it for convoke.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'If you control another player’s commander, you won’t create a Mercenary when you attack with that creature. However, if another player controls your commander, you’ll create a Mercenary when it attacks.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'If you have two commanders and they’re both declared as attackers, We Ride at Dawn’s last ability will trigger twice.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'When calculating a spell’s total cost, include any alternative costs, additional costs, or anything else that increases or reduces the cost to cast the spell. Convoke applies after the total cost is calculated. Convoke doesn’t change a spell’s mana cost or mana value.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'You can tap any untapped creature you control to convoke a spell, even one you haven’t controlled continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'If a spell that’s copied has an X whose value was determined as it was cast, the copies will have the same value of X.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'If the spell that’s copied divides damage or distributes counters among a number of targets, the division and number of targets can’t be changed.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'If the spell that’s copied is modal (that is, it says “Choose one —” or the like), the copies will have the same mode or modes. You can’t choose different ones.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'If you have multiple commanders, you’ll copy the next instant or sorcery spell you cast this turn for each time you’ve cast either of them. For example, if you’ve cast one commander once and one twice, you’ll copy that spell three times.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'The copies made by Thunderclap Drake’s delayed triggered ability are created on the stack, so they’re not “cast.”'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'The last sentence of Thunderclap Drake’s rules text was inadvertently omitted from the card. Its updated Oracle text appears above.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'Thunderclap Drake’s second ability can’t reduce the amount of colored mana you pay for a spell. It reduces only the generic mana component of that spell’s cost.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'Thunderclap Drake’s second ability doesn’t change the mana cost or mana value of any spell. It changes only the total cost you pay to cast instant and sorcery spells.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'You can’t choose to pay any additional costs for the copies. However, effects based on any additional costs that were paid for the original spell are copied as though those same costs were paid for the copies too.'}]", "[{'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'If a spell that’s copied has an X whose value was determined as it was cast, the copy will have the same value of X.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'If the copied spell divides damage or distributes counters among a number of targets, the division and number of targets can’t be changed. If you choose new targets, you must choose the same number of targets.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'If the copied spell is modal (that is, it says “Choose one —” or the like), the copy will have the same mode or modes. You can’t choose different ones.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'Spells that were cast before Stella Lee entered the battlefield count. If Stella Lee was the first spell you cast this turn, the next spell you cast this turn is your second spell.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'The copy created by Stella Lee’s last ability will have the same targets as the spell it’s copying unless you choose new ones. You may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. The new targets must be legal.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'The copy made by Stella Lee’s last ability is created on the stack, so it’s not “cast.”'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'You can’t choose to pay any additional costs for the copy. However, effects based on any additional costs that were paid for the original spell are copied as though those same costs were paid for the copy too.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'You pay all costs and follow all normal timing rules for cards played from exile with Stella Lee’s first ability. For example, if the exiled card is a land card, you may play it only during your main phase while the stack is empty.'}]", "[{'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'If any of the cards are land cards (perhaps because they were lands that had become creatures), you can play them from exile, following the normal timing rules for playing lands.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'You pay all costs and follow all normal timing rules for cards played from exile this way. For example, if the exiled card is a creature card without flash, you may cast it only during your main phase while the stack is empty.'}]", "[{'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'If the mana cost of a card in your graveyard includes {X}, X is 0 for the purpose of determining its mana value.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'Spells that were cast before Eris entered the battlefield count. If Eris was the first spell you cast this turn, the next spell you cast this turn is your second spell.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'The mana value of a double-faced card in your graveyard is always the mana value of the front face.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'The mana value of a split card in the graveyard is the total mana value of both halves of that card. It does not have two mana values.'}]", "[{'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'If the spell you cast has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'If you cast a card exiled with Smirking Spelljacker, it will go to the stack. From there, it will likely go to the battlefield or back to its owner’s graveyard. Even if it returns to exile, it will no longer be exiled with Smirking Spelljacker, so you can’t cast it again.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'If you cast a spell “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs, such as kicker costs. If the spell has any mandatory additional costs, those must be paid to cast the spell.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'Spells that can’t be countered can still be exiled by Smirking Spelljacker’s triggered ability. They won’t resolve.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'You choose whether to cast the exiled card as Smirking Spelljacker’s last ability resolves. If you do, you do so as part of the resolution of that ability. You can’t wait to cast it later in the turn. Timing restrictions based on the card’s types are ignored.'}]", "[{'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'If you leave the game, any remaining face-down exiled cards remain exiled face down indefinitely. No player may look at them.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'Playing an exiled card causes it to leave exile. You can’t play it multiple times.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'You may look at and play cards exiled face down with Gonti’s last ability (and spend mana of any type to do so) even if Gonti leaves the battlefield. If another player gains control of Gonti, that player can’t look at or play cards already exiled with Gonti, and you still can.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'You pay all costs and follow all normal timing rules for cards played from exile with Gonti’s last ability. For example, if the exiled card is a land card, you may play it only during your main phase while the stack is empty.'}]", "[{'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'Rumbleweed’s first ability doesn’t change its mana value, which is always 11.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'Rumbleweed’s last ability affects only creatures you control at the time it resolves. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn and noncreature permanents that become creatures later in the turn won’t get +3/+3 or gain trample.'}]", "[{'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'Sand Scout must be on the battlefield for its last ability to trigger. If it is put into your graveyard at the same time as one or more land cards you own, its ability won’t trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'Savvy Trader’s last ability can’t reduce the amount of colored mana you pay for a spell. It reduces only the generic mana component of that spell’s cost.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'Savvy Trader’s last ability doesn’t change the mana cost or mana value of any spell. It changes only the total cost you pay to cast spells from anywhere other than your hand.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'You may play the card exiled with Savvy Trader’s first ability even if Savvy Trader leaves the battlefield. If another player gains control of Savvy Trader, that player can’t play the card, and you still can.'}, {'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'You pay all costs and follow all normal timing rules for the card played from exile with Savvy Trader’s first ability. For example, if the exiled card is a land card, you may play it only during your main phase while the stack is empty.'}]", "[{'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'The number of Plant Warrior tokens created is equal to the number of land cards returned from your graveyard to the battlefield by Vengeful Regrowth. For example, if you cast Vengeful Regrowth targeting three Forest cards in your graveyard but two of those Forest cards are exiled in response, you’ll return the remaining Forest card and create one Plant Warrior token.'}]", "[{'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'You can tap any untapped legendary creature you control, including one you haven’t controlled continuously since the beginning of your most recent turn, to pay the cost of Leyline Dowser’s second activated ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'You may spend the two mana added by the last ability on the same spell you don’t own or on two different spells you don’t own.'}]", "[{'date': '2024-04-12', 'text': 'Yuma must be on the battlefield for its last ability to trigger. If it is put into your graveyard at the same time as a Desert card you own, its ability won’t trigger.'}]"]
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': "Mizzix\' Meisterstück", \'text\': \'Schicke eine Karte deiner Wahl, die ein Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei ist, aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil. Kopiere jede auf diese Weise ins Exil geschickte Karte. Du kannst die Kopien wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Schicke Mizzix\\\' Meisterstück ins Exil.\\nÜberlast {5}{R}{R}{R} (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch für seine Überlast-Kosten wirken. Falls du dies tust, ersetze im Text „eine … deiner Wahl" durch „jede …")\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658885&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3efcc45-b4e7-455e-85e1-7d22b8ad581d\', \'multiverseId\': 658885}, \'multiverseid\': 658885}, {\'name\': \'Poder de Mízzix\', \'text\': \'Exilia la carta objetivo que sea un instantáneo o conjuro de tu cementerio. Por cada carta exiliada de esta manera, cópiala. Puedes lanzar la copia sin pagar su coste de maná. Exilia el Poder de Mízzix.\\nSobrecarga {5}{R}{R}{R}. (Puedes lanzar este hechizo por su coste de sobrecarga. Si lo haces, cambia "la carta objetivo" en su texto por "cada carta".)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659151&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1708446c-d838-4347-beed-777b81e526bc\', \'multiverseId\': 659151}, \'multiverseid\': 659151}, {\'name\': \'Maîtrise de Mizzix\', \'text\': "Exilez une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel ciblée depuis votre cimetière. Pour chaque carte exilée de cette manière, copiez-la, et vous pouvez lancer la copie sans payer son coût de mana. Exilez la Maîtrise de Mizzix.\\nSurcharge {5}{R}{R}{R} (Vous pouvez lancer ce sort pour son coût de surcharge. Si vous faites ainsi, remplacez « ciblé(e) » par « chaque » dans son texte.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659417&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b54607d7-9bc1-49af-98ab-447a8a51bac6\', \'multiverseId\': 659417}, \'multiverseid\': 659417}, {\'name\': \'ミジックスの熟達\', \'text\': \'あなたの墓地にありインスタントやソーサリーであるカード１枚を対象とする。それを追放する。これにより追放されたカードをコピーする。そのコピーをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。ミジックスの熟達を追放する。\\n超過{5}{R}{R}{R}（あなたはこの呪文を超過コストで唱えてもよい。そうしたなら、対象は取らず、あなたの墓地にありインスタントやソーサリーであるすべてのカードを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659683&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c2d657c-7084-4163-9576-a33d327afe3a\', \'multiverseId\': 659683}, \'multiverseid\': 659683}, {\'name\': \'米捷兹的精研\', \'text\': \'将目标在你坟墓场中且为瞬间或法术的牌放逐。对每张以此法放逐的牌而言，将其复制，你可以施放该复制品，且不需支付其法术力费用。放逐米捷兹的精研。\\n超载{5}{R}{R}{R}（你可以支付此咒语的超载费用来施放它。若你如此作，则将其叙述中的「目标」更改为「每张」。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659949&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d37d8a2-05ad-4d3b-93e0-36f5853f9a33\', \'multiverseId\': 659949}, \'multiverseid\': 659949}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abgott der Vergessenheit\', \'text\': \'{T}: Ziehe eine Karte. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls du in diesem Zug einen Spielstein erzeugt hast.\\n{8}, {T}, opfere den Abgott der Vergessenheit: Erzeuge einen 10/10 farblosen Eldrazi-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Erwache, Großartiger, und säubere die Welt von unseren Feinden!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658968&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb054335-7dce-48e0-bcbb-2e014582e8ad\', \'multiverseId\': 658968}, \'multiverseid\': 658968}, {\'name\': \'Ídolo del olvido\', \'text\': \'{T}: Roba una carta. Activa esto solo si creaste una ficha este turno.\\n{8}, {T}, sacrificar el Ídolo del olvido: Crea una ficha de criatura Eldrazi incolora 10/10.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Álzate, ser inmenso, y libra al mundo de nuestros enemigos!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659234&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74b8f143-ed14-424d-985b-7d21d3431916\', \'multiverseId\': 659234}, \'multiverseid\': 659234}, {\'name\': "Idole de l\'oubli", \'text\': "{T} : Piochez une carte. N\'activez que si vous avez créé un jeton ce tour-ci.\\n{8}, {T}, sacrifiez l\'Idole de l\'oubli : Créez un jeton de créature 10/10 incolore Eldrazi.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'« Lève-toi, glorieux élu, et purifie le monde de nos ennemis ! »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659500&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5773def-60ac-4385-aa57-9aa5fb8e138b\', \'multiverseId\': 659500}, \'multiverseid\': 659500}, {\'name\': \'忘却の偶像\', \'text\': \'{T}：カード１枚を引く。このターンにあなたがトークンを生成していなければ起動できない。\\n{8}, {T}, 忘却の偶像を生け贄に捧げる：無色の10/10のエルドラージ・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「偉大なるものよ、立ち上がり、そして我らの敵たるこの世界を浄化したまえ！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659766&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79f64b8f-a1c9-4c04-a085-6da589181298\', \'multiverseId\': 659766}, \'multiverseid\': 659766}, {\'name\': \'佚界雕像\', \'text\': \'{T}：抓一张牌。只能于你派出过衍生物的回合中起动。\\n{8}，{T}，牺牲佚界雕像：派出一个10/10无色奥札奇衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「苏醒吧，巨物，再次将敌人从世上彻底涤净！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660032&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a303df9-d91a-4285-94e0-954701409220\', \'multiverseId\': 660032}, \'multiverseid\': 660032}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abrisszone\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, opfere die Abrisszone: Zerstöre ein Nichtstandardland deiner Wahl, das ein Gegner kontrolliert. Der Beherrscher des Landes kann seine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte durchsuchen, sie ins Spiel bringen und danach mischen. Du kannst deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte durchsuchen, sie ins Spiel bringen und danach mischen.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658993&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1385ae3a-86cd-4f86-a24a-165a8aee7971\', \'multiverseId\': 658993}, \'multiverseid\': 658993}, {\'name\': \'Campo de demolición\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrificar el Campo de demolición: Destruye la tierra no básica objetivo que controla un oponente. El controlador de esa tierra puede buscar en su biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, ponerla en el campo de batalla y luego barajar. Tú puedes buscar en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, ponerla en el campo de batalla y luego barajar.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659259&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b86aa69-e14c-451e-b7e4-07c9fe87eb41\', \'multiverseId\': 659259}, \'multiverseid\': 659259}, {\'name\': \'Champ de démolition\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifiez le Champ de démolition : Détruisez un terrain non-base ciblé qu\'un adversaire contrôle. Le contrôleur de ce terrain peut chercher dans sa bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, la mettre sur le champ de bataille, puis mélanger. Vous pouvez chercher dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, la mettre sur le champ de bataille, puis mélanger.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659525&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0e56977-a675-4d8f-bbff-5a1bca6b9aed\', \'multiverseId\': 659525}, \'multiverseid\': 659525}, {\'name\': \'解体爆破場\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{2}, {T}, 解体爆破場を生け贄に捧げる：対戦相手がコントロールしていて基本でない土地１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。その土地のコントローラーは「自分のライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。あなたは「あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659791&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9042bee8-9416-4f10-8727-15f00bcc9dce\', \'multiverseId\': 659791}, \'multiverseid\': 659791}, {\'name\': \'颓垣废址\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{2}，{T}，牺牲颓垣废址：消灭目标由对手操控的非基本地。该地的操控者可以从其牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，将之放进战场，然后洗牌。你可以从你牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，将之放进战场，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660057&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49985f9c-7490-46b2-b709-fa56cf4f05f4\', \'multiverseId\': 660057}, \'multiverseid\': 660057}]', '[{\'name\': \'Akademie-Monteur\', \'text\': \'Falls du einen Hinweis-, Speise- oder Schatz-Spielstein erzeugen würdest, erzeuge stattdessen einen von jedem Typ.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Montagearbeiter\', \'flavor\': \'Automatisierte Systeme an der Akademie von Tolaria sortieren Neuanschaffungen im Hinblick auf eine optimale Nutzung und bestimmen, welche studiert, gegessen oder verkauft werden sollten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658961&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29ec921e-2db7-40c9-92d0-e5e8391afd27\', \'multiverseId\': 658961}, \'multiverseid\': 658961}, {\'name\': \'Fabricante de la Academia\', \'text\': \'Si fueras a crear una ficha de Pista, Comida o Tesoro, en vez de eso, crea una de cada.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Operario\', \'flavor\': \'Los sistemas automáticos de la Academia tolariana clasifican las nuevas adquisiciones según su utilidad óptima: determinan si se deberían estudiar, comer o vender.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659227&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02e6f92c-b4e4-47b9-825e-1f26493b98f5\', \'multiverseId\': 659227}, \'multiverseid\': 659227}, {\'name\': "Fabricateur de l\'académie", \'text\': \'Si vous deviez créer un jeton Indice, Nourriture ou Trésor, à la place créez un jeton de chaque.\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact — ouvrier spécialisé\', \'flavor\': "Les systèmes automatisés de l\'Académie tolariane trient les nouvelles acquisitions selon leur usage optimal et déterminent si elles doivent être étudiées, mangées ou vendues.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659493&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74d5e2bc-3ec1-4b61-9402-4629e3e964b8\', \'multiverseId\': 659493}, \'multiverseid\': 659493}, {\'name\': \'アカデミーの整備士\', \'text\': \'あなたが食物や手掛かりや宝物であるトークン１つを生成するなら、代わりに食物・トークン１つと手掛かり・トークン１つと宝物・トークン１つを生成する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 組立作業員\', \'flavor\': \'トレイリアのアカデミーでは自動機械が新たな入手物を最適な用途に分類する。食べるか調べるか売るかを決定するのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659759&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dff3a1ed-6592-404e-bd34-57513b17fe2d\', \'multiverseId\': 659759}, \'multiverseid\': 659759}, {\'name\': \'大学院制造工人\', \'text\': \'如果你将派出一个线索，食品或珍宝衍生物，则改为这三种衍生物物各派出一个。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 — 组装工人\', \'flavor\': \'陶拉里亚大学院的自动系统会对新获物品作最优分类，以期物尽其用：它能决定物品是拿来研究、食用还是卖掉。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660025&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1cec46a7-b721-4421-a0cf-1a5813d5b98f\', \'multiverseId\': 660025}, \'multiverseid\': 660025}]', '[{\'name\': \'Angraths Plünderer\', \'text\': \'Falls eine Quelle, die du kontrollierst, einem Permanent oder Spieler Schaden zufügen würde, fügt sie dem Permanent bzw. Spieler stattdessen doppelt so viele Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Pirat\', \'flavor\': \'Kapitän Angrath schert sich nicht um Reichtümer, er will nur zerstören. Wenn er Ixalan nicht verlassen kann, dann brennt er die Welt eben nieder.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658863&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81514a6e-996c-4ff2-9986-c79df1040d3f\', \'multiverseId\': 658863}, \'multiverseid\': 658863}, {\'name\': \'Merodeadores de Angrath\', \'text\': \'Si una fuente que controlas fuera a hacer daño a un permanente o jugador, en vez de eso, hace el doble de ese daño a ese permanente o jugador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pirata humano\', \'flavor\': \'Al capitán Angrath le gusta más el caos que los tesoros. Si no puede abandonar Ixalan, quemará el plano entero.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659129&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd42d833-843f-4d4d-9d11-c9d2906b333d\', \'multiverseId\': 659129}, \'multiverseid\': 659129}, {\'name\': "Maraudeurs d\'Angrath", \'text\': \'Si une source que vous contrôlez devait infliger des blessures à un permanent ou à un joueur, elle inflige à la place le double de ces blessures à ce permanent ou à ce joueur.\', \'type\': \'Créature — humain et pirate\', \'flavor\': "Le capitaine Angrath est plus intéressé par le chaos que par les trésors. S\'il ne peut pas quitter Ixalan, il réduira le plan en cendres.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659395&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8277958a-0bb6-4e0c-b262-db2bfea85629\', \'multiverseId\': 659395}, \'multiverseid\': 659395}, {\'name\': \'アングラスの匪賊\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしている発生源１つがパーマネントやプレイヤーにダメージを与えるなら、代わりに、それはそのパーマネントやプレイヤーにその点数の２倍の点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・海賊\', \'flavor\': \'船長アングラスは宝物よりも騒乱に関心がある。イクサランを離れられずにいると、次元全体を焼き尽くしてしまうだろう。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659661&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8933b485-5e73-419c-a9c3-b7bbe8f1cbf6\', \'multiverseId\': 659661}, \'multiverseid\': 659661}, {\'name\': \'安戈斯的劫掠者\', \'text\': \'如果某个由你操控的来源将对任一永久物或牌手造成伤害，则改为它对该永久物或牌手造成两倍的伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／海盗\', \'flavor\': \'安戈斯船长无心敛财只求破坏。他若是无法离开依夏兰，便要让整座时空都陷入火海。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659927&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17b46d85-c95c-4e58-8688-5e90f6050614\', \'multiverseId\': 659927}, \'multiverseid\': 659927}]', '[{\'name\': \'Arkaner Beschuss\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du deinen ersten Spontanzauber oder deine erste Hexerei pro Zug wirkst, schicke eine per Zufall bestimmte Spontanzauber- oder Hexereikarte aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil. Kopiere dann jede Karte, die vom Arkanen Beschuss ins Exil geschickt wurde. Du kannst eine beliebige Anzahl der Kopien wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658864&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6a7edcc-5222-432a-b2a5-65e074c62b62\', \'multiverseId\': 658864}, \'multiverseid\': 658864}, {\'name\': \'Bombardeo arcano\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances tu primer hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro cada turno, exilia una carta de instantáneo o de conjuro al azar de tu cementerio. Luego, copia cada carta exiliada con el Bombardeo arcano. Puedes lanzar cualquier cantidad de esas copias sin pagar sus costes de maná.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659130&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34c8cd4b-396b-4efd-91aa-51baf4ad0f39\', \'multiverseId\': 659130}, \'multiverseid\': 659130}, {\'name\': \'Bombardement ésotérique\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez votre premier sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel à chaque tour, exilez une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel au hasard depuis votre cimetière. Puis copiez chaque carte exilée par le Bombardement ésotérique. Vous pouvez lancer n\'importe quel nombre de copies sans payer leur coût de mana.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659396&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bca120d7-f722-41e3-94b5-5839c751b327\', \'multiverseId\': 659396}, \'multiverseid\': 659396}, {\'name\': \'秘儀の砲撃\', \'text\': \'あなたが、各ターン内のあなたの１つ目のインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるたび、あなたの墓地にありインスタントやソーサリーであるカード１枚を無作為に選び、追放する。その後、秘儀の砲撃によって追放されている各カードをそれぞれコピーする。それらの各コピーを、マナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659662&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97fb0a50-b7f2-4314-9b93-41c74c82304f\', \'multiverseId\': 659662}, \'multiverseid\': 659662}, {\'name\': \'秘法轰炸\', \'text\': \'每当你施放每回合中你的第一个瞬间或法术咒语时，随机从你的坟墓场放逐一张瞬间或法术牌。然后复制每张以秘法轰炸放逐的牌。你可以施放任意数量的复制品，且不需支付其法术力费用。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659928&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62246302-ae85-4779-af75-04da36d8e5ca\', \'multiverseId\': 659928}, \'multiverseid\': 659928}]', '[{\'name\': \'Arkaner Raub\', \'text\': \'Du kannst eine Spontanzauber- oder Hexereikarte deiner Wahl aus dem Friedhof eines Gegners wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Falls der Zauberspruch auf seinen Friedhof gelegt würde, schicke ihn stattdessen ins Exil.\\nChiffrieren (Dann kannst du diese Zauberspruchkarte auf eine Kreatur codiert, die du kontrollierst, ins Exil schicken. Immer wenn jene Kreatur einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, kann ihr Beherrscher eine Kopie der codierten Karte wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658365&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a775ee0-4514-437f-a744-b980ce8fafde\', \'multiverseId\': 658365}, \'multiverseid\': 658365}, {\'name\': \'Atraco arcano\', \'text\': \'Puedes lanzar la carta de instantáneo o de conjuro objetivo desde el cementerio de un oponente sin pagar su coste de maná. Si ese hechizo fuera a ir a su cementerio, en vez de eso, exílialo.\\nCifrar. (Luego puedes exiliar esta carta de hechizo y cifrarla en una criatura que controles. Siempre que esa criatura haga daño de combate a un jugador, su controlador puede lanzar una copia de la carta cifrada sin pagar su coste de maná.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658397&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be21486a-c2db-4400-924c-cd9ce4a86a44\', \'multiverseId\': 658397}, \'multiverseid\': 658397}, {\'name\': \'Larcin arcanique\', \'text\': "Vous pouvez lancer une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel ciblée depuis le cimetière d\'un adversaire sans payer son coût de mana. Si ce sort devait être mis dans son cimetière, exilez-le à la place.\\nCryptage (Vous pouvez ensuite exiler cette carte de sort cryptée sur une créature que vous contrôlez. À chaque fois que cette créature inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, son contrôleur peut lancer une copie de la carte cryptée sans payer son coût de mana.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658429&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08861e88-3480-4984-9aff-7ea032e316fa\', \'multiverseId\': 658429}, \'multiverseid\': 658429}, {\'name\': \'秘儀の強奪\', \'text\': \'対戦相手１人の墓地にありインスタントやソーサリーであるカード１枚を対象とする。あなたはそれを、マナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。その呪文がそのプレイヤーの墓地に置かれるなら、代わりにそれを追放する。\\n暗号（その後、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体に暗号化した状態で、この呪文・カードを追放してもよい。そのクリーチャーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、それのコントローラーは、暗号化されているこのカードのコピーを、マナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658461&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3db8d945-9154-4540-9068-76b5a1e8f760\', \'multiverseId\': 658461}, \'multiverseid\': 658461}, {\'name\': \'秘法劫案\', \'text\': \'你可以从对手坟墓场中施放目标瞬间或法术牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。如果该咒语将进入其坟墓场，则改为将它放逐。\\n暗码（然后你可以放逐此咒语牌，并赋码于一个由你操控的生物上。每当该生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，其操控者可以施放所赋码之牌的复制品，且不需支付其法术力费用。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658493&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b564b01-9cc2-4b90-a338-509d3203e193\', \'multiverseId\': 658493}, \'multiverseid\': 658493}]', '[{\'name\': \'Arkaner Raub\', \'text\': \'Du kannst eine Spontanzauber- oder Hexereikarte deiner Wahl aus dem Friedhof eines Gegners wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Falls der Zauberspruch auf seinen Friedhof gelegt würde, schicke ihn stattdessen ins Exil.\\nChiffrieren\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660173&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'688a84f5-6c0f-478d-a792-1b799e954555\', \'multiverseId\': 660173}, \'multiverseid\': 660173}, {\'name\': \'Larcin arcanique\', \'text\': "Vous pouvez lancer une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel ciblée depuis le cimetière d\'un adversaire sans payer son coût de mana. Si ce sort devait être mis dans son cimetière, exilez-le à la place.\\nCryptage", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660205&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca2c2465-2b9a-47f5-a6fc-21c19f3648a5\', \'multiverseId\': 660205}, \'multiverseid\': 660205}, {\'name\': \'秘儀の強奪\', \'text\': \'対戦相手１人の墓地にありインスタントやソーサリーであるカード１枚を対象とする。あなたはそれを、マナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。その呪文がそのプレイヤーの墓地に置かれるなら、代わりにそれを追放する。\\n暗号\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660237&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eee19b97-f67c-440a-a99f-007e938c2428\', \'multiverseId\': 660237}, \'multiverseid\': 660237}, {\'name\': \'秘法劫案\', \'text\': \'你可以从对手坟墓场中施放目标瞬间或法术牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。如果该咒语将进入其坟墓场，则改为将它放逐。\\n暗码\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660269&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2150766-e966-497c-892f-c07d5f0ce515\', \'multiverseId\': 660269}, \'multiverseid\': 660269}]', '[{\'name\': \'Arkanes Petschaft\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe der Farbidentität deines Commanders.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Am Anfang war es nur ein Wassertropfen. Der Zauberspiegel ließ es zu viel mehr kristallisieren.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658962&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98068eb7-623b-49f4-be51-7cd7970eb068\', \'multiverseId\': 658962}, \'multiverseid\': 658962}, {\'name\': \'Sello arcano\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color en la identidad de color de tu comandante.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Comenzó como una simple gota de agua, pero el Espejo Mágico hizo que cristalizara en algo mucho más poderoso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659228&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19bdd1b9-c5f0-497b-ac54-645801eeade9\', \'multiverseId\': 659228}, \'multiverseid\': 659228}, {\'name\': "Cachet d\'ésotérisme", \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix de l\'identité couleur de votre commandant.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Il n\'était au départ qu\'une simple goutte d\'eau que le Miroir magique cristallisa en quelque chose d\'autre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659494&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b36b382-82d0-4560-a6fb-a8ab35b5feae\', \'multiverseId\': 659494}, \'multiverseid\': 659494}, {\'name\': \'秘儀の印鑑\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたの統率者の固有色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'初めはほんの一滴だが、魔法の鏡がそれ以上のものを形にする。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659760&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d6840dd-a17c-4d2c-8d1d-1a99d4a09491\', \'multiverseId\': 659760}, \'multiverseid\': 659760}, {\'name\': \'秘法印记\', \'text\': \'{T}：加一点法术力，其颜色为你指挥官标识色中的任一颜色。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'它起初就只是水滴。魔法明镜将之晶化为更有用的事物。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660026&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5952aa15-8955-4900-b309-5276fbe23893\', \'multiverseId\': 660026}, \'multiverseid\': 660026}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufbruch im Morgengrauen\', \'text\': \'Legendäre Kreaturenzauber, die du wirkst, haben Einberufen. (Deine Kreaturen können dir helfen, die Zaubersprüche zu wirken. Mit jeder Kreatur, die du tappst, während du einen legendären Kreaturenzauber wirkst, bezahlst du für {1} oder ein Mana einer Farbe jener Kreatur.)\\nImmer wenn dein Commander angreift, erzeuge einen 1/1 roten Söldner-Kreaturenspielstein mit „{T}: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, erhält +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei."\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658364&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60f880bd-baad-46f2-b251-5635f548a830\', \'multiverseId\': 658364}, \'multiverseid\': 658364}, {\'name\': \'Partiremos al amanecer\', \'text\': \'Los hechizos de criatura legendaria que lances tienen la habilidad de convocar. (Tus criaturas pueden ayudar a lanzar esos hechizos. Cada criatura que gires al lanzar un hechizo de criatura legendaria cuenta como un pago de {1} o de un maná del color de esa criatura.)\\nSiempre que tu comandante ataque, crea una ficha de criatura Mercenario roja 1/1 con "{T}: La criatura objetivo que controlas obtiene +1/+0 hasta el final del turno. Activa esto solo como un conjuro".\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658396&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a7ff33b-affa-4916-8118-3f2a59355acc\', \'multiverseId\': 658396}, \'multiverseid\': 658396}, {\'name\': "Nous partons à l\'aube", \'text\': "Les sorts de créature légendaires que vous lancez ont la convocation. (Vos créatures peuvent aider à lancer ces sorts. Chaque créature que vous engagez en lançant un sort de créature légendaire paie {1} ou un mana de la couleur de cette créature.)\\nÀ chaque fois que votre commandant attaque, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 rouge Mercenaire avec « {T} : Une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez gagne +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel. »", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658428&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db8422e2-eefd-4811-b80c-f9ba0263283b\', \'multiverseId\': 658428}, \'multiverseid\': 658428}, {\'name\': \'夜明けに旅立つ\', \'text\': \'あなたが唱えるすべての伝説のクリーチャー・呪文は召集を持つ。（あなたのクリーチャーが、それらの呪文を唱える助けとなる。伝説のクリーチャー・呪文を唱える段階であなたがタップした各クリーチャーは、{1}かそのクリーチャーの色のマナ１点を支払う。）\\nあなたの統率者１体が攻撃するたび、「{T}：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。」を持つ赤の１/１の傭兵・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658460&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bafa432f-aa28-4aca-9384-5a349db229b8\', \'multiverseId\': 658460}, \'multiverseid\': 658460}, {\'name\': \'破晓策马\', \'text\': \'你施放的传奇生物咒语具有召集异能。（这些咒语能用你的生物来协助施放。你于施放传奇生物咒语时每横置一个生物，就能为该咒语支付{1}或一点该生物颜色之法术力。）\\n每当你的指挥官攻击时，派出一个1/1红色佣兵衍生生物，且具有「{T}：目标由你操控的生物得+1/+0直到回合结束。只能于法术时机起动。」\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658492&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3708fe3c-68bf-4b64-9a69-6e78ac74fb11\', \'multiverseId\': 658492}, \'multiverseid\': 658492}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufbruch im Morgengrauen\', \'text\': \'Legendäre Kreaturenzauber, die du wirkst, haben Einberufen.\\nImmer wenn dein Commander angreift, erzeuge einen 1/1 roten Söldner-Kreaturenspielstein mit „{T}: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, erhält +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei."\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660172&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec39db98-7e5e-4605-b87e-c411b0732bfb\', \'multiverseId\': 660172}, \'multiverseid\': 660172}, {\'name\': "Nous partons à l\'aube", \'text\': "Les sorts de créature légendaires que vous lancez ont la convocation.\\nÀ chaque fois que votre commandant attaque, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 rouge Mercenaire avec « {T} : Une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez gagne +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel. »", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660204&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6806ee5f-56c4-412e-8d06-d9f759db1001\', \'multiverseId\': 660204}, \'multiverseid\': 660204}, {\'name\': \'夜明けに旅立つ\', \'text\': \'あなたが唱えるすべての伝説のクリーチャー・呪文は召集を持つ。\\nあなたの統率者１体が攻撃するたび、「{T}：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。」を持つ赤の１/１の傭兵・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660236&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'397b340a-1ac7-4229-9e5c-1975aa2d7cb8\', \'multiverseId\': 660236}, \'multiverseid\': 660236}, {\'name\': \'破晓策马\', \'text\': \'你施放的传奇生物咒语具有召集异能。\\n每当你的指挥官攻击时，派出一个1/1红色佣兵衍生生物，且具有「{T}：目标由你操控的生物得+1/+0直到回合结束。只能于法术时机起动。」\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660268&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b0a91ed-b609-4edf-8e0c-c3cbcdf2b8e3\', \'multiverseId\': 660268}, \'multiverseid\': 660268}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufregende Entdeckung\', \'text\': \'Du erhältst 2 Lebenspunkte dazu. Dann kannst du zwei Karten abwerfen. Falls du dies tust, ziehe drei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Das muss die verlorene Stadt Zantafar sein, in der mein Volk lebte, bevor sie Nomaden wurden. Denk nur, wie viel Geschichte wir hier lernen können!"\\n—Quintorius, Kundhort-Magiestudent\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658955&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fed58674-7928-4598-b7eb-511488f69f48\', \'multiverseId\': 658955}, \'multiverseid\': 658955}, {\'name\': \'Descubrimiento emocionante\', \'text\': \'Ganas 2 vidas. Luego, puedes descartar dos cartas. Si lo haces, roba tres cartas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Esta debe de ser la ciudad perdida de Zantafar, donde vivía mi pueblo antes de convertirse en nómada. ¡Cuánta historia debe albergar este lugar!".\\n—Quintorius, estudiante de magia de Sapiéntium\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659221&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9131340-8541-49db-b484-953a5824e559\', \'multiverseId\': 659221}, \'multiverseid\': 659221}, {\'name\': \'Découverte fascinante\', \'text\': \'Vous gagnez 2 points de vie. Vous pouvez ensuite vous défausser de deux cartes. Si vous faites ainsi, piochez trois cartes.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Ce doit être la cité perdue de Zantafar, où vivait mon peuple avant qu\'il ne devienne nomade. Imagine l\'histoire qu\'on va pouvoir apprendre ici ! »\\n—Quintorius, mage-étudiant de Forsapience", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659487&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f364aff-d488-4832-a6e9-01ccd68a70d5\', \'multiverseId\': 659487}, \'multiverseid\': 659487}, {\'name\': \'身震いする発見\', \'text\': \'あなたは２点のライフを得る。その後、カード２枚を捨ててもよい。そうしたなら、カード３枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「これこそがザンタファーの失われた都市に違いない。私の祖先が放浪を始める以前に住んでいた場所だ。ここでどんな歴史を学べるのだろうか！」\\n――ロアホールドの魔道生徒、クイントリウス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659753&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'610803f7-38c0-4cec-ac59-b0f57b7d1e80\', \'multiverseId\': 659753}, \'multiverseid\': 659753}, {\'name\': \'快意发现\', \'text\': \'你获得2点生命。然后你可以弃两张牌。如果你如此作，则抓三张牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「这里就是失落之城赞塔法。在成为游牧民之前，我的族人便是住在这边。想想我们能在这里学到多少历史！」\\n～衡鉴修习法师昆托力\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660019&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6971ff8-1edc-4f1e-be14-6ecdb64c1e22\', \'multiverseId\': 660019}, \'multiverseid\': 660019}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausdrucksvolle Iteration\', \'text\': \'Schaue dir die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Nimm eine davon auf deine Hand, lege eine davon unter deine Bibliothek und schicke eine davon ins Exil. Du kannst die ins Exil geschickte Karte in diesem Zug spielen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Prismari-Studenten tanzen im Spannungsfeld zwischen Leidenschaft und Perfektion.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658934&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db207c4c-8d39-4ddd-89e2-497c9a6f866f\', \'multiverseId\': 658934}, \'multiverseid\': 658934}, {\'name\': \'Iteración expresiva\', \'text\': \'Mira las tres primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Pon una de ellas en tu mano, una de ellas en el fondo de tu biblioteca y exilia una de ellas. Puedes jugar la carta exiliada este turno.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Los estudiantes de Prismari bailan con la tensión entre la pasión y la perfección.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659200&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df420095-a47e-4f09-8105-01da3985a429\', \'multiverseId\': 659200}, \'multiverseid\': 659200}, {\'name\': \'Itération expressive\', \'text\': "Regardez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez l\'une d\'elles dans votre main, mettez l\'une d\'elles au-dessous de votre bibliothèque, et exilez l\'une d\'elles. Vous pouvez jouer la carte exilée ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Les étudiants de Prismari dansent entre passion et perfection.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659466&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ffb2dcb-b2b8-460d-8655-c3c25bfc2d10\', \'multiverseId\': 659466}, \'multiverseid\': 659466}, {\'name\': \'表現の反復\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード３枚を見る。それらのうち１枚をあなたの手札に加え、それらのうち１枚をあなたのライブラリーの一番下に置き、１枚を追放する。このターン、その追放されているカードをプレイしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'プリズマリの学生たちは情熱と完璧の葛藤の中で踊る。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659732&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c6d4fd7-e594-4a9e-afe4-712e763d3d29\', \'multiverseId\': 659732}, \'multiverseid\': 659732}, {\'name\': \'展现迭代\', \'text\': \'检视你牌库顶的三张牌。将其中一张置于你手上，一张置于你的牌库底，一张放逐。本回合中，你可以使用所放逐的牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'在激情与精进的张力之间，粹丽学生尽情起舞。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659998&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9cf53fe-ede7-4f11-83d9-833723ba070b\', \'multiverseId\': 659998}, \'multiverseid\': 659998}]', "[{'name': 'Ausgestoßener Wandelwicht', 'text': 'Wandelwicht (Diese Karte hat alle Kreaturentypen.)\\nDer Ausgestoßene Wandelwicht kann nicht blocken und nicht geblockt werden.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Gestaltwandler', 'flavor': 'Ein wechselhaftes Gesicht sät Misstrauen und erntet ein Leben in Einsamkeit.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658838&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dbf03b4e-913f-4bc1-85c8-f4e0b196c340', 'multiverseId': 658838}, 'multiverseid': 658838}, {'name': 'Cambiaformas desterrado', 'text': 'Cambiaformas. (Esta carta es de todos los tipos de criatura.)\\nEl Cambiaformas desterrado no puede bloquear y no puede ser bloqueado.', 'type': 'Criatura — Metamorfo', 'flavor': 'Un rostro volátil siembra desconfianza, y la desconfianza conlleva una vida solitaria.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659104&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7359d1f4-212d-46ab-9730-28a490710a90', 'multiverseId': 659104}, 'multiverseid': 659104}, {'name': 'Proscrit changelin', 'text': 'Changelin (Cette carte a tous les types de créature.)\\nLe Proscrit changelin ne peut pas bloquer et ne peut pas être bloqué.', 'type': 'Créature — changeforme', 'flavor': 'Un visage changeant inspire la méfiance. La méfiance suscite la solitude.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659370&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f9970838-6806-4ee3-8e23-3bd16d03fab7', 'multiverseId': 659370}, 'multiverseid': 659370}, {'name': '変わり身ののけ者', 'text': '多相（このカードはすべてのクリーチャー・タイプである。）\\n変わり身ののけ者ではブロックできず、変わり身ののけ者はブロックされない。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 多相の戦士', 'flavor': '移り気な表情が不信を蒔く。不信は孤独な命を刈り取る。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659636&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '16f2f4ce-48aa-4515-aaf7-332bd6d3382f', 'multiverseId': 659636}, 'multiverseid': 659636}, {'name': '化形黜人', 'text': '化形（此牌是所有生物类别。）\\n化形黜人不能进行阻挡，也不能被阻挡。', 'type': '生物 — 变形兽', 'flavor': '变幻面容埋下猜疑祸根。猜疑祸根长出孤独人生。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659902&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '750b5d9f-bb65-4c0e-bb95-8cca2488542f', 'multiverseId': 659902}, 'multiverseid': 659902}]", '[{\'name\': \'Ausmerzungsritual\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre jedes Nichtland-Permanent mit Manabetrag 2 oder weniger. Erzeuge {B} oder {G} für jedes auf diese Weise zerstörte Permanent.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Deine eigene Zerbrechlichkeit ist dein Untergang. Ich mache sie nur offenbar."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658929&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f31c579-8b3b-452b-868a-6775bc7126d1\', \'multiverseId\': 658929}, \'multiverseid\': 658929}, {\'name\': \'Ritual de eliminación\', \'text\': \'Destruye cada permanente que no sea tierra con valor de maná de 2 o menos. Agrega {B} o {G} por cada permanente destruido de esta manera.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Tu debilidad es tu perdición. Yo solo la expongo".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659195&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'456e9c45-2ece-4146-b48a-e00552524205\', \'multiverseId\': 659195}, \'multiverseid\': 659195}, {\'name\': \'Rituel sacrificiel\', \'text\': \'Détruisez chaque permanent non-terrain ayant une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à 2. Ajoutez {B} ou {G} pour chaque permanent détruit de cette manière.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Ta propre fragilité est ta faiblesse. Je ne fais que l\'exposer. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659461&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'293772ee-e23c-454e-9472-0223817af453\', \'multiverseId\': 659461}, \'multiverseid\': 659461}, {\'name\': \'選別の儀式\', \'text\': \'マナ総量が２以下であり土地でないすべてのパーマネントを破壊する。これにより破壊されたパーマネント１つにつき、{B}か{G}を加える。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「あなたは自分自身の弱点で破滅したのよ。私はそれを利用しただけ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659727&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9b5bf86-ff1c-4716-8d15-ed6da96dc6d6\', \'multiverseId\': 659727}, \'multiverseid\': 659727}, {\'name\': \'牲祭仪式\', \'text\': \'消灭所有法术力值等于或小于2的非地永久物。每以此法消灭一个永久物，便加{B}或{G}。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「你失败的原因在于自身的软弱。我只不过是为你指出这一点。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659993&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54f1fc0f-24cf-4501-844e-1bc63d780217\', \'multiverseId\': 659993}, \'multiverseid\': 659993}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bandana der Traumdiebin\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, schaue dir die oberste Karte seiner Bibliothek an und schicke sie dann verdeckt ins Exil. Solange sie im Exil bleibt, kannst du sie spielen, und Mana beliebigen Typs kann ausgegeben werden, um jenen Zauberspruch zu wirken.\\nAusrüsten {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658390&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b72be7f5-71d1-4ac5-83ef-bdff37eaaf0d\', \'multiverseId\': 658390}, \'multiverseid\': 658390}, {\'name\': \'Pañuelo de ladrona onírica\', \'text\': \'Siempre que la criatura equipada haga daño de combate a un jugador, mira la primera carta de su biblioteca y luego exíliala boca abajo. Mientras permanezca exiliada, puedes jugarla y puedes usar maná de cualquier tipo para lanzar ese hechizo.\\nEquipar {1}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658422&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9de83f70-be2a-4ec5-857e-0dedafb42bd5\', \'multiverseId\': 658422}, \'multiverseid\': 658422}, {\'name\': \'Bandana de voleuse de rêves\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que la créature équipée inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, regardez la carte du dessus de sa bibliothèque, puis exilez-la face cachée. Tant qu\'elle reste exilée, vous pouvez la jouer, et du mana de n\'importe quel type peut être dépensé pour lancer ce sort.\\nÉquipement {1}", \'type\': \'Artefact — équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658454&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ad5f5a5-a018-4bd5-bf1d-28a8ceef539f\', \'multiverseId\': 658454}, \'multiverseid\': 658454}, {\'name\': \'夢盗人のバンダナ\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、そのプレイヤーのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を見て、裏向きで追放する。それが追放され続けているかぎり、あなたはそれをプレイしてもよく、その呪文を唱えるために任意のタイプのマナを支払ってもよい。\\n装備{1}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658486&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3ecaae4-d0f6-4102-a12f-e53b9e106472\', \'multiverseId\': 658486}, \'multiverseid\': 658486}, {\'name\': \'窃梦贼头巾\', \'text\': \'每当佩带此武具的生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，检视该牌手的牌库顶牌，然后牌面朝下地放逐它。于该牌持续放逐的时段内，你可以使用它，且能用任意种类的法术力来施放该咒语。\\n佩带{1}\', \'type\': \'神器 — 武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658518&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4fdd1e38-616c-4131-9c78-e4813a8acc63\', \'multiverseId\': 658518}, \'multiverseid\': 658518}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bandana der Traumdiebin\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, schaue dir die oberste Karte seiner Bibliothek an und schicke sie dann verdeckt ins Exil. Solange sie im Exil bleibt, kannst du sie spielen, und Mana beliebigen Typs kann ausgegeben werden, um jenen Zauberspruch zu wirken.\\nAusrüsten {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660198&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80ca1362-c75f-4c67-8fd3-211ba737f217\', \'multiverseId\': 660198}, \'multiverseid\': 660198}, {\'name\': \'Bandana de voleuse de rêves\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que la créature équipée inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, regardez la carte du dessus de sa bibliothèque, puis exilez-la face cachée. Tant qu\'elle reste exilée, vous pouvez la jouer, et du mana de n\'importe quel type peut être dépensé pour lancer ce sort.\\nÉquipement {1}", \'type\': \'Artefact — équipement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660230&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e52a44ce-728a-4a29-9e98-b5bf17b08ea0\', \'multiverseId\': 660230}, \'multiverseid\': 660230}, {\'name\': \'夢盗人のバンダナ\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、そのプレイヤーのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を見て、裏向きで追放する。それが追放され続けているかぎり、あなたはそれをプレイしてもよく、その呪文を唱えるために任意のタイプのマナを支払ってもよい。\\n装備{1}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660262&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e340dce-70c3-4e30-9fb6-59a570e140fa\', \'multiverseId\': 660262}, \'multiverseid\': 660262}, {\'name\': \'窃梦贼头巾\', \'text\': \'每当佩带此武具的生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，检视该牌手的牌库顶牌，然后牌面朝下地放逐它。于该牌持续放逐的时段内，你可以使用它，且能用任意种类的法术力来施放该咒语。\\n佩带{1}\', \'type\': \'神器 — 武具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660294&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea0f04ee-385c-47ac-b1d8-5d1545c54f75\', \'multiverseId\': 660294}, \'multiverseid\': 660294}]', '[{\'name\': \'Barals Expertise\', \'text\': \'Bringe bis zu drei Artefakte und/oder Kreaturen deiner Wahl auf die Hand ihrer Besitzer zurück.\\nDu kannst einen Zauberspruch mit Manabetrag 4 oder weniger aus deiner Hand wirken, ohne seine Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Geht mir aus dem Weg."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658801&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'745ce664-d821-43b1-9260-5f9611d3a380\', \'multiverseId\': 658801}, \'multiverseid\': 658801}, {\'name\': \'Pericia de Baral\', \'text\': \'Regresa hasta tres artefactos y/o criaturas objetivo a las manos de sus propietarios.\\nPuedes lanzar un hechizo desde tu mano con valor de maná de 4 o menos sin pagar su coste de maná.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Fuera de mi camino".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659067&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98201116-c3e6-41d9-b410-b2189b06b1e9\', \'multiverseId\': 659067}, \'multiverseid\': 659067}, {\'name\': \'Expertise de Baral\', \'text\': "Renvoyez jusqu\'à trois cibles, artefacts et/ou créatures, dans les mains de leurs propriétaires.\\nVous pouvez lancer un sort avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à 4 depuis votre main sans payer son coût de mana.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Hors de mon chemin. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659333&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5d48b3b-34c9-4652-9d26-2c264297d9de\', \'multiverseId\': 659333}, \'multiverseid\': 659333}, {\'name\': \'バラルの巧技\', \'text\': \'アーティファクトやクリーチャーである最大３つを対象とする。それらをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\nあなたの手札から、マナ総量が４以下である呪文１つを、マナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「邪魔だ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659599&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0810438a-cfad-4599-b2bf-44c96cae966e\', \'multiverseId\': 659599}, \'multiverseid\': 659599}, {\'name\': \'巴罗的专才\', \'text\': \'将至多三个目标神器和／或生物移回其拥有者手上。\\n你可以从你手上施放一个法术力值等于或小于4的咒语，且不需支付其法术力费用。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「别挡我的路。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659865&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'359d748d-9cb3-4fba-9c40-2d8e1aa40c46\', \'multiverseId\': 659865}, \'multiverseid\': 659865}]', '[{\'name\': \'Befehlsturm\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe der Farbidentität deines Commanders.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn die Niederlage nah und die Anführer verschwunden sind, schauen alle Augen in eine Richtung.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658990&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'114de3dd-5d79-4786-b610-b2930d087972\', \'multiverseId\': 658990}, \'multiverseid\': 658990}, {\'name\': \'Torre de mando\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color en la identidad de color de tu comandante.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando se acerca la derrota y escasea el liderazgo, todos los ojos miran en una misma dirección.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659256&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e8241e5-4aa6-40e9-a322-e04609eab0be\', \'multiverseId\': 659256}, \'multiverseid\': 659256}, {\'name\': \'Tour de commandement\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix de l\'identité couleur de votre commandant.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'Quand la défaite est proche et que les ordres viennent à manquer, tous les yeux se portent dans la même direction.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659522&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f29ac52b-9ac6-424d-8b77-bfa7dff7cffa\', \'multiverseId\': 659522}, \'multiverseid\': 659522}, {\'name\': \'統率の塔\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたの統率者の固有色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'敗北が間近で指揮も不十分になったとき、すべての目は一つの方向に向けられる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659788&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30d9e29f-208a-44ac-997b-3e68c1acc77e\', \'multiverseId\': 659788}, \'multiverseid\': 659788}, {\'name\': \'指挥塔\', \'text\': \'{T}：加一点法术力，其颜色为你指挥官标识色中的任一颜色。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'当落败已成定局，当指引无处可寻，全军目光便会聚集一处。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660054&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d34d122-1e91-45ad-b682-4ad67ab2c48f\', \'multiverseId\': 660054}, \'multiverseid\': 660054}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beinschienen des Blitzes\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur hat Eile und Verhülltheit. (Sie kann nicht das Ziel von Zaubersprüchen oder Fähigkeiten sein.)\\nAusrüsten {0}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'Als der Blitz in die Klippen einschlug, wurde Erz zu Eisen, Eisen zu Stahl und Stahl zu Beinschienen. Der Blitz blieb für immer.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658970&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a1afc09-319a-4a7a-8cbe-20ab85ed4c45\', \'multiverseId\': 658970}, \'multiverseid\': 658970}, {\'name\': \'Grebas relámpago\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada tiene las habilidades de prisa y velo. (No puede ser objetivo de hechizos o habilidades.)\\nEquipar {0}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'Después de que el relámpago golpeó los acantilados, el mineral se transformó en hierro, el hierro se convirtió en acero y el acero se convirtió en grebas. El relámpago nunca se fue.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659236&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ac73fe2-8bf0-46d5-a762-d5a17f5191e8\', \'multiverseId\': 659236}, \'multiverseid\': 659236}, {\'name\': "Jambières d\'éclair", \'text\': \'La créature équipée a la célérité et le linceul. (Elle ne peut pas être la cible de sorts ou de capacités.)\\nÉquipement {0}\', \'type\': \'Artefact — équipement\', \'flavor\': "Quand l\'éclair frappa les falaises, le minerai devint du fer, le fer de l\'acier, et l\'acier, des jambières. Jamais l\'éclair ne partit.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659502&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fee9e743-5d2a-44a5-bbf4-2920895720d0\', \'multiverseId\': 659502}, \'multiverseid\': 659502}, {\'name\': \'稲妻のすね当て\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは速攻と被覆を持つ。（それは呪文や能力の対象にならない。）\\n装備{0}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'稲妻が崖を打った後、鉱石は鉄となり、鉄は鋼となり、鋼はすね当てとなった。稲妻はそこに残ったままだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659768&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b66c733-028a-4d67-b6c1-774e278a054f\', \'multiverseId\': 659768}, \'multiverseid\': 659768}, {\'name\': \'迅雷护胫\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物具有敏捷与帷幕异能。（它不能成为咒语或异能的目标。）\\n佩带{0}\', \'type\': \'神器 — 武具\', \'flavor\': \'闪电击中山崖后，矿石成铁，铁成钢，钢成护胫。迅雷长存其间。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660034&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c7f7aa0-5022-41ce-a2f4-7511e06960f5\', \'multiverseId\': 660034}, \'multiverseid\': 660034}]', '[{\'name\': \'Beständiger Behemoth\', \'text\': \'Du kannst Länder aus deinem Friedhof spielen.\\nExhumieren {G}{G} ({G}{G}: Bringe diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück. Sie erhält Eile. Schicke sie zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments, oder falls sie das Spiel verlassen würde, ins Exil. Spiele Exhumieren wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Bestie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658972&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01087721-fc80-404a-9969-2091eb75ecb7\', \'multiverseId\': 658972}, \'multiverseid\': 658972}, {\'name\': \'Behemot perenne\', \'text\': \'Puedes jugar tierras desde tu cementerio.\\nDesenterrar {G}{G}. ({G}{G}: Regresa esta carta de tu cementerio al campo de batalla. Gana la habilidad de prisa. Exíliala al comienzo del próximo paso final o si fuera a dejar el campo de batalla. Activa la habilidad de desenterrar solo como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Bestia\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659238&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb84ed70-c2a3-4cf8-b7ed-4e36b682968a\', \'multiverseId\': 659238}, \'multiverseid\': 659238}, {\'name\': \'Béhémoth vivace\', \'text\': "Vous pouvez jouer des terrains depuis votre cimetière.\\nExhumation {G}{G} ({G}{G} : Renvoyez cette carte sur le champ de bataille depuis votre cimetière. Elle acquiert la célérité. Exilez-la au début de la prochaine étape de fin ou si elle devait quitter le champ de bataille. N\'exhumez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact — bête\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659504&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8303db1-e419-44c9-bcda-cda46f8b84be\', \'multiverseId\': 659504}, \'multiverseid\': 659504}, {\'name\': \'常緑のビヒモス\', \'text\': \'あなたの墓地から土地をプレイしてもよい。\\n蘇生{G}{G}（{G}{G}：あなたの墓地にあるこのカードを戦場に戻す。これは速攻を得る。次の終了ステップの開始時に、あるいは、これが戦場を離れるなら、これを追放する。蘇生はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — ビースト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659770&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca07912b-dd5e-4511-bf3c-55ea8213f6d1\', \'multiverseId\': 659770}, \'multiverseid\': 659770}, {\'name\': \'经年贝西摩斯\', \'text\': \'你可以从你的坟墓场中使用地。\\n破坟{G}{G}（{G}{G}：将此牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。它获得敏捷异能。在下一个结束步骤开始时，或若它将离开战场，将它放逐。只能于法术时机破坟。）\', \'type\': \'神器生物 — 野兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660036&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ce795a5-2ccc-436f-939b-388599325e25\', \'multiverseId\': 660036}, \'multiverseid\': 660036}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bitteres Wiedersehen\', \'text\': \'Wenn das Bittere Wiedersehen ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Karte abwerfen. Falls du dies tust, ziehe zwei Karten.\\n{1}, opfere das Bittere Wiedersehen: Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Der Friedensgipfel offenbarte, dass die Fehde zwischen Urza und Mishra nur blutig enden konnte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658866&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da36b3d2-431b-476b-81d3-c35efe9ceb26\', \'multiverseId\': 658866}, \'multiverseid\': 658866}, {\'name\': \'Reencuentro amargo\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Reencuentro amargo entre al campo de batalla, puedes descartar una carta. Si lo haces, roba dos cartas.\\n{1}, sacrificar el Reencuentro amargo: Las criaturas que controlas ganan la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'La cumbre de paz demostró que el enfrentamiento entre Urza y Mishra solo podía acabar con un derramamiento de sangre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659132&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c00e478-ce9a-4e7a-aa97-48630a380c00\', \'multiverseId\': 659132}, \'multiverseid\': 659132}, {\'name\': \'Retrouvailles amères\', \'text\': "Quand les Retrouvailles amères arrivent sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez vous défausser d\'une carte. Si vous faites ainsi, piochez deux cartes.\\n{1}, sacrifiez les Retrouvailles amères : Les créatures que vous contrôlez acquièrent la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'La conférence de paix prouva que la rancœur entre Urza et Mishra ne pourrait finir que dans le sang.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659398&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8288ff72-29b9-4b94-8f16-9cf25282e3d1\', \'multiverseId\': 659398}, \'multiverseid\': 659398}, {\'name\': \'苦々しい再会\', \'text\': \'苦々しい再会が戦場に出たとき、カード１枚を捨ててもよい。そうしたなら、カード２枚を引く。\\n{1}, 苦々しい再会を生け贄に捧げる：ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'和平交渉で判明したのは、ウルザとミシュラの怨恨は流血沙汰にしかならないということだった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659664&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ffe934e-cbe1-466d-900d-08e75e1250fe\', \'multiverseId\': 659664}, \'multiverseid\': 659664}, {\'name\': \'苦涩重逢\', \'text\': \'当苦涩重逢进战场时，你可以弃一张牌。若你如此作，则抓两张牌。\\n{1}，牺牲苦涩重逢：由你操控的生物获得敏捷异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'和平峰会证明，克撒与米斯拉之间的嫌隙只能以流血收场。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659930&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b094a8ae-8c14-4750-b4ad-c43f824c85ed\', \'multiverseId\': 659930}, \'multiverseid\': 659930}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutdürstige Widersacherin\', \'text\': \'Eile\\nWenn die Blutdürstige Widersacherin ins Spiel kommt, kannst du beliebig oft {2}{R} bezahlen. Wenn du diese Kosten ein- oder mehrmals bezahlst, lege entsprechend viele +1/+1-Marken auf die Blutdürstige Widersacherin. Schicke dann bis zu entsprechend viele Spontanzauber- und/oder Hexereikarten deiner Wahl mit Manabetrag 3 oder weniger aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil und kopiere sie. Du kannst eine beliebige Anzahl der Kopien wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658867&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'deaf7a5c-1116-45a3-aecd-79beb274ce10\', \'multiverseId\': 658867}, \'multiverseid\': 658867}, {\'name\': \'Adversaria sedienta de sangre\', \'text\': \'Prisa.\\nCuando la Adversaria sedienta de sangre entre al campo de batalla, puedes pagar {2}{R} tantas veces como quieras. Cuando pagues este coste una o más veces, pon esa misma cantidad de contadores +1/+1 sobre la Adversaria sedienta de sangre, luego exilia hasta esa misma cantidad de cartas de instantáneo y/o de conjuro objetivo con valor de maná de 3 o menos de tu cementerio y cópialas. Puedes lanzar cualquier cantidad de esas copias sin pagar sus costes de maná.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659133&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14444d87-d5c3-4f4e-982d-f8814c004386\', \'multiverseId\': 659133}, \'multiverseid\': 659133}, {\'name\': \'Adversaire assoiffée de sang\', \'text\': "Célérité\\nQuand l\'Adversaire assoiffée de sang arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez payer {2}{R} autant de fois que vous le souhaitez. Quand vous payez ce coût au moins une fois, mettez autant de marqueurs +1/+1 sur l\'Adversaire assoiffée de sang, puis exilez jusqu\'à autant de cartes d\'éphémère et/ou de rituel ciblées avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à 3 depuis votre cimetière et copiez-les. Vous pouvez lancer n\'importe quel nombre de copies sans payer leur coût de mana.", \'type\': \'Créature — vampire\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659399&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'506924f6-fd99-468e-9c1d-99d84e4be7be\', \'multiverseId\': 659399}, \'multiverseid\': 659399}, {\'name\': \'血に飢えた敵対者\', \'text\': \'速攻\\n血に飢えた敵対者が戦場に出たとき、{2}{R}を望む回数支払ってもよい。あなたがこのコストを１回以上支払ったとき、その回数以下の枚数の、あなたの墓地にありマナ総量が３以下でありインスタントやソーサリーであるカードを対象とする。血に飢えた敵対者の上にその回数に等しい個数の＋１/＋１カウンターを置く。その後、対象としたすべてのカードを追放し、コピーする。あなたはそれらのコピーを、マナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659665&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8cc1f11-cb87-4448-a776-e1d1ce80f892\', \'multiverseId\': 659665}, \'multiverseid\': 659665}, {\'name\': \'嗜血仇敌\', \'text\': \'敏捷\\n当嗜血仇敌进战场时，你可以支付{2}{R}任意次数。当你支付一次或数次此费用时，根据该数量在嗜血仇敌上放置等量的+1/+1指示物，然后将至多等量之目标法术力值等于或小于3的瞬间和／或法术牌从你的坟墓场放逐并复制。你可以施放任意数量的复制品，且不需支付其法术力费用。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659931&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'054eaa90-856d-4bab-af2a-7ff6c711c23a\', \'multiverseId\': 659931}, \'multiverseid\': 659931}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bojukamoor\', \'text\': \'Das Bojukamoor kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn das Bojukamoor ins Spiel kommt, schicke den Friedhof eines Spielers deiner Wahl ins Exil.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658983&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8ac4e07-1055-4c36-8baa-2a0209fad3ec\', \'multiverseId\': 658983}, \'multiverseid\': 658983}, {\'name\': \'Ciénaga de Bojuka\', \'text\': \'La Ciénaga de Bojuka entra al campo de batalla girada.\\nCuando la Ciénaga de Bojuka entre al campo de batalla, exilia el cementerio del jugador objetivo.\\n{T}: Agrega {B}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659249&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94bd4022-a891-4b54-b530-3c77de235e7d\', \'multiverseId\': 659249}, \'multiverseid\': 659249}, {\'name\': \'Marécage de Bojuka\', \'text\': "Le Marécage de Bojuka arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Marécage de Bojuka arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez le cimetière d\'un joueur ciblé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659515&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4cee0d6-a7f1-41a1-9f37-3028d0dd2e11\', \'multiverseId\': 659515}, \'multiverseid\': 659515}, {\'name\': \'ボジューカの沼\', \'text\': \'ボジューカの沼はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nボジューカの沼が戦場に出たとき、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーの墓地を追放する。\\n{T}：{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659781&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19aa2c97-2cfe-4012-89cc-df25e5d98ab2\', \'multiverseId\': 659781}, \'multiverseid\': 659781}, {\'name\': \'泊卒卡腐沼\', \'text\': \'泊卒卡腐沼须横置进战场。\\n当泊卒卡腐沼进战场时，放逐目标牌手的坟墓场。\\n{T}：加{B}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660047&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6d7d904-9ed2-433c-8311-e7324f0fd83a\', \'multiverseId\': 660047}, \'multiverseid\': 660047}]', '[{\'name\': \'Boros-Amulett\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Das Boros-Amulett fügt einem Spieler oder Planeswalker deiner Wahl 4 Schadenspunkte zu.\\n• Permanente, die du kontrollierst, erhalten Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n• Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält Doppelschlag bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658926&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eddd1473-d2bb-4c09-a027-af1c24fb9929\', \'multiverseId\': 658926}, \'multiverseid\': 658926}, {\'name\': \'Amuleto boros\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• El Amuleto boros hace 4 puntos de daño al jugador o planeswalker objetivo.\\n• Los permanentes que controlas ganan la habilidad de indestructible hasta el final del turno.\\n• La criatura objetivo gana la habilidad de dañar dos veces hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659192&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3c90584-d94e-4572-92b3-0a808df43b9a\', \'multiverseId\': 659192}, \'multiverseid\': 659192}, {\'name\': \'Charme de Boros\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Le Charme de Boros inflige 4 blessures à une cible, joueur ou planeswalker.\\n• Les permanents que vous contrôlez acquièrent l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n• Une créature ciblée acquiert la double initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659458&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c41efa20-2a08-42d0-a680-c3aad35afb09\', \'multiverseId\': 659458}, \'multiverseid\': 659458}, {\'name\': \'ボロスの魔除け\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n・プレイヤーやプレインズウォーカーである１つを対象とする。ボロスの魔除けはそれに４点のダメージを与える。\\n・ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのパーマネントは破壊不能を得る。\\n・クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは二段攻撃を得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659724&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1efb0251-d4ec-47d3-a224-59aa1c4d8657\', \'multiverseId\': 659724}, \'multiverseid\': 659724}, {\'name\': \'波洛斯护符\', \'text\': \'选择一项～\\n•波洛斯护符对目标牌手或鹏洛客造成4点伤害。\\n•由你操控的永久物获得不灭异能直到回合结束。\\n•目标生物获得连击异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659990&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f27f86bb-8a3f-40d1-beb6-0b67721c939b\', \'multiverseId\': 659990}, \'multiverseid\': 659990}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brandrodung\', \'text\': \'Opfere ein Land als zusätzliche Kosten, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken.\\nDurchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu zwei Standardland-Karten, bringe sie ins Spiel und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Die Turbulenz erschafft beim Vorbeiziehen die Welt neu und lässt nur die Polyeder unverändert.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658904&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2bcea9f-c854-4604-9445-4fc8ad4efda4\', \'multiverseId\': 658904}, \'multiverseid\': 658904}, {\'name\': \'Gradar\', \'text\': \'Como coste adicional para lanzar este hechizo, sacrifica una tierra.\\nBusca en tu biblioteca hasta dos cartas de tierra básica, ponlas en el campo de batalla y luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'La Turbulencia rediseña el mundo a su paso, dejando solo los edros intactos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659170&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1cb8abe-dd5a-430c-8203-7a11295f286e\', \'multiverseId\': 659170}, \'multiverseid\': 659170}, {\'name\': \'Hersage\', \'text\': "En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer ce sort, sacrifiez un terrain.\\nCherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à deux cartes de terrain de base, mettez-les sur le champ de bataille, puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'Le Roulis redessine le monde sur son passage, ne laissant derrière lui que les hèdrons inchangés.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659436&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a143b86b-82b9-4c28-8f74-96085232e50c\', \'multiverseId\': 659436}, \'multiverseid\': 659436}, {\'name\': \'砕土\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるための追加コストとして、土地１つを生け贄に捧げる。\\nあなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード最大２枚を探し、戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'乱動は通り過ぎた世界を一変させてしまう。変わらないのは面晶体だけだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659702&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'793e56b3-3ba4-4495-b587-52b4adcd0c21\', \'multiverseId\': 659702}, \'multiverseid\': 659702}, {\'name\': \'整地\', \'text\': \'牺牲一个地，以作为施放此咒语的额外费用。\\n从你牌库中搜寻至多两张基本地牌，将它们放进战场，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'狂搅所经之处，地貌为之改写，只有晶石维持不变。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659968&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'247853f3-d7ff-4373-a6f5-60aab13d01d5\', \'multiverseId\': 659968}, \'multiverseid\': 659968}]', '[{\'name\': \'Breena die Demagogin\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn ein Spieler einen deiner Gegner angreift und falls jener Gegner mehr Lebenspunkte hat als ein anderer deiner Gegner, zieht der angreifende Spieler eine Karte und du legst zwei +1/+1-Marken auf eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Vogel, Hexenmeister\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658927&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86d9afc2-70bf-4a6b-aabf-70c9215ab0e4\', \'multiverseId\': 658927}, \'multiverseid\': 658927}, {\'name\': \'Breena, la Demagoga\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que un jugador ataque a uno de tus oponentes, si ese oponente tiene más vidas que otro de tus oponentes, ese jugador atacante roba una carta y tú pones dos contadores +1/+1 sobre una criatura que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Brujo ave\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659193&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8100585c-a106-433d-8846-fcb1f75a89a1\', \'multiverseId\': 659193}, \'multiverseid\': 659193}, {\'name\': \'Breena, la démagogue\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un joueur attaque un de vos adversaires, si cet adversaire a plus de points de vie qu\'un autre de vos adversaires, ce joueur attaquant pioche une carte et vous mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur une créature que vous contrôlez.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — oiseau et psychagogue\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659459&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'044b87ec-8f66-4257-b1ec-68ace3ab11ee\', \'multiverseId\': 659459}, \'multiverseid\': 659459}, {\'name\': \'大衆扇動者、ブリーナ\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nプレイヤー１人があなたの対戦相手１人を攻撃するたび、その攻撃されたプレイヤーのライフがそのプレイヤーでないあなたの対戦相手１人より多い場合、その攻撃プレイヤーはカード１枚を引き、あなたはあなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体の上に＋１/＋１カウンター２個を置く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 鳥・邪術師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659725&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6a6faf9-66c9-4851-b546-403485456991\', \'multiverseId\': 659725}, \'multiverseid\': 659725}, {\'name\': \'煽动师布莉娜\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当一位牌手攻击你的任一对手时，若后者的总生命比你的另一位对手多，则该攻击牌手抓一张牌，且你在一个由你操控的生物上放置两个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 鸟／邪术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659991&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93b6089c-cb9d-47fa-b69b-19713d9e42f4\', \'multiverseId\': 659991}, \'multiverseid\': 659991}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brütende Drachenmutter\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nLandung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen 0/2 roten Drache-Ei-Kreaturenspielstein mit Verteidiger und „Wenn diese Kreatur stirbt, erzeuge einen 2/2 roten Drache-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit und ‚{R}: Diese Kreatur erhält +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\\'"\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658886&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5bef42d8-38c2-4c6c-a850-dae367ada642\', \'multiverseId\': 658886}, \'multiverseid\': 658886}, {\'name\': \'Dragona en anidación\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nAterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, crea una ficha de criatura Huevo Dragón roja 0/2 con la habilidad de defensor y "Cuando esta criatura muera, crea una ficha de criatura Dragón roja 2/2 con la habilidad de volar y \\\'{R}: Esta criatura obtiene +1/+0 hasta el final del turno\\\'".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659152&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'636a950c-d0a2-4a71-9695-ce93b3be150c\', \'multiverseId\': 659152}, \'multiverseid\': 659152}, {\'name\': \'Dragonne nidifiante\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nToucheterre — À chaque fois qu\\\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, créez un jeton de créature 0/2 rouge Dragon et Œuf avec le défenseur et « Quand cette créature meurt, créez un jeton de créature 2/2 rouge Dragon avec le vol et "{R} : Cette créature gagne +1/+0 jusqu\\\'à la fin du tour" ».\', \'type\': \'Créature — dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659418&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a22501bd-4daf-4e7c-a480-63ecac395818\', \'multiverseId\': 659418}, \'multiverseid\': 659418}, {\'name\': \'巣ごもりドラゴン\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n上陸 ― 土地１つがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、防衛と「このクリーチャーが死亡したとき、飛行と『{R}：ターン終了時まで、このクリーチャーは＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。』を持つ赤の２/２のドラゴン・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。」を持つ赤の０/２のドラゴン・卵・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659684&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f88987c-4f34-40b8-a8a5-829455388b1d\', \'multiverseId\': 659684}, \'multiverseid\': 659684}, {\'name\': \'筑巢巨龙\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，派出一个0/2红色龙／蛋衍生生物，且具有守军与「当此生物死去时，派出一个2/2红色的龙衍生生物，且具有飞行与『{R}：此生物得+1/+0直到回合结束。』」\', \'type\': \'生物 — 龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659950&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4080ab5e-33d3-4322-9c46-5c19089ab789\', \'multiverseId\': 659950}, \'multiverseid\': 659950}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chaosschleife\', \'text\': \'Der Besitzer eines Permanents deiner Wahl mischt es in seine Bibliothek und deckt dann die oberste Karte seiner Bibliothek auf. Falls es eine Permanent-Karte ist, bringt er sie ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658870&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'050e3f1b-0d41-4cac-8123-d069f26aa0a1\', \'multiverseId\': 658870}, \'multiverseid\': 658870}, {\'name\': \'Distorsión caótica\', \'text\': \'El propietario del permanente objetivo lo baraja en su biblioteca y luego muestra la primera carta de su biblioteca. Si es una carta de permanente, la pone en el campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659136&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96b112e5-f741-4dd7-b5d9-b9730da9c54d\', \'multiverseId\': 659136}, \'multiverseid\': 659136}, {\'name\': \'Distorsion chaotique\', \'text\': "Le propriétaire d\'un permanent ciblé le mélange à sa bibliothèque et révèle ensuite la carte du dessus de sa bibliothèque. Si c\'est une carte de permanent, il la met sur le champ de bataille.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659402&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'325275b9-5671-4c86-a37d-101f69f7d2a4\', \'multiverseId\': 659402}, \'multiverseid\': 659402}, {\'name\': \'混沌のねじれ\', \'text\': \'パーマネント１つを対象とする。それのオーナーはそれを自分のライブラリーに加えて切り直し、その後、自分のライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を公開する。それがパーマネント・カードなら、そのプレイヤーはそれを戦場に出す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659668&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97f7eef2-a59e-49a2-9a79-1a227723d6af\', \'multiverseId\': 659668}, \'multiverseid\': 659668}, {\'name\': \'混沌歪曲\', \'text\': \'选择目标永久物。其拥有者将它洗入其牌库，然后展示其牌库顶牌。如果该牌是永久物牌，则该牌手将它放进战场。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659934&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f6f6209-9b94-4de3-925c-53d0ab4bb703\', \'multiverseId\': 659934}, \'multiverseid\': 659934}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chaosstab\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}: Ein Gegner deiner Wahl schickt Karten oben von seiner Bibliothek ins Exil, bis er eine Spontanzauber- oder Hexereikarte ins Exil schickt. Du kannst die Karte wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Lege dann alle Karten, die auf diese Weise ins Exil geschickt und nicht gewirkt wurden, in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter seine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658964&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3af26cb-0269-4990-89b5-8cccf5741045\', \'multiverseId\': 658964}, \'multiverseid\': 658964}, {\'name\': \'Varita del caos\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}: El oponente objetivo exilia cartas de la parte superior de su biblioteca hasta que exilie una carta de instantáneo o de conjuro. Puedes lanzar esa carta sin pagar su coste de maná. Luego, pon las cartas exiliadas que no fueron lanzadas de esta manera en el fondo de esa biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659230&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5a7e101-c8a7-4c99-8448-7d8b7f139936\', \'multiverseId\': 659230}, \'multiverseid\': 659230}, {\'name\': \'Baguette du chaos\', \'text\': "{4}, {T} : Un adversaire ciblé exile les cartes du dessus de sa bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce qu\'il exile une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel. Vous pouvez lancer cette carte sans payer son coût de mana. Mettez ensuite les cartes exilées qui n\'ont pas été lancées de cette manière au-dessous de cette bibliothèque, dans un ordre aléatoire.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659496&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a616baa8-2fb2-472d-aae4-12bfd14c6c52\', \'multiverseId\': 659496}, \'multiverseid\': 659496}, {\'name\': \'混沌のワンド\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}：対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは、インスタントやソーサリーであるカード１枚が追放されるまで、自分のライブラリーの一番上から１枚ずつ追放していく。あなたはそのカードをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。その後、これにより追放して唱えなかったカードをそのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659762&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'567c746f-000d-4c01-bba3-388fb1cb47c1\', \'multiverseId\': 659762}, \'multiverseid\': 659762}, {\'name\': \'混沌法杖\', \'text\': \'{4}，{T}：目标对手从其牌库顶开始放逐牌，直到放逐一张瞬间或法术牌为止。你可以施放该牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。然后将所有以此法放逐且未施放的牌依随机顺序置于该牌库底。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660028&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1303e35a-6f6f-4920-92c1-beb5fed76d4a\', \'multiverseId\': 660028}, \'multiverseid\': 660028}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chromatische Laterne\', \'text\': \'Länder, die du kontrollierst, haben „{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe."\\n{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Dimir-Magier setzen die Lampen geschickt ein — aus dem ungewohnten Mana erschaffen sie Gestaltwandler und Schläfer-Agenten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658965&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15f70b7d-b02b-488f-a4b1-e21c3fd84f0b\', \'multiverseId\': 658965}, \'multiverseid\': 658965}, {\'name\': \'Linterna cromática\', \'text\': \'Las tierras que controlas tienen "{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color".\\n{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Los magos dimir hicieron buen uso de las linternas, creando metamorfos y agentes durmientes a partir de un maná que les era extraño.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659231&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40480a05-0560-426f-a975-30451731b359\', \'multiverseId\': 659231}, \'multiverseid\': 659231}, {\'name\': \'Lanterne chromatique\', \'text\': \'Les terrains que vous contrôlez ont : « {T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix. »\\n{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'Les mages dimirs tirent parti des lanternes, créant des changeformes et des agents en sommeil à partir de mana dont ils ignorent tout.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659497&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3257e909-3c60-4472-8338-2d963e2920ea\', \'multiverseId\': 659497}, \'multiverseid\': 659497}, {\'name\': \'彩色の灯籠\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべての土地は「{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。」を持つ。\\n{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'ディミーアの魔道士は灯籠をうまく使い、異質のマナから多相の戦士や潜伏工作員を生み出している。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659763&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de4ba172-41d5-473d-a367-ac920c373f4f\', \'multiverseId\': 659763}, \'multiverseid\': 659763}, {\'name\': \'五彩宫灯\', \'text\': \'由你操控的地具有「{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力。」\\n{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'底密尔法师充分利用宫灯，从他们不熟悉的法术力当中制造出变形兽和潜藏密探。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660029&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73327e0d-2941-4e18-a20a-eab0b82f8fb7\', \'multiverseId\': 660029}, \'multiverseid\': 660029}]', '[{\'name\': \'Das Mimeoplasma\', \'text\': \'Sowie das Mimeoplasma ins Spiel kommt, kannst du zwei Kreaturenkarten aus Friedhöfen ins Exil schicken. Falls du dies tust, kommt es als Kopie einer der Karten mit zusätzlich so vielen +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel, wie die Stärke der anderen Karte beträgt.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Schlammwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658944&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7cc1ed53-e1ea-4d7c-a213-3000502f90d9\', \'multiverseId\': 658944}, \'multiverseid\': 658944}, {\'name\': \'El Mimeoplasma\', \'text\': \'En cuanto El Mimeoplasma entre al campo de batalla, puedes exiliar dos cartas de criatura de cementerios. Si lo haces, entra al campo de batalla como una copia de una de esas cartas y con una cantidad de contadores +1/+1 adicionales sobre él igual a la fuerza de la otra carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Cieno\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659210&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b159cca-9282-48f8-bf22-732eda7f197f\', \'multiverseId\': 659210}, \'multiverseid\': 659210}, {\'name\': \'Le Ronéoplasme\', \'text\': "Au moment où Le Ronéoplasme arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez exiler deux cartes de créature depuis plusieurs cimetières. Si vous faites ainsi, il arrive sur le champ de bataille comme une copie d\'une de ces cartes avec, sur lui, un nombre de marqueurs +1/+1 supplémentaires égal à la force de l\'autre carte.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — limon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659476&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad02348c-5fb6-4a39-8003-113520c61a49\', \'multiverseId\': 659476}, \'multiverseid\': 659476}, {\'name\': \'擬態の原形質\', \'text\': \'擬態の原形質が戦場に出るに際し、あなたは墓地にあるクリーチャー ・カード２枚を追放してもよい。そうしたなら、これはそれらのカードの一方のコピーとして、もう一方のカードのパワーに等しい個数の＋１/＋１カウンターが追加で置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ウーズ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659742&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04ae991f-ac1e-414c-97eb-ed973fe30c03\', \'multiverseId\': 659742}, \'multiverseid\': 659742}, {\'name\': \'拟生原浆\', \'text\': \'于拟生原浆进战场时，你可以将两张生物牌从坟墓场放逐。若你如此作，则它便当作这些牌其中之一的复制品来进入战场，且上面额外有等同于另一张牌之力量的+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 流浆\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660008&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bda87585-1683-4c70-9166-4782c49424e1\', \'multiverseId\': 660008}, \'multiverseid\': 660008}]', '[{\'name\': \'Demolieren und Wiederaufbauen\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Zerstöre ein Artefakt oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl.\\n• Du millst fünf Karten, dann kannst du eine Länderkarte aus deinem Friedhof getappt ins Spiel bringen.\\nRückblende {3}{R}{G}\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658960&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'132f3628-cb60-41bd-8575-05cd71cfb6cc\', \'multiverseId\': 658960}, \'multiverseid\': 658960}, {\'name\': \'Caos y reconstrucción\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• Destruye el artefacto o encantamiento objetivo.\\n• Muele cinco cartas y luego puedes poner una carta de tierra de tu cementerio en el campo de batalla girada.\\nRetrospectiva {3}{R}{G}.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659226&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ae06ba8-241c-4af0-8de2-a079190b982e\', \'multiverseId\': 659226}, \'multiverseid\': 659226}, {\'name\': \'Détruire et rebâtir\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Détruisez une cible, artefact ou enchantement.\\n• Meulez cinq cartes, puis vous pouvez mettre sur le champ de bataille, engagée, une carte de terrain de votre cimetière.\\nFlashback {3}{R}{G}", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659492&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'073d15d9-b4ec-4244-960e-7078de7541c8\', \'multiverseId\': 659492}, \'multiverseid\': 659492}, {\'name\': \'倒壊と再建\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n・アーティファクトやエンチャントである１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\\n・カード５枚を切削する。その後、あなたの墓地にある土地・カード１枚をタップ状態で戦場に出してもよい。\\nフラッシュバック{3}{R}{G}\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659758&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73a391e1-cd7c-4117-8246-9e60a7718497\', \'multiverseId\': 659758}, \'multiverseid\': 659758}, {\'name\': \'破坏重建\', \'text\': \'选择一项～\\n•消灭目标神器或结界。\\n•磨五张牌，然后你可以将一张地牌从你坟墓场横置放进战场。\\n返照{3}{R}{G}\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660024&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1cb3b49-bdf0-4509-9424-3dee78e93175\', \'multiverseId\': 660024}, \'multiverseid\': 660024}]', '[{\'name\': \'Demütige Überläuferin\', \'text\': \'{T}: Ziehe zwei Karten. Ein Gegner deiner Wahl übernimmt die Kontrolle über die Demütige Überläuferin. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur während deines Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'„Einst warst du eine Mardu, dein Körper und dein Wille stark. Jetzt müssen wir noch deinen Geist unterweisen."\\n—Houn, Jeskai-Ältester\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658880&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffe4b9f4-eed7-41c6-b4b5-acacdbd47d9d\', \'multiverseId\': 658880}, \'multiverseid\': 658880}, {\'name\': \'Desertora humilde\', \'text\': \'{T}: Roba dos cartas. El oponente objetivo gana el control de la Desertora humilde. Activa esto solo durante tu turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Fuiste mardu una vez, por lo que tu cuerpo y tu voluntad son fuertes. Ahora debemos entrenar tu mente".\\n—Hun, anciana jeskai\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659146&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28233b36-eb0f-4e55-b70b-f14501052e18\', \'multiverseId\': 659146}, \'multiverseid\': 659146}, {\'name\': \'Humble défecteur\', \'text\': "{T} : Piochez deux cartes. Un adversaire ciblé acquiert le contrôle de l\'Humble défecteur. N\'activez que pendant votre tour.", \'type\': \'Créature — humain et gredin\', \'flavor\': \'« Tu étais un Mardu, ton corps et ta volonté sont robustes. Nous devons maintenant entraîner ton esprit. »\\n—Houn, doyen jeskaï\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659412&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aac889ac-468a-450c-bb8a-d42a782d733d\', \'multiverseId\': 659412}, \'multiverseid\': 659412}, {\'name\': \'謙虚な離反者\', \'text\': \'{T}：対戦相手１人を対象とする。カード２枚を引く。そのプレイヤーは謙虚な離反者のコントロールを得る。あなたのターンにしか起動できない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'「お主はかつてマルドゥであった、故に体と意志は鍛えられている。これからはその精神を鍛えよう。」\\n――ジェスカイの長老、フーン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659678&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a15dbd43-96d2-4b14-ae3f-768e5546f9a1\', \'multiverseId\': 659678}, \'multiverseid\': 659678}, {\'name\': \'谦卑皈宗者\', \'text\': \'{T}：抓两张牌。目标对手获得谦卑皈宗者的操控权。只能于你的回合中起动。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'「你曾属玛尔都，已有健硕身躯与顽强意志。如今我们必须锻炼你的心灵。」\\n～洁斯凯长老侯恩\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659944&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a059536-19b6-4355-813e-fcbe816eba92\', \'multiverseId\': 659944}, \'multiverseid\': 659944}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dezimieren\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre ein Artefakt deiner Wahl, eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl und ein Land deiner Wahl. (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch nur wirken, falls du legale Wahlmöglichkeiten für alle seine Ziele hast.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Es gibt viele Arten von Anarchie: sozial, individuell, Gruul …\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658930&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79e79bf9-e091-4faf-acec-b98e10113dee\', \'multiverseId\': 658930}, \'multiverseid\': 658930}, {\'name\': \'Diezmar\', \'text\': \'Destruye el artefacto objetivo, la criatura objetivo, el encantamiento objetivo y la tierra objetivo. (No puedes lanzar este hechizo a menos que tengas opciones legales para todos sus objetivos.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'La anarquía llega de muchas formas: social, individual, gruul...\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659196&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfa94809-9c36-49a8-9f3f-0f900a3cfab2\', \'multiverseId\': 659196}, \'multiverseid\': 659196}, {\'name\': \'Décimation\', \'text\': "Détruisez un artefact ciblé, une créature ciblée, un enchantement ciblé et un terrain ciblé. (Vous ne pouvez pas lancer ce sort à moins que vous n\'ayez des choix légaux pour toutes ses cibles.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "L\'anarchie se présente sous bien des formes : sociale, individuelle, Gruul...", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659462&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9f7b5a8-1e5e-413c-a2ea-e2d3b5584103\', \'multiverseId\': 659462}, \'multiverseid\': 659462}, {\'name\': \'大量破壊\', \'text\': \'アーティファクト１つを対象とし、クリーチャー１体を対象とし、エンチャント１つを対象とし、土地１つを対象とする。それらを破壊する。（すべての対象を適正に選択しないかぎり、この呪文を唱えられない。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'無秩序とはさまざまな形態で存在する――社会、個人、グルール……。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659728&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ddc8a91b-34a7-4a6e-ba67-a2fbde5376eb\', \'multiverseId\': 659728}, \'multiverseid\': 659728}, {\'name\': \'摧残\', \'text\': \'消灭目标神器，目标生物，目标结界和目标地。（除非你能够选出所有合法目标，否则便不能施放此咒语。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'无政府状态有很多种形式：社会，个人，古鲁…\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659994&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b5b187a-4746-4c4f-ae8c-9143a2dbcaaf\', \'multiverseId\': 659994}, \'multiverseid\': 659994}]', "[{'name': 'Die Wiederherstellung Dominarias', 'text': '(Je eine Sagenmarke beim Ins-Spiel-Kommen und nach deinem Ziehsegment. Opfern nach III.)\\nI, II, — Du millst zwei Karten, dann kannst du eine Kreaturenkarte aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurückbringen.\\nIII — Bringe alle Länderkarten aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück und mische dann deinen Friedhof in deine Bibliothek.', 'type': 'Verzauberung — Sage', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658907&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'abd125c5-212e-4f09-b417-75b5f58702ea', 'multiverseId': 658907}, 'multiverseid': 658907}, {'name': 'La Reparación de Dominaria', 'text': '(En cuanto esta Saga entre y después de tu paso de robar, agrega un contador de sabiduría. Sacrifícala después de III.)\\nI, II — Muele dos cartas y luego puedes regresar una carta de criatura de tu cementerio a tu mano.\\nIII — Regresa todas las cartas de tierra de tu cementerio al campo de batalla y luego baraja tu cementerio en tu biblioteca.', 'type': 'Encantamiento — Saga', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659173&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '61feafdd-0ffe-4092-b676-8d1d8dcf7453', 'multiverseId': 659173}, 'multiverseid': 659173}, {'name': 'La Restauration de Dominaria', 'text': '(Au moment où cette saga arrive sur le champ de bataille et après votre étape de pioche, ajoutez un marqueur « sapience ». Sacrifiez après III.)\\nI, II — Meulez deux cartes, puis vous pouvez renvoyer une carte de créature depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.\\nIII — Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille toutes les cartes de terrain depuis votre cimetière, puis mélangez votre cimetière dans votre bibliothèque.', 'type': 'Enchantement — saga', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659439&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1c8020e7-0241-4f50-b8f1-40e16d2325ef', 'multiverseId': 659439}, 'multiverseid': 659439}, {'name': 'ドミナリアの大修復', 'text': '（この英雄譚が出た際とあなたのドロー・ステップの後に、伝承カウンター１個を加える。IIIの後に、生け贄に捧げる。）\\nI, II ― カード２枚を切削する。その後、あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚をあなたの手札に戻してもよい。\\nIII ― あなたの墓地にあるすべての土地・カードを戦場に戻す。その後、あなたの墓地をあなたのライブラリーに加えて切り直す。', 'type': 'エンチャント — 英雄譚', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659705&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0ee47e6d-a2ca-47ef-b2fe-5e15023cb955', 'multiverseId': 659705}, 'multiverseid': 659705}, {'name': '多明纳里亚愈合', 'text': '（于此传纪进战场时及于你抓牌步骤后，加一个学问指示物。到III后牺牲之。）\\nI, II — 磨两张牌，然后你可以将一张生物牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\\nIII — 将所有地牌从你的坟墓场移回战场，然后将你的坟墓场洗入你的牌库。', 'type': '结界 — 传纪', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659971&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4d22af44-f555-4132-9e20-1ca102dd997c', 'multiverseId': 659971}, 'multiverseid': 659971}]", '[{\'name\': \'Diebische Himmelstaucherin\', \'text\': \'Bonus {X}. X kann nicht 0 sein. (Du kannst zusätzlich {X} bezahlen, sowie du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst.)\\nFliegend\\nWenn die Diebische Himmelstaucherin ins Spiel kommt und falls ihre Bonuskosten bezahlt wurden, übernimm die Kontrolle über ein Artefakt deiner Wahl mit Manabetrag X oder weniger. Falls das Artefakt eine Ausrüstung ist, lege sie an die Diebische Himmelstaucherin an.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Meervolk, Räuber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658828&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd7bd7cd-b489-423d-b9de-55e73a7876d7\', \'multiverseId\': 658828}, \'multiverseid\': 658828}, {\'name\': \'Ladronzuela surcacielos\', \'text\': \'Estímulo {X}. X no puede ser 0. (Puedes pagar {X} adicionales al lanzar este hechizo.)\\nVuela.\\nCuando la Ladronzuela surcacielos entre al campo de batalla, si fue estimulada, gana el control del artefacto objetivo con valor de maná de X o menos. Si ese artefacto es un Equipo, anéxalo a la Ladronzuela surcacielos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón tritón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659094&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d628a672-bb71-4b34-9593-e9be42f4ac64\', \'multiverseId\': 659094}, \'multiverseid\': 659094}, {\'name\': \'Plongeuse céleste voleuse\', \'text\': "Kick {X}. X ne peut pas être 0. (Vous pouvez payer {X} supplémentaires au moment où vous lancez ce sort.)\\nVol\\nQuand la Plongeuse céleste voleuse arrive sur le champ de bataille, si elle a été kickée, acquérez le contrôle d\'un artefact ciblé avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à X. Si cet artefact est un équipement, attachez-le à la Plongeuse céleste voleuse.", \'type\': \'Créature — ondin et gredin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659360&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf794023-87bd-445f-a3e2-bc30e68c6bfd\', \'multiverseId\': 659360}, \'multiverseid\': 659360}, {\'name\': \'泥棒スカイダイバー\', \'text\': \'キッカー{X}。Ｘは０にできない。（この呪文を唱えるに際し、あなたは追加で{X}を支払ってもよい。）\\n飛行\\n泥棒スカイダイバーが戦場に出たとき、これがキッカーされていた場合、マナ総量がＸ以下であるアーティファクト１つを対象とする。それのコントロールを得る。そのアーティファクトが装備品なら、それを泥棒スカイダイバーにつける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — マーフォーク・ならず者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659626&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e60c9c93-d2ad-4f7b-ad2a-f41937bba816\', \'multiverseId\': 659626}, \'multiverseid\': 659626}, {\'name\': \'跃空窃贼\', \'text\': \'增幅{X}。X不能为0。（你施放此咒语时可以额外支付{X}。）\\n飞行\\n当跃空窃贼进战场时，若它已增幅，则获得目标法术力值等于或小于X的神器之操控权。若该神器是武具，则将它贴附在跃空窃贼上。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人鱼／浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659892&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9260d6e-6bf6-4f00-ba19-b10b86515472\', \'multiverseId\': 659892}, \'multiverseid\': 659892}]', '[{\'name\': \'Diebisches Mischwesen\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn des Versorgungssegments jedes Gegners manifestierst du die oberste Karte seiner Bibliothek. (Bringe sie als eine 2/2 Kreatur verdeckt ins Spiel. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Manakosten auf, falls es eine Kreaturenkarte ist.)\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, aber nicht besitzt, stirbt, verliert ihr Besitzer 2 Lebenspunkte und du erhältst 2 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Menschenaffe, Ophis\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658860&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18f9ec3a-3410-44e1-afac-d965ef93c7e2\', \'multiverseId\': 658860}, \'multiverseid\': 658860}, {\'name\': \'Amalgama ladrona\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo del mantenimiento de cada oponente, manifiestas la primera carta de la biblioteca de ese jugador. (Ponla en el campo de batalla boca abajo como una criatura 2/2. Ponla boca arriba en cualquier momento por su coste de maná si es una carta de criatura.)\\nSiempre que una criatura que controlas pero de la cual no eres propietario muera, su propietario pierde 2 vidas y tú ganas 2 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Víbora simio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659126&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'711a5417-158c-46b9-abfd-0e9fb2993ab7\', \'multiverseId\': 659126}, \'multiverseid\': 659126}, {\'name\': \'Amalgame voleur\', \'text\': "Au début de l\'entretien de chaque adversaire, vous manifestez la carte du dessus de la bibliothèque de ce joueur. (Mettez-la sur le champ de bataille face cachée comme une créature 2/2. Retournez-la face visible à tout moment pour son coût de mana si c\'est une carte de créature.)\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez mais que vous ne possédez pas meurt, son propriétaire perd 2 points de vie et vous gagnez 2 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature — grand singe et serpent\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659392&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c20a277-e165-4c9c-bf16-31af22571fcb\', \'multiverseId\': 659392}, \'multiverseid\': 659392}, {\'name\': \'盗み取る融合体\', \'text\': \'各対戦相手のアップキープの開始時に、あなたはそのプレイヤーのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を予示する。（それを裏向きの状態で２/２クリーチャーとして戦場に出す。それがクリーチャー・カードなら、そのマナ・コストで、いつでも表向きにしてよい。）\\nあなたがコントロールしていてあなたがオーナーでないクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、それのオーナーは２点のライフを失い、あなたは２点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 類人猿・蛇\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659658&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9607789e-0167-47e3-aa23-31ecdbf03acd\', \'multiverseId\': 659658}, \'multiverseid\': 659658}, {\'name\': \'行窃拼合怪\', \'text\': \'在每位对手的维持开始时，你可以显化该牌手的牌库顶牌。（将它牌面朝下地放进战场，当成2/2生物。如果该牌是生物牌，则可随时支付其法术力费用使其翻回正面。）\\n每当一个由你操控但不由你拥有的生物死去时，其拥有者失去2点生命且你获得2点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 猿猴／蛇\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659924&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1ec9fef-8eff-4af6-983b-cfd431274b47\', \'multiverseId\': 659924}, \'multiverseid\': 659924}]', '[{\'name\': \'Diebisches Ungeziefer\', \'text\': \'Todesberührung, Lebensverknüpfung\\n{T}, bezahle 1 Lebenspunkt: Erzeuge zwei Mana genau einer beliebigen Farbe. Gib dieses Mana nur aus, um Zaubersprüche zu wirken, die du nicht besitzt.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Ungeziefer\', \'flavor\': \'Nachdem sie gesehen hatte, was das Ungeziefer mit ihrer Taschenuhr anstellte, war Elsa nicht mehr sicher, ob sie sie überhaupt zurückhaben wollte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658375&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67a70f26-8aa0-4ecb-892e-e7b1bff80ac9\', \'multiverseId\': 658375}, \'multiverseid\': 658375}, {\'name\': \'Alimaña ladrona\', \'text\': \'Toque mortal, vínculo vital.\\n{T}, pagar 1 vida: Agrega dos manás de un color cualquiera. Usa este maná solo para lanzar hechizos de los cuales no eres propietario.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Alimaña\', \'flavor\': \'Tras ver lo que hacía la alimaña con su reloj de bolsillo, Elsa dudó de si quería recuperarlo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658407&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e9c315a-d42c-4f90-9e6c-d782a6d0405d\', \'multiverseId\': 658407}, \'multiverseid\': 658407}, {\'name\': \'Vermine voleuse\', \'text\': "Contact mortel, lien de vie\\n{T}, Payez 1 point de vie : Ajoutez deux manas d\'une seule couleur de votre choix. Ne dépensez ce mana que pour lancer des sorts que vous ne possédez pas.", \'type\': \'Créature — vermine\', \'flavor\': \'Après avoir vu ce que la vermine en faisait, Elsa ne voulait même pas récupérer sa montre à gousset.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658439&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'421e24c1-c7f1-4f13-aa29-858b069df9e2\', \'multiverseId\': 658439}, \'multiverseid\': 658439}, {\'name\': \'泥棒の匪獣\', \'text\': \'接死、絆魂\\n{T}, １点のライフを支払う：好きな色１色のマナ２点を加える。このマナは、あなたがオーナーでない呪文を唱えるためにしか支払えない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 匪獣\', \'flavor\': \'匪獣がそれを使って何をしているかを目にしたエルサは、自分の懐中時計を返してほしいかすら自信が持てなかった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658471&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7e27657-177a-487a-8b69-08745f7cb5e5\', \'multiverseId\': 658471}, \'multiverseid\': 658471}, {\'name\': \'窃物害兽\', \'text\': \'死触，系命\\n{T}，支付1点生命：加两点任意颜色的单色法术力。此法术力只能用来施放不由你拥有的咒语。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 害兽\', \'flavor\': \'在看到害兽如何折腾她的怀表之后，艾尔莎已不确定自己是否还想把它要回来。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658503&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16f3b4b2-46d6-4753-9aa7-536bd8c0f84d\', \'multiverseId\': 658503}, \'multiverseid\': 658503}]', '[{\'name\': \'Diebisches Ungeziefer\', \'text\': \'Todesberührung, Lebensverknüpfung\\n{T}, bezahle 1 Lebenspunkt: Erzeuge zwei Mana genau einer beliebigen Farbe. Gib dieses Mana nur aus, um Zaubersprüche zu wirken, die du nicht besitzt.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Ungeziefer\', \'flavor\': \'Nachdem sie gesehen hatte, was das Ungeziefer mit ihrer Taschenuhr anstellte, war Elsa nicht mehr sicher, ob sie sie überhaupt zurückhaben wollte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660183&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'faf124c3-48cd-4deb-bfa9-0d0e1f39a3d9\', \'multiverseId\': 660183}, \'multiverseid\': 660183}, {\'name\': \'Vermine voleuse\', \'text\': "Contact mortel, lien de vie\\n{T}, Payez 1 point de vie : Ajoutez deux manas d\'une seule couleur de votre choix. Ne dépensez ce mana que pour lancer des sorts que vous ne possédez pas.", \'type\': \'Créature — vermine\', \'flavor\': \'Après avoir vu ce que la vermine en faisait, Elsa ne voulait même pas récupérer sa montre à gousset.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660215&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ee7d8c0-3c87-4b15-a989-5916d2940516\', \'multiverseId\': 660215}, \'multiverseid\': 660215}, {\'name\': \'泥棒の匪獣\', \'text\': \'接死、絆魂\\n{T}, １点のライフを支払う：好きな色１色のマナ２点を加える。このマナは、あなたがオーナーでない呪文を唱えるためにしか支払えない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 匪獣\', \'flavor\': \'匪獣がそれを使って何をしているかを目にしたエルサは、自分の懐中時計を返してほしいかすら自信が持てなかった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660247&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef6b4cbe-3a5e-4d7d-b764-9a82f4cdc9bb\', \'multiverseId\': 660247}, \'multiverseid\': 660247}, {\'name\': \'窃物害兽\', \'text\': \'死触，系命\\n{T}，支付1点生命：加两点任意颜色的单色法术力。此法术力只能用来施放不由你拥有的咒语。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 害兽\', \'flavor\': \'在看到害兽如何折腾她的怀表之后，艾尔莎已不确定自己是否还想把它要回来。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660279&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'214a3662-ef6f-46d1-a430-95a84ad998ec\', \'multiverseId\': 660279}, \'multiverseid\': 660279}]', '[{\'name\': \'Diener der Leere\', \'text\': \'Fahl (Diese Karte hat keine Farbe.)\\n{1}{G}, lege eine Karte, die ein Gegner besitzt, aus dem Exil auf seinen Friedhof: Erzeuge einen 1/1 farblosen Eldrazi-Brut-Kreaturenspielstein. Er hat „Opfere diese Kreatur: Erzeuge {C}."\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi, Verwerter\', \'flavor\': \'Die Eldrazi löschen Leben nicht einfach aus … sie ersetzen es.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658922&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56770f7f-4c4e-4e7f-a75c-7674c48470b4\', \'multiverseId\': 658922}, \'multiverseid\': 658922}, {\'name\': \'Asistente del vacío\', \'text\': \'Vacío. (Esta carta no tiene ningún color.)\\n{1}{G}, poner una carta del exilio que sea propiedad de un oponente en el cementerio de ese jugador: Crea una ficha de criatura Vástago Eldrazi incolora 1/1. Tiene "Sacrificar esta criatura: Agrega {C}".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Metabolizador eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Los Eldrazi no se limitan a extinguir la vida: la suplantan.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659188&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67ec93b3-d9d5-400b-a0be-a81182a588ec\', \'multiverseId\': 659188}, \'multiverseid\': 659188}, {\'name\': \'Suivant du vide\', \'text\': "Carence (Cette carte n\'a pas de couleur.)\\n{1}{G}, mettez une carte qu\'un adversaire possède dans le cimetière de ce joueur depuis l\'exil : Créez un jeton de créature 1/1 incolore Eldrazi et Scion. Il a « Sacrifiez cette créature : Ajoutez {C}. »", \'type\': \'Créature — eldrazi et convertisseur\', \'flavor\': "Les Eldrazi ne se contentent pas d\'effacer toute vie, ils la supplantent.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659454&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4858a499-7866-4e4d-a334-c9157a6bc8a3\', \'multiverseId\': 659454}, \'multiverseid\': 659454}, {\'name\': \'虚空の従者\', \'text\': \'欠色（このカードは無色である。）\\n{1}{G}, 追放領域にあり対戦相手がオーナーであるカード１枚をそのプレイヤーの墓地に置く：無色の１/１のエルドラージ・末裔・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。それは「このクリーチャーを生け贄に捧げる：{C}を加える。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ・昇華者\', \'flavor\': \'エルドラージは生命を消し去るだけではない。それに取って代わるのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659720&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08570cff-6043-4930-9913-f0ccf396d5ee\', \'multiverseId\': 659720}, \'multiverseid\': 659720}, {\'name\': \'虚空侍从\', \'text\': \'虚色（此牌没有颜色。）\\n{1}{G}，将一张由对手拥有的牌从放逐区置入该牌手的坟墓场：派出一个1/1无色奥札奇／孽裔衍生生物。它具有「牺牲此生物：加{C}。」\', \'type\': \'生物 — 奥札奇／噬体\', \'flavor\': \'奥札奇不只是灭绝生命～它们取而代之。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659986&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a83b503f-c55b-412e-8bb6-5702efac1668\', \'multiverseId\': 659986}, \'multiverseid\': 659986}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dimir-Aquädukt\', \'text\': \'Das Dimir-Aquädukt kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn das Dimir-Aquädukt ins Spiel kommt, bringe ein Land, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658998&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'196a404d-5e7f-4972-8872-121a6be25099\', \'multiverseId\': 658998}, \'multiverseid\': 658998}, {\'name\': \'Acueducto dimir\', \'text\': \'El Acueducto dimir entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Acueducto dimir entre al campo de batalla, regresa una tierra que controlas a la mano de su propietario.\\n{T}: Agrega {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659264&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29be60f7-be4f-4e45-ad5a-deea3414028d\', \'multiverseId\': 659264}, \'multiverseid\': 659264}, {\'name\': \'Aqueduc de Dimir\', \'text\': "L\'Aqueduc de Dimir arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand l\'Aqueduc de Dimir arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez un terrain que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U}{B}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659530&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e18fc390-52d8-401b-95de-b0e98a6efd42\', \'multiverseId\': 659530}, \'multiverseid\': 659530}, {\'name\': \'ディミーアの水路\', \'text\': \'ディミーアの水路はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nディミーアの水路が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：{U}{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659796&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a2c7934-8dbf-4354-aba1-1ea60ba95676\', \'multiverseId\': 659796}, \'multiverseid\': 659796}, {\'name\': \'底密尔下水道\', \'text\': \'底密尔下水道须横置进战场。\\n当底密尔下水道进战场时，将一个由你操控的地移回其拥有者手上。\\n{T}：加{U}{B}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660062&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6f50c7f-443f-46dc-8d0d-c364d9c66555\', \'multiverseId\': 660062}, \'multiverseid\': 660062}]', '[{\'name\': \'Donnerschlag-Sceada\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nSpontanzauber und Hexereien, die du wirkst, kosten beim Wirken {1} weniger.\\n{2}{U}, opfere den Donnerschlag-Sceada: Wenn du in diesem Zug deinen nächsten Spontanzauber oder deine nächste Hexerei wirkst, kopiere jenen Zauberspruch so oft, wie du deinen Commander in dieser Partie aus deiner Kommandozone gewirkt hast.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Sceada\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658369&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'084b982d-105a-4020-b38e-4f5f67d4642b\', \'multiverseId\': 658369}, \'multiverseid\': 658369}, {\'name\': \'Draco golpetrueno\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nTe cuesta {1} menos lanzar hechizos de instantáneo o de conjuro.\\n{2}{U}, sacrificar el Draco golpetrueno: Cuando lances tu próximo hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro este turno, cópialo por cada vez que hayas lanzado a tu comandante desde la zona de mando este juego.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Draco\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658401&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00e318a3-14f0-46bb-b210-ec844d194ae3\', \'multiverseId\': 658401}, \'multiverseid\': 658401}, {\'name\': \'Drakôn du tonnerre\', \'text\': "Vol\\nLes sorts d\'éphémère et de rituel que vous lancez coûtent {1} de moins à lancer.\\n{2}{U}, sacrifiez le Drakôn du tonnerre : Quand vous lancez votre prochain sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel ce tour-ci, copiez-le pour chaque fois que vous avez lancé votre commandant depuis la zone de commandement pendant cette partie.", \'type\': \'Créature — drakôn\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658433&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'850e63de-94ec-4fd5-a68e-6df48805b7ad\', \'multiverseId\': 658433}, \'multiverseid\': 658433}, {\'name\': \'雷音のドレイク\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたがインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるためのコストは{1}少なくなる。\\n{2}{U}, 雷音のドレイクを生け贄に捧げる：このターン、あなたがインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を次に唱えたとき、このゲームであなたが統率領域からあなたの統率者を唱えた１回につき１回それをコピーする。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドレイク\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658465&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1186374f-6746-4095-b236-8ebfd7869657\', \'multiverseId\': 658465}, \'multiverseid\': 658465}, {\'name\': \'雷鸣龙兽\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n你施放的瞬间与法术咒语减少{1}来施放。\\n{2}{U}，牺牲雷鸣龙兽：本回合中，当你施放你的下一个瞬间或法术咒语时，你本盘游戏中每从统帅区施放过一次你的指挥官，便将该咒语复制一次。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 龙兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658497&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b5b55c2-deaf-4cbc-bb4e-4d041b0c945e\', \'multiverseId\': 658497}, \'multiverseid\': 658497}]', '[{\'name\': \'Donnerschlag-Sceada\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nSpontanzauber und Hexereien, die du wirkst, kosten beim Wirken {1} weniger.\\n{2}{U}, opfere den Donnerschlag-Sceada: Wenn du in diesem Zug deinen nächsten Spontanzauber oder deine nächste Hexerei wirkst, kopiere jenen Zauberspruch so oft, wie du deinen Commander in dieser Partie aus deiner Kommandozone gewirkt hast.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Sceada\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660177&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'add9758d-e1af-49be-a88b-fdcd7f0b401c\', \'multiverseId\': 660177}, \'multiverseid\': 660177}, {\'name\': \'Drakôn du tonnerre\', \'text\': "Vol\\nLes sorts d\'éphémère et de rituel que vous lancez coûtent {1} de moins à lancer.\\n{2}{U}, sacrifiez le Drakôn du tonnerre : Quand vous lancez votre prochain sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel ce tour-ci, copiez-le pour chaque fois que vous avez lancé votre commandant depuis la zone de commandement pendant cette partie.", \'type\': \'Créature — drakôn\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660209&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f3af448-d19b-4e65-98db-b286541c0e87\', \'multiverseId\': 660209}, \'multiverseid\': 660209}, {\'name\': \'雷音のドレイク\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたがインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるためのコストは{1}少なくなる。\\n{2}{U}, 雷音のドレイクを生け贄に捧げる：このターン、あなたがインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を次に唱えたとき、このゲームであなたが統率領域からあなたの統率者を唱えた１回につき１回それをコピーする。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドレイク\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660241&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0746b6c-1167-4b96-8bb3-e87f78de5460\', \'multiverseId\': 660241}, \'multiverseid\': 660241}, {\'name\': \'雷鸣龙兽\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n你施放的瞬间与法术咒语减少{1}来施放。\\n{2}{U}，牺牲雷鸣龙兽：本回合中，当你施放你的下一个瞬间或法术咒语时，你本盘游戏中每从统帅区施放过一次你的指挥官，便将该咒语复制一次。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 龙兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660273&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'542aaac6-36be-4126-b19d-05302728c3e5\', \'multiverseId\': 660273}, \'multiverseid\': 660273}]', "[{'name': 'Drachenschädel-Pass', 'text': 'Der Drachenschädel-Pass kommt getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du kontrollierst einen Sumpf oder ein Gebirge.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B} oder {R}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658999&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '783b477c-54c0-4045-b10b-388245a9ddfd', 'multiverseId': 658999}, 'multiverseid': 658999}, {'name': 'Cumbre Cráneo de Dragón', 'text': 'La Cumbre Cráneo de Dragón entra al campo de batalla girada a menos que controles un Pantano o una Montaña.\\n{T}: Agrega {B} o {R}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659265&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e3ed3c1e-bf66-472a-9def-5eedff59c155', 'multiverseId': 659265}, 'multiverseid': 659265}, {'name': 'Sommet du Crânedragon', 'text': 'Le Sommet du Crânedragon arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé à moins que vous ne contrôliez un marais ou une montagne.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B} ou {R}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659531&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c69d596a-a2d2-4dd8-9bf3-887c00bdcdae', 'multiverseId': 659531}, 'multiverseid': 659531}, {'name': '竜髑髏の山頂', 'text': 'あなたが沼や山をコントロールしていないかぎり、竜髑髏の山頂はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{B}か{R}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659797&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '577182b1-2f1c-4685-af6f-3c2ac6f05244', 'multiverseId': 659797}, 'multiverseid': 659797}, {'name': '龙颅山峰', 'text': '除非你操控沼泽或山脉，否则龙颅山峰须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{B}或{R}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660063&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7f94304c-f3e9-41f9-b5a3-969354993b56', 'multiverseId': 660063}, 'multiverseid': 660063}]", '[{\'name\': \'Drei Besuche\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Wald-Karte, bringe sie ins Spiel und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Diejenigen, die den Wald lieben, wollen nur seine majestätische Schönheit vergrößern.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658919&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2440121-c996-4285-ac69-fc871e63b83b\', \'multiverseId\': 658919}, \'multiverseid\': 658919}, {\'name\': \'Tres visitas\', \'text\': \'Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de Bosque, ponla en el campo de batalla y luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Aquellos que aman el bosque solo desean extender su majestuosidad.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659185&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31616f7e-e57a-4290-9684-80474cf2f0ce\', \'multiverseId\': 659185}, \'multiverseid\': 659185}, {\'name\': \'Trois visites\', \'text\': \'Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de forêt, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille, puis mélangez.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Ceux qui aiment la forêt ne souhaitent qu\'étendre sa majesté.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659451&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5666418-1f17-45ef-8557-2c768456f973\', \'multiverseId\': 659451}, \'multiverseid\': 659451}, {\'name\': \'三顧の礼\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーから森・カード１枚を探し、戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'木々を愛する者たちは、単にその威厳を広めたいのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659717&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3809589f-c298-4d45-a553-524538e786ed\', \'multiverseId\': 659717}, \'multiverseid\': 659717}, {\'name\': \'三顾茅庐\', \'text\': \'从你牌库中搜寻一张树林牌，将之放进战场，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'真爱树林者，一心只求传播其间之壮美。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659983&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'184ffb0d-aeb7-4723-9dc2-873e8aff6f8c\', \'multiverseId\': 659983}, \'multiverseid\': 659983}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dschungelschrein\', \'text\': \'Der Dschungelschrein kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {R}, {G} oder {W}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Auf Naya sind Ehrgeiz und Verrat selten geworden, fast ausgerottet von der Ehrfurcht, die dort den irdischen Göttern entgegengebracht wird.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659013&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b200f5e1-1df1-4838-9497-cdf3398920a0\', \'multiverseId\': 659013}, \'multiverseid\': 659013}, {\'name\': \'Altar de la jungla\', \'text\': \'El Altar de la jungla entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {R}, {G} o {W}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'En Naya, la ambición y la traición no son corrientes, llevadas casi a la extinción por la veneración a los dioses terrestres.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659279&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b414b75-5cfc-4b01-bc04-9192909f4c46\', \'multiverseId\': 659279}, \'multiverseid\': 659279}, {\'name\': \'Reliquaire de la jungle\', \'text\': \'Le Reliquaire de la jungle arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R}, {G} ou {W}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Sur Naya, l\'ambition et la traîtrise sont rares. La dévotion aux divinités terrestres les a presque portées à l\'extinction.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659545&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2241b65-b8dc-4a10-89bd-af1bddd484a6\', \'multiverseId\': 659545}, \'multiverseid\': 659545}, {\'name\': \'ジャングルの祭殿\', \'text\': \'ジャングルの祭殿はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{R}か{G}か{W}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'ナヤでは、地上の神への畏怖から、野心や裏切りは絶滅に近いほど狩りつくされている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659811&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fdcf3718-1fc0-4f0c-a486-f80c215b8c21\', \'multiverseId\': 659811}, \'multiverseid\': 659811}, {\'name\': \'丛林祭祠\', \'text\': \'丛林祭祠须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{R}，{G}或{W}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'野心与背叛在纳雅并不常见，早已被对现世神明的崇敬猎捕得近乎灭绝。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660077&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d0accb09-443c-4e5e-944d-4fc81c62f59d\', \'multiverseId\': 660077}, \'multiverseid\': 660077}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dunkelschlickküste\', \'text\': \'Die Dunkelschlickküste kommt getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du kontrollierst zwei oder weniger andere Länder.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U} oder {B}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Wo Neugier auf Grausamkeit trifft, entstehen abscheuliche Erfindungen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658991&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56410ab0-fa7b-4895-8f78-6d6ab3a4b6aa\', \'multiverseId\': 658991}, \'multiverseid\': 658991}, {\'name\': \'Playas de Fangoscuro\', \'text\': \'Las Playas de Fangoscuro entran al campo de batalla giradas a menos que controles otras dos o menos tierras.\\n{T}: Agrega {U} o {B}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando se unen la curiosidad y la crueldad, se engendran innovaciones espantosas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659257&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2cbb9e3a-1bf5-44b9-8a0f-62dae1d6e8b9\', \'multiverseId\': 659257}, \'multiverseid\': 659257}, {\'name\': \'Rivages de Nappenoire\', \'text\': \'Les Rivages de Nappenoire arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagés à moins que vous ne contrôliez deux autres terrains ou moins.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U} ou {B}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Là où la curiosité rencontre la cruauté, d\'horribles innovations naissent.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659523&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9e97438-3641-44a6-a23b-5cdf28b9f68e\', \'multiverseId\': 659523}, \'multiverseid\': 659523}, {\'name\': \'闇滑りの岸\', \'text\': \'あなたがこれでない３つ以上の土地をコントロールしているなら、闇滑りの岸はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{U}か{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'好奇心と残酷さが出会うところで、恐ろしいほどの革新が興る。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659789&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7cd0323d-e7d3-46d9-8f04-555e0364e2c8\', \'multiverseId\': 659789}, \'multiverseid\': 659789}, {\'name\': \'暗光海滨\', \'text\': \'除非你操控两个或更少其他地，否则暗光海滨须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{U}或{B}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'在好奇与残暴交汇之处，骇人发明日新月异。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660055&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'832add04-c1fa-4ef1-bff0-345eb50258bf\', \'multiverseId\': 660055}, \'multiverseid\': 660055}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dunkelwasser-Katakomben\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Erzeuge {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Schlammige Wellen an der Küste Otarias verbergen die vergessenen Überreste des Krieges mit den Phyrexianern.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658992&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4066d86-9573-4623-ad6d-a94036052cc4\', \'multiverseId\': 658992}, \'multiverseid\': 658992}, {\'name\': \'Catacumbas Aguanegra\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Agrega {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Las lóbregas mareas otarianas esconden las traiciones olvidadas de la guerra pirexiana.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659258&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f37d284e-7880-4457-bd81-6aa0b8717e71\', \'multiverseId\': 659258}, \'multiverseid\': 659258}, {\'name\': \'Catacombes de Sombreau\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {U}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Les boueuses vagues d\'Otaria cachent les horreurs oubliées de la guerre phyrexiane.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659524&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9b55d37-0770-4ef9-a520-f6a9a2343e87\', \'multiverseId\': 659524}, \'multiverseid\': 659524}, {\'name\': \'ダークウォーターの地下墓地\', \'text\': \'{1},{T}：{U}{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'オタリアの濁った潮流が、ファイレクシア戦の古い裏切り行為を覆い隠している。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659790&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81202c07-e7e5-48bb-a5ba-0bcd0529560f\', \'multiverseId\': 659790}, \'multiverseid\': 659790}, {\'name\': \'黑水陵墓\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}：加{U}{B}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'欧塔利亚的黑色浪潮，掩藏着非瑞克西亚战争中已被遗忘的变节旧事。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660056&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6291c8b2-d9f6-49b1-a3ba-194758ac423b\', \'multiverseId\': 660056}, \'multiverseid\': 660056}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dünen der Toten\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\nWenn die Dünen der Toten aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt werden, erzeuge einen 2/2 schwarzen Zombie-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Land — Wüste\', \'flavor\': \'Den Fluch des Umherirrens gab es bereits lange bevor Nicol Bolas Fuß auf Amonkhet setzte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659001&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'495ec2ba-4620-4dda-9e97-f809341458b7\', \'multiverseId\': 659001}, \'multiverseid\': 659001}, {\'name\': \'Dunas de los difuntos\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\nCuando las Dunas de los difuntos vayan a un cementerio desde el campo de batalla, crea una ficha de criatura Zombie negra 2/2.\', \'type\': \'Tierra — Desierto\', \'flavor\': \'La maldición de los errantes ya impregnaba Amonkhet mucho antes de la llegada de Nicol Bolas. Él simplemente se aprovechó de ella.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659267&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'491afc9a-0880-4fa9-9109-4eac7991f3ff\', \'multiverseId\': 659267}, \'multiverseid\': 659267}, {\'name\': \'Dunes des morts\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\nQuand les Dunes des morts sont mises dans un cimetière depuis le champ de bataille, créez un jeton de créature 2/2 noire Zombie.\', \'type\': \'Terrain — désert\', \'flavor\': "La Malédiction d\'errance existait sur Amonkhet bien avant l\'arrivée de Nicol Bolas. Il se contenta de l\'exploiter.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659533&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab047c3b-2843-4b3b-bd88-61e10d01b4ca\', \'multiverseId\': 659533}, \'multiverseid\': 659533}, {\'name\': \'死者の砂丘\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n死者の砂丘が戦場から墓地に置かれたとき、黒の２/２のゾンビ・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'土地 — 砂漠\', \'flavor\': \'放浪の呪いは以前からアモンケットに広まっていた。ニコル・ボーラスは単にそれを利用したに過ぎない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659799&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edd3349e-86e8-4a60-bdcc-8bf03f455ccb\', \'multiverseId\': 659799}, \'multiverseid\': 659799}, {\'name\': \'亡者沙丘\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n当亡者沙丘从战场进入坟墓场时，派出一个2/2黑色灵俑衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'地 — 沙漠\', \'flavor\': \'在尼可波拉斯来到阿芒凯之前，漂浪诅咒就已存在。他只不过是将之为己所用。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660065&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7ea1414-cfd2-41ac-be07-134a8550a4ba\', \'multiverseId\': 660065}, \'multiverseid\': 660065}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dünensänger\', \'text\': \'Reichweite\\nLänder, die du kontrollierst, und Länderkarten, die du besitzt und die nicht im Spiel sind, sind zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Typen Wüsten.\\nLänder, die du kontrollierst, haben „{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe."\\n{T}: Du millst zwei Karten. Du erhältst für jede Länderkarte, die auf diese Weise gemillt wurde, 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Pflanze, Druide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658383&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b5e576b-efae-4177-a620-3556fb13795c\', \'multiverseId\': 658383}, \'multiverseid\': 658383}, {\'name\': \'Cantante de las dunas\', \'text\': \'Alcance.\\nLas tierras que controlas y las cartas de tierra de las cuales eres propietario que no están en el campo de batalla son Desiertos además de sus otros tipos.\\nLas tierras que controlas tienen "{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color".\\n{T}: Muele dos cartas. Ganas 1 vida por cada carta de tierra molida de esta manera.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida planta\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658415&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a41a8e07-9e9d-45f6-8117-1070dd09f496\', \'multiverseId\': 658415}, \'multiverseid\': 658415}, {\'name\': \'Incantateur des dunes\', \'text\': \'Portée\\nLes terrains que vous contrôlez et les cartes de terrain que vous possédez qui ne sont pas sur le champ de bataille sont des déserts en plus de leurs autres types.\\nLes terrains que vous contrôlez ont : « {T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix. »\\n{T} : Meulez deux cartes. Vous gagnez 1 point de vie pour chaque carte de terrain meulée de cette manière.\', \'type\': \'Créature — plante et druide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658447&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'363d4c09-520b-4cf5-beb1-6a0655e43ded\', \'multiverseId\': 658447}, \'multiverseid\': 658447}, {\'name\': \'砂丘の詠唱者\', \'text\': \'到達\\nあなたがコントロールしているすべての土地と、あなたがオーナーであり戦場にないすべての土地・カードは、他のタイプに加えて砂漠である。\\nあなたがコントロールしているすべての土地は「{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。」を持つ。\\n{T}：カード２枚を切削する。あなたは、これにより切削した土地・カード１枚につき１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 植物・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658479&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c521a2d-08b6-4c1c-812e-149582600232\', \'multiverseId\': 658479}, \'multiverseid\': 658479}, {\'name\': \'沙丘吟颂师\', \'text\': \'延势\\n由你操控的地和由你拥有且不在战场上的地牌均额外具有沙漠此类别。\\n由你操控的地具有「{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力。」\\n{T}：磨两张牌。每以此法磨掉一张地牌，你便获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 植物／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658511&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6cedc1fb-ecad-4b9f-92a3-f4e948c3abad\', \'multiverseId\': 658511}, \'multiverseid\': 658511}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dünensänger\', \'text\': \'Reichweite\\nLänder, die du kontrollierst, und Länderkarten, die du besitzt und die nicht im Spiel sind, sind zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Typen Wüsten.\\nLänder, die du kontrollierst, haben „{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe."\\n{T}: Du millst zwei Karten. Du erhältst für jede Länderkarte, die auf diese Weise gemillt wurde, 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Pflanze, Druide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660191&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'971e6069-b8a1-47df-a592-4473dcf5d310\', \'multiverseId\': 660191}, \'multiverseid\': 660191}, {\'name\': \'Incantateur des dunes\', \'text\': \'Portée\\nLes terrains que vous contrôlez et les cartes de terrain que vous possédez qui ne sont pas sur le champ de bataille sont des déserts en plus de leurs autres types.\\nLes terrains que vous contrôlez ont : « {T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix. »\\n{T} : Meulez deux cartes. Vous gagnez 1 point de vie pour chaque carte de terrain meulée de cette manière.\', \'type\': \'Créature — plante et druide\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660223&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da5541be-675b-49ee-b296-426ab944d0a6\', \'multiverseId\': 660223}, \'multiverseid\': 660223}, {\'name\': \'砂丘の詠唱者\', \'text\': \'到達\\nあなたがコントロールしているすべての土地と、あなたがオーナーであり戦場にないすべての土地・カードは、他のタイプに加えて砂漠である。\\nあなたがコントロールしているすべての土地は「{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。」を持つ。\\n{T}：カード２枚を切削する。あなたは、これにより切削した土地・カード１枚につき１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 植物・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660255&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f1ecc42-99eb-4e16-bccb-4a5dee7abdaf\', \'multiverseId\': 660255}, \'multiverseid\': 660255}, {\'name\': \'沙丘吟颂师\', \'text\': \'延势\\n由你操控的地和由你拥有且不在战场上的地牌均额外具有沙漠此类别。\\n由你操控的地具有「{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力。」\\n{T}：磨两张牌。每以此法磨掉一张地牌，你便获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 植物／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660287&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08e24530-23d1-41fe-bbd2-69e15ec74bed\', \'multiverseId\': 660287}, \'multiverseid\': 660287}]', '[{\'name\': \'Edric, Meisterspion von Trest\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Kreatur einem deiner Gegner Kampfschaden zufügt, kann ihr Beherrscher eine Karte ziehen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elf, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'„Es steht mir nicht frei, meine Quellen zu nennen, aber ich kann dir versichern, dass das Kopfgeld auf dich hoch ist."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658931&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48a258ed-856d-46b7-a7ed-416f0b6b9f07\', \'multiverseId\': 658931}, \'multiverseid\': 658931}, {\'name\': \'Edric, maestro espía de Trest\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura haga daño de combate a uno de tus oponentes, su controlador puede robar una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Bribón elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"No tengo la libertad de revelar mis fuentes, pero puedo asegurarte que pagan mucho por tu cabeza".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659197&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3dc10c44-d27b-41d7-b211-cd962d65e599\', \'multiverseId\': 659197}, \'multiverseid\': 659197}, {\'name\': \'Edric, maître espion de Trest\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature inflige des blessures de combat à l\'un de vos adversaires, son contrôleur peut piocher une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — elfe et gredin\', \'flavor\': \'« Je ne suis pas libre de révéler mes sources, mais je peux vous assurer que votre tête est fort mise à prix. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659463&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4cdf119f-29ff-4fa0-b203-bb98765f5c2e\', \'multiverseId\': 659463}, \'multiverseid\': 659463}, {\'name\': \'トレストの密偵長、エドリック\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体があなたの対戦相手１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、それのコントローラーはカード１枚を引いてもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エルフ・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'「情報元を明かすわけにはいかないが、お前の首の値段が高いのだけは保証する。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659729&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'437ad3dd-28ca-40ed-ab42-7441f525e835\', \'multiverseId\': 659729}, \'multiverseid\': 659729}, {\'name\': \'崔斯特密探长埃卓克\', \'text\': \'每当一个生物向你的任一对手造成战斗伤害时，其操控者可以抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 妖精／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'「虽然我不能透露情报来源，但可以向你保证的是，你的脑袋很值钱。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659995&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d87c697a-edb6-40ce-bf97-9eaaed6ca6b1\', \'multiverseId\': 659995}, \'multiverseid\': 659995}]', '[{\'name\': \'Eindringender Schattenmagier\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Furcht (Diese Kreatur kann außer von Artefaktkreaturen und/oder schwarzen Kreaturen nicht geblockt werden.)\\nImmer wenn der Eindringende Schattenmagier einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, kannst du eine Karte ziehen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658950&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8e6f8c7-08bf-48b5-a2b1-3462250f3454\', \'multiverseId\': 658950}, \'multiverseid\': 658950}, {\'name\': \'Espía magosombra\', \'text\': \'Inspirar temor. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada excepto por criaturas artefacto y/o criaturas negras.)\\nSiempre que el Espía magosombra haga daño de combate a un jugador, puedes robar una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659216&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29907b0f-507f-4cf0-abc1-dffed3fda09d\', \'multiverseId\': 659216}, \'multiverseid\': 659216}, {\'name\': \'Infiltrateur ombremage\', \'text\': "Peur (Cette créature ne peut pas être bloquée excepté par des créatures-artefacts et/ou des créatures noires.)\\nÀ chaque fois que l\'Infiltrateur ombremage inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, vous pouvez piocher une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature — humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659482&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18312bc9-eb6c-4c97-815d-49f710058577\', \'multiverseId\': 659482}, \'multiverseid\': 659482}, {\'name\': \'影魔道士の浸透者\', \'text\': \'畏怖（このクリーチャーは、アーティファクトでも黒でもないクリーチャーにはブロックされない。）\\n影魔道士の浸透者がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたはカード１枚を引いてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659748&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e5b7346-60dc-4194-a3ab-4fe82760cbdf\', \'multiverseId\': 659748}, \'multiverseid\': 659748}, {\'name\': \'渗透影法师\', \'text\': \'恐惧（此生物只能被神器生物和／或黑色生物阻挡。）\\n每当渗透影法师对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，你可以抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660014&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0f094e6-570d-4061-852a-c71a08faa94d\', \'multiverseId\': 660014}, \'multiverseid\': 660014}]', '[{\'name\': \'Elektrische Offenbarung\', \'text\': \'Wirf als zusätzliche Kosten, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken, eine Karte ab.\\nZiehe zwei Karten.\\nRückblende {3}{R} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten und zusätzliche Kosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658873&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc343a75-0444-4d15-8f07-e84a05268f25\', \'multiverseId\': 658873}, \'multiverseid\': 658873}, {\'name\': \'Revelación eléctrica\', \'text\': \'Como coste adicional para lanzar este hechizo, descarta una carta.\\nRoba dos cartas.\\nRetrospectiva {3}{R}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva y cualquier coste adicional. Luego exíliala.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659139&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a80a1229-4f36-46f9-aaa9-2be5a6d1b17e\', \'multiverseId\': 659139}, \'multiverseid\': 659139}, {\'name\': \'Révélation électrique\', \'text\': "En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer ce sort, défaussez-vous d\'une carte.\\nPiochez deux cartes.\\nFlashback {3}{R} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback et ses coûts supplémentaires. Exilez-la ensuite.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659405&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c5174f9-4862-4ce1-b68d-1aec51e6924a\', \'multiverseId\': 659405}, \'multiverseid\': 659405}, {\'name\': \'電撃の啓示\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるための追加コストとして、カード１枚を捨てる。\\nカード２枚を引く。\\nフラッシュバック{3}{R}（あなたの墓地にあるこのカードを、フラッシュバック・コストと追加コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659671&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'667c7dac-4b3e-4254-aced-47e30dd1099a\', \'multiverseId\': 659671}, \'multiverseid\': 659671}, {\'name\': \'电激启示\', \'text\': \'弃一张牌，以作为施放此咒语的额外费用。\\n抓两张牌。\\n返照{3}{R}（你可以从你坟墓场中施放此牌，并支付其返照费用及额外费用，然后将它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659937&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'975eb698-fdb0-4c9e-af59-b0e82d761af3\', \'multiverseId\': 659937}, \'multiverseid\': 659937}]', '[{\'name\': \'Elektrostatisches Feld\', \'text\': \'Verteidiger\\nImmer wenn du einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkst, fügt das Elektrostatische Feld jedem Gegner 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mauer\', \'flavor\': \'„Es ist sowohl eine Zugangssperre als auch eine dekorative Wandbeleuchtung!"\\n—Daxiver, Izzet-Elektromagier\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658874&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90ca6063-b685-44c4-8b37-e9174b237c76\', \'multiverseId\': 658874}, \'multiverseid\': 658874}, {\'name\': \'Campo electrostático\', \'text\': \'Defensor.\\nSiempre que lances un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro, el Campo electrostático hace 1 punto de daño a cada oponente.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Muro\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Es a la vez un mecanismo que impide la entrada y un bonito sistema de luces para el pasillo!".\\n—Dáxiver, electromante ízzet\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659140&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c3cb791-7d5d-453c-8441-8160adccbfad\', \'multiverseId\': 659140}, \'multiverseid\': 659140}, {\'name\': \'Champ électrostatique\', \'text\': "Défenseur\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel, le Champ électrostatique inflige 1 blessure à chaque adversaire.", \'type\': \'Créature — mur\', \'flavor\': "« C\'est à la fois un mécanisme anti-pénétration et un éclairage de couloir esthétique ! »\\n—Daxiver, électromancien d\'Izzet", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659406&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8177d8c-c100-4805-b476-2ad868e15aa6\', \'multiverseId\': 659406}, \'multiverseid\': 659406}, {\'name\': \'静電場\', \'text\': \'防衛\\nあなたがインスタントかソーサリーである呪文１つを唱えるたび、静電場は各対戦相手にそれぞれ１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 壁\', \'flavor\': \'「これは侵入拒否の装置でありながら、廊下を照らす美しい照明でもある！」\\n――イゼットの電術師、ダクシヴァー\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659672&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'322e0f5d-099d-4980-b1dc-a87deb5ff0e9\', \'multiverseId\': 659672}, \'multiverseid\': 659672}, {\'name\': \'静电力场\', \'text\': \'守军\\n每当你施放瞬间或法术咒语时，静电力场向每位对手各造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 墙\', \'flavor\': \'「这东西既是个不错的门禁装置，也是盏漂亮的廊灯！」\\n～伊捷电流术士达西维\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659938&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b36f8f0-be08-4a5e-86e6-d99c8492c9d7\', \'multiverseId\': 659938}, \'multiverseid\': 659938}]', "[{'name': 'Elementarausbruch', 'text': 'Erzeuge einen 4/4 roten Drache-Elementarwesen-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit und Bravour.\\nSturm (Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, kopiere ihn einmal für jeden Zauberspruch, der in diesem Zug vor ihm gewirkt wurde.)', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': 'Der Krater schrie in den Wind, und der Wind trug seine feurige Stimme über den Himmel.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658379&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3d04886d-9ec0-482e-a9fe-6b6043a22cb4', 'multiverseId': 658379}, 'multiverseid': 658379}, {'name': 'Erupción elemental', 'text': 'Crea una ficha de criatura Elemental Dragón roja 4/4 con las habilidades de volar y destreza.\\nTormenta. (Cuando lances este hechizo, cópialo por cada hechizo lanzado antes que él en este turno.)', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': 'El cráter lanzó un rugido al viento, y el viento llevó su voz ardiente a través del cielo.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658411&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eb42a45b-0f32-4bce-8677-b23fd30afbf6', 'multiverseId': 658411}, 'multiverseid': 658411}, {'name': 'Éruption élémentaire', 'text': 'Créez un jeton de créature 4/4 rouge Élémental et Dragon avec le vol et la prouesse.\\nDéluge (Quand vous lancez ce sort, copiez-le pour chaque sort lancé avant lui ce tour-ci.)', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': 'Le cratère hurla au vent, et le vent porta sa voix ardente dans le ciel.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658443&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1b0e9c67-6b5b-46fa-bb8c-5dd123bf1789', 'multiverseId': 658443}, 'multiverseid': 658443}, {'name': '精霊の噴火', 'text': '飛行と果敢を持つ赤の４/４のドラゴン・エレメンタル・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\nストーム（あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、これを、このターンにこれより前に唱えられた呪文の数と同じ回数コピーする。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '噴火口は風に叫び、その風は焼けるような声を大空へと運ぶ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658475&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bc6898ec-8682-48f6-a715-75b0a028f8a4', 'multiverseId': 658475}, 'multiverseid': 658475}, {'name': '元素爆发', 'text': '派出一个4/4红色，具飞行与灵技异能的龙／元素衍生生物。\\n风暴（当施放此咒语时，本回合于它之前每施放过一个咒语，便将此咒语复制一次。）', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '火山口尖啸着直冲云霄，其炽热喧嚣随着狂风传遍天际。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658507&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '66c3d15d-54d2-4220-b1dc-f116d6917d4a', 'multiverseId': 658507}, 'multiverseid': 658507}]", "[{'name': 'Elementarausbruch', 'text': 'Erzeuge einen 4/4 roten Drache-Elementarwesen-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit und Bravour.\\nSturm', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': 'Der Krater schrie in den Wind, und der Wind trug seine feurige Stimme über den Himmel.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660187&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '684b52c7-c7ae-45f6-a86b-a7c61f240e1e', 'multiverseId': 660187}, 'multiverseid': 660187}, {'name': 'Éruption élémentaire', 'text': 'Créez un jeton de créature 4/4 rouge Élémental et Dragon avec le vol et la prouesse.\\nDéluge', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': 'Le cratère hurla au vent, et le vent porta sa voix ardente dans le ciel.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660219&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0c90192d-6d88-45f6-8c93-3737416552cd', 'multiverseId': 660219}, 'multiverseid': 660219}, {'name': '精霊の噴火', 'text': '飛行と果敢を持つ赤の４/４のドラゴン・エレメンタル・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\nストーム', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '噴火口は風に叫び、その風は焼けるような声を大空へと運ぶ。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660251&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '49c83018-443a-4380-86ad-483b1276ffaa', 'multiverseId': 660251}, 'multiverseid': 660251}, {'name': '元素爆发', 'text': '派出一个4/4红色，具飞行与灵技异能的龙／元素衍生生物。\\n风暴', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '火山口尖啸着直冲云霄，其炽热喧嚣随着狂风传遍天际。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660283&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd00743bb-8f69-4248-9825-d6c5f2150ef7', 'multiverseId': 660283}, 'multiverseid': 660283}]", "[{'name': 'Elfischer Verjüngerer', 'text': 'Wenn der Elfische Verjüngerer ins Spiel kommt, schaue dir die obersten fünf Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst davon eine Länderkarte getappt ins Spiel bringen. Lege den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Elf, Druide', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658901&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '23d904b7-ba63-4178-a6b0-134583dd8d1f', 'multiverseId': 658901}, 'multiverseid': 658901}, {'name': 'Elfo rejuvenecedor', 'text': 'Cuando el Elfo rejuvenecedor entre al campo de batalla, mira las cinco primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Puedes poner en el campo de batalla girada una carta de tierra de entre ellas. Pon el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.', 'type': 'Criatura — Druida elfo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659167&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '11b91fbf-9bbd-40b6-94a3-c629c5a3db27', 'multiverseId': 659167}, 'multiverseid': 659167}, {'name': 'Rajeunisseur elfe', 'text': 'Quand le Rajeunisseur elfe arrive sur le champ de bataille, regardez les cinq cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez mettre sur le champ de bataille, engagée, une carte de terrain parmi elles. Mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.', 'type': 'Créature — elfe et druide', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659433&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'befb6252-5d5d-4739-a7b7-5d7361aad777', 'multiverseId': 659433}, 'multiverseid': 659433}, {'name': 'エルフの再生者', 'text': 'エルフの再生者が戦場に出たとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード５枚を見る。その中から土地・カード１枚をタップ状態で戦場に出してもよい。残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エルフ・ドルイド', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659699&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0555c524-bc91-469c-838e-1b4abef4dbc4', 'multiverseId': 659699}, 'multiverseid': 659699}, {'name': '回春妖精', 'text': '当回春妖精进战场时，检视你牌库顶的五张牌。你可以将其中一张地牌横置放进战场。将其余的牌以随机顺序置于你牌库底。', 'type': '生物 — 妖精／德鲁伊', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659965&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7ad10c49-d4d7-4c93-88eb-dbe93dafb283', 'multiverseId': 659965}, 'multiverseid': 659965}]", '[{\'name\': \'Engel der Ruinen\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Engel der Ruinen ins Spiel kommt, schicke bis zu zwei Artefakte und/oder Verzauberungen deiner Wahl ins Exil.\\nEbenenumwandlung {2} ({2}, wirf diese Karte ab: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Ebene-Karte, zeige sie offen vor, nimm sie auf deine Hand und mische danach.)\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658788&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8458626e-873b-4922-bbf0-455495f958c3\', \'multiverseId\': 658788}, \'multiverseid\': 658788}, {\'name\': \'Ángel de las ruinas\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Ángel de las ruinas entre al campo de batalla, exilia hasta dos artefactos y/o encantamientos objetivo.\\nCiclo de llanura {2}. ({2}, descartar esta carta: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de Llanura, muéstrala, ponla en tu mano y luego baraja.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Ángel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659054&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfa83bf7-f198-4d73-9554-5fced2057038\', \'multiverseId\': 659054}, \'multiverseid\': 659054}, {\'name\': \'Ange des ruines\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand l\'Ange des ruines arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez jusqu\'à deux cibles, artefacts et/ou enchantements.\\nRecyclage de plaine {2} ({2}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de plaine, révélez-la, mettez-la dans votre main, puis mélangez.)", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact — ange\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659320&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d91f9da-ef12-44be-a15a-7f8360c17f5e\', \'multiverseId\': 659320}, \'multiverseid\': 659320}, {\'name\': \'遺跡の天使\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n遺跡の天使が戦場に出たとき、アーティファクトやエンチャントである最大２つを対象とする。それらを追放する。\\n平地サイクリング{2}（{2}, このカードを捨てる：あなたのライブラリーから平地・カード１枚を探し、公開し、あなたの手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659586&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f384873-4d43-413f-8fa4-401295004078\', \'multiverseId\': 659586}, \'multiverseid\': 659586}, {\'name\': \'遗迹天使\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当遗迹天使进战场时，放逐至多两个目标神器和／或结界。\\n循环平原{2}（{2}，弃掉此牌：从你牌库中搜寻一张平原牌，展示该牌，将它置于你手上，然后洗牌。）\', \'type\': \'神器生物 — 天使\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659852&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a22b0978-6b4d-472b-b83a-8bde5b45099f\', \'multiverseId\': 659852}, \'multiverseid\': 659852}]', '[{\'name\': \'Engel des Ausgleichs\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Lebensverknüpfung\\nWenn der Engel des Ausgleichs ins Spiel kommt, bringe eine Permanent-Karte deiner Wahl mit Manabetrag 4 oder weniger aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück.\\nZugabe {6}{W}{W} ({6}{W}{W}, schicke diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil: Erzeuge für jeden Gegner eine Spielstein-Kopie, die ihn in diesem Zug angreift, falls möglich. Die Spielsteine erhalten Eile. Opfere sie zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments. Aktiviere Zugabe wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Engel, Krieger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658361&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f2744f1-1c19-4af0-80ed-e2eb6fcc3dde\', \'multiverseId\': 658361}, \'multiverseid\': 658361}, {\'name\': \'Ángel de la indemnidad\', \'text\': \'Vuela, vínculo vital.\\nCuando el Ángel de la indemnidad entre al campo de batalla, regresa la carta de permanente objetivo con valor de maná de 4 o menos de tu cementerio al campo de batalla.\\nReplicar {6}{W}{W}. ({6}{W}{W}, exiliar esta carta de tu cementerio: Por cada oponente, crea una ficha que es una copia que ataca a ese oponente este turno, si puede. Ganan la habilidad de prisa. Sacrifícalas al comienzo del próximo paso final. Activa esto solo como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero ángel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658393&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7f8ef82-da90-449e-a88e-236be56d7d63\', \'multiverseId\': 658393}, \'multiverseid\': 658393}, {\'name\': "Ange de l\'indemnisation", \'text\': "Vol, lien de vie\\nQuand l\'Ange de l\'indemnisation arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez sur le champ de bataille, depuis votre cimetière, une carte de permanent ciblée avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à 4.\\nEncore {6}{W}{W} ({6}{W}{W}, exilez cette carte de votre cimetière : Pour chaque adversaire, créez une copie jeton qui attaque cet adversaire ce tour-ci si possible. Elle acquiert la célérité. Sacrifiez-la au début de la prochaine étape de fin. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Créature — ange et guerrier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658425&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f491f4b3-8bb7-41b5-a5be-009663364e7e\', \'multiverseId\': 658425}, \'multiverseid\': 658425}, {\'name\': \'赦免の天使\', \'text\': \'飛行、絆魂\\n赦免の天使が戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地にありマナ総量が４以下であるパーマネント・カード１枚を対象とする。それを戦場に戻す。\\n再演{6}{W}{W} ({6}{W}{W}, あなたの墓地にあるこのカードを追放する：各対戦相手につきそれぞれ、このカードのコピーであり、このターン可能ならそのプレイヤーを攻撃するトークン１体を生成する。それらは速攻を得る。次の終了ステップの開始時に、それらを生け贄に捧げる。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 天使・戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658457&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23052a79-4201-40ca-900d-197a7ca910f1\', \'multiverseId\': 658457}, \'multiverseid\': 658457}, {\'name\': \'弥偿天使\', \'text\': \'飞行，系命\\n当弥偿天使进战场时，将目标法术力值等于或小于4的永久物牌从你坟墓场移回战场。\\n返场{6}{W}{W}（{6}{W}{W}，从你的坟墓场放逐此牌：为每位对手各进行以下流程～派出一个衍生复制品，且其本回合若能攻击该对手，便须如此作。它们获得敏捷异能。在下一个结束步骤开始时，将它们牺牲。只能于法术时机起动。）\', \'type\': \'生物 — 天使／战士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658489&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82c16fac-d233-4a8e-8dea-fc626dc97bc2\', \'multiverseId\': 658489}, \'multiverseid\': 658489}]', '[{\'name\': \'Engel des Ausgleichs\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Lebensverknüpfung\\nWenn der Engel des Ausgleichs ins Spiel kommt, bringe eine Permanent-Karte deiner Wahl mit Manabetrag 4 oder weniger aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück.\\nZugabe {6}{W}{W}\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Engel, Krieger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660169&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5edee70e-0453-455a-ae9b-ebf1c8e7bffd\', \'multiverseId\': 660169}, \'multiverseid\': 660169}, {\'name\': "Ange de l\'indemnisation", \'text\': "Vol, lien de vie\\nQuand l\'Ange de l\'indemnisation arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez sur le champ de bataille, depuis votre cimetière, une carte de permanent ciblée avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à 4.\\nEncore {6}{W}{W}", \'type\': \'Créature — ange et guerrier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660201&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a9790dd-2842-488d-a63b-77e98027221f\', \'multiverseId\': 660201}, \'multiverseid\': 660201}, {\'name\': \'赦免の天使\', \'text\': \'飛行、絆魂\\n赦免の天使が戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地にありマナ総量が４以下であるパーマネント・カード１枚を対象とする。それを戦場に戻す。\\n再演{6}{W}{W}\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 天使・戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660233&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a9cbde6-b6bf-478c-a9d6-6e2c30465099\', \'multiverseId\': 660233}, \'multiverseid\': 660233}, {\'name\': \'弥偿天使\', \'text\': \'飞行，系命\\n当弥偿天使进战场时，将目标法术力值等于或小于4的永久物牌从你坟墓场移回战场。\\n返场{6}{W}{W}\', \'type\': \'生物 — 天使／战士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660265&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61a7faeb-64d0-4603-bf17-85bd338d359c\', \'multiverseId\': 660265}, \'multiverseid\': 660265}]', '[{\'name\': \'Engelhafter Söldner\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Wachsamkeit\\nImmer wenn der Engelhafte Söldner oder eine andere Nichtspielsteinkreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen 1/1 roten Söldner-Kreaturenspielstein mit „{T}: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, erhält +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei."\\nImmer wenn der Engelhafte Söldner angreift und falls seine Stärke 6 oder mehr beträgt, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Engel, Söldner\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658362&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9d0f341-ef6c-48e9-b062-a43a9d698ca9\', \'multiverseId\': 658362}, \'multiverseid\': 658362}, {\'name\': \'Sicario angelical\', \'text\': \'Vuela, vigilancia.\\nSiempre que el Sicario angelical u otra criatura que no sea ficha entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, crea una ficha de criatura Mercenario roja 1/1 con "{T}: La criatura objetivo que controlas obtiene +1/+0 hasta el final del turno. Activa esto solo como un conjuro".\\nSiempre que el Sicario angelical ataque, si su fuerza es de 6 o más, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Mercenario ángel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658394&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71ff7f07-52f3-4db8-a710-05fd5e1acb44\', \'multiverseId\': 658394}, \'multiverseid\': 658394}, {\'name\': \'Mercenaire angélique\', \'text\': "Vol, vigilance\\nÀ chaque fois que le Mercenaire angélique ou une autre créature non-jeton arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 rouge Mercenaire avec « {T} : Une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez gagne +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel. »\\nÀ chaque fois que le Mercenaire angélique attaque, si sa force est supérieure ou égale à 6, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature — ange et mercenaire\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658426&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'994bd5b4-b71b-46d4-af05-d940b69ac466\', \'multiverseId\': 658426}, \'multiverseid\': 658426}, {\'name\': \'天使の売剣\', \'text\': \'飛行、警戒\\n天使の売剣や、トークンでもこれでもないクリーチャー１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、「{T}：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。」を持つ赤の１/１の傭兵・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n天使の売剣が攻撃するたび、これのパワーが６以上である場合、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 天使・傭兵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658458&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac7a849e-5bea-40a8-b3b3-7cfa23f227d2\', \'multiverseId\': 658458}, \'multiverseid\': 658458}, {\'name\': \'贷剑天使\', \'text\': \'飞行，警戒\\n每当贷剑天使或另一个非衍生物的生物在你操控下进战场时，派出一个1/1红色佣兵衍生生物，且具有「{T}：目标由你操控的生物得+1/+0直到回合结束。只能于法术时机起动。」\\n每当贷剑天使攻击时，若其力量等于或大于6，则抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 天使／佣兵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658490&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a217398-deb2-4019-94dc-48aae3d938f5\', \'multiverseId\': 658490}, \'multiverseid\': 658490}]', '[{\'name\': \'Engelhafter Söldner\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Wachsamkeit\\nImmer wenn der Engelhafte Söldner oder eine andere Nichtspielsteinkreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen 1/1 roten Söldner-Kreaturenspielstein mit „{T}: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die du kontrollierst, erhält +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei."\\nImmer wenn der Engelhafte Söldner angreift und falls seine Stärke 6 oder mehr beträgt, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Engel, Söldner\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660170&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b93c622c-9762-4e0f-9d53-738d915bc219\', \'multiverseId\': 660170}, \'multiverseid\': 660170}, {\'name\': \'Mercenaire angélique\', \'text\': "Vol, vigilance\\nÀ chaque fois que le Mercenaire angélique ou une autre créature non-jeton arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 rouge Mercenaire avec « {T} : Une créature ciblée que vous contrôlez gagne +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel. »\\nÀ chaque fois que le Mercenaire angélique attaque, si sa force est supérieure ou égale à 6, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature — ange et mercenaire\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660202&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53fa0a95-c906-4881-80a1-9a7080b3fd26\', \'multiverseId\': 660202}, \'multiverseid\': 660202}, {\'name\': \'天使の売剣\', \'text\': \'飛行、警戒\\n天使の売剣や、トークンでもこれでもないクリーチャー１体があなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、「{T}：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。」を持つ赤の１/１の傭兵・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n天使の売剣が攻撃するたび、これのパワーが６以上である場合、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 天使・傭兵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660234&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2561d816-9545-4998-ae68-76f04732b11f\', \'multiverseId\': 660234}, \'multiverseid\': 660234}, {\'name\': \'贷剑天使\', \'text\': \'飞行，警戒\\n每当贷剑天使或另一个非衍生物的生物在你操控下进战场时，派出一个1/1红色佣兵衍生生物，且具有「{T}：目标由你操控的生物得+1/+0直到回合结束。只能于法术时机起动。」\\n每当贷剑天使攻击时，若其力量等于或大于6，则抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 天使／佣兵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660266&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61bd88a4-159d-4819-aa39-6b51a949fa9a\', \'multiverseId\': 660266}, \'multiverseid\': 660266}]', '[{\'name\': \'Enklave der Bynder\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{3}, {T}: Ziehe eine Karte. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls du eine Kreatur mit Stärke 4 oder mehr kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Es gibt einen Zufluchtsort, der sich nur denjenigen offenbart, die von Eludha gesegnet wurden — der mystischen Verbindung zwischen Bynder und Monster.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658984&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db77f4cb-c18b-42f5-9907-7fc612611cd4\', \'multiverseId\': 658984}, \'multiverseid\': 658984}, {\'name\': \'Enclave de los vinculadores\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{3}, {T}: Roba una carta. Activa esto solo si controlas una criatura con fuerza de 4 o más.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Hay un santuario que solo se muestra a los agraciados por la eludha, la conexión mística entre vinculador y monstruo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659250&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4cfd2f87-b788-4a10-a0c6-ab1a76b4d49a\', \'multiverseId\': 659250}, \'multiverseid\': 659250}, {\'name\': \'Enclave des brideurs\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{3}, {T} : Piochez une carte. N\'activez que si vous contrôlez une créature de force supérieure ou égale à 4.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Il existe un sanctuaire qui ne se dévoile qu\'à ceux touchés par la grâce de l\'éludha : la connexion mystique entre un brideur et un monstre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659516&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c94c802-b6ee-4786-8551-c083e03c9105\', \'multiverseId\': 659516}, \'multiverseid\': 659516}, {\'name\': \'眷者の居留地\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{3}, {T}：カード１枚を引く。あなたがパワーが４以上であるクリーチャーをコントロールしていなければ起動できない。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'エルーダに恵まれた者の前にのみ現れる聖域がある。怪物と不思議な絆を結んだ者たちの聖域だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659782&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a430657b-4c33-41a0-84b4-c9a2c0a36062\', \'multiverseId\': 659782}, \'multiverseid\': 659782}, {\'name\': \'持绊人秘境\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{3}，{T}：抓一张牌。只能于你操控力量等于或大于4的生物时起动。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'联系持绊人与怪兽之间的神秘纽带称作灵绊，而有处庇护地只向持有这类羁绊者敞开大门。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660048&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b6e8e0c-7556-490a-be4b-ba45c6578f04\', \'multiverseId\': 660048}, \'multiverseid\': 660048}]', '[{\'name\': \'Episches Experiment\', \'text\': \'Schicke die obersten X Karten deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Du kannst davon Spontanzauber und Hexereien mit Manabetrag X oder weniger wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Lege dann alle Karten, die auf diese Weise ins Exil geschickt und nicht gewirkt wurden, auf deinen Friedhof.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658932&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4408d02d-f3c0-4160-9255-3301dcaa441d\', \'multiverseId\': 658932}, \'multiverseid\': 658932}, {\'name\': \'Experimento épico\', \'text\': \'Exilia las X primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Puedes lanzar hechizos de instantáneo y de conjuro con valor de maná de X o menos de entre ellas sin pagar sus costes de maná. Luego, pon en tu cementerio todas las cartas exiliadas de esta manera que no fueron lanzadas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659198&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbc68a17-8d56-454d-87f4-61d3b18124ab\', \'multiverseId\': 659198}, \'multiverseid\': 659198}, {\'name\': \'Expérience épique\', \'text\': "Exilez les X cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez lancer les sorts d\'éphémère et de rituel avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à X parmi elles sans payer leur coût de mana. Mettez ensuite toutes les cartes exilées de cette manière qui n\'ont pas été lancées dans votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659464&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7091e9df-f612-43fb-9ac4-e99521755e9a\', \'multiverseId\': 659464}, \'multiverseid\': 659464}, {\'name\': \'世紀の実験\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカードＸ枚を追放する。その中から、マナ総量がＸ以下でありインスタントやソーサリーである望む数の呪文をマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。その後、これにより追放して唱えなかったすべてのカードをあなたの墓地に置く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659730&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c31edbe9-de7f-4a33-bb65-1fccc9186b74\', \'multiverseId\': 659730}, \'multiverseid\': 659730}, {\'name\': \'壮绝实验\', \'text\': \'放逐你牌库顶的X张牌。你可以从其中施放法术力值等于或小于X的瞬间和法术咒语，且不需支付其法术力费用。然后将所有以此法放逐且未施放的牌置入你的坟墓场。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659996&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'effd04ac-b9bb-4e78-8715-38b057a40b75\', \'multiverseId\': 659996}, \'multiverseid\': 659996}]', '[{\'name\': \'Eris, tosende Sturmböe\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken für jeden unterschiedlichen Manabetrag unter den Spontanzauber- und Hexereikarten in deinem Friedhof {2} weniger.\\nFliegend, Bravour\\nImmer wenn du deinen zweiten Zauberspruch innerhalb desselben Zuges wirkst, erzeuge einen 4/4 roten Drache-Elementarwesen-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit und Bravour.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elementarwesen, Hexenmeister\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658309&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0782de7-20f4-49c7-9180-cbbebb531cb6\', \'multiverseId\': 658309}, \'multiverseid\': 658309}, {\'name\': \'Eris, rugido de la tormenta\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {2} menos lanzar este hechizo por cada valor de maná distinto entre las cartas de instantáneo y de conjuro en tu cementerio.\\nVuela, destreza.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Brujo elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658313&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5018f93-aaed-4d8d-be29-0f975ebb46e5\', \'multiverseId\': 658313}, \'multiverseid\': 658313}, {\'name\': \'Eris, rugissement de la tempête\', \'text\': "Ce sort coûte {2} de moins à lancer pour chaque valeur de mana différente parmi les cartes d\'éphémère et de rituel dans votre cimetière.\\nVol, prouesse\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez votre deuxième sort à chaque tour, créez un jeton de créature 4/4 rouge Élémental et Dragon avec le vol et la prouesse.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — élémental et psychagogue\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658317&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21b5ecc2-ca19-4bc6-b4db-69d4f1c36199\', \'multiverseId\': 658317}, \'multiverseid\': 658317}, {\'name\': \'嵐の咆哮、エリス\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるためのコストは、あなたの墓地にありインスタントやソーサリーであるカードの中のマナ総量１種類につき{2}少なくなる。\\n飛行、果敢\\nあなたが各ターン内のあなたの２つ目の呪文を唱えるたび、飛行と果敢を持つ赤の４/４のドラゴン・エレメンタル・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エレメンタル・邪術師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658321&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7890c6b0-dae6-4d64-a431-119e1adb391c\', \'multiverseId\': 658321}, \'multiverseid\': 658321}, {\'name\': \'风暴之吼埃力斯\', \'text\': \'你坟墓场中的瞬间和法术牌间每有一种不同的法术力值，此咒语便减少{2}来施放。\\n飞行，灵技\\n每当你施放每回合中你的第二个咒语时，派出一个4/4红色，具飞行与灵技异能的龙／元素衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 元素／邪术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658325&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70113825-3545-49a8-86ca-8a9e35bdb1e2\', \'multiverseId\': 658325}, \'multiverseid\': 658325}]', '[{\'name\': \'Eris, tosende Sturmböe\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken für jeden unterschiedlichen Manabetrag unter den Spontanzauber- und Hexereikarten in deinem Friedhof {2} weniger.\\nFliegend, Bravour\\nImmer wenn du deinen zweiten Zauberspruch innerhalb desselben Zuges wirkst, erzeuge einen 4/4 roten Drache-Elementarwesen-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit und Bravour.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elementarwesen, Hexenmeister\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660121&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c6cd32e-7f8b-43d4-88ad-59b37d2aa386\', \'multiverseId\': 660121}, \'multiverseid\': 660121}, {\'name\': \'Eris, rugissement de la tempête\', \'text\': "Ce sort coûte {2} de moins à lancer pour chaque valeur de mana différente parmi les cartes d\'éphémère et de rituel dans votre cimetière.\\nVol, prouesse\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez votre deuxième sort à chaque tour, créez un jeton de créature 4/4 rouge Élémental et Dragon avec le vol et la prouesse.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — élémental et psychagogue\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660125&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a732a660-0a55-4ab5-9588-01a3ac8b0c22\', \'multiverseId\': 660125}, \'multiverseid\': 660125}, {\'name\': \'嵐の咆哮、エリス\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるためのコストは、あなたの墓地にありインスタントやソーサリーであるカードの中のマナ総量１種類につき{2}少なくなる。\\n飛行、果敢\\nあなたが各ターン内のあなたの２つ目の呪文を唱えるたび、飛行と果敢を持つ赤の４/４のドラゴン・エレメンタル・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エレメンタル・邪術師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660129&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f0597f9-f87b-4c6c-8d89-6f535ae77ab5\', \'multiverseId\': 660129}, \'multiverseid\': 660129}, {\'name\': \'风暴之吼埃力斯\', \'text\': \'你坟墓场中的瞬间和法术牌间每有一种不同的法术力值，此咒语便减少{2}来施放。\\n飞行，灵技\\n每当你施放每回合中你的第二个咒语时，派出一个4/4红色，具飞行与灵技异能的龙／元素衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 元素／邪术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660133&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d065140c-a5ba-48ed-89b2-988d06492e9d\', \'multiverseId\': 660133}, \'multiverseid\': 660133}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erkunden\', \'text\': \'Du darfst in diesem Zug ein zusätzliches Land spielen.\\nZiehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Die Belohnung für einen Entdecker ist ein Blick auf die Möglichkeiten der Zukunft.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658902&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a459377-fdd9-414b-85de-cc0dba97e808\', \'multiverseId\': 658902}, \'multiverseid\': 658902}, {\'name\': \'Explorar\', \'text\': \'Puedes jugar una tierra adicional este turno.\\nRoba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'La recompensa de un explorador es una visión de las posibilidades del mañana.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659168&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f3904b1-3c05-43c0-b0b4-298aec0f5e9a\', \'multiverseId\': 659168}, \'multiverseid\': 659168}, {\'name\': \'Explorer\', \'text\': \'Vous pouvez jouer un terrain supplémentaire ce tour-ci.\\nPiochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "La récompense de l\'explorateur est la vision des possibilités du lendemain.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659434&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'574b5687-4fe1-4d84-9ecb-18f1cc62b61d\', \'multiverseId\': 659434}, \'multiverseid\': 659434}, {\'name\': \'探検\', \'text\': \'このターン、追加で土地１つをプレイしてもよい。\\nカード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'探検家にとっての報奨とは、明日の可能性への見通しである。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659700&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ebcfde4-9550-4a1a-8165-79fb47ecdcce\', \'multiverseId\': 659700}, \'multiverseid\': 659700}, {\'name\': \'探索大地\', \'text\': \'本回合中，你可以额外使用一个地。\\n抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'探险家的报偿，就是目睹明天的可能性。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659966&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec3032cb-9b36-41e4-9c96-4139b12b2849\', \'multiverseId\': 659966}, \'multiverseid\': 659966}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erweiterung des Verstandes\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Gegner zum ersten Mal in einem Zug einen Zauberspruch wirkt, schickt er die oberste Karte seiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Falls die Karte kein Land ist, kannst du sie wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Unendliche Weisheit kann nicht von einem einzelnen Verstand aufgenommen werden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658811&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26900ba0-4ee4-4213-925c-73484120c63e\', \'multiverseId\': 658811}, \'multiverseid\': 658811}, {\'name\': \'Expandir la mente\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un oponente lance su primer hechizo cada turno, ese jugador exilia la primera carta de su biblioteca. Si es una carta que no sea tierra, puedes lanzarla sin pagar su coste de maná.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'Una única mente no puede contener la sabiduría infinita.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659077&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cec03c8-e15c-464d-bc86-a634732b2ba3\', \'multiverseId\': 659077}, \'multiverseid\': 659077}, {\'name\': "Dilatation de l\'esprit", \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un adversaire lance son premier sort à chaque tour, ce joueur exile la carte du dessus de sa bibliothèque. Si c\'est une carte non-terrain, vous pouvez la lancer sans payer son coût de mana.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'Une sagesse infinie ne peut pas être contenue dans un seul esprit.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659343&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d841ef3-0fe0-44ce-b2fc-ac8ae014c60c\', \'multiverseId\': 659343}, \'multiverseid\': 659343}, {\'name\': \'意識の拡張\', \'text\': \'対戦相手１人が各ターン内の自分の１つ目の呪文を唱えるたび、そのプレイヤーは自分のライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を追放する。それが土地でないカードなら、あなたはそれをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'無限の英知は一つの意識には収まりきらない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659609&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23648123-2ab5-4765-9dd3-0dbc431ddb44\', \'multiverseId\': 659609}, \'multiverseid\': 659609}, {\'name\': \'心之所纵\', \'text\': \'每当任一对手施放每回合中其第一个咒语时，该牌手放逐其牌库顶牌。若它为非地牌，则你可以施放它，且不需支付其法术力费用。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'无尽智慧只用单一心灵是装不下的。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659875&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04eb9dc5-7bf6-4d5e-9421-4a5c0714eab7\', \'multiverseId\': 659875}, \'multiverseid\': 659875}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erzmagus-Emeritus\', \'text\': \'Magiefertigkeit — Immer wenn du einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkst oder kopierst, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'Einige emeritierte Professoren kehren regelmäßig von ihren Reisen zurück, um Geschichten von den mystischen Wundern von Arcavios zu erzählen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658800&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'970eb8a0-1ddf-4bba-be26-d36aa470bba0\', \'multiverseId\': 658800}, \'multiverseid\': 658800}, {\'name\': \'Archimago emérito\', \'text\': \'Hechicería — Siempre que lances o copies un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'Ciertos profesores eméritos regresan de sus viajes de vez en cuando para compartir historias sobre las maravillas místicas de Arcavios.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659066&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69649f2a-b018-4153-a65a-9afe82ec9cc3\', \'multiverseId\': 659066}, \'multiverseid\': 659066}, {\'name\': \'Archimage émérite\', \'text\': "Sorcellerie — À chaque fois que vous lancez ou copiez un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature — humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "Certains professeurs émérites reviennent périodiquement de leurs voyages pour partager des récits concernant les merveilles mystiques d\'Arcavios.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659332&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63e67cf6-662b-4e92-af25-6b4dd9f5fabc\', \'multiverseId\': 659332}, \'multiverseid\': 659332}, {\'name\': \'大魔導師の名誉教授\', \'text\': \'魔技 ― あなたがインスタントやソーサリーである呪文１つを唱えるかコピーするたび、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'名誉教授の中には定期的に放浪から戻りアルケヴィオスの神秘的な脅威の物語を共有する者もいる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659598&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3708f300-8a7a-4157-ad2d-9f6a06031088\', \'multiverseId\': 659598}, \'multiverseid\': 659598}, {\'name\': \'荣休大法师\', \'text\': \'魔艺～每当你施放或复制瞬间或法术咒语时，抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'有些荣休教授会定期回到校园，与学生分享自己漫游阿凯维沃时遇到的奇闻轶事。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659864&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c424425e-8980-4bcc-a87c-6f3477416abd\', \'multiverseId\': 659864}, \'multiverseid\': 659864}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ewiglaufende Uhr\', \'text\': \'{T}: Du millst zwei Karten.\\n{2}, schicke die Ewiglaufende Uhr ins Exil: Mische eine beliebige Anzahl an Karten deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof in deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn du immerzu die Zeit im Blick hast, vergiss nicht, sie auch zu nutzen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658973&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51ff8c83-449c-4a61-a1e3-e713ca16f671\', \'multiverseId\': 658973}, \'multiverseid\': 658973}, {\'name\': \'Reloj perpetuo\', \'text\': \'{T}: Muele dos cartas.\\n{2}, exiliar el Reloj perpetuo: Baraja cualquier cantidad de cartas objetivo de tu cementerio en tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'No te preocupes tanto por registrar el paso del tiempo, o te olvidarás de aprovecharlo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659239&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72eb4320-219e-4e98-8b05-e384f4f18ac4\', \'multiverseId\': 659239}, \'multiverseid\': 659239}, {\'name\': \'Sablier perpétuel\', \'text\': "{T} : Meulez deux cartes.\\n{2}, exilez le Sablier perpétuel : Mélangez n\'importe quel nombre de cartes ciblées depuis votre cimetière dans votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'À trop vouloir mesurer le temps, on oublie de faire usage de celui dont on dispose.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659505&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfd15843-3dd6-4ebc-9d16-09b1bf6b3683\', \'multiverseId\': 659505}, \'multiverseid\': 659505}, {\'name\': \'終わりなき時計\', \'text\': \'{T}：カード２枚を切削する。\\n{2}, 終わりなき時計を追放する：あなたの墓地にある望む枚数のカードを対象とする。それらをあなたのライブラリーに加えて切り直す。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'活用するのを忘れるような時間の記録にこだわる必要はない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659771&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'509e6dd9-8a03-4a11-a799-ee649f9f1fa1\', \'multiverseId\': 659771}, \'multiverseid\': 659771}, {\'name\': \'永动时计\', \'text\': \'{T}：磨两张牌。\\n{2}，放逐永动时计：将任意数量的目标牌从你的坟墓场洗回你的牌库。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'不要一心沉浸在记录时间里，反而忘了善用它。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660037&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62af3637-11da-47ba-b5ac-e1032d72f6e9\', \'multiverseId\': 660037}, \'multiverseid\': 660037}]', '[{\'name\': \'Exotischer Obstgarten\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe, das ein Land, das ein Gegner kontrolliert, produzieren könnte.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Das war ein seltsamer Morgen. Als wir aufwachten, hatten sich unsere Bäume verwandelt. Wir wussten nicht, ob wir sie gießen oder polieren sollten."\\n—Pulan, Hainpfleger aus Bant\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659003&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd09e328-a260-4587-a9f4-4ee9d164f350\', \'multiverseId\': 659003}, \'multiverseid\': 659003}, {\'name\': \'Huerto exótico\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color que pueda producir una tierra que controla un oponente.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"Fue una mañana extraña. Cuando despertamos, encontramos nuestros árboles transformados. No sabíamos si regarlos o lustrarlos".\\n—Pulan, jardinero de Bant\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659269&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'150de996-f0ef-4c4c-9795-3b74221ffe5c\', \'multiverseId\': 659269}, \'multiverseid\': 659269}, {\'name\': \'Verger exotique\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix qu\'un terrain qu\'un adversaire contrôle pourrait produire.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "« C\'était une étrange matinée. Quand nous nous sommes réveillés, nos arbres avaient été transformés. Nous ne savions plus si nous devions les arroser ou les polir. »\\n—Pulan, arboriste de Bant", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659535&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5164c64d-cf44-4682-870b-b8498192660a\', \'multiverseId\': 659535}, \'multiverseid\': 659535}, {\'name\': \'風変わりな果樹園\', \'text\': \'{T}：対戦相手がコントロールしている土地が生み出すことのできる色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「変な朝だったよ。起きたら、俺らの樹が変わっちまってたんだ。水やったらいいのか磨いたらいいのかわかんなくってな。」\\n――バントの果樹園主、プーラン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659801&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81d88be4-71b9-41d1-b662-c44843456805\', \'multiverseId\': 659801}, \'multiverseid\': 659801}, {\'name\': \'异国果园\', \'text\': \'{T}：加一点法术力，其颜色为由对手操控的地能产生之任一颜色。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'「那是个奇怪的早晨。我们醒来时，就发现树变了样子。不晓得该要替它浇水还是把它擦亮。」\\n～班特栽果人普兰\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660067&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f802c33b-6fb3-4d59-b429-b2a4324af941\', \'multiverseId\': 660067}, \'multiverseid\': 660067}]', '[{\'name\': \'Exzentrische Farmerin\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Exzentrische Farmerin ins Spiel kommt, millst du drei Karten. Dann kannst du eine Länderkarte aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurückbringen. (Um eine Karte zu millen, lege die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek auf deinen Friedhof.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Gesinde\', \'flavor\': \'„Vorsicht! Die Samen sollen doch nicht an deinen Fühlern festkleben wie letztes Mal."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658900&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80d6c5bc-57a8-4efc-a725-89e976bb144a\', \'multiverseId\': 658900}, \'multiverseid\': 658900}, {\'name\': \'Granjera excéntrica\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Granjera excéntrica entre al campo de batalla, muele tres cartas y luego puedes regresar una carta de tierra de tu cementerio a tu mano. (Para moler una carta, pon la primera carta de tu biblioteca en tu cementerio.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Plebeyo humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Ten cuidado, no vaya a ser que las semillas se te peguen a las antenas como la otra vez".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659166&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'371486d0-9ab0-44af-9e9e-be2a99ee3dad\', \'multiverseId\': 659166}, \'multiverseid\': 659166}, {\'name\': \'Fermière excentrique\', \'text\': \'Quand la Fermière excentrique arrive sur le champ de bataille, meulez trois cartes, puis vous pouvez renvoyer une carte de terrain depuis votre cimetière dans votre main. (Pour meuler une carte, mettez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque dans votre cimetière.)\', \'type\': \'Créature — humain et paysan\', \'flavor\': \'« Attention. Il ne faudrait pas que les graines collent à tes antennes comme la dernière fois. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659432&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f77ec017-f9a0-483f-8144-190b1d5ad327\', \'multiverseId\': 659432}, \'multiverseid\': 659432}, {\'name\': \'風変わりな農夫\', \'text\': \'風変わりな農夫が戦場に出たとき、カード３枚を切削する。その後、あなたの墓地にある土地・カード１枚をあなたの手札に戻してもよい。（カードを切削するとは、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカードをあなたの墓地に置くことである。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・農民\', \'flavor\': \'「気をつけて食べなよ。この前みたいに触角に種がくっついたら困るからね。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659698&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06477965-6ca4-4226-b20f-639a0779de49\', \'multiverseId\': 659698}, \'multiverseid\': 659698}, {\'name\': \'古怪农夫\', \'text\': \'当古怪农夫进战场时，磨三张牌，然后你可以将一张地牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。（磨一张牌的流程是将你牌库顶的牌置入你的坟墓场。）\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／平民\', \'flavor\': \'「这次慢点吃。别像上次那样把南瓜籽沾得满触角都是。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659964&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2bbe1cd-4dc9-47af-be17-8da58e5d6dee\', \'multiverseId\': 659964}, \'multiverseid\': 659964}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fain der Vermittler\', \'text\': \'{T}, opfere eine Kreatur: Lege zwei +1/+1-Marken auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.\\n{T}, entferne eine Marke von einer Kreatur, die du kontrollierst: Erzeuge einen Schatz-Spielstein.\\n{T}, opfere ein Artefakt: Erzeuge einen 2/1 weißen und schwarzen Tintling-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\\n{3}{B}: Enttappe Fain den Vermittler.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Hexenmeister\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658843&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35360ebc-1afe-46ad-aec7-beab41c95b44\', \'multiverseId\': 658843}, \'multiverseid\': 658843}, {\'name\': \'Fain, el Negociante\', \'text\': \'{T}, sacrificar una criatura: Pon dos contadores +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo.\\n{T}, remover un contador de una criatura que controlas: Crea una ficha de Tesoro.\\n{T}, sacrificar un artefacto: Crea una ficha de criatura Tintícola blanca y negra 2/1 con la habilidad de volar.\\n{3}{B}: Endereza a Fain, el Negociante.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Brujo humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659109&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d050085-0b46-4268-bdaa-e835bb49648a\', \'multiverseId\': 659109}, \'multiverseid\': 659109}, {\'name\': \'Faïn, le courtier\', \'text\': "{T}, sacrifiez une créature : Mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur une créature ciblée.\\n{T}, retirez un marqueur d\'une créature que vous contrôlez : Créez un jeton Trésor.\\n{T}, sacrifiez un artefact : Créez un jeton de créature 2/1 blanche et noire Encrelin avec le vol.\\n{3}{B} : Dégagez Faïn, le courtier.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — humain et psychagogue\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659375&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c0ba816-d78c-40ec-a81f-5dbf144591b2\', \'multiverseId\': 659375}, \'multiverseid\': 659375}, {\'name\': \'仲介人、フェイン\', \'text\': \'{T}, クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に＋１/＋１カウンター２個を置く。\\n{T}, あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体の上からカウンター１個を取り除く：宝物・トークン１つを生成する。\\n{T}, アーティファクト１つを生け贄に捧げる：飛行を持つ白黒の２/１の墨獣・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n{3}{B}：仲介人、フェインをアンタップする。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・邪術師\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659641&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'451e5bcc-8686-4f88-86f7-13ef6a410b82\', \'multiverseId\': 659641}, \'multiverseid\': 659641}, {\'name\': \'掮客斐恩\', \'text\': \'{T}，牺牲一个生物：在目标生物上放置两个+1/+1指示物。\\n{T}，从由你操控的生物上移去一个指示物：派出一个珍宝衍生物。\\n{T}，牺牲一个神器：派出一个2/1，白黑双色，具飞行异能的墨灵衍生生物。\\n{3}{B}：重置掮客斐恩。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 人类／邪术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659907&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3f15a40-76b6-4469-ad15-4ddc7afeef86\', \'multiverseId\': 659907}, \'multiverseid\': 659907}]', "[{'name': 'Farbige Felsklippen', 'text': '{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.', 'type': 'Land — Wüste', 'flavor': 'Feinste Sandkörner haben über Jahrhunderte hinweg die Klippen der Shefet-Wüste abgeschliffen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659019&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7b703e6a-7128-461f-8be6-b6c7d62ccb87', 'multiverseId': 659019}, 'multiverseid': 659019}, {'name': 'Riscos pigmentados', 'text': '{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color.', 'type': 'Tierra — Desierto', 'flavor': 'Siglos de ásperas arenas tallaron y pulieron el terreno rocoso del desierto Shefet.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659285&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4259efa1-fcba-4568-8c8d-d42e50c02ffe', 'multiverseId': 659285}, 'multiverseid': 659285}, {'name': 'Promontoires peints', 'text': '{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{1}, {T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix.', 'type': 'Terrain — désert', 'flavor': 'Pendant des siècles, les sables purificateurs ont taillé et poli les sols rocheux du Désert de Shefet.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659551&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '01fd13c5-dc63-4b0f-8a00-7d515fec0b1b', 'multiverseId': 659551}, 'multiverseid': 659551}, {'name': '色彩の断崖', 'text': '{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{1}, {T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。', 'type': '土地 — 砂漠', 'flavor': '数百年にわたって研磨性の砂がシェフェト砂漠を磨き削り、急峻な地形が形成された。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659817&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3e9671ae-bfc3-45e2-8427-4f0959d4279e', 'multiverseId': 659817}, 'multiverseid': 659817}, {'name': '斑斓绝壁', 'text': '{T}：加{C}。\\n{1}，{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力。', 'type': '地 — 沙漠', 'flavor': '千百年风沙侵蚀，造就谢菲沙漠岩壁奇景。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660083&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '929f7cc9-b076-43c2-9f33-be92f7cc0fec', 'multiverseId': 660083}, 'multiverseid': 660083}]", '[{\'name\': \'Feixende Zauberdiebin\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nFliegend\\nWenn die Feixende Zauberdiebin ins Spiel kommt, schicke einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl, den ein Gegner kontrolliert, ins Exil.\\nImmer wenn die Feixende Zauberdiebin angreift und falls eine von ihr ins Exil geschickte Karte im Exil ist, kannst du jene Karte wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dschinn, Zauberer, Räuber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658368&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d0b381b-d140-490f-ab6a-21d8f466e34f\', \'multiverseId\': 658368}, \'multiverseid\': 658368}, {\'name\': \'Robahechizos sonriente\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nVuela.\\nCuando la Robahechizos sonriente entre al campo de batalla, exilia el hechizo objetivo que controla un oponente.\\nSiempre que la Robahechizos sonriente ataque, si se exilió una carta con ella, puedes lanzar la carta exiliada sin pagar su coste de maná.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón hechicero djinn\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658400&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f4eb1a0-8bfe-42e8-b970-5c94bd75e636\', \'multiverseId\': 658400}, \'multiverseid\': 658400}, {\'name\': \'Détourneuse de sorts narquoise\', \'text\': "Flash\\nVol\\nQuand la Détourneuse de sorts narquoise arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez un sort ciblé qu\'un adversaire contrôle.\\nÀ chaque fois que la Détourneuse de sorts narquoise attaque, si une carte est exilée par elle, vous pouvez lancer la carte exilée sans payer son coût de mana.", \'type\': \'Créature — djinn et sorcier et gredin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658432&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e25ec53-8705-45b3-931c-9410e0438b24\', \'multiverseId\': 658432}, \'multiverseid\': 658432}, {\'name\': \'嘲笑う呪文乗っ取り\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n飛行\\n嘲笑う呪文乗っ取りが戦場に出たとき、対戦相手がコントロールしている呪文１つを対象とする。それを追放する。\\n嘲笑う呪文乗っ取りが攻撃するたび、これによりカードが追放されている場合、あなたはその追放されているカードをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ジン・ウィザード・ならず者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658464&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2080be4e-15c3-48ea-8cff-237a96e6dfde\', \'multiverseId\': 658464}, \'multiverseid\': 658464}, {\'name\': \'窃笑劫咒客\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n飞行\\n当窃笑劫咒客进战场时，放逐目标由对手操控的咒语。\\n每当窃笑劫咒客攻击时，若仍有以它放逐的牌，则你可以施放所放逐之牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 巨灵／法术师／浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658496&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6a1565e-681c-478a-b63c-1c507c1b683a\', \'multiverseId\': 658496}, \'multiverseid\': 658496}]', '[{\'name\': \'Feixende Zauberdiebin\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nFliegend\\nWenn die Feixende Zauberdiebin ins Spiel kommt, schicke einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl, den ein Gegner kontrolliert, ins Exil.\\nImmer wenn die Feixende Zauberdiebin angreift und falls eine von ihr ins Exil geschickte Karte im Exil ist, kannst du jene Karte wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dschinn, Zauberer, Räuber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660176&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19662898-d612-486e-a30c-3e6246279c6a\', \'multiverseId\': 660176}, \'multiverseid\': 660176}, {\'name\': \'Détourneuse de sorts narquoise\', \'text\': "Flash\\nVol\\nQuand la Détourneuse de sorts narquoise arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez un sort ciblé qu\'un adversaire contrôle.\\nÀ chaque fois que la Détourneuse de sorts narquoise attaque, si une carte est exilée par elle, vous pouvez lancer la carte exilée sans payer son coût de mana.", \'type\': \'Créature — djinn et sorcier et gredin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660208&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37336770-fc12-4cb3-be49-f832e9070893\', \'multiverseId\': 660208}, \'multiverseid\': 660208}, {\'name\': \'嘲笑う呪文乗っ取り\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n飛行\\n嘲笑う呪文乗っ取りが戦場に出たとき、対戦相手がコントロールしている呪文１つを対象とする。それを追放する。\\n嘲笑う呪文乗っ取りが攻撃するたび、これによりカードが追放されている場合、あなたはその追放されているカードをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ジン・ウィザード・ならず者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660240&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'332af104-f866-4497-91e1-ac437c4bc80f\', \'multiverseId\': 660240}, \'multiverseid\': 660240}, {\'name\': \'窃笑劫咒客\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n飞行\\n当窃笑劫咒客进战场时，放逐目标由对手操控的咒语。\\n每当窃笑劫咒客攻击时，若仍有以它放逐的牌，则你可以施放所放逐之牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 巨灵／法术师／浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660272&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2ef2fc2-29ef-4cb9-8067-dcf4db8bfe06\', \'multiverseId\': 660272}, \'multiverseid\': 660272}]', '[{\'name\': \'Feldschmiede\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {R} oder {W}. Die Feldschmiede fügt dir 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Nachdem Terisiares Minen erschöpft waren, sah man immer mehr Kriegsgerät aus Altmetall."\\n—Der Artefakt-Krieg\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658981&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5fb11ca3-6dfd-436f-a546-57e0a6b240d9\', \'multiverseId\': 658981}, \'multiverseid\': 658981}, {\'name\': \'Forja del campo de batalla\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{T}: Agrega {R} o {W}. La Forja del campo de batalla te hace 1 punto de daño.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"A medida que las minas de Terisiare se agotaban, empezó a abundar la chatarra metálica".\\n—La Guerra de las Antigüedades\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659247&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be4dbb1e-ad94-4c16-940b-750af8d4f304\', \'multiverseId\': 659247}, \'multiverseid\': 659247}, {\'name\': \'Forge de campagne\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R} ou {W}. La Forge de campagne vous inflige 1 blessure.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'« Alors que les mines de Terisiare se vidaient, le métal de récupération devint de plus en plus abondant. »\\n—La Guerre des Antiquités\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659513&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35b64ea7-eeb8-4492-ae8c-824d999f23f3\', \'multiverseId\': 659513}, \'multiverseid\': 659513}, {\'name\': \'戦場の鍛冶場\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}：{R}か{W}を加える。戦場の鍛冶場はあなたに１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「テリシアの鉱山が枯渇するにつれ、金属くずはいっそう潤沢になっていった。」\\n――「アンティキティー戦争」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659779&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23b5337e-d45e-4bc0-9715-77e16d4cd54d\', \'multiverseId\': 659779}, \'multiverseid\': 659779}, {\'name\': \'战场融炉\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{T}：加{R}或{W}。战场融炉对你造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'「随着泰瑞西亚矿藏渐被挖空，金属废渣变得愈发常见。」\\n～《古文明之战》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660045&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c7b82d5-bbc9-40f2-a9f2-7a1b728e4c5c\', \'multiverseId\': 660045}, \'multiverseid\': 660045}]', '[{\'name\': \'Felix Fünfstiefel\', \'text\': \'Bedrohlich, Abwehr {2}\\nFalls eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt und dadurch bei einem Permanent, das du kontrollierst, eine ausgelöste Fähigkeit ausgelöst wird, wird jene Fähigkeit ein weiteres Mal ausgelöst.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Schlammwesen, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'Keine lebenswichtigen Organe, das macht Duelle wesentlich leichter.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658310&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49f750b5-45a4-4e64-afe3-8980be77ac4b\', \'multiverseId\': 658310}, \'multiverseid\': 658310}, {\'name\': \'Félix Cincobotas\', \'text\': \'Amenaza, rebatir {2}.\\nSi una criatura que controlas hace daño de combate a un jugador y esto hace que se dispare una habilidad disparada de un permanente que controlas, esa habilidad se dispara una vez más.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Bribón cieno\', \'flavor\': \'Contar con varios pseudópodos y carecer de órganos internos te otorga una ventaja importante en los duelos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658314&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4da97bc5-feac-4ddb-95cc-31008cd76cc4\', \'multiverseId\': 658314}, \'multiverseid\': 658314}, {\'name\': \'Félix Cinq-bottes\', \'text\': "Menace, parade {2}\\nSi une créature que vous contrôlez qui inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur provoque le déclenchement d\'une capacité déclenchée d\'un permanent que vous contrôlez, cette capacité se déclenche une fois de plus.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — limon et gredin\', \'flavor\': "Les duels sont tout de suite plus simples quand on a plein de pseudopodes et pas d\'organes vitaux.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658318&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1469a96-ded4-4a44-9a56-e18c6a7e6c07\', \'multiverseId\': 658318}, \'multiverseid\': 658318}, {\'name\': \'五足のフェリクス\', \'text\': \'威迫、護法{2}\\nあなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーがプレイヤーに戦闘ダメージを与えたことによりあなたがコントロールしているパーマネントの誘発型能力１つが誘発したなら、その能力は追加でもう１回誘発する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ウーズ・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'仮足が何本もある上に生命維持に欠かせない臓器がないのは、決闘が著しく楽である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658322&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6f5cdda-17d6-4aca-bae8-862eb2319eac\', \'multiverseId\': 658322}, \'multiverseid\': 658322}, {\'name\': \'五靴菲利斯\', \'text\': \'威慑，守护{2}\\n如果由你操控之永久物的触发式异能因由你操控的生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害而触发，则该异能额外触发一次。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 流浆／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'他有许多伪足，又无必要器官～这些都让决斗变得简单许多。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658326&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b69271e-1360-411c-b93d-182da94283a9\', \'multiverseId\': 658326}, \'multiverseid\': 658326}]', '[{\'name\': \'Felix Fünfstiefel\', \'text\': \'Bedrohlich, Abwehr {2}\\nFalls eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt und dadurch bei einem Permanent, das du kontrollierst, eine ausgelöste Fähigkeit ausgelöst wird, wird jene Fähigkeit ein weiteres Mal ausgelöst.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Schlammwesen, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'Keine lebenswichtigen Organe, das macht Duelle wesentlich leichter.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660122&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a8c98d3-2e98-48f5-a002-7926ac2d296f\', \'multiverseId\': 660122}, \'multiverseid\': 660122}, {\'name\': \'Félix Cinq-bottes\', \'text\': "Menace, parade {2}\\nSi une créature que vous contrôlez qui inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur provoque le déclenchement d\'une capacité déclenchée d\'un permanent que vous contrôlez, cette capacité se déclenche une fois de plus.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — limon et gredin\', \'flavor\': "Les duels sont tout de suite plus simples quand on a plein de pseudopodes et pas d\'organes vitaux.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660126&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7fc469f-faee-4ac4-8c9a-4a1c8e2757b0\', \'multiverseId\': 660126}, \'multiverseid\': 660126}, {\'name\': \'五足のフェリクス\', \'text\': \'威迫、護法{2}\\nあなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーがプレイヤーに戦闘ダメージを与えたことによりあなたがコントロールしているパーマネントの誘発型能力１つが誘発したなら、その能力は追加でもう１回誘発する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ウーズ・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'仮足が何本もある上に生命維持に欠かせない臓器がないのは、決闘が著しく楽である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660130&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a63dfa17-17a3-48ad-9a16-af8b696ea1c0\', \'multiverseId\': 660130}, \'multiverseid\': 660130}, {\'name\': \'五靴菲利斯\', \'text\': \'威慑，守护{2}\\n如果由你操控之永久物的触发式异能因由你操控的生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害而触发，则该异能额外触发一次。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 流浆／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'他有许多伪足，又无必要器官～这些都让决斗变得简单许多。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660134&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20fa9d45-6a06-4331-bea9-da55f7a2ba20\', \'multiverseId\': 660134}, \'multiverseid\': 660134}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fellwarstein\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe, das ein Land, das ein Gegner kontrolliert, produzieren könnte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Was besitzt du, das ich nicht erlangen kann?"\\n—Mairsil der Täuscher\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658967&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'642885d1-a573-4d8d-8e7d-1e5f7134aff6\', \'multiverseId\': 658967}, \'multiverseid\': 658967}, {\'name\': \'Piedra de Fellwar\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color que pueda producir una tierra que controla un oponente.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Qué tienes que yo no pueda obtener?".\\n—Mairsil, el Usurpador\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659233&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2873722e-06ca-414e-b894-50a6b18bf90b\', \'multiverseId\': 659233}, \'multiverseid\': 659233}, {\'name\': \'Pierre de Guermont\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix qu\'un terrain qu\'un adversaire contrôle pourrait produire.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Qu\'avez-vous que je ne puisse obtenir ? »\\n—Mairsil, le prétendant", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659499&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7be6a097-6d18-4977-a8aa-bf71bd348441\', \'multiverseId\': 659499}, \'multiverseid\': 659499}, {\'name\': \'友なる石\', \'text\': \'{T}：対戦相手がコントロールしている土地が生み出すことのできる色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「お前は、私が手に入れられない何を持っているのだ？」\\n――偽善者、メアシル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659765&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e72ca42-ff4f-41fd-87f3-436978ba903a\', \'multiverseId\': 659765}, \'multiverseid\': 659765}, {\'name\': \'战野之石\', \'text\': \'{T}：加一点法术力，其颜色为由对手操控的地能产生之任一颜色。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「你有的东西，哪一样我得不到？」\\n～伪装者梅西尔\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660031&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88f3903a-9fdb-40c4-ac30-03015a269901\', \'multiverseId\': 660031}, \'multiverseid\': 660031}]', '[{\'name\': \'Felskuppenzuflucht\', \'text\': \'Die Felskuppenzuflucht kommt getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du kontrollierst ein Gebirge oder eine Ebene.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {R} oder {W}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Sanft fällt das Licht auf den Tempel von Epityr und lässt die in Stein gemeißelten Flügel der Engelsretterin schimmern.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658988&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a00521a-fd6f-4b66-a820-6fed454018a9\', \'multiverseId\': 658988}, \'multiverseid\': 658988}, {\'name\': \'Refugio en la cima\', \'text\': \'El Refugio en la cima entra al campo de batalla girado a menos que controles una Montaña o una Llanura.\\n{T}: Agrega {R} o {W}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'La luz del sol cae inmaculada sobre el templo de Épityr, solo suavizada por las sombras recordadas de las alas de los salvadores angelicales.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659254&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45c38176-c87f-4f5a-9ebe-db0ddf71dead\', \'multiverseId\': 659254}, \'multiverseid\': 659254}, {\'name\': \'Rectorat du haut des falaises\', \'text\': \'Le Rectorat du haut des falaises arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé à moins que vous ne contrôliez une montagne ou une plaine.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R} ou {W}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "La lumière cristalline du soleil inonde le temple d\'Epityr, adoucie par l\'ombre indélébile des ailes angéliques salvatrices.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659520&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2646b1f-95f0-47dc-ab2c-c0f988615cd6\', \'multiverseId\': 659520}, \'multiverseid\': 659520}, {\'name\': \'断崖の避難所\', \'text\': \'あなたが山や平地をコントロールしていないかぎり、断崖の避難所はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{R}か{W}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'エピティアの寺院を照らす純粋な陽光は、救世天使の翼が作る影の記憶で弱まっている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659786&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e4fd1fb-276b-4c8b-960e-f75645dc3086\', \'multiverseId\': 659786}, \'multiverseid\': 659786}, {\'name\': \'崖顶修行所\', \'text\': \'除非你操控山脉或平原，否则崖顶修行所须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{R}或{W}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'纯洁阳光洒落艾比提殿堂，穿过为人追忆的救世天使双翼而更加柔和。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660052&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f89d84f0-7aed-45b6-baf5-706a16badd8e\', \'multiverseId\': 660052}, \'multiverseid\': 660052}]', '[{\'name\': \'Fesselndes Crewmitglied\', \'text\': \'{3}{R}: Übernimm bis zum Ende des Zuges die Kontrolle über eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert. Enttappe sie. Sie erhält Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Pirat\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir segeln, wir plündern und dann feiern wir."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658869&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'456fdf20-fb6b-4787-8034-551da16d1f95\', \'multiverseId\': 658869}, \'multiverseid\': 658869}, {\'name\': \'Tripulación cautivadora\', \'text\': \'{3}{R}: Gana el control de la criatura objetivo que controla un oponente hasta el final del turno. Endereza esa criatura. Gana la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno. Activa esto solo como un conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pirata humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Navegamos, saqueamos y, por último, bailamos".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659135&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a86d9ae3-1df0-4f3b-b705-8e6e8bbc1c0a\', \'multiverseId\': 659135}, \'multiverseid\': 659135}, {\'name\': \'Équipage captivant\', \'text\': "{3}{R} : Acquérez le contrôle d\'une créature ciblée qu\'un adversaire contrôle jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Dégagez cette créature. Elle acquiert la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Créature — humain et pirate\', \'flavor\': \'« On vogue. On pille. Et puis on danse. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659401&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4000794-85af-4bb3-b19b-571e07988f4e\', \'multiverseId\': 659401}, \'multiverseid\': 659401}, {\'name\': \'蠱惑的な船員\', \'text\': \'{3}{R}：対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それのコントロールを得る。そのクリーチャーをアンタップする。ターン終了時まで、それは速攻を得る。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・海賊\', \'flavor\': \'「航海して、略奪して、踊るのさ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659667&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1bf2a8f-1261-47a2-94aa-a914b098324a\', \'multiverseId\': 659667}, \'multiverseid\': 659667}, {\'name\': \'魅力船员\', \'text\': \'{3}{R}：获得目标由对手操控的生物之操控权直到回合结束。重置该生物。它获得敏捷异能直到回合结束。只能于法术时机起动。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／海盗\', \'flavor\': \'「我们扬帆。我们劫掠。我们起舞。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659933&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7b3451f-528d-4f61-84b2-3c97b76dce92\', \'multiverseId\': 659933}, \'multiverseid\': 659933}]', '[{\'name\': \'Finale der Offenbarung\', \'text\': \'Ziehe X Karten. Falls X gleich 10 oder mehr ist, mische stattdessen deinen Friedhof in deine Bibliothek, ziehe X Karten, enttappe bis zu fünf Länder, und du hast für den Rest der Partie keine maximale Handkartenzahl.\\nSchicke das Finale der Offenbarung ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Ugin erkannte das Juwel, das Bolas mit seinem Meditationsreich verband, als Schlüssel zu dessen Untergang.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658807&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48bd0bc3-d010-430d-9718-d2cdf425c953\', \'multiverseId\': 658807}, \'multiverseid\': 658807}, {\'name\': \'Final de revelación\', \'text\': \'Roba X cartas. Si X es 10 o más, en vez de eso, baraja tu cementerio en tu biblioteca, roba X cartas, endereza hasta cinco tierras y tu mano no tiene tamaño máximo durante el resto del juego.\\nExilia el Final de revelación.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Ugin vio que la gema que conectaba a Nicol Bolas con su Reino de Meditación sería la clave de la caída de su hermano.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659073&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4da51183-6658-4bf3-b54e-330e2b3e8e22\', \'multiverseId\': 659073}, \'multiverseid\': 659073}, {\'name\': \'Summum de la révélation\', \'text\': "Piochez X cartes. Si X est supérieur ou égal à 10, à la place mélangez votre cimetière dans votre bibliothèque, piochez X cartes, dégagez jusqu\'à cinq terrains, et vous n\'avez pas de taille de main maximale pour le restant de la partie.\\nExilez le Summum de la révélation.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Pour Ugin, la gemme qui connectait Bolas à son Royaume de méditation était la clé qui conduirait son frère à sa perte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659339&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7b38f62-5414-4da9-b10b-0a3e93d3b0b6\', \'multiverseId\': 659339}, \'multiverseid\': 659339}, {\'name\': \'啓示の終焉\', \'text\': \'カードＸ枚を引く。Ｘが10以上なら、代わりに、あなたの墓地をあなたのライブラリーに加えて切り直し、カードＸ枚を引き、土地最大５つをアンタップし、このゲームの残りの間あなたの手札の上限はなくなる。\\n啓示の終焉を追放する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'ウギンは、ボーラスと瞑想領土を繋ぐその宝石が、彼を滅ぼす鍵になると目星をつけた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659605&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1490f0b-659f-4552-bd3e-6d9def7b4211\', \'multiverseId\': 659605}, \'multiverseid\': 659605}, {\'name\': \'预示终时\', \'text\': \'抓X张牌。如果X等于或大于10，则改为将你的坟墓场洗入你的牌库，抓X张牌，重置至多五个地，且于这盘游戏接下来的时段，你的手牌数量没有上限。\\n放逐预示终时。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'波拉斯靠着这颗巨大宝石来维持与冥想境的联系。在乌金眼中，这正是打倒其胞弟的关键所在。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659871&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'949f71a2-7b4e-4162-89ce-c8b147e49276\', \'multiverseId\': 659871}, \'multiverseid\': 659871}]', '[{\'name\': \'Finale der Verheißung\', \'text\': \'Du kannst bis zu eine Spontanzauberkarte deiner Wahl und/oder bis zu eine Hexereikarte deiner Wahl, deren Manabetrag jeweils X oder weniger ist, aus deinem Friedhof wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Falls ein Zauberspruch, der auf diese Weise gewirkt wurde, auf deinen Friedhof gelegt würde, schicke ihn stattdessen ins Exil. Falls X gleich 10 oder mehr ist, kopiere jeden der Zaubersprüche zweimal. Du kannst neue Ziele für die Kopien bestimmen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658876&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b7db342-d9dc-4d5c-80ff-85bd2becb6e7\', \'multiverseId\': 658876}, \'multiverseid\': 658876}, {\'name\': \'Final de promesa\', \'text\': \'Puedes lanzar hasta una carta de instantáneo objetivo y/o hasta una carta de conjuro objetivo desde tu cementerio, cada una con valor de maná de X o menos, sin pagar sus costes de maná. Si un hechizo lanzado de esta manera fuera a ir a tu cementerio, en vez de eso, exílialo. Si X es 10 o más, copia cada uno de esos hechizos dos veces. Puedes elegir nuevos objetivos para las copias.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659142&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e815994-9310-40aa-a123-21a7ecbda550\', \'multiverseId\': 659142}, \'multiverseid\': 659142}, {\'name\': \'Summum de la promesse\', \'text\': "Vous pouvez lancer jusqu\'à une carte d\'éphémère ciblée et/ou jusqu\'à une carte de rituel ciblée, chacune avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à X, depuis votre cimetière sans payer leur coût de mana. Si un sort lancé de cette manière devait être mis dans votre cimetière, exilez-le à la place. Si X est supérieur ou égal à 10, copiez chacun de ces sorts deux fois. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour ces copies.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659408&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1ad2da15-e6ce-4b87-b8f2-4cf4406d5f8b\', \'multiverseId\': 659408}, \'multiverseid\': 659408}, {\'name\': \'約束の終焉\', \'text\': \'それぞれあなたの墓地にありマナ総量がＸ以下である、インスタント・カード歳大１枚を対象とし、ソーサリー・カード最大１枚を対象とする。それらをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。これにより唱えられた呪文があなたの墓地に置かれるなら、代わりにそれを追放する。Ｘが10以上なら、それらの呪文をそれぞれ２回コピーする。それらのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659674&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e580a5a3-cd25-4298-938c-44776edcb13d\', \'multiverseId\': 659674}, \'multiverseid\': 659674}, {\'name\': \'允诺终时\', \'text\': \'选择目标在你坟墓场中的至多一张瞬间牌和／或至多一张法术牌，且两者的法术力值均须等于或小于X。你可以从该处施放这些牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。如果以此法施放的咒语将进入你的坟墓场，则改为将它放逐。如果X等于或大于10，则将这些咒语各复制两次。你可以为每个复制品选择新的目标。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659940&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'066a2808-0d8f-4409-bf9c-098543df1ead\', \'multiverseId\': 659940}, \'multiverseid\': 659940}]', '[{\'name\': \'Flinkfuß-Stiefel\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur hat Fluchsicherheit und Eile. (Sie kann nicht das Ziel von Zaubersprüchen oder Fähigkeiten sein, die deine Gegner kontrollieren.)\\nAusrüsten {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'„Es ist weise, sich kopfüber ins Gefecht zu stürzen … wenn man vorbereitet ist."\\n—Kenjek, Hauptmann der Tausend Schwerter\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658978&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ff99699-2812-4751-857f-f66df58bffca\', \'multiverseId\': 658978}, \'multiverseid\': 658978}, {\'name\': \'Botas de pies ligeros\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada tiene las habilidades de antimaleficio y prisa. (No puede ser objetivo de hechizos o habilidades que controlan tus oponentes.)\\nEquipar {1}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'"Lanzarse de cabeza al combate demuestra una gran sabiduría... siempre que estés preparado".\\n—Kenjek, capitana de las Mil espadas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659244&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6ea0e8c-b651-466c-a46b-4a4f7ae6715d\', \'multiverseId\': 659244}, \'multiverseid\': 659244}, {\'name\': \'Bottes de piedagile\', \'text\': \'La créature équipée a la défense talismanique et la célérité. (Elle ne peut pas être la cible de sorts ou de capacités que vos adversaires contrôlent.)\\nÉquipement {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefact — équipement\', \'flavor\': "« Foncer tête baissée dans la mêlée, c\'est très bien... à condition d\'y être préparé. »\\n—Kenjek, capitaine des Mille épées", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659510&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'698d3952-392e-4245-8197-a6aa20ea180d\', \'multiverseId\': 659510}, \'multiverseid\': 659510}, {\'name\': \'速足のブーツ\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは呪禁と速攻を持つ。（それは対戦相手がコントロールしている呪文や能力の対象にならない。）\\n装備{1}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'「戦闘に一直線に突入するのは非常に頭のいいやり方と言えるわ。ちゃんと準備していればの話だけどね。」\\n――千本剣の隊長、ケンジェク\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659776&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9487cb9-6a44-42bb-9ac3-03a258d10605\', \'multiverseId\': 659776}, \'multiverseid\': 659776}, {\'name\': \'疾行靴\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物具有辟邪与敏捷异能。（它不能成为由对手操控之咒语或异能的目标。）\\n佩带{1}\', \'type\': \'神器 — 武具\', \'flavor\': \'「贸然参战乃是智者所为…如果你做好了准备的话。」\\n～千刃团队长肯耶珂\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660042&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59998134-4c11-4dd1-a14b-d2a8bd978b78\', \'multiverseId\': 660042}, \'multiverseid\': 660042}]', "[{'name': 'Fluch des Borstenviehs', 'text': 'Schicke X Kreaturen deiner Wahl ins Exil. Für jede auf diese Weise ins Exil geschickte Kreatur erzeugt ihr Beherrscher einen 2/2 grünen Wildschwein-Kreaturenspielstein.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': 'Und wieder wurde eine bevorstehende Schlacht mit lautem Grunzen abgewendet.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658802&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5d375d24-5269-4956-b77d-511de1ac7f00', 'multiverseId': 658802}, 'multiverseid': 658802}, {'name': 'Maldición porcina', 'text': 'Exilia X criaturas objetivo. Por cada criatura exiliada de esta manera, su controlador crea una ficha de criatura Jabalí verde 2/2.', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': 'Otra batalla inminente acallada por profusos gruñidos y hozares despreocupados.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659068&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c5f942b1-40f7-48a5-8841-c09198d99321', 'multiverseId': 659068}, 'multiverseid': 659068}, {'name': 'Malédiction du pourceau', 'text': 'Exilez X créatures ciblées. Pour chaque créature exilée de cette manière, son contrôleur crée un jeton de créature 2/2 verte Sanglier.', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': 'Une autre bataille imminente se solda par des couinements porcins et des frottements de groin insouciants.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659334&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b3061cc8-bb91-4da9-8b9e-a4f005ade9c3', 'multiverseId': 659334}, 'multiverseid': 659334}, {'name': '豚の呪い', 'text': 'クリーチャーＸ体を対象とする。それらを追放する。これにより追放された各クリーチャーにつきそれぞれ、そのコントローラーは緑の２/２の猪・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '鼻を鳴らす音と気楽に地面を掘り返す喧噪に包まれ、また一つ差し迫った戦争が鎮静化された。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659600&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4b620e9d-b76a-490d-8eaf-73eba079dae9', 'multiverseId': 659600}, 'multiverseid': 659600}, {'name': '野猪之咒', 'text': '放逐X个目标生物。对每个以此法放逐的生物而言，其操控者派出一个2/2绿色野猪衍生生物。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '另一场迫在眉睫的战役，在乱嗅和随意拱土之间消弭于无形。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659866&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0e877c3d-eb59-4e8e-bc36-5f79c7d52f80', 'multiverseId': 659866}, 'multiverseid': 659866}]", '[{\'name\': \'Flucht in die Wildnis\', \'text\': \'Schicke die obersten fünf Karten deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Du kannst Karten, die auf diese Weise ins Exil geschickt wurden, bis zum Ende deines nächsten Zuges spielen.\\nDu darfst in diesem Zug ein zusätzliches Land spielen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Die Wachen heizten den Kamin an und schlossen die Tür zu Ellwens Kammer ab. Am nächsten Morgen war das Feuer erloschen und Ellwen verschwunden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658933&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b71fbdd-8dab-4332-bfc8-5b11577c86f8\', \'multiverseId\': 658933}, \'multiverseid\': 658933}, {\'name\': \'Huir a las tierras salvajes\', \'text\': \'Exilia las cinco primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Puedes jugar las cartas exiliadas de esta manera hasta el final de tu próximo turno.\\nPuedes jugar una tierra adicional este turno.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Los guardias avivaron las llamas del hogar y cerraron la puerta de los aposentos de Ellwen. Por la mañana, el fuego se había consumido y Ellwen ya no estaba.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659199&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77603287-33ba-4868-81c7-d0364f474b0c\', \'multiverseId\': 659199}, \'multiverseid\': 659199}, {\'name\': \'Évasion dans les friches\', \'text\': "Exilez les cinq cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez jouer les cartes exilées de cette manière jusqu\'à la fin de votre prochain tour.\\nVous pouvez jouer un terrain supplémentaire ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Les gardes attisèrent l\'âtre et verrouillèrent la porte de la chambre d\'Ellwen. Au matin, le feu s\'était éteint et Ellwen avait disparu.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659465&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'482d17ed-5561-4a6e-983b-cabb432e92f3\', \'multiverseId\': 659465}, \'multiverseid\': 659465}, {\'name\': \'僻境への脱出\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード５枚を追放する。次のあなたのターンの終了時まで、これにより追放されているカードをプレイしてもよい。\\nこのターン、追加で土地１つをプレイしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'護衛たちは暖炉に火をつけエルウィンの居房に鍵をかけた。朝には火が消えていて、エルウィンの姿はなかった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659731&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2fc0078e-af0f-4fdc-80d4-e507d1e6b8da\', \'multiverseId\': 659731}, \'multiverseid\': 659731}, {\'name\': \'逃往幻野\', \'text\': \'放逐你牌库顶的五张牌。直到你下一个回合的回合结束，你可以使用以此法放逐的牌。\\n本回合中，你可以额外使用一个地。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'卫兵生好炉火，然后锁上了艾尔雯闺房的大门。等到了早上的时候，炉火已全部熄灭，艾尔雯不知所踪。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659997&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8d12839-f111-4d6a-b2b0-e0b8f65b3d89\', \'multiverseId\': 659997}, \'multiverseid\': 659997}]', '[{\'name\': \'Frühlingsblüten-Druide\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Frühlingsblüten-Druide ins Spiel kommt, kannst du ein Land opfern. Falls du dies tust, durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu zwei Standardland-Karten, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'„Neues Wachstum legt einen heilenden Verband über vernarbte Wunden."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658918&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87714451-c95b-42ef-8da6-ffcdbcd7340e\', \'multiverseId\': 658918}, \'multiverseid\': 658918}, {\'name\': \'Druida broteflorecedor\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Druida broteflorecedor entre al campo de batalla, puedes sacrificar una tierra. Si lo haces, busca en tu biblioteca hasta dos cartas de tierra básica, ponlas en el campo de batalla giradas y luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"El crecimiento de brotes nuevos es una cataplasma para heridas que llevan demasiado tiempo sin cicatrizar".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659184&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59afc2e1-02bc-46b7-996d-f34b7c7f89a2\', \'multiverseId\': 659184}, \'multiverseid\': 659184}, {\'name\': \'Druide du printemps\', \'text\': "Quand le Druide du printemps arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez sacrifier un terrain. Si vous faites ainsi, cherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à deux cartes de terrain de base, mettez-les sur le champ de bataille engagées, puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Créature — elfe et druide\', \'flavor\': \'« La première pousse applique un cataplasme qui soulage les plaies cicatrisées depuis longtemps. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659450&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3b53fc6-40b8-46e2-be14-101a7759f56b\', \'multiverseId\': 659450}, \'multiverseid\': 659450}, {\'name\': \'春花のドルイド\', \'text\': \'春花のドルイドが戦場に出たとき、土地１つを生け贄に捧げてもよい。そうしたなら、あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード最大２枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出し、その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'「新たなる成長が長くかさぶたになっていた傷跡を癒すのだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659716&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9084ae7b-e455-4f6d-a0cf-decd76bf395f\', \'multiverseId\': 659716}, \'multiverseid\': 659716}, {\'name\': \'春华德鲁伊\', \'text\': \'当春华德鲁伊进战场时，你可以牺牲一个地。若你如此作，则从你牌库中搜寻至多两张基本地牌，将它们横置放进战场，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 妖精／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': \'「全新生机为早已结痂的伤口涂上治疗药膏。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659982&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0fe5f06e-1924-47e9-84dc-7774455552f3\', \'multiverseId\': 659982}, \'multiverseid\': 659982}]', '[{\'name\': \'Funkelnder Impuls\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +2/+2 und ist angestachelt. (Sie greift in jedem Kampf an, falls möglich, und greift einen anderen Spieler als dich an, falls möglich.)\\nImmer wenn die verzauberte Kreatur angreift, erzeugst du einen Schatz-Spielstein. (Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{T}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.")\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658890&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'905cb4b2-60c0-45fa-bac7-7057f6a2f60c\', \'multiverseId\': 658890}, \'multiverseid\': 658890}, {\'name\': \'Ímpetu brillante\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +2/+2 y está incitada. (Ataca cada combate si puede y ataca a un jugador que no seas tú si puede.)\\nSiempre que la criatura encantada ataque, creas una ficha de Tesoro. (Es un artefacto con "{T}, sacrificar este artefacto: Agrega un maná de cualquier color".)\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659156&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0e307b0-6af9-4013-9549-52cc0de5a1f4\', \'multiverseId\': 659156}, \'multiverseid\': 659156}, {\'name\': \'Impetus brillant\', \'text\': "Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +2/+2 et est incitée. (Elle attaque à chaque combat si possible et attaque un joueur autre que vous si possible.)\\nÀ chaque fois que la créature enchantée attaque, vous créez un jeton Trésor. (C\'est un artefact avec « {T}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix. »)", \'type\': \'Enchantement — aura\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659422&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3463884-9063-4ce5-abc0-a3d7345d8456\', \'multiverseId\': 659422}, \'multiverseid\': 659422}, {\'name\': \'輝光の推進力\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受け、使嗾されている。（それは各戦闘で可能なら攻撃し、可能ならあなたでないプレイヤーを攻撃する。）\\nエンチャントしているクリーチャーが攻撃するたび、あなたは宝物・トークン１つを生成する。（それは、「{T}, このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659688&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'984f3b54-ccc3-4831-81da-ed19336aef3e\', \'multiverseId\': 659688}, \'multiverseid\': 659688}, {\'name\': \'闪耀促动\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n所结附的生物得+2/+2且已煽惑。（它每次战斗若能攻击，则必须攻击，且若能攻击除你以外的牌手，则必须如此作。）\\n每当所结附的生物攻击时，你派出一个珍宝衍生物。（它是具有「{T}，牺牲此神器：加一点任意颜色的法术力」的神器。）\', \'type\': \'结界 — 灵气\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659954&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d36db7c5-bde0-4d63-973f-91c491aee84c\', \'multiverseId\': 659954}, \'multiverseid\': 659954}]', '[{\'name\': \'Futter für den Schwarm\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine Kreatur oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl, die ein Gegner kontrolliert. Du verlierst Lebenspunkte in Höhe des Manabetrags jenes Permanents.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Auf abscheulichen Schwingen und blutigem Wind wird sich der Schwarm erheben."\\n—Inschrift einer Himmelsfestung\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658844&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1dda81b9-f71d-477a-9463-c300e731f4f4\', \'multiverseId\': 658844}, \'multiverseid\': 658844}, {\'name\': \'Alimentar al enjambre\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura o encantamiento objetivo que controla un oponente. Pierdes una cantidad de vidas igual al valor de maná de ese permanente.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"El enjambre se alzará con alas repugnantes y viento ensangrentado".\\n—Inscripción de aerorruina\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659110&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'430cc5de-5358-48ce-b872-60a7712b0ed4\', \'multiverseId\': 659110}, \'multiverseid\': 659110}, {\'name\': "Nourrir l\'essaim", \'text\': "Détruisez une cible, créature ou enchantement, qu\'un adversaire contrôle. Vous perdez un nombre de points de vie égal à la valeur de mana de ce permanent.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« L\'essaim s\'envolera sur ses ailes infâmes, porté par un vent sanglant. »\\n—Inscription sur un fort céleste", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659376&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'886b5f38-e89f-4c5b-a96e-4e751b8c5ff5\', \'multiverseId\': 659376}, \'multiverseid\': 659376}, {\'name\': \'大群への給餌\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーやエンチャントであり対戦相手がコントロールしている１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。あなたは、そのパーマネントのマナ総量に等しい点数のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「不快な翼と血の風により大群が起きるだろう。」\\n――スカイクレイブの碑文\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659642&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c258f6d5-aa70-4d2f-8a12-7b978221bf5d\', \'multiverseId\': 659642}, \'multiverseid\': 659642}, {\'name\': \'喂饱虫群\', \'text\': \'消灭目标由对手操控的生物或结界。你失去等同于该永久物之法术力值的生命。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「邪翼蔽日，血雨腥风，虫群必将崛起。」\\n～空境铭文\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659908&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae4d8611-9e6d-45e8-adf1-8808b6c6720d\', \'multiverseId\': 659908}, \'multiverseid\': 659908}]', '[{\'name\': \'Galvanische Iteration\', \'text\': \'Wenn du in diesem Zug deinen nächsten Spontanzauber oder deine nächste Hexerei wirkst, kopiere jenen Zauberspruch. Du kannst neue Ziele für die Kopie bestimmen.\\nRückblende {1}{U}{R} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Lieber wirkungsvoll als vorhersehbar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658937&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6edf6673-36a1-4ead-8902-1b49f8b55e49\', \'multiverseId\': 658937}, \'multiverseid\': 658937}, {\'name\': \'Iteración galvánica\', \'text\': \'Cuando lances tu próximo hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro este turno, copia ese hechizo. Puedes elegir nuevos objetivos para la copia.\\nRetrospectiva {1}{U}{R}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Más vale potente que predecible.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659203&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e844bcf1-5a9b-444a-a616-79025d0b88a2\', \'multiverseId\': 659203}, \'multiverseid\': 659203}, {\'name\': \'Itération zingante\', \'text\': "Quand vous lancez votre prochain sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel ce tour-ci, copiez ce sort. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour cette copie.\\nFlashback {1}{U}{R} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'Mieux vaut être puissant que prévisible.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659469&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec107730-590f-4066-bca2-ae63f4152aa0\', \'multiverseId\': 659469}, \'multiverseid\': 659469}, {\'name\': \'感電の反復\', \'text\': \'このターン、あなたが次にインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えたとき、その呪文をコピーする。そのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。\\nフラッシュバック{1}{U}{R}（あなたの墓地にあるこのカードをフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'ありきたりより強力の方がいい。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659735&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3315df6d-b580-471d-a768-fb79b246c8dd\', \'multiverseId\': 659735}, \'multiverseid\': 659735}, {\'name\': \'电流迭变\', \'text\': \'本回合中，当你施放你的下一个瞬间或法术咒语时，复制该咒语。你可以为该复制品选择新的目标。\\n返照{1}{U}{R}（你可以从你坟墓场中施放此牌，并支付其返照费用，然后将它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'宁要威力，不要规律。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660001&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6057be58-2563-49cd-8c04-46db28179bf2\', \'multiverseId\': 660001}, \'multiverseid\': 660001}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gefallener Shinobi\', \'text\': \'Ninjutsu {2}{U}{B} ({2}{U}{B}, bringe einen ungeblockten Angreifer, den du kontrollierst, auf die Hand zurück: Bringe diese Karte aus deiner Hand getappt und angreifend ins Spiel.)\\nImmer wenn der Gefallene Shinobi einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, schickt der Spieler die obersten zwei Karten seiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Bis zum Ende des Zuges kannst du die Karten spielen, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie, Ninja\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658936&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4078104-ae05-4b69-af16-cf1a9d9d2319\', \'multiverseId\': 658936}, \'multiverseid\': 658936}, {\'name\': \'Shinobi caída\', \'text\': \'Ninjutsu {2}{U}{B}. ({2}{U}{B}, regresar un atacante no bloqueado que controlas a la mano de su propietario: Pon esta carta en el campo de batalla de tu mano girada y atacando.)\\nSiempre que la Shinobi caída haga daño de combate a un jugador, ese jugador exilia las dos primeras cartas de su biblioteca. Hasta el final del turno, puedes jugar esas cartas sin pagar sus costes de maná.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ninja zombie\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659202&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0d6f3ab-54c5-4efc-9291-f06b36e67f12\', \'multiverseId\': 659202}, \'multiverseid\': 659202}, {\'name\': \'Shinobi déchu\', \'text\': "Ninjutsu {2}{U}{B} ({2}{U}{B}, renvoyez dans votre main un attaquant non-bloqué que vous contrôlez : Mettez sur le champ de bataille cette carte, engagée et attaquante, depuis votre main.)\\nÀ chaque fois que le Shinobi déchu inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, ce joueur exile les deux cartes du dessus de sa bibliothèque. Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, vous pouvez jouer ces cartes sans payer leur coût de mana.", \'type\': \'Créature — zombie et ninja\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659468&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2972e86-0d4e-4b2b-9f46-b573de72069e\', \'multiverseId\': 659468}, \'multiverseid\': 659468}, {\'name\': \'堕ちた忍び\', \'text\': \'忍術{2}{U}{B}（{2}{U}{B}, あなたがコントロールしていてブロックされなかった攻撃クリーチャー１体を手札に戻す：あなたの手札にあるこのカードをタップ状態かつ攻撃している状態で戦場に出す。）\\n堕ちた忍びがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、そのプレイヤーは自分のライブラリーの一番上にあるカード２枚を追放する。ターン終了時まで、あなたはそれらのカードをマナ・コストを支払うことなくプレイしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ・忍者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659734&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db495ec3-5117-46ff-9c5e-3d33ed212aba\', \'multiverseId\': 659734}, \'multiverseid\': 659734}, {\'name\': \'堕亡忍者\', \'text\': \'忍术{2}{U}{B}（{2}{U}{B}，将一个由你操控且未受阻挡的攻击生物回手：将此牌从你手上横置放进战场，且正进行攻击。）\\n每当堕亡忍者对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，该牌手放逐其牌库顶的两张牌。直到回合结束，你可以使用这些牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 灵俑／忍者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660000&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'935d6aa3-00ac-408f-906c-17256fcbfe60\', \'multiverseId\': 660000}, \'multiverseid\': 660000}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geflügelte Stiefel\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur hat Flugfähigkeit und Abwehr {4}. (Immer wenn die ausgerüstete Kreatur das Ziel eines Zauberspruchs oder einer Fähigkeit wird, den bzw. die ein Gegner kontrolliert, neutralisiere ihn bzw. sie, es sei denn, jener Spieler bezahlt {4}.)\\nAusrüsten {1}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'Lass dich davontragen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658834&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6945f41a-30a0-4294-8dc4-454d5d7ad1e2\', \'multiverseId\': 658834}, \'multiverseid\': 658834}, {\'name\': \'Botas aladas\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada tiene las habilidades de volar y rebatir {4}. (Siempre que la criatura equipada sea objetivo de un hechizo o habilidad que controla un oponente, contrarréstalo a menos que ese jugador pague {4}.)\\nEquipar {1}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'Déjate llevar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659100&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43ad3fae-5fa5-46d7-9e0e-db31f6026f81\', \'multiverseId\': 659100}, \'multiverseid\': 659100}, {\'name\': \'Bottes ailées\', \'text\': "La créature équipée a le vol et parade {4}. (À chaque fois que la créature équipée devient la cible d\'un sort ou d\'une capacité qu\'un adversaire contrôle, contrecarrez ce sort ou cette capacité à moins que ce joueur ne paie {4}.)\\nÉquipement {1}", \'type\': \'Artefact — équipement\', \'flavor\': \'Laissez-vous emporter.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659366&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb0d9e19-e3cc-4867-b2e9-5af1aa12202e\', \'multiverseId\': 659366}, \'multiverseid\': 659366}, {\'name\': \'ウィングド・ブーツ\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは飛行と護法{4}を持つ。（装備しているクリーチャーが対戦相手がコントロールしている呪文や能力の対象になるたび、そのプレイヤーが{4}を支払わないかぎり、その呪文や能力を打ち消す。）\\n装備{1}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'地に足がつかない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659632&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'208b23b7-5b08-4bdf-9c8d-847d15f33215\', \'multiverseId\': 659632}, \'multiverseid\': 659632}, {\'name\': \'飞翼靴\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物具有飞行与守护{4}。（每当佩带此武具的生物成为由对手操控之咒语或异能的目标时，除非该牌手支付{4}，否则反击之。）\\n佩带{1}\', \'type\': \'神器 — 武具\', \'flavor\': \'随风飞舞。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659898&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e86638e-1f26-4791-b70b-47b6ba4558eb\', \'multiverseId\': 659898}, \'multiverseid\': 659898}]', "[{'name': 'Gehirn extrahieren', 'text': 'Ein Gegner deiner Wahl bestimmt X Karten auf seiner Hand. Schaue dir die Karten an. Du kannst davon einen Zauberspruch wirken, ohne seine Manakosten zu bezahlen.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': 'Kein Gedanke ist so saftig wie ein Geheimnis.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658935&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cb5774c3-285c-4684-bdfb-019ec3b941c0', 'multiverseId': 658935}, 'multiverseid': 658935}, {'name': 'Extraer cerebro', 'text': 'El oponente objetivo elige X cartas de su mano. Mira esas cartas. Puedes lanzar un hechizo de entre ellas sin pagar su coste de maná.', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': 'No hay pensamiento más suculento que un secreto.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659201&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '07826756-49f4-4a26-a2da-569603d2d74d', 'multiverseId': 659201}, 'multiverseid': 659201}, {'name': 'Extraction de cerveau', 'text': 'Un adversaire ciblé choisit X cartes de sa main. Regardez ces cartes. Vous pouvez lancer un sort parmi elles sans payer son coût de mana.', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': 'Les secrets sont les plus délicieuses des pensées.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659467&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2293ed4a-3a67-47ae-9aea-65918fc975c9', 'multiverseId': 659467}, 'multiverseid': 659467}, {'name': '脳髄引き抜き', 'text': '対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは自分の手札にあるカードＸ枚を選ぶ。あなたはそれらのカードを見る。あなたはその中から呪文１つを、マナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '秘密ほどそそる思考はない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659733&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2ebedb62-70a7-4c2a-bbec-c5d2a3f595c6', 'multiverseId': 659733}, 'multiverseid': 659733}, {'name': '夺脑', 'text': '目标对手从其手上选择X张牌。你检视这些牌。你可以从其中施放一个咒语，且不需支付其法术力费用。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '没有什么思想能比秘密更鲜美。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659999&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '27101edc-0632-4ad1-80cb-fa51c04136c7', 'multiverseId': 659999}, 'multiverseid': 659999}]", '[{\'name\': \'Gehirndieb-Drache\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nZu Beginn deines Endsegments schickst du die oberste Karte der Bibliothek jedes Gegners ins Exil. Du kannst die Karten spielen, solange sie im Exil bleiben. Falls du auf diese Weise einen Zauberspruch wirkst, kannst du Mana ausgeben, als wäre es Mana beliebiger Farbe, um ihn zu wirken.\\nImmer wenn ein Nichtland-Permanent, das ein Gegner besitzt, unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, verliert jener Gegner Lebenspunkte in Höhe seines Manabetrags.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache, Schrecken\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658837&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'892f30f8-5177-4d42-9bb5-fcb7e7eb1f07\', \'multiverseId\': 658837}, \'multiverseid\': 658837}, {\'name\': \'Dragón robacerebros\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nAl comienzo de tu paso final, exilia la primera carta de la biblioteca de cada oponente. Puedes jugar esas cartas mientras permanezcan exiliadas. Si lanzas un hechizo de esta manera, puedes usar maná como si fuera maná de cualquier color para lanzarlo.\\nSiempre que un permanente que no sea tierra y que sea propiedad de un oponente entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, ese oponente pierde una cantidad de vidas igual a su valor de maná.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Horror dragón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659103&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d48c3fc-128a-4434-955d-e984d3a53804\', \'multiverseId\': 659103}, \'multiverseid\': 659103}, {\'name\': "Dragon voleur d\'esprit", \'text\': "Vol\\nAu début de votre étape de fin, exilez la carte du dessus de la bibliothèque de chaque adversaire. Vous pouvez jouer ces cartes tant qu\'elles restent exilées. Si vous lancez un sort de cette manière, vous pouvez dépenser du mana comme si c\'était du mana de n\'importe quelle couleur pour le lancer.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un permanent non-terrain qu\'un adversaire possède arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, il perd un nombre de points de vie égal à sa valeur de mana.", \'type\': \'Créature — dragon et horreur\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659369&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41647727-c2e5-40b5-b57d-e0d67e6708bf\', \'multiverseId\': 659369}, \'multiverseid\': 659369}, {\'name\': \'ブレインスティーラー・ドラゴン\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたの終了ステップの開始時に、各対戦相手それぞれのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を追放する。それらのカードが追放され続けているかぎり、あなたはそれらのカードをプレイしてもよい。これによりあなたが呪文を唱えるなら、あなたはそれを唱えるためにマナを任意の色のマナであるかのように支払ってもよい。\\n対戦相手がオーナーであり土地でないパーマネント１つがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、それのオーナーはそれのマナ総量に等しい点数のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン・ホラー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659635&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3b828a17-2ca1-4c32-aedc-e0325c1d8051\', \'multiverseId\': 659635}, \'multiverseid\': 659635}, {\'name\': \'夺脑龙\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n在你的结束步骤开始时，放逐每位对手的牌库顶牌。于这些牌持续放逐的时段内，你可以使用它们。如果你以此法施放咒语，则你可以将法术力视同任意颜色的法术力来施放。\\n每当一个由对手拥有的非地永久物在你操控下进战场时，该对手失去等同于其法术力值的生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 龙／惊惧兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659901&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ceea1b58-d0c4-400a-a56e-5eafc953ec81\', \'multiverseId\': 659901}, \'multiverseid\': 659901}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geiselnehmerin\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Geiselnehmerin ins Spiel kommt, schicke eine andere Kreatur oder ein anderes Artefakt deiner Wahl ins Exil, bis die Geiselnehmerin das Spiel verlässt. Du kannst die Karte wirken, solange sie im Exil bleibt, und Mana beliebigen Typs kann ausgegeben werden, um jenen Zauberspruch zu wirken.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Pirat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658941&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14e9a1e4-b85b-4d20-aa04-80d5d5c27e0a\', \'multiverseId\': 658941}, \'multiverseid\': 658941}, {\'name\': \'Secuestradora\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Secuestradora entre al campo de batalla, exilia otra criatura o artefacto objetivo hasta que la Secuestradora deje el campo de batalla. Puedes lanzar esa carta mientras permanezca exiliada y puedes usar maná de cualquier tipo para lanzar ese hechizo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pirata humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659207&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3d9ab84-8ebf-4a7d-9f80-596107d47e5b\', \'multiverseId\': 659207}, \'multiverseid\': 659207}, {\'name\': "Preneuse d\'otage", \'text\': "Quand la Preneuse d\'otage arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez une autre cible, créature ou artefact, jusqu\'à ce que la Preneuse d\'otage quitte le champ de bataille. Vous pouvez lancer cette carte tant qu\'elle reste exilée, et du mana de n\'importe quel type peut être dépensé pour lancer ce sort.", \'type\': \'Créature — humain et pirate\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659473&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8333800-0f10-4d92-9a2a-48f334e00e2e\', \'multiverseId\': 659473}, \'multiverseid\': 659473}, {\'name\': \'人質取り\', \'text\': \'人質取りが戦場に出たとき、クリーチャーやアーティファクトでありこれでない１つを対象とする。人質取りが戦場を離れるまで、それを追放する。そのカードが追放され続けているかぎり、それを唱えてもよく、その呪文を唱えるために任意のタイプのマナを支払ってもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・海賊\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659739&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed7257f2-82fc-4038-bf30-f18db2d60229\', \'multiverseId\': 659739}, \'multiverseid\': 659739}, {\'name\': \'人质挟匪\', \'text\': \'当人质挟匪进战场时，放逐另一个目标生物或神器，直到人质挟匪离开战场为止。于该牌持续放逐的时段内，你可以施放该牌，且能用任意种类的法术力来施放该咒语。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／海盗\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660005&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f45c319f-a2ab-49c4-a067-f0d2e6aa066f\', \'multiverseId\': 660005}, \'multiverseid\': 660005}]', '[{\'name\': \'Geisterhafter Dieb\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn der Geisterhafte Dieb enttappt wird, kannst du {2} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, ziehe eine Karte.\\nImmer wenn ein Gegner einen Zauberspruch von irgendwoher außer aus seiner Hand wirkt, ziehe eine Karte.\\nWirf eine Karte ab: Der Geisterhafte Dieb kann in diesem Zug nicht geblockt werden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Geist, Räuber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658808&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e350e06f-83cc-4975-9a58-5f9b670f0f1f\', \'multiverseId\': 658808}, \'multiverseid\': 658808}, {\'name\': \'Ladronzuelo fantasmal\', \'text\': \'Siempre que el Ladronzuelo fantasmal se enderece, puedes pagar {2}. Si lo haces, roba una carta.\\nSiempre que un oponente lance un hechizo desde cualquier parte excepto desde su mano, roba una carta.\\nDescartar una carta: El Ladronzuelo fantasmal no puede ser bloqueado este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón espíritu\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659074&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d32dc6da-3321-4055-ae82-507c525f2673\', \'multiverseId\': 659074}, \'multiverseid\': 659074}, {\'name\': \'Chapardeur fantomal\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que le Chapardeur fantomal devient dégagé, vous pouvez payer {2}. Si vous faites ainsi, piochez une carte.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un adversaire lance un sort depuis autre part que sa main, piochez une carte.\\nDéfaussez-vous d\'une carte : Le Chapardeur fantomal ne peut pas être bloqué ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Créature — esprit et gredin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659340&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b75de20d-47ac-4317-830e-459f371baf08\', \'multiverseId\': 659340}, \'multiverseid\': 659340}, {\'name\': \'幽体のこそ泥\', \'text\': \'幽体のこそ泥がアンタップ状態になるたび、{2}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、カード１枚を引く。\\n対戦相手が自分の手札以外から呪文１つを唱えるたび、あなたはカード１枚を引く。\\nカード１枚を捨てる：このターン、幽体のこそ泥はブロックされない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スピリット・ならず者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659606&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07f3628a-b63f-4dcf-b62f-fe45e0f117a0\', \'multiverseId\': 659606}, \'multiverseid\': 659606}, {\'name\': \'魂魅小偷\', \'text\': \'每当魂魅小偷成为未横置时，你可以支付{2}。若你如此作，则抓一张牌。\\n每当任一对手从其手牌以外的任何区域施放咒语时，你抓一张牌。\\n弃一张牌：魂魅小偷本回合不能被阻挡。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 精怪／浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659872&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d96980a4-fa83-489e-ad29-fa7a7648af8f\', \'multiverseId\': 659872}, \'multiverseid\': 659872}]', '[{\'name\': \'Genaue Analyse\', \'text\': \'Ein Spieler deiner Wahl zieht zwei Karten.\\nRückblende — {1}{U}, bezahle 3 Lebenspunkte. (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Das Exemplar ist anscheinend defekt."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658804&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fcb3405e-dbe8-4e02-bde3-0fb4d3409197\', \'multiverseId\': 658804}, \'multiverseid\': 658804}, {\'name\': \'Análisis profundo\', \'text\': \'El jugador objetivo roba dos cartas.\\nRetrospectiva—{1}{U}, pagar 3 vidas. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"El espécimen parece dañado".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659070&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a43a237d-4d30-4053-809a-543002b38c4d\', \'multiverseId\': 659070}, \'multiverseid\': 659070}, {\'name\': \'Analyse en profondeur\', \'text\': \'Un joueur ciblé pioche deux cartes.\\nFlashback — {1}{U}, payez 3 points de vie. (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Ce spécimen semble cassé. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659336&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ad3341b-d9e2-4a1e-aaa8-00e1f7aff000\', \'multiverseId\': 659336}, \'multiverseid\': 659336}, {\'name\': \'綿密な分析\', \'text\': \'プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはカード２枚を引く。\\nフラッシュバック―{1}{U}, ３点のライフを支払う。（あなたの墓地にあるこのカードをフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「この標本は壊れているようだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659602&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c26b1e5f-1ff1-4d8c-a359-736002d53b87\', \'multiverseId\': 659602}, \'multiverseid\': 659602}, {\'name\': \'深入分析\', \'text\': \'目标牌手抓两张牌。\\n返照～{1}{U}，支付3点生命。（你可以从你坟墓场中施放此牌，并支付其返照费用，然后将它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「这样本似乎有点坏。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659868&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'26129cbe-5ef2-4056-9ba6-877aaea7e8a1\', \'multiverseId\': 659868}, \'multiverseid\': 659868}]', '[{\'name\': \'Genesis-Hydra\', \'text\': \'Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, decke die obersten X Karten deiner Bibliothek auf. Du kannst davon eine Nichtland-Permanentkarte mit Manabetrag X oder weniger ins Spiel bringen. Mische dann den Rest in deine Bibliothek.\\nDie Genesis-Hydra kommt mit X +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Pflanze, Hydra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658903&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55959920-6cc1-4ac8-9c8b-76ae27825548\', \'multiverseId\': 658903}, \'multiverseid\': 658903}, {\'name\': \'Hidra del génesis\', \'text\': \'Cuando lances este hechizo, muestra las X primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Puedes poner en el campo de batalla una carta de permanente que no sea tierra con valor de maná de X o menos de entre ellas. Luego baraja el resto en tu biblioteca.\\nLa Hidra del génesis entra al campo de batalla con X contadores +1/+1 sobre ella.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hidra planta\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659169&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63436383-4dab-425b-a205-55d1ec562efd\', \'multiverseId\': 659169}, \'multiverseid\': 659169}, {\'name\': \'Hydre de genèse\', \'text\': "Quand vous lancez ce sort, révélez les X cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Parmi elles, vous pouvez mettre sur le champ de bataille une carte de permanent non-terrain avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à X. Mélangez ensuite le reste dans votre bibliothèque.\\nL\'Hydre de genèse arrive sur le champ de bataille avec X marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle.", \'type\': \'Créature — plante et hydre\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659435&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fd28631-bcae-48bd-9826-098a0cab30da\', \'multiverseId\': 659435}, \'multiverseid\': 659435}, {\'name\': \'起源のハイドラ\', \'text\': \'あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカードＸ枚を公開する。その中から、マナ総量がＸ以下であり土地でないパーマネント・カード１枚を戦場に出してもよい。その後、残りをあなたのライブラリーに加えて切り直す。\\n起源のハイドラは、＋１/＋１カウンターＸ個が置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 植物・ハイドラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659701&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1bd2ab69-882f-4410-b7ec-a450a1857533\', \'multiverseId\': 659701}, \'multiverseid\': 659701}, {\'name\': \'创生多头龙\', \'text\': \'当你施放此咒语时，展示你牌库顶的X张牌。你可以将其中一张法术力值等于或小于X的非地永久物牌放进战场。然后将其余的牌洗入你的牌库。\\n创生多头龙进战场时上面有X个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 植物／多头龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659967&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a739cc5e-e26d-48d3-bedc-c2065a9df9a9\', \'multiverseId\': 659967}, \'multiverseid\': 659967}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gerissener Händler\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Gerissene Händler ins Spiel kommt, schicke eine Permanent-Karte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil. Du kannst die Karte spielen, solange sie im Exil bleibt.\\nZaubersprüche, die du von irgendwoher außer aus deiner Hand wirkst, kosten beim Wirken {1} weniger.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Bürger\', \'flavor\': \'„Ein bisschen Schmutz sagt nichts über die Qualität aus — weder bei Waren noch bei Menschen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658385&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a488bb9-f749-4ece-85bb-60a8ef5b1f05\', \'multiverseId\': 658385}, \'multiverseid\': 658385}, {\'name\': \'Comerciante espabilado\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Comerciante espabilado entre al campo de batalla, exilia la carta de permanente objetivo de tu cementerio. Puedes jugar esa carta mientras permanezca exiliada.\\nTe cuesta {1} menos lanzar hechizos desde cualquier parte excepto desde tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ciudadano humano\', \'flavor\': \'"La calidad de las personas y de las cosas no se ve afectada por no estar del todo limpias".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658417&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c767727a-86f3-48e8-b951-86039615ba97\', \'multiverseId\': 658417}, \'multiverseid\': 658417}, {\'name\': \'Marchand éclairé\', \'text\': "Quand le Marchand éclairé arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez une carte de permanent ciblée depuis votre cimetière. Vous pouvez jouer cette carte tant qu\'elle reste exilée.\\nLes sorts que vous lancez depuis autre part que votre main coûtent {1} de moins à lancer.", \'type\': \'Créature — humain et citoyen\', \'flavor\': "« Un peu de saleté, ce n\'est pas un gage de qualité... autant pour les choses que pour les gens. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658449&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'433e1176-399a-4d6a-980a-e47fb7fd7cdd\', \'multiverseId\': 658449}, \'multiverseid\': 658449}, {\'name\': \'抜け目ない交易商人\', \'text\': \'抜け目ない交易商人が戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地にあるパーマネント・カード１枚を対象とする。それを追放する。そのカードが追放され続けているかぎり、それをプレイしてもよい。\\nあなたがあなたの手札以外から呪文を唱えるためのコストは{1}少なくなる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・市民\', \'flavor\': \'「わずかな汚れは品質に影響しない――物であっても人であってもな。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658481&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d6a3e23-56c7-4c3d-8ef1-fa70f6973ebd\', \'multiverseId\': 658481}, \'multiverseid\': 658481}, {\'name\': \'机敏贩商\', \'text\': \'当机敏贩商进战场时，将目标永久物牌从你的坟墓场放逐。于该牌持续放逐的时段内，你可以使用该牌。\\n你从你手牌以外的任何区域施放之咒语减少{1}来施放。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／市民\', \'flavor\': \'「表面沾点泥又不影响内在品质～人物货物均如此。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658513&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a97336a0-1387-4823-83c1-6d3bc9b850a3\', \'multiverseId\': 658513}, \'multiverseid\': 658513}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gerissener Händler\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Gerissene Händler ins Spiel kommt, schicke eine Permanent-Karte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil. Du kannst die Karte spielen, solange sie im Exil bleibt.\\nZaubersprüche, die du von irgendwoher außer aus deiner Hand wirkst, kosten beim Wirken {1} weniger.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Bürger\', \'flavor\': \'„Ein bisschen Schmutz sagt nichts über die Qualität aus — weder bei Waren noch bei Menschen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660193&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fffd56a8-479b-4aa2-996b-490b69fe4121\', \'multiverseId\': 660193}, \'multiverseid\': 660193}, {\'name\': \'Marchand éclairé\', \'text\': "Quand le Marchand éclairé arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez une carte de permanent ciblée depuis votre cimetière. Vous pouvez jouer cette carte tant qu\'elle reste exilée.\\nLes sorts que vous lancez depuis autre part que votre main coûtent {1} de moins à lancer.", \'type\': \'Créature — humain et citoyen\', \'flavor\': "« Un peu de saleté, ce n\'est pas un gage de qualité... autant pour les choses que pour les gens. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660225&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3954b58f-6085-49fa-be00-20b22ef0d56c\', \'multiverseId\': 660225}, \'multiverseid\': 660225}, {\'name\': \'抜け目ない交易商人\', \'text\': \'抜け目ない交易商人が戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地にあるパーマネント・カード１枚を対象とする。それを追放する。そのカードが追放され続けているかぎり、それをプレイしてもよい。\\nあなたがあなたの手札以外から呪文を唱えるためのコストは{1}少なくなる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・市民\', \'flavor\': \'「わずかな汚れは品質に影響しない――物であっても人であってもな。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660257&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edf21336-7a2a-4850-a517-4743fa5dc483\', \'multiverseId\': 660257}, \'multiverseid\': 660257}, {\'name\': \'机敏贩商\', \'text\': \'当机敏贩商进战场时，将目标永久物牌从你的坟墓场放逐。于该牌持续放逐的时段内，你可以使用该牌。\\n你从你手牌以外的任何区域施放之咒语减少{1}来施放。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／市民\', \'flavor\': \'「表面沾点泥又不影响内在品质～人物货物均如此。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660289&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9cc882bf-e754-47fd-813e-f2f7a26c3ef7\', \'multiverseId\': 660289}, \'multiverseid\': 660289}]', "[{'name': 'Geschütztes Gestrüpp', 'text': '({T}: Erzeuge {R} oder {G}.)\\nDas Geschützte Gestrüpp kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nUmwandlung {2} ({2}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)', 'type': 'Land — Gebirge, Wald', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659029&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1cc6fe19-3746-4642-b4cf-a6291d483436', 'multiverseId': 659029}, 'multiverseid': 659029}, {'name': 'Matorrales resguardados', 'text': '({T}: Agrega {R} o {G}.)\\nLos Matorrales resguardados entran al campo de batalla girados.\\nCiclo {2}. ({2}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)', 'type': 'Tierra — Montaña bosque', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659295&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7bc3306a-80cc-4743-8104-b5b3ba40a0ee', 'multiverseId': 659295}, 'multiverseid': 659295}, {'name': 'Halliers protégés', 'text': '({T} : Ajoutez {R} ou {G}.)\\nLes Halliers protégés arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagés.\\nRecyclage {2} ({2}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)', 'type': 'Terrain — montagne et forêt', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659561&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '443d21c7-4c01-4cbd-87c1-0e01b8382b58', 'multiverseId': 659561}, 'multiverseid': 659561}, {'name': '隠れた茂み', 'text': '（{T}：{R}か{G}を加える。）\\n隠れた茂みはタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nサイクリング{2}（{2}, このカードを捨てる：カード１枚を引く。）', 'type': '土地 — 山・森', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659827&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f5445c5f-6508-467a-bb3f-5a126302fa53', 'multiverseId': 659827}, 'multiverseid': 659827}, {'name': '岩壁灌丛', 'text': '（{T}：加{R}或{G}。）\\n岩壁灌丛须横置进战场。\\n循环{2}（{2}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）', 'type': '地 — 山脉／树林', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660093&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '56595ccb-7960-42fa-a430-78b7f49a9573', 'multiverseId': 660093}, 'multiverseid': 660093}]", '[{\'name\': \'Gestohlene Waren\', \'text\': \'Ein Gegner deiner Wahl schickt Karten oben von seiner Bibliothek ins Exil, bis er eine Nichtland-Karte ins Exil schickt. Bis zum Ende des Zuges kannst du jene Karte wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658825&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9fa14ed-4bf4-4b17-bb00-522d614fece2\', \'multiverseId\': 658825}, \'multiverseid\': 658825}, {\'name\': \'Bienes robados\', \'text\': \'El oponente objetivo exilia cartas de la parte superior de su biblioteca hasta que exilie una carta que no sea tierra. Hasta el final del turno, puedes lanzar esa carta sin pagar su coste de maná.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659091&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ff50bca-70b4-4f7c-898a-0280eb0b35e0\', \'multiverseId\': 659091}, \'multiverseid\': 659091}, {\'name\': \'Marchandises volées\', \'text\': "Un adversaire ciblé exile les cartes du dessus de sa bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce qu\'il exile une carte non-terrain. Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, vous pouvez lancer cette carte sans payer son coût de mana.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659357&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf50e5c2-064f-4be0-a781-a5b593b0041c\', \'multiverseId\': 659357}, \'multiverseid\': 659357}, {\'name\': \'盗品\', \'text\': \'対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは、土地でないカード１枚が追放されるまで、自分のライブラリーの一番上から１枚ずつ追放していく。ターン終了時まで、あなたはそのカードをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659623&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ac61b6b-b185-4236-855f-cb12573e86db\', \'multiverseId\': 659623}, \'multiverseid\': 659623}, {\'name\': \'赃物\', \'text\': \'目标对手从其牌库顶开始放逐牌，直到放逐一张非地牌为止。直到回合结束，你可以施放该牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659889&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8269fc4a-22e2-4c4e-a3e3-4d53dbe47c2b\', \'multiverseId\': 659889}, \'multiverseid\': 659889}]', "[{'name': 'Gewundener Weg', 'text': 'Bestimme Kreatur oder Land. Decke die obersten vier Karten deiner Bibliothek auf. Nimm davon alle Karten des bestimmten Typs auf deine Hand und lege den Rest auf deinen Friedhof.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': 'Jeder Pfad führt zu einer Entdeckung.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658923&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0d705dfc-7fa8-4a59-9e48-ad81763c7951', 'multiverseId': 658923}, 'multiverseid': 658923}, {'name': 'Camino serpenteante', 'text': 'Elige criatura o tierra. Muestra las cuatro primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Pon todas las cartas mostradas de esta manera del tipo elegido en tu mano y el resto en tu cementerio.', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': 'Todos los caminos llevan a un descubrimiento.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659189&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1996c9e8-70c7-4988-b1fd-f49cac7aa300', 'multiverseId': 659189}, 'multiverseid': 659189}, {'name': 'Voie sinueuse', 'text': 'Choisissez créature ou terrain. Révélez les quatre cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez toutes les cartes du type choisi révélées de cette manière dans votre main et le reste dans votre cimetière.', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': 'Chaque sentier mène à une découverte.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659455&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7eec627b-b286-4d74-a158-cea0e6b1f701', 'multiverseId': 659455}, 'multiverseid': 659455}, {'name': '紆余曲折', 'text': '「クリーチャー」か「土地」を選ぶ。あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード４枚を公開する。これにより公開されて選ばれたタイプであるすべてのカードをあなたの手札に、残りをあなたの墓地に置く。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': 'どの道も発見へと繋がっている。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659721&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1ef82136-43d0-4b05-8efb-6efea0f2a0cb', 'multiverseId': 659721}, 'multiverseid': 659721}, {'name': '蜿蜒长路', 'text': '选择生物或地。展示你牌库顶的四张牌。将所有以此法展示且为该类别的牌置于你手上，其余则置入你的坟墓场。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '条条道路通发现。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659987&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '452081ce-94ba-4b07-bcb0-cab3ed6b0df1', 'multiverseId': 659987}, 'multiverseid': 659987}]", '[{\'name\': \'Glitzernde Schatzhalde\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {R}. Lege eine Versteckmarke auf die Glitzernde Schatzhalde.\\n{T}, opfere die Glitzernde Schatzhalde: Erzeuge X Mana genau einer beliebigen Farbe, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Versteckmarken auf der Glitzernden Schatzhalde ist.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Schatz\', \'flavor\': \'Ziatoras einziger Wunsch ist „mehr".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658877&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c70382c7-f315-4976-9885-b3999e16d6fd\', \'multiverseId\': 658877}, \'multiverseid\': 658877}, {\'name\': \'Reservas brillantes\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {R}. Pon un contador de alijo sobre las Reservas brillantes.\\n{T}, sacrificar las Reservas brillantes: Agrega X manás de un color cualquiera, donde X es la cantidad de contadores de alijo sobre las Reservas brillantes.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Tesoro\', \'flavor\': \'Ziatora solo desea "más".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659143&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4d80004-7ae4-4ce1-bd32-5a9db391bb3e\', \'multiverseId\': 659143}, \'multiverseid\': 659143}, {\'name\': \'Réserve scintillante\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {R}. Mettez un marqueur « stock » sur la Réserve scintillante.\\n{T}, sacrifiez la Réserve scintillante : Ajoutez X manas d\'une seule couleur de votre choix, X étant le nombre de marqueurs « stock » sur la Réserve scintillante.", \'type\': \'Artefact — trésor\', \'flavor\': "La seule chose que Ziatora désire, c\'est « encore plus ».", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659409&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75f89b6a-b5fa-46b2-8de4-a45a2787779d\', \'multiverseId\': 659409}, \'multiverseid\': 659409}, {\'name\': \'輝く備蓄品\', \'text\': \'{T}：{R}を加える。輝く備蓄品の上に隠匿カウンター１個を置く。\\n{T}, 輝く備蓄品を生け贄に捧げる：好きな色１色のマナＸ点を加える。Ｘは輝く備蓄品の上にある隠匿カウンターの個数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 宝物\', \'flavor\': \'ジアトラが求めるのはただひとつ。「もっと」である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659675&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a16d8adf-1280-4d27-92b8-20093629e015\', \'multiverseId\': 659675}, \'multiverseid\': 659675}, {\'name\': \'金光宝堆\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{R}。在金光宝堆上放置一个匿物指示物。\\n{T}，牺牲金光宝堆：加X点任意颜色的单色法术力，X为金光宝堆上的匿物指示物数量。\', \'type\': \'神器 — 珍宝\', \'flavor\': \'齐朵拉想要的只有「更多」。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659941&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1caf272-afb0-47ce-b5cf-6502309f1a2c\', \'multiverseId\': 659941}, \'multiverseid\': 659941}]', '[{\'name\': \'Glücksfall\', \'text\': \'Jeder Spieler wirft seine Hand ab und zieht dann so viele Karten, wie der Spieler, der auf diese Weise die meisten Karten abgeworfen hat, abgeworfen hat.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Reich" ist ein relativer Begriff.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658833&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fa522b0-451d-4359-b08a-c07bb123684b\', \'multiverseId\': 658833}, \'multiverseid\': 658833}, {\'name\': \'Ganga\', \'text\': \'Cada jugador descarta su mano y luego roba una cantidad de cartas igual a la mayor cantidad de cartas que un jugador descartó de esta manera.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Riqueza" es un término relativo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659099&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b44eb183-f8c4-4b9e-b500-d7d0a6fd4279\', \'multiverseId\': 659099}, \'multiverseid\': 659099}, {\'name\': \'Aubaine\', \'text\': "Chaque joueur se défausse de sa main, puis il pioche un nombre de cartes égal au plus grand nombre de cartes dont un joueur s\'est défaussé de cette manière.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'La « richesse » est toute relative.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659365&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16d36e5f-cb15-4b85-8abd-9ec49e5ae322\', \'multiverseId\': 659365}, \'multiverseid\': 659365}, {\'name\': \'意外な授かり物\', \'text\': \'各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、自分の手札を捨て、その後、これによりプレイヤー１人が捨てたカードの枚数の中の最大値に等しい枚数のカードを引く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「富」とは相対的な言葉だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659631&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7cccdc99-daf1-4bff-a065-eea93d461948\', \'multiverseId\': 659631}, \'multiverseid\': 659631}, {\'name\': \'横财\', \'text\': \'每位牌手弃掉手牌，然后各抓若干牌，其数量等同于牌手中以此法弃牌的最多数量。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「富有」只是相对的。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659897&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2047866a-74c7-4c27-9643-30fb2557f577\', \'multiverseId\': 659897}, \'multiverseid\': 659897}]', '[{\'name\': \'Goblin-Elektromagier\', \'text\': \'Spontanzauber und Hexereien, die du wirkst, kosten beim Wirken {1} weniger.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'Auf die Frage, wie viel Macht erforderlich ist, antworten Izzet-Magier immer nur „mehr".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658938&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cfba38f-a635-4eb5-bc8c-cc3883abebf7\', \'multiverseId\': 658938}, \'multiverseid\': 658938}, {\'name\': \'Electromante trasgo\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {1} menos lanzar hechizos de instantáneo o de conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando se les pregunta cuánto poder hace falta, los magos ízzet siempre responden "más".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659204&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'537a72fb-85e4-4cb5-81ed-fb8412108f45\', \'multiverseId\': 659204}, \'multiverseid\': 659204}, {\'name\': \'Électromancien gobelin\', \'text\': "Les sorts d\'éphémère et de rituel que vous lancez coûtent {1} de moins à lancer.", \'type\': \'Créature — gobelin et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "Quand on leur demande quelle quantité d\'énergie il faut, les mages d\'Izzet répondent toujours « davantage ».", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659470&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ebbcdbfa-d90d-468f-b02d-58daf8953a9c\', \'multiverseId\': 659470}, \'multiverseid\': 659470}, {\'name\': \'ゴブリンの電術師\', \'text\': \'あなたがインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるためのコストは{1}少なくなる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'どれだけのパワーが必要かと訊かれれば、必ず「もっとだ」と答えるのがイゼットの魔道士である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659736&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f20f261b-9122-4b89-9af4-6c69ee814fc8\', \'multiverseId\': 659736}, \'multiverseid\': 659736}, {\'name\': \'鬼怪电流术士\', \'text\': \'你施放的瞬间与法术咒语减少{1}来施放。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 鬼怪／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'当被问到需要多强的力量时，伊捷的法师只会回答「更多」。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660002&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8b61980-0f6b-4645-9945-ca957a1e458c\', \'multiverseId\': 660002}, \'multiverseid\': 660002}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gonti, Fürst der Opulenz\', \'text\': \'Todesberührung\\nWenn Gonti, Fürst der Opulenz, ins Spiel kommt, schaue dir die obersten vier Karten der Bibliothek eines Gegners deiner Wahl an, schicke eine davon verdeckt ins Exil und lege dann den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter seine Bibliothek. Du kannst die Karte wirken, solange sie im Exil bleibt, und Mana beliebigen Typs kann ausgegeben werden, um jenen Zauberspruch zu wirken.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Äthergeborener, Räuber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658845&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1bdedfc2-edbb-44d8-871d-aca8f153e019\', \'multiverseId\': 658845}, \'multiverseid\': 658845}, {\'name\': \'Gonti, señor de la opulencia\', \'text\': \'Toque mortal.\\nCuando Gonti, señor de la opulencia entre al campo de batalla, mira las cuatro primeras cartas de la biblioteca del oponente objetivo, exilia una de ellas boca abajo y luego pon el resto en el fondo de esa biblioteca en un orden aleatorio. Puedes lanzar esa carta mientras permanezca exiliada y puedes usar maná de cualquier tipo para lanzar ese hechizo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Bribón etergénito\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659111&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5f67656-2d5c-4c31-9353-a293ccd023ae\', \'multiverseId\': 659111}, \'multiverseid\': 659111}, {\'name\': "Gonti, seigneur de l\'opulence", \'text\': "Contact mortel\\nQuand Gonti, seigneur de l\'opulence arrive sur le champ de bataille, regardez les quatre cartes du dessus de la bibliothèque d\'un adversaire ciblé, exilez l\'une d\'elles face cachée, puis mettez le reste au-dessous de cette bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire. Vous pouvez lancer cette carte tant qu\'elle reste exilée, et du mana de n\'importe quel type peut être dépensé pour lancer ce sort.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — éthérien et gredin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659377&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c2c34f1-8d3b-4534-b172-6c6d45aa727f\', \'multiverseId\': 659377}, \'multiverseid\': 659377}, {\'name\': \'豪華の王、ゴンティ\', \'text\': \'接死\\n豪華の王、ゴンティが戦場に出たとき、対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード４枚を見、そのうち１枚を裏向きで追放する。その後、残りをそのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。そのカードが追放され続けているかぎり、それを唱えてもよく、その呪文を唱えるために任意のタイプのマナを支払ってもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 霊基体・ならず者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659643&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d604f3a2-b40f-4ebe-a13f-186e4d5c424b\', \'multiverseId\': 659643}, \'multiverseid\': 659643}, {\'name\': \'奢华领主贡提\', \'text\': \'死触\\n当奢华领主贡提进战场时，检视目标对手牌库顶的四张牌，将其中一张牌面朝下地放逐，然后将其余的牌以随机顺序置于该牌库底。于该牌持续放逐的时段内，你可以施放该牌，且能用任意种类的法术力来施放该咒语。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 乙太种／浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659909&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1f1e6a1-69f4-46b8-85c6-c97a81e30e14\', \'multiverseId\': 659909}, \'multiverseid\': 659909}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gonti, gerissener Beschaffer\', \'text\': \'Zaubersprüche, die du wirkst, aber nicht besitzt, kosten beim Wirken {1} weniger.\\nImmer wenn eine oder mehrere Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügen, schaue dir die oberste Karte der Bibliothek jenes Spielers an und schicke sie dann verdeckt ins Exil. Du kannst die Karte spielen, solange sie im Exil bleibt, und Mana beliebigen Typs kann ausgegeben werden, um jenen Zauberspruch zu wirken.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Äthergeborener, Räuber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658285&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0965b03e-88af-4cb8-9d0b-b6fb44fe06b2\', \'multiverseId\': 658285}, \'multiverseid\': 658285}, {\'name\': \'Gonti, adquisidor astuto\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {1} menos lanzar los hechizos de los cuales no eres propietario.\\nSiempre que una o más criaturas que controlas hagan daño de combate a un jugador, mira la primera carta de la biblioteca de ese jugador y luego exíliala boca abajo. Puedes jugar esa carta mientras permanezca exiliada y puedes usar maná de cualquier tipo para lanzar ese hechizo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Bribón etergénito\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658289&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d2d2568-17d8-42dd-a6b4-1b7a49bf7902\', \'multiverseId\': 658289}, \'multiverseid\': 658289}, {\'name\': \'Gonti, acquéreur astucieux\', \'text\': "Les sorts que vous lancez mais que vous ne possédez pas coûtent {1} de moins à lancer.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'au moins une créature que vous contrôlez inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, regardez la carte du dessus de la bibliothèque de ce joueur, puis exilez-la face cachée. Vous pouvez jouer cette carte tant qu\'elle reste exilée, et du mana de n\'importe quel type peut être dépensé pour lancer ce sort.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — éthérien et gredin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658293&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'817ebac3-134e-42d1-8382-06b02c93184f\', \'multiverseId\': 658293}, \'multiverseid\': 658293}, {\'name\': \'抜け目ない取得者、ゴンティ\', \'text\': \'あなたがあなたがオーナーでない呪文を唱えるためのコストは{1}少なくなる。\\nあなたがコントロールしている１体以上のクリーチャーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、そのプレイヤーのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を見て、裏向きで追放する。そのカードが追放され続けているかぎり、あなたはそれをプレイしてもよく、その呪文を唱えるために任意のタイプのマナを支払ってもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 霊基体・ならず者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658297&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5bfb31c7-f36c-4b85-ab98-40d63001abf9\', \'multiverseId\': 658297}, \'multiverseid\': 658297}, {\'name\': \'精明占徒贡提\', \'text\': \'你施放之不由你拥有的咒语减少{1}来施放。\\n每当由你操控的一个或数个生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，检视该牌手的牌库顶牌，然后牌面朝下地放逐它。于该牌持续放逐的时段内，你可以使用该牌，且能用任意种类的法术力来施放该咒语。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 乙太种／浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658301&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9af3cb52-5152-4022-822a-ccee9b9e34d7\', \'multiverseId\': 658301}, \'multiverseid\': 658301}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gossenschütze\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkst, fügt der Gossenschütze jedem Gegner 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'„Feuer! Feuer! Feuer! Welche Freude! Welche Glut! Alles soll brennen!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658879&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8505a1c9-b8cd-4196-a518-7e2fc4db0cd8\', \'multiverseId\': 658879}, \'multiverseid\': 658879}, {\'name\': \'Disparacuneta\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro, el Disparacuneta hace 2 puntos de daño a cada oponente.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Fuego! ¡Fuego! ¡Fuego! ¡Qué alegría! ¡Menudo fuego! ¡Que arda todo!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659145&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72c65fe2-e6ac-46c8-ae2e-a8ce9d3f37d8\', \'multiverseId\': 659145}, \'multiverseid\': 659145}, {\'name\': \'Gobelin des rues\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel, le Gobelin des rues inflige 2 blessures à chaque adversaire.", \'type\': \'Créature — gobelin et shamane\', \'flavor\': \'« Le feu ! Le feu ! Le feu ! Quelle joie ! Quel beau feu ! Brûle tout ! »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659411&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c59ae0eb-2e90-4366-b0b6-63a4f7003938\', \'multiverseId\': 659411}, \'multiverseid\': 659411}, {\'name\': \'どぶ潜み\', \'text\': \'あなたがインスタントやソーサリーである呪文１つを唱えるたび、どぶ潜みは各対戦相手にそれぞれ２点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'「火だ！火だ！火だ！素晴らしい！なんて素晴らしい炎だ！全部燃やし尽くしてしまえ！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659677&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c94ed6d0-5365-467a-b4e7-52e91e5d7747\', \'multiverseId\': 659677}, \'multiverseid\': 659677}, {\'name\': \'贫窟伏击客\', \'text\': \'每当你施放瞬间或法术咒语时，贫窟伏击客向每位对手各造成2点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 鬼怪／祭师\', \'flavor\': \'「大火！大火！大火！好开心！好大火！给我全烧掉！」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659943&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3bbb1b61-2c06-4983-a681-aa772cc37cc0\', \'multiverseId\': 659943}, \'multiverseid\': 659943}]', '[{\'name\': \'Graywaters Problemlöser\', \'text\': \'Jede gesetzlose Kreaturenkarte in deinem Friedhof hat Zugabe {X}, wobei X gleich ihrem Manabetrag ist. (Schicke die Karte ins Exil und bezahle ihre Zugabe-Kosten: Erzeuge für jeden Gegner eine Spielstein-Kopie, die ihn in diesem Zug angreift, falls möglich. Die Spielsteine erhalten Eile. Opfere sie zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments. Aktiviere Zugabe wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eidechse, Söldner\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658388&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'62667637-58b7-4a08-a6b8-37fae86d3e3f\', \'multiverseId\': 658388}, \'multiverseid\': 658388}, {\'name\': \'Amañador de Graywater\', \'text\': \'Cada carta de criatura forajida en tu cementerio tiene la habilidad de replicar {X}, donde X es su valor de maná. (Exiliarla y pagar su coste de replicar: Por cada oponente, crea una ficha que es una copia y que ataca a ese oponente este turno, si puede. Ganan la habilidad de prisa. Sacrifícalas al comienzo del próximo paso final. Activa esto solo como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Mercenario lagarto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658420&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'326988ce-6928-474e-b220-5efc51292335\', \'multiverseId\': 658420}, \'multiverseid\': 658420}, {\'name\': "Médiateur d\'Eaugrise", \'text\': "Chaque carte de créature Hors-la-loi dans votre cimetière a encore {X}, X étant sa valeur de mana. (Exilez-la et payez son coût d\'encore : Pour chaque adversaire, créez une copie jeton qui attaque cet adversaire ce tour-ci si possible. Elle acquiert la célérité. Sacrifiez-la au début de la prochaine étape de fin. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Créature — lézard et mercenaire\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658452&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09852e99-1974-4e17-af74-8169c14570d5\', \'multiverseId\': 658452}, \'multiverseid\': 658452}, {\'name\': \'グレイウォーターの仲介者\', \'text\': \'あなたの墓地にあり無法者である各クリーチャー・カードはそれぞれ再演{X}を持つ。Ｘはそれのマナ総量に等しい。（それを追放し、それの再演コストを支払う：各対戦相手につきそれぞれ、そのカードのコピーであり、このターン可能ならそのプレイヤーを攻撃するトークン１つを生成する。それらは速攻を得る。次の終了ステップの開始時に、それらを生け贄に捧げる。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — トカゲ・傭兵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658484&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2606f98b-ebb1-4ff9-9ad5-7603c14172bf\', \'multiverseId\': 658484}, \'multiverseid\': 658484}, {\'name\': \'灰水的息事客\', \'text\': \'你坟墓场中的每张狂徒生物牌均具有返场{X}，X为其法术力值。（放逐它并支付其返场费用：为每位对手各进行以下流程～派出一个衍生复制品，且其本回合若能攻击该对手，便须如此作。它们获得敏捷异能。在下一个结束步骤开始时，将它们牺牲。只能于法术时机起动。）\', \'type\': \'生物 — 蜥蜴／佣兵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658516&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1af4e47-5a5a-48d7-ae67-ac829d245834\', \'multiverseId\': 658516}, \'multiverseid\': 658516}]', '[{\'name\': \'Graywaters Problemlöser\', \'text\': \'Jede gesetzlose Kreaturenkarte in deinem Friedhof hat Zugabe {X}, wobei X gleich ihrem Manabetrag ist.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eidechse, Söldner\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660196&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0402e54b-b6e7-46de-8e35-19b6a89c09c0\', \'multiverseId\': 660196}, \'multiverseid\': 660196}, {\'name\': "Médiateur d\'Eaugrise", \'text\': \'Chaque carte de créature Hors-la-loi dans votre cimetière a encore {X}, X étant sa valeur de mana.\', \'type\': \'Créature — lézard et mercenaire\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660228&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc482e50-d1d0-4c75-9580-d2de4dff5284\', \'multiverseId\': 660228}, \'multiverseid\': 660228}, {\'name\': \'グレイウォーターの仲介者\', \'text\': \'あなたの墓地にあり無法者である各クリーチャー・カードはそれぞれ再演{X}を持つ。Ｘはそれのマナ総量に等しい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — トカゲ・傭兵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660260&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40882176-07f8-446f-8621-76423fd01734\', \'multiverseId\': 660260}, \'multiverseid\': 660260}, {\'name\': \'灰水的息事客\', \'text\': \'你坟墓场中的每张狂徒生物牌均具有返场{X}，X为其法术力值。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 蜥蜴／佣兵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660292&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af6e7f93-8c65-4663-a145-e8e68cbcb17d\', \'multiverseId\': 660292}, \'multiverseid\': 660292}]', '[{\'name\': \'Grenzo der Verheerer\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, bestimme eines —\\n• Stachle eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die jener Spieler kontrolliert.\\n• Schicke die oberste Karte der Bibliothek jenes Spielers ins Exil. Bis zum Ende des Zuges kannst du die Karte wirken, und um sie zu wirken kannst du Mana ausgeben, als wäre es Mana beliebiger Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Goblin, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'„Legt ihr das Feuer. Ich übernehme das Plündern."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658878&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d6cc453-f1f8-4a58-91ba-3b27b62d59f2\', \'multiverseId\': 658878}, \'multiverseid\': 658878}, {\'name\': \'Grenzo, creador de estragos\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura que controlas haga daño de combate a un jugador, elige uno:\\n• Incita a la criatura objetivo que controla ese jugador.\\n• Exilia la primera carta de la biblioteca de ese jugador. Hasta el final del turno, puedes lanzar esa carta y puedes usar maná como si fuera maná de cualquier color para lanzarla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Bribón trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'"Tú quemas y yo saqueo".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659144&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd462cf4-d668-4d14-aeae-5648cdc42d37\', \'multiverseId\': 659144}, \'multiverseid\': 659144}, {\'name\': \'Grenzo, fauteur de ravages\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, choisissez l\'un —\\n• Incitez une créature ciblée que ce joueur contrôle.\\n• Exilez la carte du dessus de la bibliothèque de ce joueur. Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, vous pouvez lancer cette carte et vous pouvez dépenser du mana comme s\'il s\'agissait de mana de n\'importe quelle couleur pour lancer ce sort.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — gobelin et gredin\', \'flavor\': \'« Toi tu brûles. Et moi je pille. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659410&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7cc5597-ad72-4057-99fc-58639dad0355\', \'multiverseId\': 659410}, \'multiverseid\': 659410}, {\'name\': \'騒乱の発端、グレンゾ\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n・そのプレイヤーがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを使嗾する。\\n・そのプレイヤーのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を追放する。ターン終了時まで、あなたはそのカードを唱えてもよく、その呪文を唱えるためにマナを任意の色のマナであるかのように支払ってもよい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ゴブリン・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'「お前らは火をつけろ。わしはお宝を頂戴してくる。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659676&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88e4973f-1819-4dbc-bf82-253986139766\', \'multiverseId\': 659676}, \'multiverseid\': 659676}, {\'name\': \'滋事头格伦佐\', \'text\': \'每当一个由你操控的生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，选择一项～\\n•煽惑目标由该牌手操控的生物。\\n•放逐该牌手的牌库顶牌。直到回合结束，你可以施放该牌，且你可以将法术力视同任意颜色的法术力来施放该咒语。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 鬼怪／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'「你来烧。我来抢。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659942&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c8d4c2c-b363-4ee1-a5e2-300143768d21\', \'multiverseId\': 659942}, \'multiverseid\': 659942}]', '[{\'name\': \'Grollkraut\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken für jede Länderkarte in deinem Friedhof {1} weniger.\\nWachsamkeit, Reichweite, verursacht Trampelschaden\\nWenn das Grollkraut ins Spiel kommt, erhalten andere Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, +3/+3 und verursachen Trampelschaden bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Pflanze, Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': \'Eine Ein-Planze-Armee.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658384&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'479082d0-acb4-4eec-8865-fbc07b940cd0\', \'multiverseId\': 658384}, \'multiverseid\': 658384}, {\'name\': \'Retumbarrilla\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {1} menos lanzar este hechizo por cada carta de tierra en tu cementerio.\\nVigilancia, alcance, arrolla.\\nCuando la Retumbarrilla entre al campo de batalla, las otras criaturas que controlas obtienen +3/+3 y ganan la habilidad de arrollar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental planta\', \'flavor\': \'Es todo un ecosistema en guerra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658416&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'501f83ed-3ef9-4883-aa59-21c8f8206470\', \'multiverseId\': 658416}, \'multiverseid\': 658416}, {\'name\': \'Amarante rugissante\', \'text\': "Ce sort coûte {1} de moins à lancer pour chaque carte de terrain dans votre cimetière.\\nVigilance, portée, piétinement\\nQuand l\'Amarante rugissante arrive sur le champ de bataille, les autres créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +3/+3 et acquièrent le piétinement jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature — plante et élémental\', \'flavor\': "C\'est un écosystème armé.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658448&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ccbc277-3c52-425e-a3d3-bb55bbc7d8fd\', \'multiverseId\': 658448}, \'multiverseid\': 658448}, {\'name\': \'ランブルウィード\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるためのコストは、あなたの墓地にある土地・カード１枚につき{1}少なくなる。\\n警戒、到達、トランプル\\nランブルウィードが戦場に出たとき、ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべてのクリーチャーは＋３/＋３の修整を受けトランプルを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 植物・エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': \'まるごとひとつの生態系である軍隊だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658480&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'573d0370-13fa-471f-86b4-c0252f489187\', \'multiverseId\': 658480}, \'multiverseid\': 658480}, {\'name\': \'隆滚草\', \'text\': \'你坟墓场中每有一张地牌，此咒语便减少{1}来施放。\\n警戒，延势，践踏\\n当隆滚草进战场时，直到回合结束，由你操控的其他生物得+3/+3且获得践踏异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 植物／元素\', \'flavor\': \'名副其实的全生态大军。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658512&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ca43654-83b3-4aa5-88e7-b3c42df99011\', \'multiverseId\': 658512}, \'multiverseid\': 658512}]', '[{\'name\': \'Grollkraut\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken für jede Länderkarte in deinem Friedhof {1} weniger.\\nWachsamkeit, Reichweite, verursacht Trampelschaden\\nWenn das Grollkraut ins Spiel kommt, erhalten andere Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, +3/+3 und verursachen Trampelschaden bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Pflanze, Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': \'Eine Ein-Planze-Armee.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660192&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b03a8eb6-76be-4fc5-8c7f-e5b4dc4b4260\', \'multiverseId\': 660192}, \'multiverseid\': 660192}, {\'name\': \'Amarante rugissante\', \'text\': "Ce sort coûte {1} de moins à lancer pour chaque carte de terrain dans votre cimetière.\\nVigilance, portée, piétinement\\nQuand l\'Amarante rugissante arrive sur le champ de bataille, les autres créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +3/+3 et acquièrent le piétinement jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature — plante et élémental\', \'flavor\': "C\'est un écosystème armé.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660224&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8b24ec8-577f-48a1-bb97-7d737b122fc0\', \'multiverseId\': 660224}, \'multiverseid\': 660224}, {\'name\': \'ランブルウィード\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるためのコストは、あなたの墓地にある土地・カード１枚につき{1}少なくなる。\\n警戒、到達、トランプル\\nランブルウィードが戦場に出たとき、ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないすべてのクリーチャーは＋３/＋３の修整を受けトランプルを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 植物・エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': \'まるごとひとつの生態系である軍隊だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660256&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98f5a59b-9587-4bea-91d1-062ebeb5edfe\', \'multiverseId\': 660256}, \'multiverseid\': 660256}, {\'name\': \'隆滚草\', \'text\': \'你坟墓场中每有一张地牌，此咒语便减少{1}来施放。\\n警戒，延势，践踏\\n当隆滚草进战场时，直到回合结束，由你操控的其他生物得+3/+3且获得践踏异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 植物／元素\', \'flavor\': \'名副其实的全生态大军。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660288&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56119779-df7a-4483-aa49-bfde99459f01\', \'multiverseId\': 660288}, \'multiverseid\': 660288}]', '[{\'name\': \'Großer Coup\', \'text\': \'Wirf als zusätzliche Kosten, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken, eine Karte ab.\\nZiehe zwei Karten und erzeuge zwei Schatz-Spielsteine. (Sie sind Artefakte mit „{T}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.")\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Unvorstellbare Reichtümer? Ich kann dir versichern, ich habe eine lebhafte Vorstellungskraft."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658865&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3dbbfdb3-cae1-472d-b76b-d8bc0c76bc6e\', \'multiverseId\': 658865}, \'multiverseid\': 658865}, {\'name\': \'Hacerse de oro\', \'text\': \'Como coste adicional para lanzar este hechizo, descarta una carta.\\nRoba dos cartas y crea dos fichas de Tesoro. (Son artefactos con "{T}, sacrificar este artefacto: Agrega un maná de cualquier color".)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Riquezas inimaginables? Te aseguro que tengo una imaginación desbordante".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659131&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'671c906a-925b-4a83-b497-0729fc8eedb5\', \'multiverseId\': 659131}, \'multiverseid\': 659131}, {\'name\': \'Le pactole\', \'text\': "En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer ce sort, défaussez-vous d\'une carte.\\nPiochez deux cartes et créez deux jetons Trésor. (Ce sont des artefacts avec « {T}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix. »)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Des richesses inimaginables ? Je peux vous assurer que j\'ai une imagination débordante. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659397&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12a8bf1f-cfe4-4fc1-91b4-aa92bf74bc9b\', \'multiverseId\': 659397}, \'multiverseid\': 659397}, {\'name\': \'大勝ち\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるための追加コストとして、カード１枚を捨てる。\\nカード２枚を引き、宝物・トークン２つを生成する。（それらは、「{T}, このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「想像を絶する富？大丈夫、鮮明に想像できるわ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659663&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aff57633-8898-4b56-8c89-b4acdbec9b4b\', \'multiverseId\': 659663}, \'multiverseid\': 659663}, {\'name\': \'大干一票\', \'text\': \'弃一张牌，以作为施放此咒语的额外费用。\\n抓两张牌并派出两个珍宝衍生物。（它们是具有「{T}，牺牲此神器：加一点任意颜色的法术力」的神器。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「有钱到难以想象？我向你保证，我有丰富的想象力。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659929&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf2388d3-313a-47c5-be5a-4628e4e7bab8\', \'multiverseId\': 659929}, \'multiverseid\': 659929}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gruft des Erzengels\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{2}{W}{B}, {T}: Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten Todesberührung und Lebensverknüpfung bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Über Jahrhunderte hinweg hielt meine Kreation diese Welt im Gleichgewicht. Doch jetzt ist nur noch ihr Schatten da."\\n—Sorin Markov\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659049&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba588fa8-ab90-462b-9872-f6e5d456d7e2\', \'multiverseId\': 659049}, \'multiverseid\': 659049}, {\'name\': \'Bóveda del arcángel\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{2}{W}{B}, {T}: Las criaturas que controlas ganan las habilidades de toque mortal y vínculo vital hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"Por siglos mi creación mantuvo este mundo en equilibrio. Ahora solo queda su sombra".\\n—Sorin Markov\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659315&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'caa6fed8-44a5-4b75-b7cc-e6e456a150b0\', \'multiverseId\': 659315}, \'multiverseid\': 659315}, {\'name\': "Caveau de l\'archange", \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{2}{W}{B}, {T} : Les créatures que vous contrôlez acquièrent le contact mortel et le lien de vie jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "« Pendant des siècles, ma création a maintenu l\'équilibre de ce monde. Désormais, seule son ombre subsiste. »\\n—Sorin Markov", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659581&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91327287-2505-487a-9d7d-b5926be76ef6\', \'multiverseId\': 659581}, \'multiverseid\': 659581}, {\'name\': \'大天使の霊堂\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{2}{W}{B}, {T}：ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは接死と絆魂を得る。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「何世紀もの間、我が造物はこの世界の均衡を保ってきた。今では彼女の影が残るのみだ。」\\n――ソリン・マルコフ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659847&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16f09bb6-1662-441e-8dc6-e88bc00ea172\', \'multiverseId\': 659847}, \'multiverseid\': 659847}, {\'name\': \'大天使地窖\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{2}{W}{B}，{T}：由你操控的生物获得死触与系命异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'「数百年来，我的造物让这世界保持平衡。现在只剩下她的阴影。」\\n～索霖马可夫\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660113&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c08f971-566e-444f-a45e-da35d51a2eba\', \'multiverseId\': 660113}, \'multiverseid\': 660113}]', '[{\'name\': \'Gründliches Überdenken\', \'text\': \'Ziehe eine Karte.\\nRückblende {2}{U} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Entweder weiß ich den Spruch schon, den ich brauche, oder ich weiß es gleich."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658829&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64ce6c61-0110-43f3-8f82-716772270669\', \'multiverseId\': 658829}, \'multiverseid\': 658829}, {\'name\': \'Pensar dos veces\', \'text\': \'Roba una carta.\\nRetrospectiva {2}{U}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"O bien conozco el hechizo que necesito, o estoy a punto de hacerlo".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659095&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5305e5ea-5e2a-4259-bd9c-9251d7d08b83\', \'multiverseId\': 659095}, \'multiverseid\': 659095}, {\'name\': \'Réfléchir à deux fois\', \'text\': \'Piochez une carte.\\nFlashback {2}{U} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Ou je sais déjà de quel sort j\'ai besoin, ou je vais le découvrir. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659361&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b5f49a4-2515-4887-943f-338d3e612e9b\', \'multiverseId\': 659361}, \'multiverseid\': 659361}, {\'name\': \'熟慮\', \'text\': \'カード１枚を引く。\\nフラッシュバック{2}{U}（あなたの墓地にあるこのカードをフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「私が必要な呪文は、知ってるか、間もなく知るかだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659627&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3babeab-82cb-425f-ad3d-1f88b5c67e67\', \'multiverseId\': 659627}, \'multiverseid\': 659627}, {\'name\': \'再次考虑\', \'text\': \'抓一张牌。\\n返照{2}{U}（你可以从你的坟墓场施放此牌，并支付其返照费用，然后将它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「我不是懂了正好需要的咒语，就是快要懂了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659893&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77fd65a5-db7d-49c1-8c04-ea8893c371d9\', \'multiverseId\': 659893}, \'multiverseid\': 659893}]', "[{'name': 'Grünlicher Morast', 'text': '{1}, {T}: Erzeuge {B}{G}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': 'Leben und Tod mischen sich, und diese beiden Enden desselben Zyklus lassen etwas Neues entstehen.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659050&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9f0d493a-7200-4c85-b57d-ba84656e8d2f', 'multiverseId': 659050}, 'multiverseid': 659050}, {'name': 'Ciénaga verdecente', 'text': '{1}, {T}: Agrega {B}{G}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': 'La vida y la muerte juntas, ambos extremos del mismo ciclo creando algo totalmente nuevo.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659316&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5fe33cc5-2548-4130-b5c9-ff18106a200a', 'multiverseId': 659316}, 'multiverseid': 659316}, {'name': 'Marécage irradié', 'text': '{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {B}{G}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': 'Communion entre la vie et la mort, les deux extrémités du même cycle donnent naissance à autre chose.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659582&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dd0fb20e-f7b4-4eff-9313-166ebd871148', 'multiverseId': 659582}, 'multiverseid': 659582}, {'name': '緑ばんだ沼', 'text': '{1}, {T}：{B}{G}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': '混ざり合う生と死。それは別の何かを生み出す、同じ円の両端なのである。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659848&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3b5a10b9-2c1f-4209-a0ec-4db97d718c9d', 'multiverseId': 659848}, 'multiverseid': 659848}, {'name': '碧绿腐沼', 'text': '{1}，{T}：加{B}{G}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': '生与死这属于同一循环的两端在此处接合一体，赋予他物崭新形态。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660114&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8ed86b95-2a40-4047-a220-cf55e6442ef4', 'multiverseId': 660114}, 'multiverseid': 660114}]", "[{'name': 'Haifun', 'text': 'Immer wenn du einen Nichtkreatur-Zauberspruch wirkst, erzeuge einen X/X blauen Hai-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit, wobei X gleich dem Manabetrag jenes Zauberspruchs ist.\\nUmwandlung {X}{1}{U} ({X}{1}{U}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)\\nWenn du den Haifun umwandelst, erzeuge einen X/X blauen Hai-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.', 'type': 'Verzauberung', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658823&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '399e2429-f71c-4f6f-bac1-a0cbd2a00798', 'multiverseId': 658823}, 'multiverseid': 658823}, {'name': 'Tifón de tiburones', 'text': 'Siempre que lances un hechizo que no sea criatura, crea una ficha de criatura Tiburón azul X/X con la habilidad de volar, donde X es el valor de maná de ese hechizo.\\nCiclo {X}{1}{U}. ({X}{1}{U}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)\\nCuando actives la habilidad de ciclo del Tifón de tiburones, crea una ficha de criatura Tiburón azul X/X con la habilidad de volar.', 'type': 'Encantamiento', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659089&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '58c43322-3964-4d55-b92f-e3952a44ed0a', 'multiverseId': 659089}, 'multiverseid': 659089}, {'name': 'Typhon de requins', 'text': 'À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort non-créature, créez un jeton de créature X/X bleue Requin avec le vol, X étant la valeur de mana de ce sort.\\nRecyclage {X}{1}{U} ({X}{1}{U}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)\\nQuand vous recyclez le Typhon de requins, créez un jeton de créature X/X bleue Requin avec le vol.', 'type': 'Enchantement', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659355&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f5f02679-7f31-41ab-9a9b-3856f94bbf57', 'multiverseId': 659355}, 'multiverseid': 659355}, {'name': 'サメ台風', 'text': 'あなたがクリーチャーでない呪文１つを唱えるたび、飛行を持つ青のＸ/Ｘのサメ・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。Ｘはその呪文のマナ総量に等しい。\\nサイクリング {X}{1}{U}（{X}{1}{U}, このカードを捨てる：カード１枚を引く。）\\nあなたがサメ台風をサイクリングしたとき、飛行を持つ青のＸ/Ｘのサメ・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。', 'type': 'エンチャント', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659621&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '23c059d8-6489-4026-9661-716d949ac854', 'multiverseId': 659621}, 'multiverseid': 659621}, {'name': '聚鲨台风', 'text': '每当你施放非生物咒语时，派出一个X/X蓝色，具飞行异能的鲨鱼衍生生物，X为该咒语的法术力值。\\n循环{X}{1}{U}（{X}{1}{U}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）\\n当你循环聚鲨台风时，派出一个X/X蓝色，具飞行异能的鲨鱼衍生生物。', 'type': '结界', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659887&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ffa24f95-a05c-4535-ae52-aa3d88e798cb', 'multiverseId': 659887}, 'multiverseid': 659887}]", '[{\'name\': \'Hashep-Oase\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}, bezahle 1 Lebenspunkt: Erzeuge {G}.\\n{1}{G}{G}, {T}, opfere eine Wüste: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +3/+3 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.\', \'type\': \'Land — Wüste\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659009&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6198400-1e66-45e5-bba1-837c6986a594\', \'multiverseId\': 659009}, \'multiverseid\': 659009}, {\'name\': \'Oasis de Hashep\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{T}, pagar 1 vida: Agrega {G}.\\n{1}{G}{G}, {T}, sacrificar un Desierto: La criatura objetivo obtiene +3/+3 hasta el final del turno. Activa esto solo como un conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Tierra — Desierto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659275&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a0fdab4-adb4-4293-87ad-892d66fbe908\', \'multiverseId\': 659275}, \'multiverseid\': 659275}, {\'name\': "Oasis d\'Hashep", \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T}, payez 1 point de vie : Ajoutez {G}.\\n{1}{G}{G}, {T}, sacrifiez un désert : Une créature ciblée gagne +3/+3 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Terrain — désert\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659541&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18d1706b-ff24-43b9-ab96-1627714bfcd2\', \'multiverseId\': 659541}, \'multiverseid\': 659541}, {\'name\': \'ハシェプのオアシス\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}, １点のライフを支払う：{G}を加える。\\n{1}{G}{G}, {T}, 砂漠１つを生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋３/＋３の修整を受ける。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。\', \'type\': \'土地 — 砂漠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659807&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f3e4f4d-23c8-49a2-b183-d7b7d75971f5\', \'multiverseId\': 659807}, \'multiverseid\': 659807}, {\'name\': \'哈什普绿洲\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{T}，支付1点生命：加{G}。\\n{1}{G}{G}，{T}，牺牲一个沙漠：目标生物得+3/+3直到回合结束。只能于法术时机起动。\', \'type\': \'地 — 沙漠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660073&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1a5bdb2-708a-4320-93b6-a436d551ddee\', \'multiverseId\': 660073}, \'multiverseid\': 660073}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hazezon der Sandformer\', \'text\': \'Wüstentarnung (Diese Kreatur kann nicht geblockt werden, solange der verteidigende Spieler eine Wüste kontrolliert.)\\nDu kannst Wüste-Länder aus deinem Friedhof spielen.\\nImmer wenn eine Wüste unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge zwei 1/1 rote, grüne und weiße Sand-Krieger-Kreaturenspielsteine.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Krieger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658939&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e6a3bc8-76ce-4256-a5c5-786a2be86309\', \'multiverseId\': 658939}, \'multiverseid\': 658939}, {\'name\': \'Hazezon, moldeador de arena\', \'text\': \'Cruza desiertos. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada mientras el jugador defensor controle un Desierto.)\\nPuedes jugar tierras Desierto desde tu cementerio.\\nSiempre que un Desierto entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, crea dos fichas de criatura Guerrero Arena rojas, verdes y blancas 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Guerrero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659205&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de310891-0ab3-4c67-b48c-547cdb529945\', \'multiverseId\': 659205}, \'multiverseid\': 659205}, {\'name\': \'Hazezon, modeleur de sable\', \'text\': "Traversée des déserts (Cette créature ne peut pas être bloquée tant que le joueur défenseur contrôle au moins un désert.)\\nVous pouvez jouer des terrains Désert depuis votre cimetière.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un désert arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, créez deux jetons de créature 1/1 rouge, verte et blanche Sable et Guerrier.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — humain et guerrier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659471&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'096bd93d-9570-4355-a25d-2557b5ef62af\', \'multiverseId\': 659471}, \'multiverseid\': 659471}, {\'name\': \'砂の造物師、ハゼゾン\', \'text\': \'砂漠渡り（防御プレイヤーが砂漠をコントロールしているかぎり、このクリーチャーはブロックされない。）\\nあなたの墓地から砂漠・土地をプレイしてもよい。\\n砂漠１つがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、赤緑白の１/１の砂漠の民・戦士・クリーチャー・トークン２体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659737&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'780ec636-6860-483b-885a-ab8d0d412e1b\', \'multiverseId\': 659737}, \'multiverseid\': 659737}, {\'name\': \'塑砂师哈泽忠\', \'text\': \'沙漠行者（只要防御牌手操控沙漠，此生物便不能被阻挡。）\\n你可以从你的坟墓场中使用沙漠地。\\n每当一个沙漠在你的操控下进战场时，派出两个1/1，红绿白三色的砂／战士衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 人类／战士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660003&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'142ceeb6-666f-455b-978d-40ee5ee65c5a\', \'multiverseId\': 660003}, \'multiverseid\': 660003}]', '[{\'name\': \'Heliods Eingreifen\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Zerstöre X Artefakte und/oder Verzauberungen deiner Wahl.\\n• Ein Spieler deiner Wahl erhält zweimal X Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich bringe eine Morgenröte, auf die keine Nacht folgen wird."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658791&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2174665e-4037-42f3-b692-ced3d8973af7\', \'multiverseId\': 658791}, \'multiverseid\': 658791}, {\'name\': \'Intervención de Heliod\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• Destruye X artefactos y/o encantamientos objetivo.\\n• El jugador objetivo gana el doble de X vidas.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Traigo un amanecer que ninguna noche podrá revocar".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659057&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbe531de-c457-4ba0-a040-316aeacaf71c\', \'multiverseId\': 659057}, \'multiverseid\': 659057}, {\'name\': "Intervention d\'Héliode", \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Détruisez X cibles, artefacts et/ou enchantements.\\n• Un joueur ciblé gagne deux fois X points de vie.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« J\'apporte une aube à laquelle nulle nuit ne pourra succéder. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659323&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c47f57f-144d-487f-937a-ae565b7ea5e7\', \'multiverseId\': 659323}, \'multiverseid\': 659323}, {\'name\': \'ヘリオッドの介入\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n・アーティファクトやエンチャントであるＸ個を対象とする。それらを破壊する。\\n・プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはＸの２倍の点数のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「私は夜明けをもたらそう。夜が続くことのない朝を。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659589&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'249c72e1-7105-413b-9ccd-8f81862e2322\', \'multiverseId\': 659589}, \'multiverseid\': 659589}, {\'name\': \'赫利欧德的干预\', \'text\': \'选择一项～\\n•消灭X个目标神器和／或结界。\\n•目标牌手获得两倍于X的生命。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「我降下破晓曙光，纵暗夜亦不能掩。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659855&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24bb5fc7-db3c-4974-b48b-ec78b87316da\', \'multiverseId\': 659855}, \'multiverseid\': 659855}]', '[{\'name\': \'Herzlose Zwangsverpflichtung\', \'text\': \'Schicke alle Kreaturen ins Exil. Du kannst jede auf diese Weise ins Exil geschickte Karte spielen, solange sie im Exil bleibt, und Mana beliebigen Typs kann ausgegeben werden, um jenen Zauberspruch zu wirken. Schicke die Herzlose Zwangsverpflichtung ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Geschichte erinnert sich an die Eroberer, nicht an die Knochen, auf denen sie stehen."\\n—Gonti\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658373&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0cdccc74-96e2-4806-8dc4-8b881ec87a19\', \'multiverseId\': 658373}, \'multiverseid\': 658373}, {\'name\': \'Reclutamiento descorazonado\', \'text\': \'Exilia todas las criaturas. Por cada carta exiliada de esta manera, puedes jugar esa carta mientras permanezca exiliada y puedes usar maná de cualquier tipo para lanzar ese hechizo. Exilia el Reclutamiento descorazonado.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"La historia recuerda a los conquistadores, no los huesos sobre los que se alzan".\\n—Gonti\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658405&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec4ac32b-72c8-4f37-91ed-ced68b4737b6\', \'multiverseId\': 658405}, \'multiverseid\': 658405}, {\'name\': \'Conscription cruelle\', \'text\': "Exilez toutes les créatures. Pour chaque carte exilée de cette manière, vous pouvez jouer cette carte tant qu\'elle reste exilée, et du mana de n\'importe quel type peut être dépensé pour lancer ce sort. Exilez la Conscription cruelle.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« L\'histoire retient les conquérants, pas les ossements qu\'ils piétinent. »\\n—Gonti", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658437&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1366eba8-f705-4d15-beb0-47330e45c999\', \'multiverseId\': 658437}, \'multiverseid\': 658437}, {\'name\': \'心なき徴兵\', \'text\': \'すべてのクリーチャーを追放する。これにより追放された各カードにつきそれぞれ、そのカードが追放され続けているかぎり、あなたはそれをプレイしてもよく、その呪文を唱えるために任意のタイプのマナを支払ってもよい。心なき徴兵を追放する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「歴史は征服者を記憶にとどめる。その犠牲となった骨ではなく。」\\n――ゴンティ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658469&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1d631a5-3081-488c-9b5f-14c76ba9b931\', \'multiverseId\': 658469}, \'multiverseid\': 658469}, {\'name\': \'无情征召\', \'text\': \'放逐所有生物。对每张以此法放逐的牌而言，于该牌持续放逐的时段内，你可以使用该牌，且能用任意种类的法术力来施放该咒语。放逐无情征召。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「历史只会铭记功成之人，而非积累脚下的万千枯骨。」\\n～贡提\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658501&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0735bd9e-2378-48b9-abe7-42237c7714b7\', \'multiverseId\': 658501}, \'multiverseid\': 658501}]', '[{\'name\': \'Herzlose Zwangsverpflichtung\', \'text\': \'Schicke alle Kreaturen ins Exil. Du kannst jede auf diese Weise ins Exil geschickte Karte spielen, solange sie im Exil bleibt, und Mana beliebigen Typs kann ausgegeben werden, um jenen Zauberspruch zu wirken. Schicke die Herzlose Zwangsverpflichtung ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Geschichte erinnert sich an die Eroberer, nicht an die Knochen, auf denen sie stehen."\\n—Gonti\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660181&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a17a16f-6503-45f0-b1b8-e09541983c13\', \'multiverseId\': 660181}, \'multiverseid\': 660181}, {\'name\': \'Conscription cruelle\', \'text\': "Exilez toutes les créatures. Pour chaque carte exilée de cette manière, vous pouvez jouer cette carte tant qu\'elle reste exilée, et du mana de n\'importe quel type peut être dépensé pour lancer ce sort. Exilez la Conscription cruelle.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« L\'histoire retient les conquérants, pas les ossements qu\'ils piétinent. »\\n—Gonti", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660213&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54964934-c522-45db-be1e-9e55ee1ab63c\', \'multiverseId\': 660213}, \'multiverseid\': 660213}, {\'name\': \'心なき徴兵\', \'text\': \'すべてのクリーチャーを追放する。これにより追放された各カードにつきそれぞれ、そのカードが追放され続けているかぎり、あなたはそれをプレイしてもよく、その呪文を唱えるために任意のタイプのマナを支払ってもよい。心なき徴兵を追放する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「歴史は征服者を記憶にとどめる。その犠牲となった骨ではなく。」\\n――ゴンティ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660245&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96b0f2bb-70c8-4d81-adbc-5ea8bc630f68\', \'multiverseId\': 660245}, \'multiverseid\': 660245}, {\'name\': \'无情征召\', \'text\': \'放逐所有生物。对每张以此法放逐的牌而言，于该牌持续放逐的时段内，你可以使用该牌，且能用任意种类的法术力来施放该咒语。放逐无情征召。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「历史只会铭记功成之人，而非积累脚下的万千枯骨。」\\n～贡提\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660277&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39db4017-b954-4ed4-90c8-89e13cd3d2c4\', \'multiverseId\': 660277}, \'multiverseid\': 660277}]', "[{'name': 'Himmel // Erde // Himmel // Erde', 'text': 'Himmel fügt jeder fliegenden Kreatur X Schadenspunkte zu.', 'type': 'Spontanzauber', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Himmel // Erde', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658940&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6f9c53df-e498-49aa-ba02-c8f9282889b8', 'multiverseId': 658940}, 'multiverseid': 658940}, {'name': 'Cielo // Tierra // Cielo // Tierra', 'text': 'Cielo hace X puntos de daño a cada criatura con la habilidad de volar.', 'type': 'Instantáneo', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Cielo // Tierra', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659206&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '65e45a27-6b2a-4da4-8e20-3cb4c9188e83', 'multiverseId': 659206}, 'multiverseid': 659206}, {'name': 'Ciel // Terre // Ciel // Terre', 'text': 'Le Ciel inflige X blessures à chaque créature avec le vol.', 'type': 'Éphémère', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': 'Ciel // Terre', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659472&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '119b8ce4-7b01-48ff-b66c-2ad5945c9820', 'multiverseId': 659472}, 'multiverseid': 659472}, {'name': '劈天 // 盖地 // 劈天 // 盖地', 'text': '劈天对每个具飞行异能的生物各造成X点伤害。', 'type': '瞬间', 'flavor': None, 'faceName': '劈天 // 盖地', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660004&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f6914920-4830-465f-ba2d-60fa55dcda89', 'multiverseId': 660004}, 'multiverseid': 660004}]", '[{\'name\': \'Hinterlandhafen\', \'text\': \'Der Hinterlandhafen kommt getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du kontrollierst einen Wald oder eine Insel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G} oder {U}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'An einem Ort, wo sich Meer und Bäume treffen, kann man leicht vergessen, dass im größten Teil von Innistrad die Dunkelheit herrscht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659010&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63710413-f3ce-49c4-ad9c-0a10d0a132ac\', \'multiverseId\': 659010}, \'multiverseid\': 659010}, {\'name\': \'Puerto interior\', \'text\': \'El Puerto interior entra al campo de batalla girado a menos que controles un Bosque o una Isla.\\n{T}: Agrega {G} o {U}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'En los lugares en que el mar se funde con el bosque, es fácil olvidar la oscuridad que gobierna en Innistrad.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659276&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'228865ed-7ccc-41e3-86d8-2f4283c267cf\', \'multiverseId\': 659276}, \'multiverseid\': 659276}, {\'name\': "Port de l\'arrière-pays", \'text\': "Le Port de l\'arrière-pays arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé à moins que vous ne contrôliez une forêt ou une île.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G} ou {U}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Là où la mer rejoint les arbres, il est facile d\'oublier les ténèbres qui règnent sur la majeure partie d\'Innistrad.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659542&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8862905-ead5-4799-9216-05d84b8f3f16\', \'multiverseId\': 659542}, \'multiverseid\': 659542}, {\'name\': \'内陸の湾港\', \'text\': \'あなたが森や島をコントロールしていないかぎり、内陸の湾港はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{G}か{U}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'海が樹々と出会う場所では、イニストラードのほとんどを占める闇を忘れるのも容易い。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659808&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7837b9c9-4e81-489d-a4ba-c421a68b2e15\', \'multiverseId\': 659808}, \'multiverseid\': 659808}, {\'name\': \'内陆港湾\', \'text\': \'除非你操控树林或海岛，否则内陆港湾须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{G}或{U}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'在海洋与林木交接之处，很容易忘记黑暗统治着依尼翠大部分的地区。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660074&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c783d6b2-80ad-4226-8bf3-a284511ea066\', \'multiverseId\': 660074}, \'multiverseid\': 660074}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hinterlistige Rhetorik\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Gegner dich und/oder einen oder mehrere Planeswalker, die du kontrollierst, angreift, schicke die oberste Karte der Bibliothek jenes Spielers ins Exil. Du kannst jene Karte spielen, solange sie im Exil bleibt, und um sie zu wirken, kannst du Mana ausgeben, als wäre es Mana beliebiger Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658839&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6da07d53-a387-48d4-8760-a139eba83f9a\', \'multiverseId\': 658839}, \'multiverseid\': 658839}, {\'name\': \'Retórica astuta\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un oponente te ataque a ti y/o a uno o más planeswalkers que controlas, exilia la primera carta de la biblioteca de ese jugador. Puedes jugar esa carta mientras permanezca exiliada, y puedes usar maná como si fuera maná de cualquier color para lanzarla.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659105&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39efb14d-7c7f-4145-a2ad-672fd8db5bc7\', \'multiverseId\': 659105}, \'multiverseid\': 659105}, {\'name\': \'Rhétorique rusée\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un adversaire vous attaque et/ou attaque au moins un planeswalker que vous contrôlez, exilez la carte du dessus de la bibliothèque de ce joueur. Vous pouvez jouer cette carte tant qu\'elle reste exilée, et vous pouvez dépenser du mana comme s\'il s\'agissait de mana de n\'importe quelle couleur pour la lancer.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659371&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a9d0bd2-5ab3-41b0-82a7-96475441fa4f\', \'multiverseId\': 659371}, \'multiverseid\': 659371}, {\'name\': \'狡猾な弁論\', \'text\': \'対戦相手１人が、あなたや、あなたがコントロールしているプレインズウォーカー１体以上を攻撃するたび、そのプレイヤーのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を追放する。それが追放され続けているかぎり、あなたはそのカードをプレイしてもよく、あなたはそれを唱えるためにマナを任意の色のマナであるかのように支払ってもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659637&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4cd81b9e-4ff0-440f-b8f4-4f7a374a9b81\', \'multiverseId\': 659637}, \'multiverseid\': 659637}, {\'name\': \'花言巧语\', \'text\': \'每当任一对手攻击你和／或由你操控的一个或数个鹏洛客时，放逐该牌手的牌库顶牌。于该牌持续放逐的时段内，你可以使用该牌，且你可以将法术力视同任意颜色的法术力来施放。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659903&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c9ddef2-156a-4823-8c19-17d403cad7dd\', \'multiverseId\': 659903}, \'multiverseid\': 659903}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hochmütiger Dschinn\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nDie Stärke des Hochmütigen Dschinns ist gleich der Anzahl an Spontanzauber- und Hexereikarten in deinem Friedhof.\\nSpontanzauber und Hexereien, die du wirkst, kosten beim Wirken {1} weniger.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dschinn\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich finde dein Outfit toll. Es ist so … rustikal."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658809&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18b29e1a-2b36-4c22-9e33-3de8eb04515a\', \'multiverseId\': 658809}, \'multiverseid\': 658809}, {\'name\': \'Djinn arrogante\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nLa fuerza del Djinn arrogante es igual a la cantidad de cartas de instantáneo y de conjuro en tu cementerio.\\nTe cuesta {1} menos lanzar hechizos de instantáneo o de conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Djinn\', \'flavor\': \'"Me encanta tu ropa. Es muy... rústica".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659075&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'17e5b7d5-0195-4627-a60d-3354b954fdc0\', \'multiverseId\': 659075}, \'multiverseid\': 659075}, {\'name\': \'Djinn hautain\', \'text\': "Vol\\nLa force du Djinn hautain est égale au nombre de cartes d\'éphémère et de rituel dans votre cimetière.\\nLes sorts d\'éphémère et de rituel que vous lancez coûtent {1} de moins à lancer.", \'type\': \'Créature — djinn\', \'flavor\': "« J\'adore votre tenue. Elle est tellement... rustique. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659341&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4057f004-380f-45be-b4e7-4c4de722ad39\', \'multiverseId\': 659341}, \'multiverseid\': 659341}, {\'name\': \'傲慢なジン\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n傲慢なジンのパワーは、あなたの墓地にありインスタントやソーサリーであるカードの枚数に等しい。\\nあなたがインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるためのコストは{1}少なくなる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ジン\', \'flavor\': \'「素敵な衣装だ。なんていうか……質素だね。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659607&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35b0303c-e609-4356-a420-40d63842c40f\', \'multiverseId\': 659607}, \'multiverseid\': 659607}, {\'name\': \'狂妄巨灵\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n狂妄巨灵的力量等同于你坟墓场中瞬间与法术牌的数量加总。\\n你施放的瞬间与法术咒语减少{1}来施放。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 巨灵\', \'flavor\': \'「我喜欢你的装扮。看上去非常…淳朴。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659873&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'addee488-c5ae-4552-8741-9202b5d5e2f1\', \'multiverseId\': 659873}, \'multiverseid\': 659873}]', '[{\'name\': \'Hymne des Marschalls\', \'text\': \'Multibonus {1}{W} (Du kannst zusätzlich beliebig oft {1}{W} bezahlen, sowie du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst.)\\nKreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.\\nWenn die Hymne des Marschalls ins Spiel kommt, bringe bis zu X Kreaturenkarten deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück, wobei X gleich der Anzahl ist, wie oft die Bonuskosten der Hymne des Marschalls bezahlt wurden.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658792&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3284ac2d-ca1e-499e-8989-3ac0e1969c44\', \'multiverseId\': 658792}, \'multiverseid\': 658792}, {\'name\': \'Himno del mariscal\', \'text\': \'Multiestímulo {1}{W}. (Puedes pagar {1}{W} adicionales tantas veces como quieras al lanzar este hechizo.)\\nLas criaturas que controlas obtienen +1/+1.\\nCuando el Himno del mariscal entre al campo de batalla, regresa hasta X cartas de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio al campo de batalla, donde X es igual a la cantidad de veces que el Himno del mariscal fue estimulado.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659058&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1dac1b3d-64d9-4ad9-acba-c9c183628b1d\', \'multiverseId\': 659058}, \'multiverseid\': 659058}, {\'name\': \'Antienne du maréchal\', \'text\': "Multikick {1}{W} (Vous pouvez payer {1}{W} supplémentaires autant de fois que vous le souhaitez au moment où vous lancez ce sort.)\\nLes créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1.\\nQuand l\'Antienne du maréchal arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez sur le champ de bataille jusqu\'à X cartes de créature ciblées depuis votre cimetière, X étant le nombre de fois que l\'Antienne du maréchal a été kickée.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659324&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'053bbf3c-d738-47d8-ad0d-aaa4c09dd9dc\', \'multiverseId\': 659324}, \'multiverseid\': 659324}, {\'name\': \'司令官の頌歌\', \'text\': \'多重キッカー{1}{W}（あなたはこの呪文を唱えるに際し、追加で{1}{W}を望む回数支払ってもよい。）\\nあなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n司令官の頌歌が戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード最大Ｘ枚を対象とする。それらを戦場に戻す。Ｘは司令官の頌歌がキッカーされた回数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659590&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93882202-f0bd-45a1-80d5-e13b59afcd34\', \'multiverseId\': 659590}, \'multiverseid\': 659590}, {\'name\': \'元帅赞美诗\', \'text\': \'多重增幅{1}{W}（你施放此咒语时可以任意次数地额外支付{1}{W}。）\\n由你操控的生物得+1/+1。\\n当元帅赞美诗进战场时，将至多X张目标生物牌从你的坟墓场移回战场，X为元帅赞美诗增幅过的次数。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659856&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0b87f04-c110-47e1-9c37-25416c37d3f9\', \'multiverseId\': 659856}, \'multiverseid\': 659856}]', '[{\'name\': \'Höhlen von Koilos\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W} oder {B}. Die Höhlen von Koilos fügen dir 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Nach Jahren der Stille widerhallen in den Höhlen wieder die grausigen Geräusche von Phyrexianern, die sich auf den Krieg vorbereiten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658987&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3331c432-2d47-4270-ad4e-778c030e4d17\', \'multiverseId\': 658987}, \'multiverseid\': 658987}, {\'name\': \'Cuevas de Koilos\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{T}: Agrega {W} o {B}. Las Cuevas de Koilos te hacen 1 punto de daño.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Tras años de silencio, en las cuevas vuelve a resonar el espeluznante eco de los pirexianos que se preparan para la guerra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659253&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfabf0ef-16be-46a0-8911-354e371d6326\', \'multiverseId\': 659253}, \'multiverseid\': 659253}, {\'name\': \'Cavernes de Koïlos\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W} ou {B}. Les Cavernes de Koïlos vous infligent 1 blessure.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Après des années de silence, les cavernes se font à nouveau l\'écho des sons horribles des Phyrexians se préparant pour la guerre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659519&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b18339d8-e124-4274-a1dd-737cbf40da43\', \'multiverseId\': 659519}, \'multiverseid\': 659519}, {\'name\': \'コイロスの洞窟\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}：{W}か{B}を加える。コイロスの洞窟はあなたに１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'沈黙の時を経て、戦争の準備をするファイレクシア人の不気味な音が洞窟から鳴り響いた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659785&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4fcc4f7e-4b6b-49d1-9129-25f83f8794d1\', \'multiverseId\': 659785}, \'multiverseid\': 659785}, {\'name\': \'喀洛斯洞窟\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{T}：加{W}或{B}。喀洛斯洞窟对你造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'沉寂多年后，洞窟内再度回荡起非瑞克西亚人备战声响。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660051&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e7b879d-c050-41ae-aba1-a70fd269dd77\', \'multiverseId\': 660051}, \'multiverseid\': 660051}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ikonoklastin vom Dritten Pfad\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Nichtkreatur-Zauberspruch wirkst, erzeuge einen 1/1 farblosen Soldat-Artefaktkreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Mönch\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn du nur einen Hammer hast, kommt dir alles wie ein Nagel vor. Ich schlage lediglich vor, unseren Werkzeugkasten ein wenig zu erweitern."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658954&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2df86840-c625-4870-83ab-920731dabf03\', \'multiverseId\': 658954}, \'multiverseid\': 658954}, {\'name\': \'Iconoclasta del Tercer Camino\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo que no sea criatura, crea una ficha de criatura artefacto Soldado incolora 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Monje humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Cuando solo tienes un martillo, todo te parece un clavo. Yo únicamente propongo ampliar nuestra caja de herramientas".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659220&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a852ee3f-58bf-48ce-bf08-4d8279c30c73\', \'multiverseId\': 659220}, \'multiverseid\': 659220}, {\'name\': \'Iconoclaste de la Troisième Voie\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort non-créature, créez un jeton de créature-artefact 1/1 incolore Soldat.\', \'type\': \'Créature — humain et moine\', \'flavor\': "« Quand on n\'a qu\'un marteau, tout ressemble à un clou. Je propose seulement d\'améliorer notre boîte à outils. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659486&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'077205a6-1c52-45c8-b6e8-fe737cc49ab6\', \'multiverseId\': 659486}, \'multiverseid\': 659486}, {\'name\': \'第三の道の偶像破壊者\', \'text\': \'あなたがクリーチャーでない呪文１つを唱えるたび、無色の１/１の兵士・アーティファクト・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・モンク\', \'flavor\': \'「手元にあるのが金鎚だけだと、何もかもが釘に見えてしまう。私は単に、我らの工具箱を充実させようと提案しているだけだ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659752&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'363386bf-6cb4-4ec7-b012-402ccaeffdcf\', \'multiverseId\': 659752}, \'multiverseid\': 659752}, {\'name\': \'蹊径会异端\', \'text\': \'每当你施放非生物咒语时，派出一个1/1无色士兵衍生神器生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／修行僧\', \'flavor\': \'「如果你手上只有锤子，那所有东西都只会看着像钉子。我只是建议工具箱里多备点其他器具。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660018&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1b58e14-2e74-462c-bb55-0e0b487a2cfc\', \'multiverseId\': 660018}, \'multiverseid\': 660018}]', '[{\'name\': \'Immerändernde Weite\', \'text\': \'{T}, opfere die Immerändernde Weite: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Zwei Schritte nach Norden führen dich in die ungewisse Zukunft, nach Süden in die unruhige Vergangenheit, nach Osten in den heutigen Tag und nach Westen in das große Durcheinander.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659046&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68cf72fe-a388-4906-8412-8c637792e94b\', \'multiverseId\': 659046}, \'multiverseid\': 659046}, {\'name\': \'Expansión terramórfica\', \'text\': \'{T}, sacrificar la Expansión terramórfica: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, ponla en el campo de batalla girada y luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Haz dos pasos al norte hacia el futuro inestable, al sur hacia el pasado inquieto, al este hacia el presente o al oeste hacia lo desconocido.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659312&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'beb55783-7475-48aa-b1b8-8327f5cdcc97\', \'multiverseId\': 659312}, \'multiverseid\': 659312}, {\'name\': \'Immensité terramorphe\', \'text\': "{T}, sacrifiez l\'Immensité terramorphe : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille engagée, puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Faites deux pas au nord dans l\'avenir instable, au sud dans le passé agité, à l\'est dans le présent ou à l\'ouest dans le vaste inconnu.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659578&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12727206-9fcd-42b5-b321-a5e2f08ce779\', \'multiverseId\': 659578}, \'multiverseid\': 659578}, {\'name\': \'広漠なる変幻地\', \'text\': \'{T}, 広漠なる変幻地を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'二歩北へ進めば不安定な未来、南へ進めば不穏な過去、東に進めば今日この日、西へ進めば偉大なる未知。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659844&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2ac4851-6d1e-4d2b-b2e8-faf67ec8e5aa\', \'multiverseId\': 659844}, \'multiverseid\': 659844}, {\'name\': \'地塑旷野\', \'text\': \'{T}，牺牲地塑旷野：从你牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，将之横置放进战场，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'迈开两步，向北迈进动荡将来，向南则为无宁过往，向东步回眼下此刻，或向西踏入未知境地。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660110&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2a21244-6fd0-42da-8f4f-7b5e27ec3e13\', \'multiverseId\': 660110}, \'multiverseid\': 660110}]', '[{\'name\': \'Impulsiver Langfinger\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Impulsive Langfinger stirbt, erzeuge einen Schatz-Spielstein. (Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{T}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.")\\nZugabe {3}{R} ({3}{R}, schicke diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil: Erzeuge für jeden Gegner eine Spielstein-Kopie, die ihn in diesem Zug angreift, falls möglich. Die Spielsteine erhalten Eile. Opfere sie zu Beginn des nächsten Endsegments. Aktiviere Zugabe wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin, Pirat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658881&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5cacdd1-a55e-4542-bfc0-1306667efa8f\', \'multiverseId\': 658881}, \'multiverseid\': 658881}, {\'name\': \'Ladronzuelo impulsivo\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Ladronzuelo impulsivo muera, crea una ficha de Tesoro. (Es un artefacto con "{T}, sacrificar este artefacto: Agrega un maná de cualquier color".)\\nReplicar {3}{R}. ({3}{R}, exiliar esta carta de tu cementerio: Por cada oponente, crea una ficha que es una copia que ataca a ese oponente este turno, si puede. Ganan la habilidad de prisa. Sacrifícalas al comienzo del próximo paso final. Activa esto solo como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pirata trasgo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659147&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f0f40d0-d0ff-4363-8917-7eea18f658c3\', \'multiverseId\': 659147}, \'multiverseid\': 659147}, {\'name\': \'Chapardeur impulsif\', \'text\': "Quand le Chapardeur impulsif meurt, créez un jeton Trésor. (C\'est un artefact avec « {T}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix. »)\\nEncore {3}{R} ({3}{R}, exilez cette carte de votre cimetière : Pour chaque adversaire, créez une copie jeton qui attaque cet adversaire ce tour-ci si possible. Elle acquiert la célérité. Sacrifiez-la au début de la prochaine étape de fin. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Créature — gobelin et pirate\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659413&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a46f20a-ff0e-4565-861b-63f0620ea03b\', \'multiverseId\': 659413}, \'multiverseid\': 659413}, {\'name\': \'衝動的なこそ泥\', \'text\': \'衝動的なこそ泥が死亡したとき、宝物・トークン１つを生成する。（それは、「{T}, このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\\n再演{3}{R}（{3}{R}, あなたの墓地にあるこのカードを追放する：各対戦相手につきそれぞれ、このカードのコピーであり、このターン可能ならそのプレイヤーを攻撃するトークン１体を生成する。それらは速攻を得る。次の終了ステップの開始時に、それらを生け贄に捧げる。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・海賊\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659679&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'102edc11-bfa5-4135-b8d6-bf8bc580c698\', \'multiverseId\': 659679}, \'multiverseid\': 659679}, {\'name\': \'冲动小偷\', \'text\': \'当冲动小偷死去时，派出一个珍宝衍生物。（它是具有「{T}，牺牲此神器：加一点任意颜色的法术力」的神器。）\\n返场{3}{R}（{3}{R}，从你的坟墓场放逐此牌：为每位对手各进行以下流程～派出一个衍生复制品，且其本回合若能攻击该对手，便须如此作。它们获得敏捷异能。在下一个结束步骤开始时，将它们牺牲。只能于法术时机起动。）\', \'type\': \'生物 — 鬼怪／海盗\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659945&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f12e34e8-e824-4cf6-9a6a-f291dd51fc17\', \'multiverseId\': 659945}, \'multiverseid\': 659945}]', '[{\'name\': \'In Betracht ziehen\', \'text\': \'Schaue dir die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek an und lege sie in beliebiger Reihenfolge zurück. Du kannst mischen.\\nZiehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Wer sich heute vorbereitet, gewinnt morgen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658815&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a499637d-ae33-4c0e-8a54-9e3c4f1edaf2\', \'multiverseId\': 658815}, \'multiverseid\': 658815}, {\'name\': \'Reflexionar\', \'text\': \'Mira las tres primeras cartas de tu biblioteca y luego regrésalas en cualquier orden. Puedes barajar.\\nRoba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'El mañana pertenece a quienes hoy se preparan para él.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659081&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'915ef7fd-b3d0-4670-a47d-a436a15fad6d\', \'multiverseId\': 659081}, \'multiverseid\': 659081}, {\'name\': \'Contemplation\', \'text\': "Regardez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque, puis remettez-les dessus dans l\'ordre de votre choix. Vous pouvez mélanger.\\nPiochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "L\'avenir appartient à ceux qui s\'y préparent la veille.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659347&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75d7a459-327f-4c8e-80a9-689581646bb6\', \'multiverseId\': 659347}, \'multiverseid\': 659347}, {\'name\': \'思案\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード３枚を見、その後、望む順番で戻す。ライブラリーを切り直してもよい。\\nカード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'明日という日は、今日それを迎える準備をしている者のためにある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659613&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1de6875b-8602-4bc5-950e-93a7ddfde234\', \'multiverseId\': 659613}, \'multiverseid\': 659613}, {\'name\': \'沉思\', \'text\': \'检视你牌库顶的三张牌，然后将它们以任意顺序放回。你可以洗牌。\\n抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'明日属于今天就为它作好准备的人。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659879&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32f4b277-1407-4cce-ab35-1ce703451910\', \'multiverseId\': 659879}, \'multiverseid\': 659879}]', '[{\'name\': \'In den Zeiten wühlen\', \'text\': \'Wühlen (Mit jeder Karte, die du aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil schickst, während du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, bezahlst du {1} seiner Kosten.)\\nSchaue dir die obersten sieben Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Nimm zwei davon auf deine Hand und lege den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658805&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ad1c3cd-47cf-467e-bf08-2194d6a73e62\', \'multiverseId\': 658805}, \'multiverseid\': 658805}, {\'name\': \'Hurgar en el tiempo\', \'text\': \'Excavar. (Cada carta que exilies de tu cementerio al lanzar este hechizo cuenta como un pago de {1}.)\\nMira las siete primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Pon dos de ellas en tu mano y el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en cualquier orden.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659071&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'205308a0-850c-45f4-a31e-61a9d9f93afe\', \'multiverseId\': 659071}, \'multiverseid\': 659071}, {\'name\': \'Fouille temporelle\', \'text\': "Fouille (Chaque carte que vous exilez depuis votre cimetière en lançant ce sort paie {1}.)\\nRegardez les sept cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez deux d\'entre elles dans votre main et le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque, dans l\'ordre de votre choix.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659337&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'401a563c-7503-4e79-babf-7bd132293a35\', \'multiverseId\': 659337}, \'multiverseid\': 659337}, {\'name\': \'時を越えた探索\', \'text\': \'探査（この呪文を唱える段階であなたの墓地から追放した各カードはそれぞれ{1}を支払う。）\\nあなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード７枚を見る。そのうち２枚をあなたの手札に、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に望む順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659603&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e66c5bce-5297-4808-a5c3-5086881d7aa5\', \'multiverseId\': 659603}, \'multiverseid\': 659603}, {\'name\': \'历时挖掘\', \'text\': \'掘穴（你于施放此咒语时每从你坟墓场中放逐一张牌，就能为此咒语支付{1}。）\\n检视你牌库顶的七张牌。将其中两张置于你手上，其余则以任意顺序置于你牌库底。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659869&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'88b78705-71e5-468f-b675-00ba4ebec907\', \'multiverseId\': 659869}, \'multiverseid\': 659869}]', "[{'name': 'Isolierte Kapelle', 'text': 'Die Isolierte Kapelle kommt getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du kontrollierst eine Ebene oder einen Sumpf.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W} oder {B}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': 'Nicht jede Kirche ist ein Ort des Glaubens.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659011&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1e87034f-cbe1-4eea-96a2-c65b8b51a9bf', 'multiverseId': 659011}, 'multiverseid': 659011}, {'name': 'Capilla aislada', 'text': 'La Capilla aislada entra al campo de batalla girada a menos que controles una Llanura o un Pantano.\\n{T}: Agrega {W} o {B}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': 'No todas las iglesias son lugares de adoración.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659277&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '76339988-2c46-4d9c-bfa1-d8449603eb16', 'multiverseId': 659277}, 'multiverseid': 659277}, {'name': 'Chapelle isolée', 'text': 'La Chapelle isolée arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée à moins que vous ne contrôliez une plaine ou un marais.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W} ou {B}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': 'Toutes les églises ne sont pas des lieux de culte.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659543&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '86173581-1806-4211-b273-c20d22b9f750', 'multiverseId': 659543}, 'multiverseid': 659543}, {'name': '孤立した礼拝堂', 'text': 'あなたが平地や沼をコントロールしていないかぎり、孤立した礼拝堂はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{W}か{B}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': 'すべての教会が信仰の場所とは限らない。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659809&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eb3018dc-7fed-4435-ac10-299edc5836aa', 'multiverseId': 659809}, 'multiverseid': 659809}, {'name': '孤立礼拜堂', 'text': '除非你操控平原或沼泽，否则孤立礼拜堂须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{W}或{B}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': '并非每个教堂都是信念之地。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660075&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '293df7d9-dbc0-470a-8f4a-6c2d6ede42c0', 'multiverseId': 660075}, 'multiverseid': 660075}]", '[{\'name\': \'Izzet-Dampfwerk\', \'text\': \'Das Izzet-Dampfwerk kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn das Izzet-Dampfwerk ins Spiel kommt, bringe ein Land, das du kontrollierst, auf die Hand seines Besitzers zurück.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659012&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3187c69d-2ccb-41bc-9890-1f811da88790\', \'multiverseId\': 659012}, \'multiverseid\': 659012}, {\'name\': \'Calderas ízzet\', \'text\': \'Las Calderas ízzet entran al campo de batalla giradas.\\nCuando las Calderas ízzet entren al campo de batalla, regresa una tierra que controlas a la mano de su propietario.\\n{T}: Agrega {U}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659278&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'402bd9c4-32cb-4725-926a-50662c2279dc\', \'multiverseId\': 659278}, \'multiverseid\': 659278}, {\'name\': "Chaufferie d\'Izzet", \'text\': "La Chaufferie d\'Izzet arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\nQuand la Chaufferie d\'Izzet arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez un terrain que vous contrôlez dans la main de son propriétaire.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U}{R}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659544&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f02e192b-dbe8-4191-8816-6bc4deef910b\', \'multiverseId\': 659544}, \'multiverseid\': 659544}, {\'name\': \'イゼットの煮沸場\', \'text\': \'イゼットの煮沸場はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nイゼットの煮沸場が戦場に出たとき、あなたがコントロールしている土地１つをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n{T}：{U}{R}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659810&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f47c1a60-4ebb-446b-af55-cc29109ba90e\', \'multiverseId\': 659810}, \'multiverseid\': 659810}, {\'name\': \'伊捷炼炉厂\', \'text\': \'伊捷炼炉厂须横置进战场。\\n当伊捷炼炉厂进战场时，将一个由你操控的地移回其拥有者手上。\\n{T}：加{U}{R}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660076&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91a0024b-7dea-4e0e-b416-f01a26141fdf\', \'multiverseId\': 660076}, \'multiverseid\': 660076}]', '[{\'name\': \'Izzet-Petschaft\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Erzeuge {U}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Das Petschaft der Izzet erhält immer wieder ein neues Aussehen, und jedes Mal wird es einem schmeichelnden Portrait von Niv-Mizzet ähnlicher.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658969&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18fda58f-a136-4dd0-9494-bc695d85393b\', \'multiverseId\': 658969}, \'multiverseid\': 658969}, {\'name\': \'Sello ízzet\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Agrega {U}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'El Sello ízzet se rediseña a menudo, y cada vez se parece más a un retrato de Niv-Mízzet.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659235&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'99644dca-ddfc-40f5-960c-c9fde0bef663\', \'multiverseId\': 659235}, \'multiverseid\': 659235}, {\'name\': "Cachet d\'Izzet", \'text\': \'{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {U}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Le cachet d\'Izzet est régulièrement modifié pour ressembler de plus en plus à un portrait miniature de Niv-Mizzet.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659501&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13306d30-94eb-4d6b-a287-c8b3937fb65f\', \'multiverseId\': 659501}, \'multiverseid\': 659501}, {\'name\': \'イゼットの印鑑\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}：{U}{R}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'イゼットの印鑑はしばしばデザインし直され、そのたびにニヴ＝ミゼットの虚栄に満ちた肖像に近づいていく。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659767&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6f5ff34-3b64-42de-be9a-80855069391c\', \'multiverseId\': 659767}, \'multiverseid\': 659767}, {\'name\': \'伊捷印记\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}：加{U}{R}。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'伊捷印记的设计经常变化，每次都更接近尼米捷浮华的画像。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660033&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc2f3a5f-29ce-46ed-8405-7c72393ec64b\', \'multiverseId\': 660033}, \'multiverseid\': 660033}]', '[{\'name\': \'Jagender Trygon\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn der Jagende Trygon einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, kannst du ein Artefakt oder eine Verzauberung deiner Wahl, das bzw. die der Spieler kontrolliert, zerstören.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Bestie\', \'flavor\': \'Trygonen, die von umgewandelter Magie in der Luft gehalten werden, sind auf dauernder Jagd nach Quellen ihres magischen Antriebs.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658956&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ad9f01e-4d69-4a07-a76f-14e31fe06e1f\', \'multiverseId\': 658956}, \'multiverseid\': 658956}, {\'name\': \'Depredador trygon\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que el Depredador trygon haga daño de combate a un jugador, puedes destruir el artefacto o encantamiento objetivo que controla ese jugador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bestia\', \'flavor\': \'Sostenidos por magia metabolizada, los trygons están hambrientos buscando fuentes de su alimento místico.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659222&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e2987a5-4caf-4a45-b9ad-86d4e5349fd9\', \'multiverseId\': 659222}, \'multiverseid\': 659222}, {\'name\': \'Clavelade prédatrice\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que la Clavelade prédatrice inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, vous pouvez détruire une cible, artefact ou enchantement, que ce joueur contrôle.\', \'type\': \'Créature — bête\', \'flavor\': "Maintenues dans les airs par la magie qu\'elles ont métabolisée, les clavelades sont avides d\'énergie mystique.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659488&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3d3913f-2cb6-4b73-bbf2-bf6ce0d9570c\', \'multiverseId\': 659488}, \'multiverseid\': 659488}, {\'name\': \'三角エイの捕食者\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n三角エイの捕食者がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、そのプレイヤーがコントロールしていてアーティファクトやエンチャントである１つを対象とする。それを破壊してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ビースト\', \'flavor\': \'代謝魔法で浮かんでいる三角エイは、魔力を満たすための源に貪欲だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659754&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bf4d6ace-276c-4001-a2a7-00e2639bf427\', \'multiverseId\': 659754}, \'multiverseid\': 659754}, {\'name\': \'掠食飞鳐\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当掠食飞鳐对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，你可以消灭目标由该牌手操控的神器或结界。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 野兽\', \'flavor\': \'飞鳐依赖消耗性法术在空中飞翔，为补充魔力燃料来源而不断掠食。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660020&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9db3b8e-3ea3-4c71-aeab-ae7366dd5d07\', \'multiverseId\': 660020}, \'multiverseid\': 660020}]', '[{\'name\': \'Junger Pyromagier\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkst, erzeuge einen 1/1 roten Elementarwesen-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'Verbrennungen sind die aufrichtigste Form der Schmeichelei.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658895&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df04e0fe-b70a-461d-a05c-4ba9a8ab3728\', \'multiverseId\': 658895}, \'multiverseid\': 658895}, {\'name\': \'Piromante joven\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro, crea una ficha de criatura Elemental roja 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán humano\', \'flavor\': \'La inmolación es la forma más sincera de adulación.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659161&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c829cc7-a1f5-4346-9ecd-f74e191255ca\', \'multiverseId\': 659161}, \'multiverseid\': 659161}, {\'name\': \'Jeune pyromancien\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 rouge Élémental.", \'type\': \'Créature — humain et shamane\', \'flavor\': "L\'immolation est la forme de flatterie la plus sincère.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659427&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc60b41e-2312-4c9f-838b-144e851b4365\', \'multiverseId\': 659427}, \'multiverseid\': 659427}, {\'name\': \'若き紅蓮術士\', \'text\': \'あなたがインスタントやソーサリーである呪文１つを唱えるたび、赤の１/１のエレメンタル・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'焼身は最も誠実な追従である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659693&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'516a4d09-8cd4-4879-bb73-530378dc5285\', \'multiverseId\': 659693}, \'multiverseid\': 659693}, {\'name\': \'年轻烈焰术士\', \'text\': \'每当你施放瞬间或法术咒语时，派出一个1/1红色元素衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／祭师\', \'flavor\': \'献祭是最真诚的奉承形式。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659959&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9e57ee2-c54d-4eff-bb79-7e29a627fcec\', \'multiverseId\': 659959}, \'multiverseid\': 659959}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kaktusreservat\', \'text\': \'Das Kaktusreservat kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana eines beliebigen Typs, das ein Land, das du kontrollierst, produzieren könnte.\\n{3}: Bis zum Ende des Zuges wird das Kaktusreservat zu einer X/X grünen Pflanze-Kreatur mit Reichweite, wobei X gleich dem höchsten Manabetrag unter deinen Commandern ist. Es ist immer noch ein Land.\', \'type\': \'Land — Wüste\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658392&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08ab5264-285d-4c94-8d2d-f0ae54767751\', \'multiverseId\': 658392}, \'multiverseid\': 658392}, {\'name\': \'Reserva de cactus\', \'text\': \'La Reserva de cactus entra al campo de batalla girada.\\n{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier tipo que pueda producir una tierra que controlas.\\n{3}: Hasta el final del turno, la Reserva de cactus se convierte en una criatura Planta verde X/X con la habilidad de alcance, donde X es el mayor valor de maná entre tus comandantes. Sigue siendo una tierra.\', \'type\': \'Tierra — Desierto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658424&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01b2c664-35f9-46e2-9247-a871f2ba71ed\', \'multiverseId\': 658424}, \'multiverseid\': 658424}, {\'name\': \'Réserve naturelle de cactus\', \'text\': "La Réserve naturelle de cactus arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez un mana de n\'importe quel type qu\'un terrain que vous contrôlez pourrait produire.\\n{3} : Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, la Réserve naturelle de cactus devient une créature X/X verte Plante avec la portée, X étant la valeur de mana la plus élevée parmi vos commandants. C\'est toujours un terrain.", \'type\': \'Terrain — désert\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658456&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d12eb32-8526-4ab4-8e0a-29f6bcfbac31\', \'multiverseId\': 658456}, \'multiverseid\': 658456}, {\'name\': \'サボテン保護区\', \'text\': \'サボテン保護区はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：あなたがコントロールしている土地が生み出すことのできるマナのタイプのうち望むタイプのマナ１点を加える。\\n{3}：ターン終了時まで、サボテン保護区は到達を持つ緑のＸ/Ｘの植物・クリーチャーになる。Ｘは、あなたの統率者の中のマナ総量の最大値に等しい。これは土地でもある。\', \'type\': \'土地 — 砂漠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658488&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c13439fe-e7b9-4f21-9a25-3cfe9878e555\', \'multiverseId\': 658488}, \'multiverseid\': 658488}, {\'name\': \'仙掌保护地\', \'text\': \'仙掌保护地须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加一点法术力，其类别为由你操控的地能产生之任一类别。\\n{3}：直到回合结束，仙掌保护地成为X/X绿色，具延势异能的植物生物，X为你指挥官中的最大法术力值。它仍然是地。\', \'type\': \'地 — 沙漠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658520&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec7dd1b3-7d5f-49ea-805a-d130a06e4065\', \'multiverseId\': 658520}, \'multiverseid\': 658520}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kaktusreservat\', \'text\': \'Das Kaktusreservat kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana eines beliebigen Typs, das ein Land, das du kontrollierst, produzieren könnte.\\n{3}: Bis zum Ende des Zuges wird das Kaktusreservat zu einer X/X grünen Pflanze-Kreatur mit Reichweite, wobei X gleich dem höchsten Manabetrag unter deinen Commandern ist. Es ist immer noch ein Land.\', \'type\': \'Land — Wüste\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660200&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f95418b-fe01-4bfa-ad68-4bbf2fe9cf4b\', \'multiverseId\': 660200}, \'multiverseid\': 660200}, {\'name\': \'Réserve naturelle de cactus\', \'text\': "La Réserve naturelle de cactus arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez un mana de n\'importe quel type qu\'un terrain que vous contrôlez pourrait produire.\\n{3} : Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, la Réserve naturelle de cactus devient une créature X/X verte Plante avec la portée, X étant la valeur de mana la plus élevée parmi vos commandants. C\'est toujours un terrain.", \'type\': \'Terrain — désert\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660232&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6bb70e57-1375-4264-8104-e3e358f507b8\', \'multiverseId\': 660232}, \'multiverseid\': 660232}, {\'name\': \'サボテン保護区\', \'text\': \'サボテン保護区はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：あなたがコントロールしている土地が生み出すことのできるマナのタイプのうち望むタイプのマナ１点を加える。\\n{3}：ターン終了時まで、サボテン保護区は到達を持つ緑のＸ/Ｘの植物・クリーチャーになる。Ｘは、あなたの統率者の中のマナ総量の最大値に等しい。これは土地でもある。\', \'type\': \'土地 — 砂漠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660264&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'106a2456-0d62-4192-83bd-14112b1c643a\', \'multiverseId\': 660264}, \'multiverseid\': 660264}, {\'name\': \'仙掌保护地\', \'text\': \'仙掌保护地须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加一点法术力，其类别为由你操控的地能产生之任一类别。\\n{3}：直到回合结束，仙掌保护地成为X/X绿色，具延势异能的植物生物，X为你指挥官中的最大法术力值。它仍然是地。\', \'type\': \'地 — 沙漠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660296&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0e2d7373-e761-4665-aeaf-ee46746db2cf\', \'multiverseId\': 660296}, \'multiverseid\': 660296}]', "[{'name': 'Kaltäugiger Selkie', 'text': 'Inseltarnung (Diese Kreatur kann nicht geblockt werden, solange der verteidigende Spieler eine Insel kontrolliert.)\\nImmer wenn der Kaltäugige Selkie einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, kannst du entsprechend viele Karten ziehen.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Meervolk, Räuber', 'flavor': 'Er wandert die alten Nebenflüsse hinauf, die angelegt worden waren, als sich die Merrow noch um die Gezeiten kümmerten.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658928&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ae32202d-fcc0-44dd-944e-ef2f42821a7c', 'multiverseId': 658928}, 'multiverseid': 658928}, {'name': 'Selkie de ojos fríos', 'text': 'Cruza islas. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada mientras el jugador defensor controle una Isla.)\\nSiempre que la Selkie de ojos fríos haga daño de combate a un jugador, puedes robar esa misma cantidad de cartas.', 'type': 'Criatura — Bribón tritón', 'flavor': 'Ella sigue las viejas tradiciones de cuando los merrow todavía daban forma a las mareas.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659194&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f4abd2ce-8941-4018-853f-fb3640eedb11', 'multiverseId': 659194}, 'multiverseid': 659194}, {'name': 'Selkie aux yeux glacés', 'text': 'Traversée des îles (Cette créature ne peut pas être bloquée tant que le joueur défenseur contrôle au moins une île.)\\nÀ chaque fois que la Selkie aux yeux glacés inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, vous pouvez piocher autant de cartes.', 'type': 'Créature — ondin et gredin', 'flavor': 'Elle utilise les anciens chenaux construits quand les suires façonnaient encore les marées.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659460&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '50829a99-3194-4c76-a64f-d8fb2b041b69', 'multiverseId': 659460}, 'multiverseid': 659460}, {'name': '冷淡なセルキー', 'text': '島渡り（防御プレイヤーが島をコントロールしているかぎり、このクリーチャーはブロックされない。）\\n冷淡なセルキーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたはその点数に等しい枚数のカードを引いてもよい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — マーフォーク・ならず者', 'flavor': 'メロウがまだ潮汐を形作っていた頃、彼女は古き支流に従っていた。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659726&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '90a82fe1-444e-4248-ae7f-e2a95c2c5b67', 'multiverseId': 659726}, 'multiverseid': 659726}, {'name': '冷眼海豹妖', 'text': '海岛行者（只要防御牌手操控海岛，此生物便不能被阻挡。）\\n每当冷眼海豹妖对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，你可以抓等量的牌。', 'type': '生物 — 人鱼／浪客', 'flavor': '美洛仍能塑潮时曾形成许多支流，如今的她只沿着这些古老河道游动。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659992&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '41d572e3-858a-41c1-8b4f-28370655b27f', 'multiverseId': 659992}, 'multiverseid': 659992}]", '[{\'name\': \'Kamber die Plünderin\', \'text\': \'Partner von Laurine der Täuscherin (Wenn diese Kreatur ins Spiel kommt, kann ein Spieler deiner Wahl Laurine aus seiner Bibliothek auf seine Hand nehmen und danach mischen.)\\nLebensverknüpfung\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, stirbt, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu und erzeugst einen Blut-Spielstein. (Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{1}, {T}, wirf eine Karte ab, opfere dieses Artefakt: Ziehe eine Karte.")\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Vampir, Räuber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658847&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ca914ac-94fc-4d1f-8b5b-6f6c2569f3e6\', \'multiverseId\': 658847}, \'multiverseid\': 658847}, {\'name\': \'Kamber, la Saqueadora\', \'text\': \'Camarada de Laurine, la Distracción. (Cuando esta criatura entre al campo de batalla, el jugador objetivo puede poner a Laurine en su mano desde su biblioteca y luego barajar.)\\nVínculo vital.\\nSiempre que una criatura que controla un oponente muera, ganas 1 vida y creas una ficha de Sangre. (Es un artefacto con "{1}, {T}, descartar una carta, sacrificar este artefacto: Roba una carta".)\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Bribón vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659113&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b274f7c1-4972-44cc-a72c-330d0c6d0ba0\', \'multiverseId\': 659113}, \'multiverseid\': 659113}, {\'name\': \'Kamber, la saccageuse\', \'text\': "Partenariat avec Laurine, la diversion (Quand cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille, un joueur ciblé peut mettre Laurine dans sa main depuis sa bibliothèque, puis mélanger.)\\nLien de vie\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature qu\'un adversaire contrôle meurt, vous gagnez 1 point de vie et vous créez un jeton Sang. (C\'est un artefact avec « {1}, {T}, défaussez-vous d\'une carte, sacrifiez cet artefact : Piochez une carte. »)", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — vampire et gredin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659379&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b793bcfa-cfe9-4382-886b-d777f1a7211a\', \'multiverseId\': 659379}, \'multiverseid\': 659379}, {\'name\': \'略奪者、カンバー\', \'text\': \'陽動する者、ロリーンとの共闘（このクリーチャーが戦場に出たとき、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは「自分のライブラリーから陽動する者、ロリーンを自分の手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。）\\n絆魂\\n対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、あなたは１点のライフを得、血・トークン１つを生成する。（それは「{1}, {T}, カード１枚を捨てる, このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：カード１枚を引く。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 吸血鬼・ならず者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659645&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a22e0d93-ba6c-4cbf-814b-1bdf61565d0e\', \'multiverseId\': 659645}, \'multiverseid\': 659645}, {\'name\': \'劫掠者康芭\', \'text\': \'与诱敌手劳琳拍档（当此生物进战场时，目标牌手可以将劳琳从其牌库置于其手上，然后洗牌。）\\n系命\\n每当一个由对手操控的生物死去时，你获得1点生命并派出一个血滴衍生物。（它是具有「{1}，{T}，弃一张牌，牺牲此神器：抓一张牌」的神器。）\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 吸血鬼／浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659911&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18ca3681-56d7-40b7-8714-d568701a519c\', \'multiverseId\': 659911}, \'multiverseid\': 659911}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kapitänin Lannery Storm\', \'text\': \'Eile\\nImmer wenn Kapitänin Lannery Storm angreift, erzeuge einen Schatz-Spielstein. (Er ist ein Artefakt mit „{T}, opfere dieses Artefakt: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.")\\nImmer wenn du einen Schatz opferst, erhält Kapitänin Lannery Storm +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Pirat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658868&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6fc2d988-5eb8-4b5d-9ef7-0ed7bed72c7d\', \'multiverseId\': 658868}, \'multiverseid\': 658868}, {\'name\': \'Capitana Lannery Tempestad\', \'text\': \'Prisa.\\nSiempre que la Capitana Lannery Tempestad ataque, crea una ficha de Tesoro. (Es un artefacto con "{T}, sacrificar este artefacto: Agrega un maná de cualquier color".)\\nSiempre que sacrifiques un Tesoro, la Capitana Lannery Tempestad obtiene +1/+0 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Pirata humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659134&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'981dd89f-a128-493a-a7b9-6e6ad399e5fe\', \'multiverseId\': 659134}, \'multiverseid\': 659134}, {\'name\': \'Capitaine Lanneray Tempeste\', \'text\': "Célérité\\nÀ chaque fois que la Capitaine Lanneray Tempeste attaque, créez un jeton Trésor. (C\'est un artefact avec « {T}, sacrifiez cet artefact : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix. »)\\nÀ chaque fois que vous sacrifiez un trésor, la Capitaine Lanneray Tempeste gagne +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — humain et pirate\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659400&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be571bd6-c1c4-4d9a-b9ab-cb70ef284a6f\', \'multiverseId\': 659400}, \'multiverseid\': 659400}, {\'name\': \'風雲船長ラネリー\', \'text\': \'速攻\\n風雲船長ラネリーが攻撃するたび、宝物・トークン１つを生成する。（それは、「{T}, このアーティファクトを生け贄に捧げる：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。」を持つアーティファクトである。）\\nあなたが宝物１つを生け贄に捧げるたび、ターン終了時まで、風雲船長ラネリーは＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・海賊\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659666&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82ec9519-042f-45bc-93bb-d5a7ff45baa2\', \'multiverseId\': 659666}, \'multiverseid\': 659666}, {\'name\': \'兰娜莉速腾船长\', \'text\': \'敏捷\\n每当兰娜莉速腾船长攻击时，派出一个珍宝衍生物。（它是具有「{T}，牺牲此神器：加一点任意颜色的法术力」的神器。）\\n每当你牺牲一个珍宝时，兰娜莉速腾船长得+1/+0直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 人类／海盗\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659932&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a29d1ca-63c6-43ff-8820-992e9d727298\', \'multiverseId\': 659932}, \'multiverseid\': 659932}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kaza, Verfolgerin der Turbulenz\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Eile\\n{T}: Der nächste Spontanzauber oder die nächste Hexerei, den bzw. die du in diesem Zug wirkst, kostet beim Wirken {X} weniger, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Zauberern ist, die du kontrollierst, sowie diese Fähigkeit verrechnet wird.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Was ist das für ein Leben, sich in vertrauter Sicherheit zu verkriechen? Nein, danke. Ich will mitten rein ins Getümmel."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658942&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91df20f3-8d35-488a-8c1f-851efa8f11d7\', \'multiverseId\': 658942}, \'multiverseid\': 658942}, {\'name\': \'Kaza, seguidora de la Turbulencia\', \'text\': \'Vuela, prisa.\\n{T}: Te cuesta {X} menos lanzar el siguiente hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro que lances este turno, donde X es la cantidad de Hechiceros que controlas en cuanto esta habilidad se resuelve.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Qué vida es esa, la de ceñirse a lo que conoces y a lo que es seguro? No, gracias. Quiero estar en el centro de la acción".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659208&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8138fe63-05d1-4d3d-8309-f77483f0b5f2\', \'multiverseId\': 659208}, \'multiverseid\': 659208}, {\'name\': \'Kaza, chasseuse du Roulis\', \'text\': "Vol, célérité\\n{T} : Le prochain sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel que vous lancez ce tour-ci coûte {X} de moins à lancer, X étant le nombre de sorciers que vous contrôlez au moment où cette capacité se résout.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« Rester dans ce qui est sûr et familier, ce n\'est pas une vie. Trop peu pour moi. Je préfère être au cœur de l\'action. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659474&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46ce8d86-e9d6-4bfb-98df-b85284ec0d02\', \'multiverseId\': 659474}, \'multiverseid\': 659474}, {\'name\': \'乱動追い、カーザ\', \'text\': \'飛行、速攻\\n{T}：このターンにあなたが次のインスタントやソーサリーである呪文を唱えるためのコストは{X}少なくなる。Ｘはこの能力の解決時にあなたがコントロールしているウィザードの総数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「一体どんな人生なんだろうなあ、良く知ったものに囲まれて安全に暮らすっていうのは。俺は御免だね。事が起きてる真ん中にいさせてほしいね。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659740&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cce5485a-848b-4105-8006-4816c9a12dc6\', \'multiverseId\': 659740}, \'multiverseid\': 659740}, {\'name\': \'狂搅逐客卡札\', \'text\': \'飞行，敏捷\\n{T}：你本回合中施放的下一个瞬间或法术咒语减少{X}来施放，X为于此异能结算时由你操控的法术师数量。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「呆在熟悉又安全的地方混日子算什么名堂？谢了。还是让我去找点刺激吧。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660006&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c9e3903-c0ea-41e0-b1f9-d5f68a68e827\', \'multiverseId\': 660006}, \'multiverseid\': 660006}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kirri, talentierter Spross\', \'text\': \'Andere Pflanzen und Baumhirten, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +2/+0.\\nZu Beginn deiner Hauptphase nach dem Kampf bringst du eine Pflanze-, Baumhirte- oder Länderkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Pflanze, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'„Er ist vielleicht noch ein wenig grün hinter den Ohren, aber er hat Schneid!"\\n—Yuma, stolzer Beschützer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658311&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38f4be99-8743-4cb2-9a1c-fb93110ac4e8\', \'multiverseId\': 658311}, \'multiverseid\': 658311}, {\'name\': \'Kirri, brote talentoso\', \'text\': \'Las otras Plantas y/o Pueblo-arbóreos que controlas obtienen +2/+0.\\nAl comienzo de tu fase principal poscombate, regresa la carta de Planta, Pueblo-arbóreo o tierra objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Druida planta\', \'flavor\': \'"Quizá sea tan solo un brote, pero es más agudo de lo que puede parecer".\\n—Yuma, protector orgulloso\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658315&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'186a0246-bf03-4935-af02-029bfb8f8bb3\', \'multiverseId\': 658315}, \'multiverseid\': 658315}, {\'name\': \'Kirri, bourgeon talentueux\', \'text\': \'Les autres plantes et sylvins que vous contrôlez gagnent +2/+0.\\nAu début de votre deuxième phase principale, renvoyez dans votre main une carte de plante, de sylvin ou de terrain ciblée depuis votre cimetière.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — plante et druide\', \'flavor\': "« Croyez-moi, il est peut-être un peu vert, mais il n\'a pas le foie jaune. »\\n—Yuma, fier protecteur", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658319&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36746dc3-7a53-44ee-97db-080a2b781cb8\', \'multiverseId\': 658319}, \'multiverseid\': 658319}, {\'name\': \'才能あふれる若芽、キリ\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしていて植物やツリーフォークでありこれでないすべては＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。\\nあなたの戦闘後メイン・フェイズの開始時に、あなたの墓地にあり植物やツリーフォークや土地であるカード１枚を対象とする。それをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 植物・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'「まだ少し青いかもしれないが信じてほしい、あれは根無し草とはだいぶかけ離れている。」\\n――誇らしい守護者、ユウマ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658323&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'312b6f61-9482-4a16-b2c7-78279482af76\', \'multiverseId\': 658323}, \'multiverseid\': 658323}, {\'name\': \'天资新芽奇利\', \'text\': \'由你操控的其他植物和树妖得+2/+0。\\n在你战斗后的行动阶段开始时，将目标植物，树妖或地牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 植物／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': \'「他可能还有些稚嫩，但相信我，他绝对很有种。」\\n～高傲护卫毓玛\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658327&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbbbb424-6443-4511-a043-1b207dddeb19\', \'multiverseId\': 658327}, \'multiverseid\': 658327}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kirri, talentierter Spross\', \'text\': \'Andere Pflanzen und Baumhirten, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +2/+0.\\nZu Beginn deiner Hauptphase nach dem Kampf bringst du eine Pflanze-, Baumhirte- oder Länderkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Pflanze, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'„Er ist vielleicht noch ein wenig grün hinter den Ohren, aber er hat Schneid!"\\n—Yuma, stolzer Beschützer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660123&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20f89594-cad7-4c9f-87d7-4dc6bd423b01\', \'multiverseId\': 660123}, \'multiverseid\': 660123}, {\'name\': \'Kirri, bourgeon talentueux\', \'text\': \'Les autres plantes et sylvins que vous contrôlez gagnent +2/+0.\\nAu début de votre deuxième phase principale, renvoyez dans votre main une carte de plante, de sylvin ou de terrain ciblée depuis votre cimetière.\', \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — plante et druide\', \'flavor\': "« Croyez-moi, il est peut-être un peu vert, mais il n\'a pas le foie jaune. »\\n—Yuma, fier protecteur", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660127&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51cefd1d-e1d9-48d9-a650-96435acd3449\', \'multiverseId\': 660127}, \'multiverseid\': 660127}, {\'name\': \'才能あふれる若芽、キリ\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしていて植物やツリーフォークでありこれでないすべては＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。\\nあなたの戦闘後メイン・フェイズの開始時に、あなたの墓地にあり植物やツリーフォークや土地であるカード１枚を対象とする。それをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 植物・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'「まだ少し青いかもしれないが信じてほしい、あれは根無し草とはだいぶかけ離れている。」\\n――誇らしい守護者、ユウマ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660131&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'492d5efd-fb24-48c8-ba17-cc846ab7550e\', \'multiverseId\': 660131}, \'multiverseid\': 660131}, {\'name\': \'天资新芽奇利\', \'text\': \'由你操控的其他植物和树妖得+2/+0。\\n在你战斗后的行动阶段开始时，将目标植物，树妖或地牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 植物／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': \'「他可能还有些稚嫩，但相信我，他绝对很有种。」\\n～高傲护卫毓玛\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660135&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'351aa3fa-bccf-45f7-9c03-f6951c6662bb\', \'multiverseId\': 660135}, \'multiverseid\': 660135}]', '[{\'name\': \'Klingengreif-Prototyp\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn der Klingengreif-Prototyp einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, bestimmt der Spieler ein Nichtland-Permanent, das einer deiner Gegner kontrolliert, als Ziel. Zerstöre das Permanent.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Greif\', \'flavor\': \'Das neue Modell hat eine verbesserte Aerodynamik aber dafür einige Fehler im Zielsystem.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658963&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0209cf0-3a2f-4f85-a806-6640c5c058d4\', \'multiverseId\': 658963}, \'multiverseid\': 658963}, {\'name\': \'Prototipo de garrasgrifo\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que el Prototipo de garrasgrifo haga daño de combate a un jugador, destruye el permanente objetivo que no sea tierra que elija ese jugador y que controla uno de tus oponentes.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Grifo\', \'flavor\': \'El nuevo modelo cuenta con una aerodinámica mejorada, pero tiene algún defecto en el sistema de selección de objetivos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659229&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93a3c495-f0fc-4ff8-ad98-e91641dac84f\', \'multiverseId\': 659229}, \'multiverseid\': 659229}, {\'name\': \'Prototype lamegriffon\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que le Prototype lamegriffon inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, détruisez un permanent non-terrain ciblé choisi par ce joueur qu\'un de vos adversaires contrôle.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact — griffon\', \'flavor\': "L\'aérodynamique du nouveau modèle est meilleure, mais son système de visée comporte quelques bogues.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659495&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1a99fa9-7a9c-4112-9200-ea033e5297d4\', \'multiverseId\': 659495}, \'multiverseid\': 659495}, {\'name\': \'ブレードグリフの試作品\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nブレードグリフの試作品がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、そのプレイヤーが選んだ、あなたの対戦相手がコントロールしていて土地でないパーマネント１つを対象とする。それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — グリフィン\', \'flavor\': \'この新型には空力学的な改良が加わっているが、照準機構に少々問題がある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659761&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a57eefc-a707-4524-a5a5-07aefae15e98\', \'multiverseId\': 659761}, \'multiverseid\': 659761}, {\'name\': \'剑鹫原型\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当剑鹫原型对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，该牌手选择目标非地永久物，且其操控者须为你的对手之一。消灭该永久物。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 — 狮鹫\', \'flavor\': \'新款在空气动力学表现较佳，但瞄准系统方面出现一些小问题。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660027&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d69a2f9b-1007-4346-8d32-b8f640f70587\', \'multiverseId\': 660027}, \'multiverseid\': 660027}]', '[{\'name\': \'Knisternde Zauberschleuderin\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nWenn die Knisternde Zauberschleuderin ins Spiel kommt und falls du sie gewirkt hast, hat der nächste Spontanzauber oder die nächste Hexerei, den bzw. die du in diesem Zug wirkst, Sturm. (Wenn du den Zauberspruch wirkst, kopiere ihn einmal für jeden Zauberspruch, der in diesem Zug vor ihm gewirkt wurde. Du kannst neue Ziele für die Kopien bestimmen.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658377&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1440f1b5-e1a1-4a2f-ae59-716811ec3b19\', \'multiverseId\': 658377}, \'multiverseid\': 658377}, {\'name\': \'Lanzahechizos chispeante\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nCuando la Lanzahechizos chispeante entre al campo de batalla, si la lanzaste, el próximo hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro que lances este turno tiene la habilidad de tormenta. (Cuando lances ese hechizo, cópialo por cada hechizo lanzado antes que él en este turno. Puedes elegir nuevos objetivos para las copias.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658409&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3766b28-aeeb-4cbf-8601-c7e0f08c1a73\', \'multiverseId\': 658409}, \'multiverseid\': 658409}, {\'name\': \'Dégaine-sort crépitante\', \'text\': "Flash\\nQuand la Dégaine-sort crépitante arrive sur le champ de bataille, si vous l\'avez lancée, le prochain sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel que vous lancez ce tour-ci a le déluge. (Quand vous lancez ce sort, copiez-le pour chaque sort lancé avant lui ce tour-ci. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour ces copies.)", \'type\': \'Créature — humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658441&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e599fb4e-d721-4d84-bac4-59a2b06b808d\', \'multiverseId\': 658441}, \'multiverseid\': 658441}, {\'name\': \'弾ける呪文飛ばし\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n弾ける呪文飛ばしが戦場に出たとき、あなたがこれを唱えていた場合、このターンにあなたが唱えてインスタントやソーサリーである次の呪文はストームを持つ。（あなたがその呪文を唱えたとき、これを、このターンにこれより前に唱えられた呪文の数と同じ回数コピーする。それらのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658473&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9a65099-78ea-414b-904b-946bfabf9b84\', \'multiverseId\': 658473}, \'multiverseid\': 658473}, {\'name\': \'爆响施咒师\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n当爆响施咒师进战场时，若它经你施放，则你本回合中施放的下一个瞬间或法术咒语具有风暴异能。（当施放该咒语时，本回合于它之前每施放过一个咒语，便将该咒语复制一次。你可以为每个复制品选择新的目标。）\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658505&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'074600f5-282f-4c4d-8cc1-2cf05980f38d\', \'multiverseId\': 658505}, \'multiverseid\': 658505}]', '[{\'name\': \'Knisternde Zauberschleuderin\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nWenn die Knisternde Zauberschleuderin ins Spiel kommt und falls du sie gewirkt hast, hat der nächste Spontanzauber oder die nächste Hexerei, den bzw. die du in diesem Zug wirkst, Sturm.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660185&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'434034cd-b20e-41b5-8f22-49d0fbcfc262\', \'multiverseId\': 660185}, \'multiverseid\': 660185}, {\'name\': \'Dégaine-sort crépitante\', \'text\': "Flash\\nQuand la Dégaine-sort crépitante arrive sur le champ de bataille, si vous l\'avez lancée, le prochain sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel que vous lancez ce tour-ci a le déluge.", \'type\': \'Créature — humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660217&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45dac1e0-8e2e-4224-ba7b-1770ed5503c2\', \'multiverseId\': 660217}, \'multiverseid\': 660217}, {\'name\': \'弾ける呪文飛ばし\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\n弾ける呪文飛ばしが戦場に出たとき、あなたがこれを唱えていた場合、このターンにあなたが唱えてインスタントやソーサリーである次の呪文はストームを持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660249&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7e89964-f4c8-4663-b455-0aceab980e4b\', \'multiverseId\': 660249}, \'multiverseid\': 660249}, {\'name\': \'爆响施咒师\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n当爆响施咒师进战场时，若它经你施放，则你本回合中施放的下一个瞬间或法术咒语具有风暴异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660281&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77bcaf04-6c1e-4ee8-ace0-a1042e438d4a\', \'multiverseId\': 660281}, \'multiverseid\': 660281}]', '[{\'name\': \'Knochenwüste\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, opfere eine Wüste: Schicke alle Friedhöfe ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Land — Wüste\', \'flavor\': \'Erst wenn nur noch Knochen übrig sind, endet der Fluch des Umherirrens und der ewige Schlaf beginnt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659026&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c17e222-2a7d-46f4-b43e-5529843ef924\', \'multiverseId\': 659026}, \'multiverseid\': 659026}, {\'name\': \'Terrenos de los carroñeros\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrificar un Desierto: Exilia todos los cementerios.\', \'type\': \'Tierra — Desierto\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando ya no exista ni un rastro de carne, la maldición de los errantes terminará. Entonces, los muertos podrán descansar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659292&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4cd96d3-6a58-4a44-95de-edb66bced60b\', \'multiverseId\': 659292}, \'multiverseid\': 659292}, {\'name\': \'Terrains des charognards\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifiez un désert : Exilez tous les cimetières.\', \'type\': \'Terrain — désert\', \'flavor\': "Quand le dernier lambeau de chair se détache, la Malédiction d\'errance est rompue. Le mort peut enfin reposer.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659558&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8fe30e18-a9f7-4247-8c3d-5a0cda68ce5c\', \'multiverseId\': 659558}, \'multiverseid\': 659558}, {\'name\': \'屍肉あさりの地\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{2}, {T}, 砂漠１つを生け贄に捧げる：すべての墓地を追放する。\', \'type\': \'土地 — 砂漠\', \'flavor\': \'肉の最後の一片がなくなると放浪の呪いが解け、死者は安眠を許される。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659824&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f6e5a47-0ef6-4d8f-a7d1-c28ec5581b21\', \'multiverseId\': 659824}, \'multiverseid\': 659824}, {\'name\': \'荒骨咒土\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{2}，{T}，牺牲一个沙漠：放逐所有坟墓场。\', \'type\': \'地 — 沙漠\', \'flavor\': \'随着最后一丝血肉消蚀殆尽，漂浪诅咒终于止歇。亡者遂可安息。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660090&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59b59255-2875-48aa-996c-b0066d92549d\', \'multiverseId\': 660090}, \'multiverseid\': 660090}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kommando-Signalturm\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}, opfere den Kommando-Signalturm: Bringe deinen Commander aus der Kommandozone auf deine Hand.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Einmal habe ich in das Licht geblickt. Nun brennt es für immer vor meinem geistigen Auge und lässt mir keine Ruhe."\\n—Riku der Doppelspiegler\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658989&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3c06f7b-e7ac-4d66-8272-a8306b172113\', \'multiverseId\': 658989}, \'multiverseid\': 658989}, {\'name\': \'Faro del dominio\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{T}, sacrificar el Faro del dominio: Pon a tu comandante en tu mano desde la zona de mando.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"Miré fijamente a esa luz una vez. Ahora arde en mi mente y me niega la paz para siempre".\\n—Riku de los Dos Reflejos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659255&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1eb2c330-dfd7-4a68-9e8d-078a25c07fac\', \'multiverseId\': 659255}, \'multiverseid\': 659255}, {\'name\': \'Flambeau du Commandement\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T}, sacrifiez le Flambeau du Commandement : Mettez votre commandant dans votre main depuis la zone de commandement.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "« J\'ai contemplé cette lumière une fois. Elle brûle désormais dans mon esprit, me privant à jamais de repos. »\\n—Riku aux deux reflets", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659521&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c68a0d1e-f27e-4a86-ab1c-2cd7db359cc3\', \'multiverseId\': 659521}, \'multiverseid\': 659521}, {\'name\': \'統率の灯台\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}, 統率の灯台を生け贄に捧げる：統率領域にあるあなたの統率者をあなたの手札に加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「私はあの光を一度だけ見つめた。今ではそれが心の中に焼きついており、私は永遠に安息を得ることができない。」\\n――二つ反射のリクー\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659787&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e24e7cf-1dd3-4797-8734-925e8f5d9b88\', \'multiverseId\': 659787}, \'multiverseid\': 659787}, {\'name\': \'指挥信标\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{T}，牺牲指挥信标：将你的指挥官从统帅区置于你手上。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'「我只曾一度凝视这光芒。如今其亮光耀彻我心灵，令我永生不得安息。」\\n～复影黎库\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660053&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'767ed935-38ca-4acb-b100-577da1129f04\', \'multiverseId\': 660053}, \'multiverseid\': 660053}]', '[{\'name\': \'Kribbeln\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments kannst du zwei Karten millen. (Du kannst die obersten zwei Karten deiner Bibliothek auf deinen Friedhof legen.)\\nImmer wenn zum ersten Mal in einem Zug eine oder mehrere Länderkarten von irgendwoher auf deinen Friedhof gelegt werden, erzeuge einen 1/1 grünen Insekten-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658899&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0b97b4a-0563-4458-8bf9-508157b84080\', \'multiverseId\': 658899}, \'multiverseid\': 658899}, {\'name\': \'Sensación hormigueante\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, puedes moler dos cartas. (Puedes poner las dos primeras cartas de tu biblioteca en tu cementerio.)\\nSiempre que una o más cartas de tierra vayan a tu cementerio desde cualquier parte por primera vez cada turno, crea una ficha de criatura Insecto verde 1/1.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659165&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85364f8b-d172-4722-90e3-628da6320d7e\', \'multiverseId\': 659165}, \'multiverseid\': 659165}, {\'name\': \'Sensation rampante\', \'text\': "Au début de votre entretien, vous pouvez meuler deux cartes. (Vous pouvez mettre les deux cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque dans votre cimetière.)\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'au moins une carte de terrain est mise dans votre cimetière d\'où qu\'elle vienne pour la première fois à chaque tour, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 verte Insecte.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659431&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66902387-dbfd-43ce-bfd6-39bd69d70ae8\', \'multiverseId\': 659431}, \'multiverseid\': 659431}, {\'name\': \'蟻走感\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、カード２枚を切削してもよい。（あなたのライブラリーの一番にあるカード２枚をあなたの墓地に置いてもよい。）\\n各ターン内で初めて１枚以上の土地・カードがいずこかからあなたの墓地に置かれるたび、緑の１/１の昆虫・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659697&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a0d230d-32af-44b1-b326-e25404c7fc77\', \'multiverseId\': 659697}, \'multiverseid\': 659697}, {\'name\': \'蠕爬异感\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，你可以磨两张牌。（你可以将你牌库顶的两张牌置入你的坟墓场。）\\n每当每回合首度有一张或数张地牌从任何区域进入你的坟墓场时，派出一个1/1绿色昆虫衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659963&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa958e2f-c338-4022-89dc-b562356aab7f\', \'multiverseId\': 659963}, \'multiverseid\': 659963}]', '[{\'name\': \'Krosas Waldrand\', \'text\': \'Krosas Waldrand kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, opfere Krosas Waldrand: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Wald- und einer Ebene-Karte, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659014&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23377b73-2e01-4937-a464-bfb05b110226\', \'multiverseId\': 659014}, \'multiverseid\': 659014}, {\'name\': \'Borde de Krosa\', \'text\': \'El Borde de Krosa entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrificar el Borde de Krosa: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de Bosque y una carta de Llanura, ponlas en el campo de batalla giradas y luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659280&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca7d5dd8-b5e7-4c2e-9276-8e8b8396893f\', \'multiverseId\': 659280}, \'multiverseid\': 659280}, {\'name\': \'Orée de la Krosia\', \'text\': "L\'Orée de la Krosia arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, sacrifiez l\'Orée de la Krosia : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de forêt et une carte de plaine, mettez-les sur le champ de bataille engagées, puis mélangez.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659546&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ad9cbd0-80d3-4c76-858f-7d37a5ee653c\', \'multiverseId\': 659546}, \'multiverseid\': 659546}, {\'name\': \'クローサの境界\', \'text\': \'クローサの境界はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{2}, {T}, クローサの境界を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから森・カード１枚と平地・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659812&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'670a3636-bc61-4cbb-8d69-7af40279ec2d\', \'multiverseId\': 659812}, \'multiverseid\': 659812}, {\'name\': \'克洛萨边陲\', \'text\': \'克洛萨边陲须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{C}。\\n{2}，{T}，牺牲克洛萨边陲：从你牌库中搜寻一张树林牌和一张平原牌，将它们横置放进战场，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660078&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d317f25-1320-48da-a878-18ac35323a8d\', \'multiverseId\': 660078}, \'multiverseid\': 660078}]', "[{'name': 'Königin Marchesa', 'text': 'Todesberührung, Eile\\nWenn Königin Marchesa ins Spiel kommt, wirst du zum Monarchen.\\nZu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments und falls ein Gegner der Monarch ist, erzeuge einen 1/1 schwarzen Assassine-Kreaturenspielstein mit Todesberührung und Eile.', 'type': 'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Assassine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658949&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '44d9ec97-f81c-4344-a79d-c5c63f7573d2', 'multiverseId': 658949}, 'multiverseid': 658949}, {'name': 'La reina Marquesa', 'text': 'Toque mortal, prisa.\\nCuando La reina Marquesa entre al campo de batalla, te conviertes en el monarca.\\nAl comienzo de tu mantenimiento, si un oponente es el monarca, crea una ficha de criatura Asesino negra 1/1 con las habilidades de toque mortal y prisa.', 'type': 'Criatura legendaria — Asesino humano', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659215&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '87e4e842-ea41-4719-ab41-f076d14f932e', 'multiverseId': 659215}, 'multiverseid': 659215}, {'name': 'Reine Marchesa', 'text': 'Contact mortel, célérité\\nQuand la Reine Marchesa arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous devenez le monarque.\\nAu début de votre entretien, si un adversaire est le monarque, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 noire Assassin avec le contact mortel et la célérité.', 'type': 'Créature légendaire — humain et assassin', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659481&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '415d21f1-9986-4cbc-9646-719d16686a31', 'multiverseId': 659481}, 'multiverseid': 659481}, {'name': 'マルチェッサ女王', 'text': '接死、速攻\\nマルチェッサ女王が戦場に出たとき、あなたが統治者になる。\\nあなたのアップキープの開始時に、対戦相手が統治者である場合、接死と速攻を持つ黒の１/１の暗殺者・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。', 'type': '伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・暗殺者', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659747&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8f915ea2-a9b4-4c84-aee0-55668434d879', 'multiverseId': 659747}, 'multiverseid': 659747}, {'name': '玛切莎女王', 'text': '死触，敏捷\\n当玛切莎女王进战场时，你成为君主。\\n在你的维持开始时，若任一对手是君主，则你派出一个1/1黑色，具死触与敏捷异能的杀手衍生生物。', 'type': '传奇生物 — 人类／杀手', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660013&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9467289a-5609-4a14-83f1-46d6fb8e9b59', 'multiverseId': 660013}, 'multiverseid': 660013}]", '[{\'name\': \'Laden und entsichern\', \'text\': \'Ziehe eine Karte, dann ziehe für jeden anderen Spontanzauber und jede andere Hexerei, den bzw. die du in diesem Zug gewirkt hast, eine Karte.\\nAushecken {3}{U} (Du kannst {3}{U} bezahlen und diese Karte aus deiner Hand ins Exil schicken. Wirke sie in einem späteren Zug als Hexerei, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Spiele Aushecken wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Immer ein bisschen Extra-Donner mitbringen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658367&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b0c25c9-ee52-42ae-b36d-0cdfa7b86ed3\', \'multiverseId\': 658367}, \'multiverseid\': 658367}, {\'name\': \'Cargar el arma\', \'text\': \'Roba una carta y luego roba una carta por cada otro hechizo de instantáneo y de conjuro que hayas lanzado este turno.\\nTramar {3}{U}. (Puedes pagar {3}{U} y exiliar esta carta de tu mano. Lánzala como un conjuro en un turno posterior sin pagar su coste de maná. Activa la habilidad de tramar solo como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Lleva siempre encima un poco de trueno de más".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658399&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6250260-b7a0-48f1-8f28-7fbaadd07425\', \'multiverseId\': 658399}, \'multiverseid\': 658399}, {\'name\': "Prête à l\'attaque", \'text\': "Piochez une carte, puis piochez une carte pour chaque autre sort d\'éphémère et de rituel que vous avez lancé ce tour-ci.\\nComplot {3}{U} (Vous pouvez payer {3}{U} et exiler cette carte depuis votre main. Lancez-la comme un rituel pendant un autre tour sans payer son coût de mana. Ne complotez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Ayez toujours un éclair supplémentaire sous le coude. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658431&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75ca157b-722a-4013-8b3d-a69f530ab09f\', \'multiverseId\': 658431}, \'multiverseid\': 658431}, {\'name\': \'射撃準備\', \'text\': \'カード１枚を引く。その後、このターンにあなたが唱えてインスタントやソーサリーでありこれでない呪文１つにつき１枚のカードを引く。\\n計画{3}{U}{U}を支払って、あなたの手札にあるこのカードを追放してもよい。後のターンに、これをソーサリーとして、マナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。計画はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「いつでも少し多めのサンダーを携えておくように。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658463&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aeeabf13-ebb2-4fde-b744-ff0c874a286c\', \'multiverseId\': 658463}, \'multiverseid\': 658463}, {\'name\': \'装填上膛\', \'text\': \'抓一张牌，然后你本回合中每施放过一个其他瞬间或法术咒语，便抓一张牌。\\n设谋{3}{U}（你可以支付{3}{U}并从你手上放逐此牌。过了该回合后，便可于法术时机施放之，且不需支付其法术力费用。只能于法术时机设谋。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「每次都多带些光雷总没错。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658495&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4c3e8f8-e1b2-4ccb-bfbd-a3d3bb2a3464\', \'multiverseId\': 658495}, \'multiverseid\': 658495}]', '[{\'name\': \'Laden und entsichern\', \'text\': \'Ziehe eine Karte, dann ziehe für jeden anderen Spontanzauber und jede andere Hexerei, den bzw. die du in diesem Zug gewirkt hast, eine Karte.\\nAushecken {3}{U}\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Immer ein bisschen Extra-Donner mitbringen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660175&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07b2ec9e-f253-4a18-bd7e-5f23a4269fe7\', \'multiverseId\': 660175}, \'multiverseid\': 660175}, {\'name\': "Prête à l\'attaque", \'text\': "Piochez une carte, puis piochez une carte pour chaque autre sort d\'éphémère et de rituel que vous avez lancé ce tour-ci.\\nComplot {3}{U}", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Ayez toujours un éclair supplémentaire sous le coude. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660207&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'320c690d-1924-4048-9fa3-52df48c77e4f\', \'multiverseId\': 660207}, \'multiverseid\': 660207}, {\'name\': \'射撃準備\', \'text\': \'カード１枚を引く。その後、このターンにあなたが唱えてインスタントやソーサリーでありこれでない呪文１つにつき１枚のカードを引く。\\n計画{3}{U}\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「いつでも少し多めのサンダーを携えておくように。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660239&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e199dd8-3ac4-4518-b662-77f3e321a9f0\', \'multiverseId\': 660239}, \'multiverseid\': 660239}, {\'name\': \'装填上膛\', \'text\': \'抓一张牌，然后你本回合中每施放过一个其他瞬间或法术咒语，便抓一张牌。\\n设谋{3}{U}\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「每次都多带些光雷总没错。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660271&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e7d7dd9-8fa9-4024-84ce-b1625a53a398\', \'multiverseId\': 660271}, \'multiverseid\': 660271}]', '[{\'name\': \'Laurine die Täuscherin\', \'text\': \'Partner von Kamber der Plünderin (Wenn diese Kreatur ins Spiel kommt, kann ein Spieler deiner Wahl Kamber aus seiner Bibliothek auf seine Hand nehmen und danach mischen.)\\nErstschlag\\n{2}, opfere ein Artefakt oder eine Kreatur: Stachle eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an. (Bis zu deinem nächsten Zug greift die Kreatur in jedem Kampf an, falls möglich, und greift einen anderen Spieler als dich an, falls möglich.)\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Räuber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658882&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8114ead-614a-4fc9-bef2-30e63119caa6\', \'multiverseId\': 658882}, \'multiverseid\': 658882}, {\'name\': \'Laurine, la Distracción\', \'text\': \'Camarada de Kamber, la Saqueadora. (Cuando esta criatura entre al campo de batalla, el jugador objetivo puede poner a Kamber en su mano desde su biblioteca y luego barajar.)\\nDaña primero.\\n{2}, sacrificar un artefacto o una criatura: Incita a la criatura objetivo. (Hasta tu próximo turno, esa criatura ataca cada combate si puede y ataca a un jugador que no seas tú si puede.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Bribón humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659148&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4af173d5-ca6b-4bc8-aa53-8b1a942ab636\', \'multiverseId\': 659148}, \'multiverseid\': 659148}, {\'name\': \'Laurine, la diversion\', \'text\': "Partenariat avec Kamber, la saccageuse (Quand cette créature arrive sur le champ de bataille, un joueur ciblé peut mettre Kamber dans sa main depuis sa bibliothèque, puis mélanger.)\\nInitiative\\n{2}, sacrifiez un artefact ou une créature : Incitez une créature ciblée. (Jusqu\'à votre prochain tour, cette créature attaque à chaque combat si possible et attaque un joueur autre que vous si possible.)", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — humain et gredin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659414&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57cc67ae-a824-4a43-a53f-176737f2a2fc\', \'multiverseId\': 659414}, \'multiverseid\': 659414}, {\'name\': \'陽動する者、ロリーン\', \'text\': \'略奪者、カンバーとの共闘（このクリーチャーが戦場に出たとき、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは「自分のライブラリーから略奪者、カンバーを自分の手札に加える。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。」を選んでもよい。）\\n先制攻撃\\n{2}, アーティファクトやクリーチャーである１つを生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを使嗾する。（次のあなたのターンまで、そのクリーチャーは、各戦闘で可能なら攻撃し、可能ならあなたでないプレイヤーを攻撃する。）\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・ならず者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659680&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2b12b8b-25a4-4bed-8228-0a8ceab82565\', \'multiverseId\': 659680}, \'multiverseid\': 659680}, {\'name\': \'诱敌手劳琳\', \'text\': \'与劫掠者康芭拍档（当此生物进战场时，目标牌手可以将康芭从其牌库置于其手上，然后洗牌。）\\n先攻\\n{2}，牺牲一个神器或生物：煽惑目标生物。（直到你的下一个回合，该生物每次战斗若能攻击，则必须攻击，且若能攻击除你以外的牌手，则必须如此作。）\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 人类／浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659946&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71909d74-44d7-43e6-81a6-63521be3ca67\', \'multiverseId\': 659946}, \'multiverseid\': 659946}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lebensversicherung\', \'text\': \'Abnötigen (Immer wenn du einen Zauberspruch wirkst, kannst du {W/B} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, verliert jeder Gegner 1 Lebenspunkt und du erhältst entsprechend viele Lebenspunkte dazu.)\\nImmer wenn eine Nichtspielsteinkreatur stirbt, verlierst du 1 Lebenspunkt und erzeugst einen Schatz-Spielstein.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Alles Geld der Welt kann einen Herzschlag nicht zurückkaufen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658943&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41c69c86-40ab-4664-94a3-54c7918058f8\', \'multiverseId\': 658943}, \'multiverseid\': 658943}, {\'name\': \'Seguro de vida\', \'text\': \'Extorsionar. (Siempre que lances un hechizo, puedes pagar {W/B}. Si lo haces, cada oponente pierde 1 vida y tú ganas esa cantidad de vidas.)\\nSiempre que una criatura que no sea ficha muera, pierdes 1 vida y creas una ficha de Tesoro.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'Todo el dinero del mundo no te servirá para recuperar el pulso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659209&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a66fb98-177a-4783-b866-70c82ec5702c\', \'multiverseId\': 659209}, \'multiverseid\': 659209}, {\'name\': \'Assurance-vie\', \'text\': "Extorsion (À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort, vous pouvez payer {W/B}. Si vous faites ainsi, chaque adversaire perd 1 point de vie et vous gagnez autant de points de vie.)\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature non-jeton meurt, vous perdez 1 point de vie et vous créez un jeton Trésor.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "Tout l\'argent du monde ne vous achètera pas un pouls.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659475&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82ca2900-230f-4bdc-a25c-010f1f523ce1\', \'multiverseId\': 659475}, \'multiverseid\': 659475}, {\'name\': \'生命保険\', \'text\': \'強請（あなたが呪文１つを唱えるたび、{W/B}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、各対戦相手はそれぞれ１点のライフを失い、あなたはその点数分のライフを得る。）\\nトークンでないクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、あなたは１点のライフを失い宝物・トークン１つを生成する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'世界中の金すべてを積んだとしても鼓動は買い戻せない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659741&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'430e86e3-8034-4478-b092-47c39ef33987\', \'multiverseId\': 659741}, \'multiverseid\': 659741}, {\'name\': \'生命保险\', \'text\': \'敲诈（每当你施放咒语时，你可以支付{W/B}。若你如此作，则每位对手各失去1点生命，且你获得等量的生命。）\\n每当一个非衍生物的生物死去时，你失去1点生命并派出一个珍宝衍生物。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'举世财富也买不回心跳。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660007&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6894a539-cb2a-44ae-ac04-1a9a8009b825\', \'multiverseId\': 660007}, \'multiverseid\': 660007}]', '[{\'name\': \'Leylinien-Wünschelrute\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Du millst eine Karte. Du kannst eine Spontanzauber- oder Hexereikarte, die auf diese Weise gemillt wurde, auf deine Hand nehmen.\\nTappe eine ungetappte legendäre Kreatur, die du kontrollierst: Enttappe die Leylinien-Wünschelrute.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Natürlich funktioniert sie. Was sie findet? Das ist eine Überraschung für einen glücklichen Käufer wie Sie."\\n—Rutstein der Ehrliche\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658391&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e758ce6-5f91-4b81-9091-373a76510374\', \'multiverseId\': 658391}, \'multiverseid\': 658391}, {\'name\': \'Vara de zahorí de líneas místicas\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Muele una carta. Puedes poner en tu mano una carta de instantáneo o de conjuro de entre las cartas molidas de esta manera.\\nGirar una criatura legendaria enderezada que controlas: Endereza la Vara de zahorí de líneas místicas.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Claro que funciona. ¿Que qué busca? Eso es una sorpresa para su afortunado comprador".\\n—Honesto Rutstein\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658423&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2973f7d-5fa1-437b-90a7-9dd24b81f047\', \'multiverseId\': 658423}, \'multiverseid\': 658423}, {\'name\': \'Baguette de sourcier à lignes ley\', \'text\': "{1}, {T} : Meulez une carte. Vous pouvez mettre dans votre main une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel meulée de cette manière.\\nEngagez une créature légendaire dégagée que vous contrôlez : Dégagez la Baguette de sourcier à lignes ley.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Bien sûr qu\'elle fonctionne. Ce qu\'elle trouve ? C\'est une surprise pour l\'heureux acheteur que vous êtes. »\\n—Rutstein l\'honnête", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658455&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e931c5a3-a5b7-4523-9c80-cbbec9aa1519\', \'multiverseId\': 658455}, \'multiverseid\': 658455}, {\'name\': \'力線の探知機\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}：カード１枚を切削する。これにより切削したカードの中から、インスタントやソーサリーであるカード１枚をあなたの手札に加えてもよい。\\nあなたがコントロールしていてアンタップ状態である伝説のクリーチャー１体をタップする：力線の探知機をアンタップする。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「もちろん、ちゃんと動くとも。何が見つかるかって？それはな、運よく買えたあんたのような者だけのお楽しみだ。」\\n――正直者のラトスタイン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658487&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da5d5ff8-356b-414c-a608-b963789d8b4c\', \'multiverseId\': 658487}, \'multiverseid\': 658487}, {\'name\': \'地脉探寻械\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}：磨一张牌。你可以将以此法磨掉的一张瞬间或法术牌置于你手上。\\n横置一个由你操控且未横置的传奇生物：重置地脉探寻械。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「它当然有用。你问它能找到什么？这种惊喜就留给像你这样幸运的顾客来发现吧。」\\n～诚实的鲁斯登\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658519&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58d94104-7af7-4440-8108-c4ea970dbdd2\', \'multiverseId\': 658519}, \'multiverseid\': 658519}]', '[{\'name\': \'Leylinien-Wünschelrute\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Du millst eine Karte. Du kannst eine Spontanzauber- oder Hexereikarte, die auf diese Weise gemillt wurde, auf deine Hand nehmen.\\nTappe eine ungetappte legendäre Kreatur, die du kontrollierst: Enttappe die Leylinien-Wünschelrute.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Natürlich funktioniert sie. Was sie findet? Das ist eine Überraschung für einen glücklichen Käufer wie Sie."\\n—Rutstein der Ehrliche\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660199&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba494e02-8583-4426-8069-f37fd55d4f1c\', \'multiverseId\': 660199}, \'multiverseid\': 660199}, {\'name\': \'Baguette de sourcier à lignes ley\', \'text\': "{1}, {T} : Meulez une carte. Vous pouvez mettre dans votre main une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel meulée de cette manière.\\nEngagez une créature légendaire dégagée que vous contrôlez : Dégagez la Baguette de sourcier à lignes ley.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Bien sûr qu\'elle fonctionne. Ce qu\'elle trouve ? C\'est une surprise pour l\'heureux acheteur que vous êtes. »\\n—Rutstein l\'honnête", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660231&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a3bc58d-6acf-4044-976d-0b6eb2e7758f\', \'multiverseId\': 660231}, \'multiverseid\': 660231}, {\'name\': \'力線の探知機\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}：カード１枚を切削する。これにより切削したカードの中から、インスタントやソーサリーであるカード１枚をあなたの手札に加えてもよい。\\nあなたがコントロールしていてアンタップ状態である伝説のクリーチャー１体をタップする：力線の探知機をアンタップする。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「もちろん、ちゃんと動くとも。何が見つかるかって？それはな、運よく買えたあんたのような者だけのお楽しみだ。」\\n――正直者のラトスタイン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660263&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d60801c-8c10-4a02-b343-ce43994054a5\', \'multiverseId\': 660263}, \'multiverseid\': 660263}, {\'name\': \'地脉探寻械\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}：磨一张牌。你可以将以此法磨掉的一张瞬间或法术牌置于你手上。\\n横置一个由你操控且未横置的传奇生物：重置地脉探寻械。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「它当然有用。你问它能找到什么？这种惊喜就留给像你这样幸运的顾客来发现吧。」\\n～诚实的鲁斯登\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660295&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67c7ce4c-4563-4998-a91e-e19b2ea7d512\', \'multiverseId\': 660295}, \'multiverseid\': 660295}]', '[{\'name\': \'Llanowar-Ödland\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B} oder {G}. Das Llanowar-Ödland fügt dir 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Detonation des Sylex bedeutete nicht nur das Ende des Krieges, sondern auch das Ende von Dominaria, wie die meisten es kannten."\\n—Der Artefakt-Krieg\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659015&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5a91702-cb81-4b66-adf1-dd4d0b043d3c\', \'multiverseId\': 659015}, \'multiverseid\': 659015}, {\'name\': \'Yermos de Llanowar\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{T}: Agrega {B} o {G}. Los Yermos de Llanowar te hacen 1 punto de daño.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"La explosión del sylex no solo marcó el final de la guerra, sino también el de Dominaria como la conocían casi todos".\\n—La Guerra de las Antigüedades\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659281&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7fa9ca68-fbe4-49cb-ae79-968a50c6daba\', \'multiverseId\': 659281}, \'multiverseid\': 659281}, {\'name\': \'Landes de Llanowar\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B} ou {G}. Les Landes de Llanowar vous infligent 1 blessure.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "L\'explosion du Sylex marqua non seulement la fin de la guerre, mais aussi la fin de Dominaria telle qu\'on l\'avait connue. »\\n—La Guerre des Antiquités", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659547&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ccb78949-81ca-4365-bdd7-a1f82725d7bc\', \'multiverseId\': 659547}, \'multiverseid\': 659547}, {\'name\': \'ラノワールの荒原\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}：{B}か{G}を加える。ラノワールの荒原はあなたに１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「酒杯の爆発が告げたのは戦争の終わりだけではなかった。衆知の通り、それはドミナリアの終わりも告げたのだった。」\\n――「アンティキティー戦争」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659813&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfb91159-4693-4d9f-86fb-eb9c54db2e8b\', \'multiverseId\': 659813}, \'multiverseid\': 659813}, {\'name\': \'罗堰荒野\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{T}：加{B}或{G}。罗堰荒野对你造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'「同兆震爆不仅标志着战事终结，更标志着诸人所熟知的多明纳里亚已然作古。」\\n～《古文明之战》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660079&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e17e62f7-5cbb-445b-9e5f-9a79d111f559\', \'multiverseId\': 660079}, \'multiverseid\': 660079}]', '[{\'name\': \'Lohnende Ausfahrt\', \'text\': \'Wühlen (Mit jeder Karte, die du aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil schickst, während du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, bezahlst du {1} seiner Kosten.)\\nZiehe drei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Zahllose Freuden treiben auf der Oberfläche, doch darunter strömen dunkle Machenschaften.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658830&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5879317-b8d7-480d-8922-f7661fa433c8\', \'multiverseId\': 658830}, \'multiverseid\': 658830}, {\'name\': \'Crucero del tesoro\', \'text\': \'Excavar. (Cada carta que exilies de tu cementerio al lanzar este hechizo cuenta como un pago de {1}.)\\nRoba tres cartas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Incontables maravillas flotan en la superficie; mientras, en las profundidades se urden oscuras maquinaciones.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659096&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'16d6688b-110c-479a-8bce-7de64d0bb227\', \'multiverseId\': 659096}, \'multiverseid\': 659096}, {\'name\': \'Fortune des mers\', \'text\': \'Fouille (Chaque carte que vous exilez depuis votre cimetière en lançant ce sort paie {1}.)\\nPiochez trois cartes.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Tandis que d\'innombrables délices dérivent à la surface, de sombres machinations se cachent dans les profondeurs.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659362&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ea98c13-1e5d-44a0-926d-7b4e70f25817\', \'multiverseId\': 659362}, \'multiverseid\': 659362}, {\'name\': \'宝船の巡航\', \'text\': \'探査（この呪文を唱える段階であなたの墓地から追放した各カードはそれぞれ{1}を支払う。）\\nカード３枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'無数の歓楽が水面上に浮かぶ間も、暗き陰謀が水面下で展開されている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659628&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce328f40-9aee-490e-bc2a-ee96e35f0fe0\', \'multiverseId\': 659628}, \'multiverseid\': 659628}, {\'name\': \'宝船巡游\', \'text\': \'掘穴（你于施放此咒语时每从你坟墓场中放逐一张牌，就能为此咒语支付{1}。）\\n抓三张牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'金玉漂流在外，阴谋勾画其间。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659894&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97bfe14e-97d3-433b-8a1b-be152752cf8e\', \'multiverseId\': 659894}, \'multiverseid\': 659894}]', '[{\'name\': \'Magmatische Einsicht\', \'text\': \'Wirf als zusätzliche Kosten, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken, eine Länderkarte ab.\\nZiehe zwei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Der wichtigste Grundsatz von Purphoros lautet, dass man zerstören muss, um zu erschaffen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658883&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f478be2e-e4a4-4e25-9123-597cecfa6f2d\', \'multiverseId\': 658883}, \'multiverseid\': 658883}, {\'name\': \'Perspicacia de magma\', \'text\': \'Como coste adicional para lanzar este hechizo, descarta una carta de tierra.\\nRoba dos cartas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Entre los principios de Purforos destaca el que reza que uno debe destruir para poder crear.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659149&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c305e155-ec58-4587-90a1-958ed989a79a\', \'multiverseId\': 659149}, \'multiverseid\': 659149}, {\'name\': \'Perspicacité magmatique\', \'text\': "En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer ce sort, défaussez-vous d\'une carte de terrain.\\nPiochez deux cartes.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "L\'un des grands principes de Purphoros est qu\'il faut détruire pour créer.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659415&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39280090-8b03-4493-b66f-e0e6976a276e\', \'multiverseId\': 659415}, \'multiverseid\': 659415}, {\'name\': \'マグマの洞察力\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるための追加コストとして、土地・カード１枚を捨てる。\\nカード２枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'創造のためには破壊が必要とは、パーフォロスの主要な教義である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659681&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5830a1fc-d14d-4ac9-b96f-9d40747049b4\', \'multiverseId\': 659681}, \'multiverseid\': 659681}, {\'name\': \'岩浆洞察\', \'text\': \'弃一张地牌，以作为施放此咒语的额外费用。\\n抓两张牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'普罗烽斯的教义中最主要的一条：毁灭才能创造。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659947&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43d8ea63-ac0e-4831-acb4-c29852219689\', \'multiverseId\': 659947}, \'multiverseid\': 659947}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mari die Auftragsmörderin\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Kreatur, die ein Gegner kontrolliert, stirbt, schicke sie mit einer Attentatsmarke ins Exil.\\nAssassinen, Räuber und Söldner, die du kontrollierst, haben Todesberührung und „Immer wenn diese Kreatur einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, kannst du eine Attentatsmarke von einer Karte im Exil entfernen, die der Spieler besitzt. Falls du dies tust, ziehe eine Karte und erzeuge zwei Schatz-Spielsteine."\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Vampir, Assassine\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658848&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1bfc4575-3606-4505-b6d7-4b415c5f9672\', \'multiverseId\': 658848}, \'multiverseid\': 658848}, {\'name\': \'Mari, la Pluma Asesina\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura que controla un oponente muera, exíliala con un contador de asesinato sobre ella.\\nLos Asesinos, Mercenarios y Bribones que controlas tienen la habilidad de toque mortal y "Siempre que esta criatura haga daño de combate a un jugador, puedes remover un contador de asesinato de una carta en el exilio de la que ese jugador es propietario. Si lo haces, roba una carta y crea dos fichas de Tesoro".\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Asesino vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659114&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9cc16dc-86c0-4856-b751-c9de770db56c\', \'multiverseId\': 659114}, \'multiverseid\': 659114}, {\'name\': \'Mari, la plume tueuse\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature qu\'un adversaire contrôle meurt, exilez-la avec un marqueur « contrat » sur elle.\\nLes assassins, les mercenaires et les gredins que vous contrôlez ont le contact mortel et « À chaque fois que cette créature inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, vous pouvez retirer un marqueur « contrat » d\'une carte que ce joueur possède en exil. Si vous faites ainsi, piochez une carte et créez deux jetons Trésor. »", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — vampire et assassin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659380&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e814039d-a89c-47ac-9d56-fe3efdd742e2\', \'multiverseId\': 659380}, \'multiverseid\': 659380}, {\'name\': \'殺しの羽ペン、マリ\', \'text\': \'対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、それを殺人カウンター１個が置かれた状態で追放する。\\nあなたがコントロールしていて暗殺者や傭兵やならず者であるすべては、接死と「このクリーチャーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたは追放領域にありそのプレイヤーがオーナーであるカード１枚の上から殺人カウンター１個を取り除いてもよい。そうしたなら、カード１枚を引き、宝物・トークン２つを生成する。」を持つ。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 吸血鬼・暗殺者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659646&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8465ea96-51f5-48dd-96bd-8760d389ddab\', \'multiverseId\': 659646}, \'multiverseid\': 659646}, {\'name\': \'夺命笔锋玛丽\', \'text\': \'每当一个由对手操控的生物死去时，将它放逐且上面有一个灭口指示物。\\n由你操控的杀手、佣兵和浪客具有死触与「每当此生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，你可以从放逐区中由该牌手拥有的牌上移去一个灭口指示物。若你如此作，则抓一张牌并派出两个珍宝衍生物。」\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 吸血鬼／杀手\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659912&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'102763b6-3efd-43b2-8703-c2f02d63f07f\', \'multiverseId\': 659912}, \'multiverseid\': 659912}]', '[{\'name\': \'Massakermädel\', \'text\': \'Bedrohlich\\nWenn das Massakermädel ins Spiel kommt, erhält jede andere Kreatur -1/-1 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Immer wenn eine Kreatur in diesem Zug stirbt, erhält jede Kreatur außer dem Massakermädel -1/-1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Assassine\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658850&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f742312b-9c09-45f5-a156-54334c9e0005\', \'multiverseId\': 658850}, \'multiverseid\': 658850}, {\'name\': \'La Niña Masacre\', \'text\': \'Amenaza.\\nCuando La Niña Masacre entre al campo de batalla, cada otra criatura obtiene -1/-1 hasta el final del turno. Siempre que una criatura muera este turno, cada criatura que no sea La Niña Masacre obtiene -1/-1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Asesino humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659116&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de1205dd-11d8-4003-b8d9-cc43b4f32058\', \'multiverseId\': 659116}, \'multiverseid\': 659116}, {\'name\': \'La Massacreuse\', \'text\': "Menace\\nQuand La Massacreuse arrive sur le champ de bataille, chaque autre créature gagne -1/-1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. À chaque fois qu\'une créature meurt ce tour-ci, chaque créature autre que La Massacreuse gagne -1/-1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — humain et assassin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659382&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8210d50c-804e-4de5-b5ad-6e6f968c8ef1\', \'multiverseId\': 659382}, \'multiverseid\': 659382}, {\'name\': \'虐殺少女\', \'text\': \'威迫\\n虐殺少女が戦場に出たとき、ターン終了時まで、これでないすべてのクリーチャーは－１/－１の修整を受ける。このターン、クリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、ターン終了時まで、虐殺少女でないすべてのクリーチャーは－１/－１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・暗殺者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659648&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22a05c7b-2395-401f-95f3-ce35d0b7bf5d\', \'multiverseId\': 659648}, \'multiverseid\': 659648}, {\'name\': \'杀戮女郎\', \'text\': \'威慑\\n当杀戮女郎进战场时，每个其他生物各得-1/-1直到回合结束。本回合中，每当一个生物死去时，杀戮女郎以外的每个生物各得-1/-1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 人类／杀手\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659914&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'762e0885-2d80-406a-8493-6ed08061d19e\', \'multiverseId\': 659914}, \'multiverseid\': 659914}]', '[{\'name\': \'Massenmeuterei\', \'text\': \'Übernimm von jedem Gegner bis zum Ende des Zuges die Kontrolle über bis zu eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, die jener Spieler kontrolliert. Enttappe sie. Sie erhalten Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Und was sagt ihr dazu, meine getreuen Berater …? Meine Berater?"\\n—Edra, Meervolk-Souverän\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658884&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1448b9e5-778d-41c8-b5f6-41bdcf7026ec\', \'multiverseId\': 658884}, \'multiverseid\': 658884}, {\'name\': \'Sedición masiva\', \'text\': \'Por cada oponente, gana el control de hasta una criatura objetivo que controla ese jugador hasta el final del turno. Endereza esas criaturas. Ganan la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Qué me recomiendan, mis más leales consejeros?... ¿Consejeros?".\\n—Edra, soberano tritón\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659150&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4bd20022-55c4-4638-b880-4ccf85f7e5a2\', \'multiverseId\': 659150}, \'multiverseid\': 659150}, {\'name\': \'Mutinerie de masse\', \'text\': "Pour chaque adversaire, acquérez le contrôle de jusqu\'à une créature ciblée que ce joueur contrôle jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Dégagez ces créatures. Elles acquièrent la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Qu\'en dites-vous, mes fidèles conseillers ? ... Conseillers ? »\\n—Edra, souveraine ondine", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659416&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c376f0c4-3027-4a2b-93a4-6c32fe74d81e\', \'multiverseId\': 659416}, \'multiverseid\': 659416}, {\'name\': \'大量反逆\', \'text\': \'各対戦相手につきそれぞれ、そのプレイヤーがコントロールしているクリーチャー最大１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それらのクリーチャーのコントロールを得る。それらのクリーチャーをアンタップする。ターン終了時まで、それらは速攻を得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「我が最も信頼する参謀達よ、何とすべきか……？参謀？」\\n――マーフォークの君主、エドラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659682&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d1be457-cbba-4377-8085-53e7d2014ac4\', \'multiverseId\': 659682}, \'multiverseid\': 659682}, {\'name\': \'全面哗变\', \'text\': \'为每位对手各进行以下流程～获得至多一个目标由该牌手操控的生物之操控权直到回合结束。重置这些生物。它们获得敏捷异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「你们怎么看？我最忠心的大臣们？…大臣们？」\\n～人鱼君王埃德拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659948&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1cbc906a-6fdd-4d40-964c-ad1e72d2779e\', \'multiverseId\': 659948}, \'multiverseid\': 659948}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mitreißender Refrain\', \'text\': \'Erzeuge {R} für jede Karte auf der Hand eines Gegners deiner Wahl. Bis zum Ende des Zuges verlierst du dieses Mana nicht, sowie Segmente und Phasen enden. Schicke den Mitreißenden Refrain mit drei Zeitmarken ins Exil.\\nAussetzen 3 — {1}{R} (Statt diese Karte aus deiner Hand zu wirken, kannst du {1}{R} bezahlen und sie mit drei Zeitmarken ins Exil schicken. Entferne zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments eine Zeitmarke von ihr. Wenn die letzte Zeitmarke entfernt wird, kannst du sie wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658888&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ecbe54b8-998b-45c1-a4f3-6b8fe33d0858\', \'multiverseId\': 658888}, \'multiverseid\': 658888}, {\'name\': \'Estribillo estimulante\', \'text\': \'Agrega {R} por cada carta en la mano del oponente objetivo. Hasta el final del turno, no pierdes ese maná en cuanto terminan los pasos y las fases. Exilia el Estribillo estimulante con tres contadores de tiempo sobre él.\\nSuspender 3—{1}{R}. (En lugar de lanzar esta carta desde tu mano, puedes pagar {1}{R} y exiliarla con tres contadores de tiempo sobre ella. Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, remueve un contador de tiempo. Cuando remuevas el último, lánzala sin pagar su coste de maná.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659154&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71ed568e-1156-4012-83d9-f523e107479d\', \'multiverseId\': 659154}, \'multiverseid\': 659154}, {\'name\': \'Refrain entraînant\', \'text\': "Ajoutez {R} pour chaque carte dans la main d\'un adversaire ciblé. Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, vous ne perdez pas ce mana au moment où les étapes et les phases se terminent. Exilez le Refrain entraînant avec trois marqueurs « temps » sur lui.\\nSuspension 3 — {1}{R} (Plutôt que lancer cette carte depuis votre main, vous pouvez payer {1}{R} et l\'exiler avec trois marqueurs « temps » sur elle. Au début de votre entretien, retirez un marqueur « temps ». Quand le dernier marqueur est retiré, vous pouvez la lancer sans payer son coût de mana.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659420&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11427877-77ea-4cac-b8fc-f10ce03d012d\', \'multiverseId\': 659420}, \'multiverseid\': 659420}, {\'name\': \'熱狂のリフレイン\', \'text\': \'対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーの手札にあるカード１枚につき{R}を加える。ターン終了時まで、このマナはステップやフェイズの終了に際して無くならない。熱狂のリフレインを時間カウンター３個が置かれた状態で追放する。\\n待機３―{1}{R}（このカードをあなたの手札から唱えるのではなく、{1}{R}を支払って時間カウンター３個を置いた状態で追放してもよい。あなたのアップキープの開始時に、時間カウンター１個を取り除く。最後の１個を取り除いたとき、これをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659686&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3bda5da7-fcf5-4680-bc68-0a76b724484e\', \'multiverseId\': 659686}, \'multiverseid\': 659686}, {\'name\': \'醒神旋律\', \'text\': \'目标对手每有一张手牌，便加{R}。直到回合结束，你不会因步骤与阶段结束失去这份法术力。放逐醒神旋律，且上面有三个计时指示物。\\n延缓3～{1}{R}（除了从你手上施放此牌，你可以支付{1}{R}并将它放逐，且上面有三个计时指示物。在你的维持开始时，从其上移去一个计时指示物。当移去最后一个时，你可以施放它且不需支付其法术力费用。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659952&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1eca3813-5466-4d13-8c9c-f364202d1d1c\', \'multiverseId\': 659952}, \'multiverseid\': 659952}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mitternachtsuhr\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {U}.\\n{2}{U}: Lege eine Stundenmarke auf die Mitternachtsuhr.\\nZu Beginn jedes Versorgungssegments legst du eine Stundenmarke auf die Mitternachtsuhr.\\nWenn die zwölfte Stundenmarke auf die Mitternachtsuhr gelegt wird, mische deine Hand und deinen Friedhof in deine Bibliothek und ziehe dann sieben Karten. Schicke die Mitternachtsuhr ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658810&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'efac6398-d2b3-4251-80f5-be84bd2cad1f\', \'multiverseId\': 658810}, \'multiverseid\': 658810}, {\'name\': \'Reloj a la medianoche\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {U}.\\n{2}{U}: Pon un contador de hora sobre el Reloj a la medianoche.\\nAl comienzo de cada mantenimiento, pon un contador de hora sobre el Reloj a la medianoche.\\nCuando se ponga el decimosegundo contador de hora sobre el Reloj a la medianoche, baraja tu mano y tu cementerio en tu biblioteca y luego roba siete cartas. Exilia el Reloj a la medianoche.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659076&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4b3f175-fdd5-453c-b544-2a1baf297a3a\', \'multiverseId\': 659076}, \'multiverseid\': 659076}, {\'name\': \'Horloge de minuit\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {U}.\\n{2}{U} : Mettez un marqueur « heure » sur l\'Horloge de minuit.\\nAu début de chaque entretien, mettez un marqueur « heure » sur l\'Horloge de minuit.\\nQuand le douzième marqueur « heure » est mis sur l\'Horloge de minuit, mélangez votre main et votre cimetière dans votre bibliothèque, puis piochez sept cartes. Exilez l\'Horloge de minuit.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659342&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1492c570-ff06-4966-8866-87f554371e22\', \'multiverseId\': 659342}, \'multiverseid\': 659342}, {\'name\': \'真夜中の時計\', \'text\': \'{T}：{U}を加える。\\n{2}{U}：真夜中の時計の上に時刻カウンター１個を置く。\\n各アップキープの開始時に、真夜中の時計の上に時刻カウンター１個を置く。\\n真夜中の時計の上に12個目の時刻カウンターが置かれたとき、あなたの手札とあなたの墓地をあなたのライブラリーに加えて切り直し、その後、カード７枚を引く。真夜中の時計を追放する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659608&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab53a825-9ebf-497e-abde-df50eea6790a\', \'multiverseId\': 659608}, \'multiverseid\': 659608}, {\'name\': \'午夜怪钟\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{U}。\\n{2}{U}：在午夜怪钟上放置一个时刻指示物。\\n在每个维持开始时，在午夜怪钟上放置一个时刻指示物。\\n当在午夜怪钟上放置第十二个时刻指示物时，将你的手牌和坟墓场洗入你的牌库，然后抓七张牌。放逐午夜怪钟。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659874&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d88aeb53-b110-4a9a-a726-d7aa831dbb36\', \'multiverseId\': 659874}, \'multiverseid\': 659874}]', '[{\'name\': \'Moorhexe\', \'text\': \'Todesberührung\\nZu Beginn deines Endsegments und falls du in diesem Zug Lebenspunkte dazuerhalten hast, opfert jeder Gegner eine Kreatur und du bringst bis zu eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Hexenmeister\', \'flavor\': \'Viele Hände für viele Übel.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658862&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa9e70cc-6b88-4126-a908-5dd7c479ccbc\', \'multiverseId\': 658862}, \'multiverseid\': 658862}, {\'name\': \'Bruja de los páramos\', \'text\': \'Toque mortal.\\nAl comienzo de tu paso final, si ganaste vidas este turno, cada oponente sacrifica una criatura y tú regresas hasta una carta de criatura objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Brujo humano\', \'flavor\': \'Muchas manos para muchos males.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659128&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e65bcfd-ccf5-4b32-a1dd-ec4f3f9e12a7\', \'multiverseId\': 659128}, \'multiverseid\': 659128}, {\'name\': \'Envoûteuse des landes\', \'text\': "Contact mortel\\nAu début de votre étape de fin, si vous avez gagné des points de vie ce tour-ci, chaque adversaire sacrifie une créature et vous renvoyez jusqu\'à une carte de créature ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Créature — humain et psychagogue\', \'flavor\': \'Bien des mains pour bien des maux.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659394&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f4fe86d-ef8e-49f0-9237-021855c03dd1\', \'multiverseId\': 659394}, \'multiverseid\': 659394}, {\'name\': \'原野の魔女\', \'text\': \'接死\\nあなたの終了ステップの開始時に、このターンにあなたがライフを得ていた場合、あなたの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード最大１枚を対象とする。各対戦相手はそれぞれクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げ、あなたはそのカードをあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・邪術師\', \'flavor\': \'幾多の悪の、幾多の手。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659660&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c78a673c-d1f5-4d5d-b76b-49abbb6bf12b\', \'multiverseId\': 659660}, \'multiverseid\': 659660}, {\'name\': \'湿地巫婆\', \'text\': \'死触\\n在你的结束步骤开始时，若你本回合中获得过生命，则每位对手各牺牲一个生物，且你将至多一张目标生物牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／邪术师\', \'flavor\': \'身长多手，作恶多端。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659926&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7392e9f7-9830-4150-b1a9-c0c97872af45\', \'multiverseId\': 659926}, \'multiverseid\': 659926}]', '[{\'name\': \'Morbide Opportunistin\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine oder mehrere andere Kreaturen sterben, ziehe eine Karte. Diese Fähigkeit wird nur einmal pro Zug ausgelöst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'Auf Innistrad beginnt der Glücksfall des einen normalerweise damit, dass ein anderer mit dem Gesicht nach unten im Schlamm liegt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658852&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a4571cd-5843-4815-b500-60130b86a6d8\', \'multiverseId\': 658852}, \'multiverseid\': 658852}, {\'name\': \'Oportunista morbosa\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una o más otras criaturas mueran, roba una carta. Esta habilidad solo se dispara una vez por turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón humano\', \'flavor\': \'En Innistrad, las riquezas se suelen obtener de personas tendidas en el barro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659118&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be9e0a07-4eaf-4cb1-92dc-d5f917dbd8ae\', \'multiverseId\': 659118}, \'multiverseid\': 659118}, {\'name\': \'Opportuniste morbide\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'au moins une autre créature meurt, piochez une carte. Cette capacité ne se déclenche qu\'une seule fois par tour.", \'type\': \'Créature — humain et gredin\', \'flavor\': "Sur Innistrad, l\'aubaine d\'une personne commence généralement lorsqu\'une autre gît dans la boue.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659384&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'082263a6-72f3-4174-bd91-70132dea460f\', \'multiverseId\': 659384}, \'multiverseid\': 659384}, {\'name\': \'病的な日和見主義者\', \'text\': \'これでない１体以上のクリーチャーが死亡するたび、カード１枚を引く。この能力は、毎ターン１回しか誘発しない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'イニストラードでは、ひとりの意外な授かり物はまず他の人が泥の中でうつ伏せになることから始まる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659650&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5bc353e-987b-420a-9d49-c629507aef4d\', \'multiverseId\': 659650}, \'multiverseid\': 659650}, {\'name\': \'病态投机者\', \'text\': \'每当一个或数个其他生物死去时，抓一张牌。此异能每回合只会触发一次。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'在依尼翠，横财往往由他人倒毙泥中而起。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659916&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb635573-2d57-4294-9f36-a939ae83708c\', \'multiverseId\': 659916}, \'multiverseid\': 659916}]', '[{\'name\': \'Murmelnder Mystiker\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkst, erzeuge einen 1/1 blauen Vogel-Illusion-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'Gerüchte flattern wie Krähen durch die Stadt und landen scheinbar zufällig auf den Bürgern.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658812&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7eb6f652-033e-4fbf-82d1-a70604f5ac3a\', \'multiverseId\': 658812}, \'multiverseid\': 658812}, {\'name\': \'Místico murmurador\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro, crea una ficha de criatura Ilusión Ave azul 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero humano\', \'flavor\': \'Los rumores revolotean por la ciudad como cuervos, posándose sobre algunos ciudadanos al azar..., o eso parece.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659078&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b6a3dfe-0324-4908-93d7-cc9cd502c8c5\', \'multiverseId\': 659078}, \'multiverseid\': 659078}, {\'name\': \'Mystique bruissant\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 bleue Oiseau et Illusion avec le vol.", \'type\': \'Créature — humain et sorcier\', \'flavor\': \'Les rumeurs circulent en ville telles des nuées de corbeaux, se posant apparemment au hasard sur les citoyens.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659344&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aafce696-af42-463e-890e-bb7b25d1805c\', \'multiverseId\': 659344}, \'multiverseid\': 659344}, {\'name\': \'つぶやく神秘家\', \'text\': \'あなたがインスタントやソーサリーである呪文１つを唱えるたび、飛行を持つ青の１/１の鳥・イリュージョン・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'噂はカラスのように街中を舞い、見たところ無作為な市民の上に降りた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659610&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d99d008-330c-4248-954e-b66056104cfd\', \'multiverseId\': 659610}, \'multiverseid\': 659610}, {\'name\': \'细语秘教徒\', \'text\': \'每当你施放瞬间或法术咒语时，派出一个1/1蓝色，具飞行异能的鸟／虚影衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'谣言如鸦群飞舞城中，看似不经意间就停在市民肩头。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659876&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aed1f181-bf56-4dc2-8bdd-ba328e300def\', \'multiverseId\': 659876}, \'multiverseid\': 659876}]', '[{\'name\': \'Mysteriöse Ablehnung\', \'text\': \'Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl. Sein Beherrscher kann zu Beginn des Versorgungssegments des nächsten Zuges bis zu zwei Karten ziehen.\\nZiehe zu Beginn des Versorgungssegments des nächsten Zuges eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658799&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'89e00abd-685b-47cf-acf2-e749b1fad847\', \'multiverseId\': 658799}, \'multiverseid\': 658799}, {\'name\': \'Constricción arcana\', \'text\': \'Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo. Su controlador puede robar hasta dos cartas al comienzo del mantenimiento del próximo turno.\\nTú robas una carta al comienzo del mantenimiento del próximo turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659065&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e797474b-7c80-415f-bfcc-35c4a3781080\', \'multiverseId\': 659065}, \'multiverseid\': 659065}, {\'name\': \'Déni des arcanes\', \'text\': "Contrecarrez un sort ciblé. Son contrôleur peut piocher jusqu\'à deux cartes au début de l\'entretien du prochain tour.\\nVous piochez une carte au début de l\'entretien du prochain tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659331&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4db4c189-6883-439a-9a8b-d76610aa199a\', \'multiverseId\': 659331}, \'multiverseid\': 659331}, {\'name\': \'秘儀の否定\', \'text\': \'呪文１つを対象とする。それを打ち消す。次のターンのアップキープの開始時に、それのコントローラーは最大２枚のカードを引いてもよい。\\n次のターンのアップキープの開始時に、あなたはカード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659597&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d6fe04b-fb51-40af-be9c-88510eef8d40\', \'multiverseId\': 659597}, \'multiverseid\': 659597}, {\'name\': \'玄秘否定\', \'text\': \'反击目标咒语。在下一个回合维持开始时，其操控者可以抓至多两张牌。\\n在下一个回合维持开始时，你抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659863&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76c87fae-16e4-4d98-a317-9de750b0d475\', \'multiverseId\': 659863}, \'multiverseid\': 659863}]', "[{'name': 'Nachtschwärmer-Plünderer', 'text': 'Fliegend, Todesberührung, Lebensverknüpfung\\nDie Stärke des Nachtschwärmer-Plünderers ist gleich 1 plus der Anzahl an Kartentypen in den Friedhöfen deiner Gegner.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Vampir, Räuber', 'flavor': 'Unter Dranas Führung finden Vampire zu neuer Stärke und Einheit.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658854&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0662af91-a3c4-42de-ba65-4afe0e8e5cee', 'multiverseId': 658854}, 'multiverseid': 658854}, {'name': 'Saqueador halcón nocturno', 'text': 'Vuela, toque mortal, vínculo vital.\\nLa fuerza del Saqueador halcón nocturno es igual a 1 más la cantidad de tipos de cartas entre las cartas en los cementerios de tus oponentes.', 'type': 'Criatura — Bribón vampiro', 'flavor': 'Bajo el liderazgo de Drana, los vampiros están descubriendo una nueva fuerza en la solidaridad.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659120&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '26761a57-c566-459e-9ed6-8939fd6774ba', 'multiverseId': 659120}, 'multiverseid': 659120}, {'name': 'Charognard faucon de nuit', 'text': 'Vol, contact mortel, lien de vie\\nLa force du Charognard faucon de nuit est égale à 1 plus le nombre de types de carte parmi les cartes dans les cimetières de vos adversaires.', 'type': 'Créature — vampire et gredin', 'flavor': 'Depuis que Drana les dirige, les vampires retrouvent la force dans leur union.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659386&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3d502093-6bb1-4871-98f0-e3ba9fad1acc', 'multiverseId': 659386}, 'multiverseid': 659386}, {'name': '夜鷲のあさり屋', 'text': '飛行、接死、絆魂\\n夜鷲のあさり屋のパワーは、各対戦相手の墓地にあるカードの中のカード・タイプの種類数に１を足した値に等しい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・ならず者', 'flavor': 'ドラーナの指導力の下で吸血鬼たちは連帯に新たな力を見出しつつある。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659652&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '91b85765-4cca-4b93-9ce0-d797e096692e', 'multiverseId': 659652}, 'multiverseid': 659652}, {'name': '夜盗清理客', 'text': '飞行，死触，系命\\n夜盗清理客的力量等同于所有对手坟墓场中牌的牌张类别数量加1。', 'type': '生物 — 吸血鬼／浪客', 'flavor': '在哲娜的带领下，吸血鬼在团结中发现新的力量。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659918&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'eb7d37be-b22d-4ae4-9a03-f2af1da52d3e', 'multiverseId': 659918}, 'multiverseid': 659918}]", '[{\'name\': \'Nachtstahlbarren\', \'text\': \'Unzerstörbar\\n{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Er spiegelt die Reinheit des alten Mirrodin wider."\\n—Koth vom Hammerclan\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658966&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3466e333-86ab-48b7-8c70-1efbdb33a8ee\', \'multiverseId\': 658966}, \'multiverseid\': 658966}, {\'name\': \'Lingote de acero oscuro\', \'text\': \'Indestructible.\\n{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Refleja la pureza de Mirrodin-de-antes".\\n—Koth del Martillo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659232&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0d30929-fc2e-4531-908b-6d5f206f1302\', \'multiverseId\': 659232}, \'multiverseid\': 659232}, {\'name\': \'Lingot de sombracier\', \'text\': \'Indestructible\\n{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "« Il reflète la pureté du Mirrodin d\'autrefois. »\\n—Koth du Marteau", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659498&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0707b96a-aea3-467e-9e8c-a4b5e05774bf\', \'multiverseId\': 659498}, \'multiverseid\': 659498}, {\'name\': \'ダークスティールの鋳塊\', \'text\': \'破壊不能\\n{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「かつてのミラディンの純粋さを表しているんだ。」\\n――槌のコス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659764&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e67f56d4-bc3d-46ca-886b-b4b0cbd7889c\', \'multiverseId\': 659764}, \'multiverseid\': 659764}, {\'name\': \'玄铁锭\', \'text\': \'不灭\\n{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「它照映出过往秘罗地的纯洁。」\\n～锤族的寇斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660030&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'818494e4-ca3e-4883-ac97-575cccb3fd13\', \'multiverseId\': 660030}, \'multiverseid\': 660030}]', '[{\'name\': \'Nantuko-Landwirt\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Nantuko-Landwirt ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine beliebige Anzahl an Länderkarten abwerfen. Lege entsprechend viele +1/+1-Marken auf den Nantuko-Landwirt und ziehe entsprechend viele Karten.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Insekt, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'„Jeder Samen beweist Stärke und lehrt Geduld."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658908&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42dbd3f4-a77a-45d0-a934-d3b0987d1030\', \'multiverseId\': 658908}, \'multiverseid\': 658908}, {\'name\': \'Cultivador nantuko\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Cultivador nantuko entre al campo de batalla, puedes descartar cualquier cantidad de cartas de tierra. Pon esa misma cantidad de contadores +1/+1 sobre el Cultivador nantuko y roba esa misma cantidad de cartas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida insecto\', \'flavor\': \'"Todas las semillas albergan fuerza y enseñan paciencia".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659174&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cbca9242-fcc5-43a4-b689-2ea0433f5117\', \'multiverseId\': 659174}, \'multiverseid\': 659174}, {\'name\': \'Cultivateur Nantuko\', \'text\': "Quand le Cultivateur Nantuko arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez vous défausser de n\'importe quel nombre de cartes de terrain. Mettez autant de marqueurs +1/+1 sur le Cultivateur Nantuko et piochez autant de cartes.", \'type\': \'Créature — insecte et druide\', \'flavor\': \'« Chaque graine renferme de la force et enseigne la patience. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659440&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05085b8a-201c-4ff0-8189-f160b8c93179\', \'multiverseId\': 659440}, \'multiverseid\': 659440}, {\'name\': \'ナントゥーコの養成者\', \'text\': \'ナントゥーコの養成者が戦場に出たとき、あなたは望む枚数の土地・カードを捨ててもよい。ナントゥーコの養成者の上にその枚数に等しい個数の＋１/＋１カウンターを置き、それに等しい枚数のカードを引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 昆虫・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'「どの種子にも強さがあり、我慢の大切さを教えてくれる。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659706&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea774c73-b6c6-4e82-8621-d176b566492d\', \'multiverseId\': 659706}, \'multiverseid\': 659706}, {\'name\': \'耕耘螳人\', \'text\': \'当耕耘螳人进战场时，你可以弃任意数量的地牌。在耕耘螳人上放置等量的+1/+1指示物且抓等量的牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 昆虫／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': \'「每颗种子都蕴含力量，教导耐心。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659972&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37022e34-5aa2-4986-af56-397819b3180d\', \'multiverseId\': 659972}, \'multiverseid\': 659972}]', '[{\'name\': \'Nashi, Spross der Mondweisen\', \'text\': \'Ninjutsu {3}{B} ({3}{B}, bringe einen ungeblockten Angreifer, den du kontrollierst, auf die Hand zurück: Bringe diese Karte aus deiner Hand getappt und angreifend ins Spiel.)\\nImmer wenn Nashi, Spross der Mondweisen, einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, schicke die oberste Karte der Bibliothek jedes Spielers ins Exil. Bis zum Ende des Zuges kannst du davon eine Karte spielen. Falls du auf diese Weise einen Zauberspruch wirkst, bezahle Lebenspunkte in Höhe seines Manabetrags, statt seine Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Ratte, Ninja\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658853&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45a5a5fc-b5a1-4cf0-a7df-e7d413688615\', \'multiverseId\': 658853}, \'multiverseid\': 658853}, {\'name\': \'Nashi, vástago de la Sabia de la Luna\', \'text\': \'Ninjutsu {3}{B}. ({3}{B}, regresar un atacante no bloqueado que controlas a la mano de su propietario: Pon esta carta en el campo de batalla de tu mano girada y atacando.)\\nSiempre que Nashi, vástago de la Sabia de la Luna haga daño de combate a un jugador, exilia la primera carta de la biblioteca de cada jugador. Hasta el final del turno, puedes jugar una de esas cartas. Si lanzas un hechizo de esta manera, paga una cantidad de vidas igual a su valor de maná en vez de pagar su coste de maná.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Ninja rata\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659119&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a09b2e3f-f457-44e1-abc7-5cfe7c724499\', \'multiverseId\': 659119}, \'multiverseid\': 659119}, {\'name\': \'Nashi, scion du sage de la lune\', \'text\': "Ninjutsu {3}{B} ({3}{B}, renvoyez en main un attaquant non-bloqué que vous contrôlez : Mettez sur le champ de bataille cette carte, engagée et attaquante, depuis votre main.)\\nÀ chaque fois que Nashi, scion du sage de la lune inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, exilez la carte du dessus de la bibliothèque de chaque joueur. Jusqu\'à fin du tour, vous pouvez jouer une de ces cartes. Si vous lancez un sort de cette manière, payez un nombre de points de vie égal à sa valeur de mana à la place de son coût de mana.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — rat et ninja\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659385&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cee8c763-c58a-4219-be4a-5a14a134280f\', \'multiverseId\': 659385}, \'multiverseid\': 659385}, {\'name\': \'月の賢者の養子、ナシ\', \'text\': \'忍術{3}{B}（{3}{B}, あなたがコントロールしていてブロックされなかった攻撃クリーチャー１体を手札に戻す：あなたの手札にあるこのカードをタップ状態かつ攻撃している状態で戦場に出す。）\\n月の賢者の養子、ナシがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、各プレイヤーのライブラリーのそれぞれ一番上にあるカード１枚を追放する。ターン終了時まで、あなたはそれらのカードのうち１枚をプレイしてもよい。あなたがこれにより呪文を唱えるなら、マナ・コストを支払うのではなく、それのマナ総量に等しい点数のライフを支払う。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ネズミ・忍者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659651&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87d83bce-1c20-4977-8471-2b7337d63c52\', \'multiverseId\': 659651}, \'multiverseid\': 659651}, {\'name\': \'月智者后裔哪失\', \'text\': \'忍术{3}{B}（{3}{B}，将一个由你操控且未受阻挡的攻击生物回手：将此牌从你手上横置放进战场，且正进行攻击。）\\n每当月智者后裔哪失对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，放逐每位牌手的牌库顶牌。直到回合结束，你可以使用其中一张。如果你以此法施放咒语，则支付等同于其法术力值的生命，而不支付其法术力费用。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 老鼠／忍者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659917&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b4a5f08-976a-4874-895a-3c324987fc7f\', \'multiverseId\': 659917}, \'multiverseid\': 659917}]', "[{'name': 'Nebelwiesenschleicher', 'text': 'Lebensverknüpfung, Schutz vor Manabetrag 3 oder mehr', 'type': 'Kreatur — Kithkin, Räuber', 'flavor': 'Doyo vermutete, dass die Boggarts einen Raubzug auf seine Ernte planten. Daher mähte er das Getreide, um bessere Sicht zu haben.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658794&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3541ffb8-1230-4762-9525-7a59851ba11b', 'multiverseId': 658794}, 'multiverseid': 658794}, {'name': 'Furtivo de Pradera Brumosa', 'text': 'Vínculo vital, protección contra valor de maná de 3 o más.', 'type': 'Criatura — Bribón kithkin', 'flavor': 'Doyo sospechaba que los boggarts estaban conspirando contra su cosecha, así que segó todo su grano para que nada entorpeciera la visión.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659060&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0c0afb55-fb71-4ece-b512-ca067d5c13fe', 'multiverseId': 659060}, 'multiverseid': 659060}, {'name': 'Indolent brumeprairie', 'text': 'Lien de vie, protection contre la valeur de mana supérieure ou égale à 3', 'type': 'Créature — sangami et gredin', 'flavor': 'Doyo soupçonnait les boggarts de fomenter un complot contre sa récolte, alors il faucha ses céréales pour y voir plus clair.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659326&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1bab9de9-2bfd-458b-b21c-865f44f3b032', 'multiverseId': 659326}, 'multiverseid': 659326}, {'name': 'ミストメドウの身隠し', 'text': '絆魂、プロテクション（マナ総量が３以上）', 'type': 'クリーチャー — キスキン・ならず者', 'flavor': 'ボガートたちによる自分の農作物に対する陰謀を疑い、ドーヨは視界を確保するためにその穀物を鎌で刈り取った。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659592&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '96da436a-f502-45de-a675-e8b331f5144f', 'multiverseId': 659592}, 'multiverseid': 659592}, {'name': '雾牧地潜伏客', 'text': '系命，反法术力值等于或大于3保护', 'type': '生物 — 洁英／浪客', 'flavor': '多佑怀疑波尬正打他的谷物主意，于是把谷子全刈平好让视野畅通。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659858&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1932a915-bb7f-4725-af18-528c89d7bc7d', 'multiverseId': 659858}, 'multiverseid': 659858}]", '[{\'name\': \'Niv-Mizzet der Parun\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kann nicht neutralisiert werden.\\nFliegend\\nImmer wenn du eine Karte ziehst, fügt Niv-Mizzet der Parun einem Ziel deiner Wahl 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\\nImmer wenn ein Spieler einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkt, ziehst du eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Drache, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658945&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e526a755-f9a2-47b2-83c0-a27893c6f7dd\', \'multiverseId\': 658945}, \'multiverseid\': 658945}, {\'name\': \'Niv-Mízzet, parun\', \'text\': \'Este hechizo no puede ser contrarrestado.\\nVuela.\\nSiempre que robes una carta, Niv-Mízzet, parun hace 1 punto de daño a cualquier objetivo.\\nSiempre que un jugador lance un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro, tú robas una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Hechicero dragón\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659211&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92fb3e0e-f8ed-46ec-9274-84c28da95e88\', \'multiverseId\': 659211}, \'multiverseid\': 659211}, {\'name\': \'Niv-Mizzet, Parun\', \'text\': "Ce sort ne peut pas être contrecarré.\\nVol\\nÀ chaque fois que vous piochez une carte, Niv-Mizzet, Parun inflige 1 blessure à n\'importe quelle cible.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un joueur lance un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel, vous piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — dragon et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659477&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a34ceee6-95a8-4b6e-9669-df537d908ae6\', \'multiverseId\': 659477}, \'multiverseid\': 659477}, {\'name\': \'パルン、ニヴ＝ミゼット\', \'text\': \'この呪文は打ち消されない。\\n飛行\\nあなたがカード１枚を引くたび、１つを対象とする。パルン、ニヴ＝ミゼットはそれに１点のダメージを与える。\\nプレイヤーがインスタントやソーサリーである呪文１つを唱えるたび、あなたはカード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — ドラゴン・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659743&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0eeadbd1-0103-4213-800a-1d393cbdb8d5\', \'multiverseId\': 659743}, \'multiverseid\': 659743}, {\'name\': \'元祖尼米捷\', \'text\': \'此咒语不能被反击。\\n飞行\\n每当你抓一张牌时，元祖尼米捷对任意一个目标造成1点伤害。\\n每当任一牌手施放瞬间或法术咒语时，你抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 龙／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660009&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9ccf9de7-98a5-4a10-9068-79454a253acd\', \'multiverseId\': 660009}, \'multiverseid\': 660009}]', '[{\'name\': \'Nomadenaußenposten\', \'text\': \'Der Nomadenaußenposten kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {R}, {W} oder {B}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Nur die Schwachen mauern sich selbst ein. Wir leben frei unterm Wind und unsere Freiheit macht uns stark."\\n—Zurgo, Khan der Mardu\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659016&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae6c7f6e-fccd-406f-ab40-9645c62c7a22\', \'multiverseId\': 659016}, \'multiverseid\': 659016}, {\'name\': \'Destacamento nómada\', \'text\': \'El Destacamento nómada entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {R}, {W} o {B}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"Solo los débiles se encierran tras los muros. Nosotros vivimos libres como el viento, y nuestra libertad es nuestra fuerza".\\n—Zurgo, kan de los Mardu\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659282&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc7279d7-58dd-48f8-ba57-e38958373173\', \'multiverseId\': 659282}, \'multiverseid\': 659282}, {\'name\': \'Avant-poste nomade\', \'text\': "L\'Avant-poste nomade arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R}, {W} ou {B}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "« Seuls les faibles s\'enferment entre quatre murs. Nous vivons au gré du vent, et notre liberté nous renforce. »\\n—Zurgo, khan des Mardu", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659548&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83e3484f-9500-41fe-bdc8-d5f215f74c75\', \'multiverseId\': 659548}, \'multiverseid\': 659548}, {\'name\': \'遊牧民の前哨地\', \'text\': \'遊牧民の前哨地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{R}か{W}か{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「壁の向こう側に閉じこもっているのは弱者だけだ。我々は風の下で自由に生きる。自由こそが我らを強くする。」\\n――マルドゥのカン、ズルゴ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659814&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'608f5a1f-c39a-4fba-954d-53ef2e32e0bf\', \'multiverseId\': 659814}, \'multiverseid\': 659814}, {\'name\': \'游牧人哨站\', \'text\': \'游牧人哨站须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{R}，{W}或{B}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'「只有弱者才把自己关在城墙后面。我们在风中自由地生活，而自由让我们强壮。」\\n～玛尔都可汗珠高\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660080&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ad62202-cb83-4aaa-94b9-3d26fa1367cd\', \'multiverseId\': 660080}, \'multiverseid\': 660080}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ogerfürst der Slums\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine andere Nichtspielsteinkreatur stirbt, kannst du einen 1/1 schwarzen Ratte-Kreaturenspielstein erzeugen.\\nRatten, die du kontrollierst, haben Todesberührung.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Oger, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'„In seiner Mietskaserne wimmelt es von dem widerwärtigsten, abscheulichsten Ungeziefer. Und rattenverseucht ist sie auch."\\n—Branko Einohr\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658855&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22fa7a81-7dba-4af0-9e9c-ddf5e674fc05\', \'multiverseId\': 658855}, \'multiverseid\': 658855}, {\'name\': \'Ogro amo del distrito\', \'text\': \'Siempre que otra criatura que no sea ficha muera, puedes crear una ficha de criatura Rata negra 1/1.\\nLas Ratas que controlas tienen la habilidad de toque mortal.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón ogro\', \'flavor\': \'"Su propiedad está llena de las alimañas más viles y asquerosas. Y además está infestada de ratas".\\n—Branko Una Oreja\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659121&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d02d8672-1e72-4b2d-93b1-043ed23223a1\', \'multiverseId\': 659121}, \'multiverseid\': 659121}, {\'name\': \'Seigneur ogre de quartier insalubre\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une autre créature non-jeton meurt, vous pouvez créer un jeton de créature 1/1 noire Rat.\\nLes rats que vous contrôlez ont le contact mortel.", \'type\': \'Créature — ogre et gredin\', \'flavor\': \'« Son logis est rempli de la vermine la plus dégoûtante, la plus vile qui soit. Et en plus, il est infesté de rats. »\\n—Branko Une-Oreille\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659387&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'870b527d-2851-4299-9749-4a3ad3fb2548\', \'multiverseId\': 659387}, \'multiverseid\': 659387}, {\'name\': \'オーガの貧王\', \'text\': \'トークンでもこれでもないクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、黒の１/１のネズミ・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成してもよい。\\nあなたがコントロールしているすべてのネズミは接死を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — オーガ・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'「あいつのボロ部屋ときたら、気色悪い最低の害虫がうようよしてやがる。しかもネズミまで住み着いてるんだぜ。」\\n――隻耳のブランコ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659653&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48ec06d0-7a55-49b8-9284-24995c8c1714\', \'multiverseId\': 659653}, \'multiverseid\': 659653}, {\'name\': \'贫窟霸食人魔\', \'text\': \'每当另一个非衍生物的生物死去时，你可以派出一个1/1黑色老鼠衍生生物。\\n由你操控的老鼠具有死触异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 食人魔／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'「他的居所充满最邪恶恶心的病媒，还有鼠辈横行。」\\n～单耳布兰可\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659919&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c15f4568-bbfb-46ce-bb79-db609d7167cb\', \'multiverseId\': 659919}, \'multiverseid\': 659919}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ohran-Frostzahn\', \'text\': \'Angreifende Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Todesberührung.\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Verschneite Kreatur — Ophis\', \'flavor\': \'Leise wie eine Schneewehe. Unaufhaltsam wie eine Lawine.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658909&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9fa9fe3a-0ac5-41f4-8a48-dd056445ba03\', \'multiverseId\': 658909}, \'multiverseid\': 658909}, {\'name\': \'Faucesgélidas de Ohran\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas atacantes que controlas tienen la habilidad de toque mortal.\\nSiempre que una criatura que controlas haga daño de combate a un jugador, roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura nevada — Víbora\', \'flavor\': \'Silenciosa como un copo de nieve, inexorable como una avalancha.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659175&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d379bfb8-e8b0-43ba-b734-eb4da5083838\', \'multiverseId\': 659175}, \'multiverseid\': 659175}, {\'name\': "Croc-de-givre d\'Ohran", \'text\': "Les créatures attaquantes que vous contrôlez ont le contact mortel.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature que vous contrôlez inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, piochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Créature neigeuse — serpent\', \'flavor\': "Silencieux comme la congère. Inéluctable comme l\'avalanche.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659441&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c32bd8a-0452-42a5-b143-5a65976ca000\', \'multiverseId\': 659441}, \'multiverseid\': 659441}, {\'name\': \'オーランの凍り牙\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているすべての攻撃クリーチャーは接死を持つ。\\nあなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、カード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'氷雪クリーチャー — 蛇\', \'flavor\': \'雪溜のように静かに。雪崩のように残酷に。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659707&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'327ade05-026e-4591-baac-32bb70843346\', \'multiverseId\': 659707}, \'multiverseid\': 659707}, {\'name\': \'欧然霜牙蛇\', \'text\': \'由你操控且进行攻击的生物具有死触异能。\\n每当一个由你操控的生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'雪境生物 — 蛇\', \'flavor\': \'静寂如雪堆。迅猛如雪崩。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659973&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9c409a7-657b-4997-9ddc-ad13687dd195\', \'multiverseId\': 659973}, \'multiverseid\': 659973}]', '[{\'name\': \'Oktavia, Lebendige These\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken {8} weniger, falls dein Friedhof acht oder mehr Spontanzauber und/oder Hexereikarten enthält.\\nAbwehr {8}\\nMagiefertigkeit — Immer wenn du einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkst oder kopierst, hat eine Kreatur deiner Wahl Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft 8/8 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elementarwesen, Oktopus\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658813&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97c5fa3e-2c71-42e4-916d-95da713a8ecf\', \'multiverseId\': 658813}, \'multiverseid\': 658813}, {\'name\': \'Octavia, tesis viviente\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {8} menos lanzar este hechizo si tienes ocho o más cartas de instantáneo y/o de conjuro en tu cementerio.\\nRebatir {8}.\\nHechicería — Siempre que lances o copies un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro, la criatura objetivo tiene una fuerza y resistencia base de 8/8 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Pulpo elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659079&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb48fecc-bbb3-4ff2-b65f-b054a21d9b90\', \'multiverseId\': 659079}, \'multiverseid\': 659079}, {\'name\': \'Octavia, thèse vivante\', \'text\': "Ce sort coûte {8} de moins à lancer si vous avez au moins huit cartes d\'éphémère et/ou de rituel dans votre cimetière.\\nParade {8}\\nSorcellerie — À chaque fois que vous lancez ou copiez un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel, une créature ciblée a une force et une endurance de base de 8/8 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — élémental et pieuvre\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659345&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6aebc3a-b5a2-44cd-a847-7ada193bac9b\', \'multiverseId\': 659345}, \'multiverseid\': 659345}, {\'name\': \'生ける卒論、オクタヴィア\', \'text\': \'あなたの墓地にインスタントやソーサリーである８枚以上のカードがあるなら、この呪文を唱えるためのコストは{8}少なくなる。\\n護法{8}\\n魔技 ― あなたがインスタントやソーサリーである呪文１つを唱えるかコピーするたび、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それの基本のパワーとタフネスは８/８になる。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エレメンタル・タコ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659611&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55d9c97a-f313-4928-985e-aa343b4c7762\', \'multiverseId\': 659611}, \'multiverseid\': 659611}, {\'name\': \'活体论文八爪薇\', \'text\': \'如果你坟墓场中有八张或更多瞬间和／或法术牌，则此咒语减少{8}来施放。\\n守护{8}\\n魔艺～每当你施放或复制瞬间或法术咒语时，目标生物的基础力量与防御力为8/8直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 元素／章鱼\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659877&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'926ff30c-e40f-4086-be36-b8694951b029\', \'multiverseId\': 659877}, \'multiverseid\': 659877}]', '[{\'name\': \'Olivia, opulente Gesetzlose\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Lebensverknüpfung\\nImmer wenn ein oder mehrere Gesetzlose, die du kontrollierst, einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügen, erzeuge einen Schatz-Spielstein. (Assassinen, Söldner, Piraten, Räuber und Hexenmeister sind Gesetzlose.)\\n{3}, opfere zwei Schätze: Lege auf jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, zwei +1/+1-Marken. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Vampir, Assassine\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658286&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea285fd8-b235-49df-aaab-67fcf8591de2\', \'multiverseId\': 658286}, \'multiverseid\': 658286}, {\'name\': \'Olivia, forajida opulenta\', \'text\': \'Vuela, vínculo vital.\\nSiempre que uno o más forajidos que controlas hagan daño de combate a un jugador, crea una ficha de Tesoro. (Los Asesinos, Mercenarios, Piratas, Bribones y Brujos son forajidos.)\\n{3}, sacrificar dos Tesoros: Pon dos contadores +1/+1 sobre cada criatura que controlas. Activa esto solo como un conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Asesino vampiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658290&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e60199d-7467-4ffc-a4b3-38a38474bcd8\', \'multiverseId\': 658290}, \'multiverseid\': 658290}, {\'name\': \'Olivia, hors-la-loi opulente\', \'text\': "Vol, lien de vie\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'au moins un hors-la-loi que vous contrôlez inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, créez un jeton Trésor. (Les assassins, les mercenaires, les pirates, les gredins et les psychagogues sont des hors-la-loi.)\\n{3}, Sacrifiez deux trésors : Mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur chaque créature que vous contrôlez. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — vampire et assassin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658294&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e22b4d03-25a7-4a1f-829f-e0ad6ca5ba49\', \'multiverseId\': 658294}, \'multiverseid\': 658294}, {\'name\': \'富裕な無法者、オリヴィア\', \'text\': \'飛行、絆魂\\nあなたがコントロールしている１体以上の無法者がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、宝物・トークン１つを生成する。（暗殺者、海賊、邪術師、ならず者、傭兵が無法者である。）\\n{3}, 宝物２つを生け贄に捧げる：あなたがコントロールしている各クリーチャーの上にそれぞれ＋１/＋１カウンター２個を置く。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 吸血鬼・暗殺者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658298&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2262705b-c31f-41cb-836f-269000f7bcef\', \'multiverseId\': 658298}, \'multiverseid\': 658298}, {\'name\': \'奢华狂徒奥莉薇亚\', \'text\': \'飞行，系命\\n每当由你操控的一个或数个狂徒对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，派出一个珍宝衍生物。（杀手、佣兵、海盗、浪客和邪术师是狂徒。）\\n{3}，牺牲两个珍宝：在每个由你操控的生物上各放置两个+1/+1指示物。只能于法术时机起动。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 吸血鬼／杀手\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658302&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44cdd9f0-b07e-4918-b68f-2565aa244bfc\', \'multiverseId\': 658302}, \'multiverseid\': 658302}]', '[{\'name\': \'Omnath, der Sammelpunkt des Zorns\', \'text\': \'Landung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen 5/5 roten und grünen Elementarwesen-Kreaturenspielstein.\\nImmer wenn Omnath, der Sammelpunkt des Zorns, oder ein anderes Elementarwesen, das du kontrollierst, stirbt, fügt Omnath einem Ziel deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Elementarwesen\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658946&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'72c2dedf-dad4-481a-a312-9828e51115d2\', \'multiverseId\': 658946}, \'multiverseid\': 658946}, {\'name\': \'Omnath, centro de la ira\', \'text\': \'Aterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, crea una ficha de criatura Elemental roja y verde 5/5.\\nSiempre que Omnath, centro de la ira u otro Elemental que controlas muera, Omnath hace 3 puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Elemental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659212&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dccd670e-c33e-46af-9bec-d303e9132150\', \'multiverseId\': 659212}, \'multiverseid\': 659212}, {\'name\': \'Omnath, Locus de rage\', \'text\': "Toucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, créez un jeton de créature 5/5 rouge et verte Élémental.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'Omnath, Locus de rage ou qu\'un autre élémental que vous contrôlez meurt, Omnath inflige 3 blessures à n\'importe quelle cible.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — élémental\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659478&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'018a3766-cdba-4c21-a3a9-4c1f84d29c7a\', \'multiverseId\': 659478}, \'multiverseid\': 659478}, {\'name\': \'怒りの座、オムナス\', \'text\': \'上陸 ― 土地１つがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、赤緑の５/５のエレメンタル・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\\n怒りの座、オムナスや、あなたがコントロールしていてこれでないエレメンタル１体が死亡するたび、１つを対象とする。怒りの座、オムナスはそれに３点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エレメンタル\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659744&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1da22db1-edb4-487a-b9b0-e8a29e604b4a\', \'multiverseId\': 659744}, \'multiverseid\': 659744}, {\'name\': \'怒火核欧那斯\', \'text\': \'地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，派出一个5/5，红绿双色的元素衍生生物。\\n每当怒火核欧那斯或另一个由你操控的元素死去时，欧那斯对任意一个目标造成3点伤害。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 元素\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660010&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b78c278b-a59c-43cf-80d2-b4cdcfb5c676\', \'multiverseId\': 660010}, \'multiverseid\': 660010}]', '[{\'name\': \'Oni der lautlosen Klinge\', \'text\': \'Ninjutsu {4}{U}{B} ({4}{U}{B}, bringe einen ungeblockten Angreifer, den du kontrollierst, auf die Hand zurück: Bringe diese Karte aus deiner Hand getappt und angreifend ins Spiel.)\\nImmer wenn der Oni der lautlosen Klinge einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, schaue dir die Karten auf der Hand des Spielers an. Du kannst davon einen Zauberspruch wirken, ohne seine Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dämon, Ninja\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658951&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eae39e54-3052-4ea8-ab65-c4998b5c764b\', \'multiverseId\': 658951}, \'multiverseid\': 658951}, {\'name\': \'Oni hoja silenciosa\', \'text\': \'Ninjutsu {4}{U}{B}. ({4}{U}{B}, regresar un atacante no bloqueado que controlas a la mano de su propietario: Pon esta carta en el campo de batalla de tu mano girada y atacando.)\\nSiempre que el Oni hoja silenciosa haga daño de combate a un jugador, mira la mano de ese jugador. Puedes lanzar un hechizo de entre esas cartas sin pagar su coste de maná.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ninja demonio\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659217&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ad10ffb-3881-4605-8a4c-3e6ed407cbb0\', \'multiverseId\': 659217}, \'multiverseid\': 659217}, {\'name\': \'Oni à la lame silencieuse\', \'text\': "Ninjutsu {4}{U}{B} ({4}{U}{B}, renvoyez en main un attaquant non-bloqué que vous contrôlez : Mettez sur le champ de bataille cette carte, engagée et attaquante, depuis votre main.)\\nÀ chaque fois que l\'Oni à la lame silencieuse inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, regardez la main de ce joueur. Vous pouvez lancer un sort parmi ces cartes sans payer son coût de mana.", \'type\': \'Créature — démon et ninja\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659483&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bbe1df0a-eeea-457c-8731-4ccdd1db4035\', \'multiverseId\': 659483}, \'multiverseid\': 659483}, {\'name\': \'静刃の鬼\', \'text\': \'忍術 {4}{U}{B} （{4}{U}{B}, あなたがコントロールしていてブロックされなかった攻撃クリーチャー１体を手札に戻す：あなたの手札にあるこのカードをタップ状態かつ攻撃している状態で戦場に出す。）\\n静刃の鬼がプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、あなたはそのプレイヤーの手札を見る。あなたはそれらのカードの中から呪文１つを、マナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — デーモン・忍者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659749&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6406c6c5-b54d-4d0d-b2d6-46234e105dc6\', \'multiverseId\': 659749}, \'multiverseid\': 659749}, {\'name\': \'静刃邪鬼\', \'text\': \'忍术{4}{U}{B}（{4}{U}{B}，将一个由你操控且未受阻挡的攻击生物回手：将此牌从你手上横置放进战场，且正进行攻击。）\\n每当静刃邪鬼对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，检视该牌手的手牌。你可以从这些牌之中施放一个咒语，且不需支付其法术力费用。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 恶魔／忍者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660015&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24859860-5969-4eef-870a-0f8bf8455780\', \'multiverseId\': 660015}, \'multiverseid\': 660015}]', '[{\'name\': \'Optionen\', \'text\': \'Hellsicht 1. (Schaue dir die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst sie unter deine Bibliothek legen.)\\nZiehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Manchmal ist die schwierigste Wahl die zwischen zwei Wundern."\\n—Gadwick der Alte\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658814&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02ccceac-3621-4c59-a550-a5ba504c0869\', \'multiverseId\': 658814}, \'multiverseid\': 658814}, {\'name\': \'Optar\', \'text\': \'Adivina 1. (Mira la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Puedes poner esa carta en el fondo.)\\nRoba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"A veces, lo más difícil es elegir entre dos maravillas".\\n—Gadwick, el Marchito\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659080&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61b90d3f-7202-4d0d-858e-47b4aeaf53c0\', \'multiverseId\': 659080}, \'multiverseid\': 659080}, {\'name\': \'Option\', \'text\': \'Regard 1. (Regardez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez mettre cette carte au-dessous.)\\nPiochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Parfois le choix le plus difficile est entre deux merveilles. »\\n—Gadwick, le Brisquard\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659346&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'669f9b60-b7b0-460a-a0e3-57ace5ab7c04\', \'multiverseId\': 659346}, \'multiverseid\': 659346}, {\'name\': \'選択\', \'text\': \'占術１を行う。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を見る。そのカードを一番下に置いてもよい。）\\nカード１枚を引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「時に難しい選択がある。二つの驚異から一方を選ぶときだ。」\\n――老いたる者、ガドウィック\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659612&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a59a325-bced-4fb9-8ff6-f5939c2b8af0\', \'multiverseId\': 659612}, \'multiverseid\': 659612}, {\'name\': \'抉择\', \'text\': \'占卜1。（检视你牌库顶的牌。你可以将该牌置于你的牌库底。）\\n抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「有时候，在两个奇迹中作选择才最困难。」\\n～老年法师盖威克\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659878&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a42738b-8fa3-4c97-b745-e7fabca71036\', \'multiverseId\': 659878}, \'multiverseid\': 659878}]', "[{'name': 'Orakel von Mul Daya', 'text': 'Du darfst in jedem deiner Züge ein zusätzliches Land spielen.\\nDie oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek ist offen.\\nDu kannst Länder oben von deiner Bibliothek spielen.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Elf, Schamane', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658910&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1db06eb3-880c-49a7-b760-5347fc006772', 'multiverseId': 658910}, 'multiverseid': 658910}, {'name': 'Oráculo Mul Daya', 'text': 'Puedes jugar una tierra adicional en cada uno de tus turnos.\\nJuega mostrando la primera carta de tu biblioteca.\\nPuedes jugar tierras desde la parte superior de tu biblioteca.', 'type': 'Criatura — Chamán elfo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659176&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '96a45d00-d242-45f9-b8c3-bdbf197e4707', 'multiverseId': 659176}, 'multiverseid': 659176}, {'name': 'Oracle de Mul Daya', 'text': 'Vous pouvez jouer un terrain supplémentaire pendant chacun de vos tours.\\nJouez avec la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque révélée.\\nVous pouvez jouer les terrains depuis le dessus de votre bibliothèque.', 'type': 'Créature — elfe et shamane', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659442&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '01f348a4-97e9-4496-8e21-b76af1340fa9', 'multiverseId': 659442}, 'multiverseid': 659442}, {'name': 'ムル・ダヤの巫女', 'text': 'あなたの各ターンに、追加で土地１つをプレイしてもよい。\\nあなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を公開したままプレイする。\\nあなたのライブラリーの一番上から土地をプレイしてもよい。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エルフ・シャーマン', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659708&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9f428e77-98b8-4370-b0ef-55463d495b88', 'multiverseId': 659708}, 'multiverseid': 659708}, {'name': '慕达雅先知', 'text': '你在自己的每个回合中可以额外使用一个地。\\n你以展示牌库顶牌的方式进行游戏。\\n你可以从你的牌库顶使用地。', 'type': '生物 — 妖精／祭师', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659974&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd738ec4f-59bb-4152-965a-f81993a7df91', 'multiverseId': 659974}, 'multiverseid': 659974}]", '[{\'name\': \'Orochi-Seelenplünderer\', \'text\': \'Ninjutsu {3}{B} ({3}{B}, bringe einen ungeblockten Angreifer, den du kontrollierst, auf die Hand zurück: Bringe diese Karte aus deiner Hand getappt und angreifend ins Spiel.)\\nImmer wenn eine oder mehrere Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügen, erzeuge einen Schatz-Spielstein und manifestiere die oberste Karte der Bibliothek jenes Spielers. (Bringe sie als eine 2/2 Kreatur verdeckt ins Spiel. Decke sie zu einem beliebigen Zeitpunkt für ihre Manakosten auf, falls es eine Kreaturenkarte ist.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Ophis, Ninja, Räuber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658374&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33b3a74a-d40d-409f-8b70-5dc4ecfb638a\', \'multiverseId\': 658374}, \'multiverseid\': 658374}, {\'name\': \'Desgarralmas orochi\', \'text\': \'Ninjutsu {3}{B}. ({3}{B}, regresar un atacante no bloqueado que controlas a la mano de su propietario: Pon esta carta en el campo de batalla de tu mano girada y atacando.)\\nSiempre que una o más criaturas que controlas hagan daño de combate a un jugador, crea una ficha de Tesoro y manifiesta la primera carta de la biblioteca de ese jugador. (Ponla en el campo de batalla boca abajo como una criatura 2/2. Ponla boca arriba en cualquier momento por su coste de maná si es una carta de criatura.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón ninja víbora\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658406&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'372d93b3-e527-4d73-bf85-f9f98715099a\', \'multiverseId\': 658406}, \'multiverseid\': 658406}, {\'name\': "Voleur d\'âme orochi", \'text\': "Ninjutsu {3}{B} ({3}{B}, renvoyez en main un attaquant non-bloqué que vous contrôlez : Mettez sur le champ de bataille cette carte, engagée et attaquante, depuis votre main.)\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'au moins une créature que vous contrôlez inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, créez un jeton Trésor et manifestez la carte du dessus de la bibliothèque de ce joueur. (Mettez-la sur le champ de bataille face cachée comme une créature 2/2. Retournez-la face visible à tout moment pour son coût de mana si c\'est une carte de créature.)", \'type\': \'Créature — serpent et ninja et gredin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658438&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'889395d0-e747-4451-93ec-2ae741123119\', \'multiverseId\': 658438}, \'multiverseid\': 658438}, {\'name\': \'大蛇の魂裂き\', \'text\': \'忍術{3}{B}（{3}{B}, あなたがコントロールしていてブロックされなかった攻撃クリーチャー１体を手札に戻す：あなたの手札にあるこのカードをタップ状態かつ攻撃している状態で戦場に出す。）\\nあなたがコントロールしている１体以上のクリーチャーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、宝物・トークン１つを生成し、そのプレイヤーのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を予示する。（それを裏向きで２/２のクリーチャーとして戦場に出す。それがクリーチャー・カードなら、そのマナ・コストで、いつでも表向きにしてよい。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 蛇・忍者・ならず者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658470&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'639dec09-6d9d-4f5b-bd7f-cd62c611090a\', \'multiverseId\': 658470}, \'multiverseid\': 658470}, {\'name\': \'裂魂蛇人\', \'text\': \'忍术{3}{B}（{3}{B}，将一个由你操控且未受阻挡的攻击生物回手：将此牌从你手上横置放进战场，且正进行攻击。）\\n每当由你操控的一个或数个生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，派出一个珍宝衍生物并显化该牌手的牌库顶牌。（将它牌面朝下地放进战场，当成2/2生物。如果该牌是生物牌，则可随时支付其法术力费用使其翻回正面。）\', \'type\': \'生物 — 蛇／忍者／浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658502&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f07a074-322b-4e25-bdac-cb00b6fe20b2\', \'multiverseId\': 658502}, \'multiverseid\': 658502}]', '[{\'name\': \'Orochi-Seelenplünderer\', \'text\': \'Ninjutsu {3}{B}\\nImmer wenn eine oder mehrere Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügen, erzeuge einen Schatz-Spielstein und manifestiere die oberste Karte der Bibliothek jenes Spielers.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Ophis, Ninja, Räuber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660182&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73d64b3b-b983-4ae8-b951-7dcc3b6e67c2\', \'multiverseId\': 660182}, \'multiverseid\': 660182}, {\'name\': "Voleur d\'âme orochi", \'text\': "Ninjutsu {3}{B}\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'au moins une créature que vous contrôlez inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, créez un jeton Trésor et manifestez la carte du dessus de la bibliothèque de ce joueur.", \'type\': \'Créature — serpent et ninja et gredin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660214&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a9bf0ce-9125-449b-8f1d-a50cd5609af1\', \'multiverseId\': 660214}, \'multiverseid\': 660214}, {\'name\': \'大蛇の魂裂き\', \'text\': \'忍術{3}{B}\\nあなたがコントロールしている１体以上のクリーチャーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、宝物・トークン１つを生成し、そのプレイヤーのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を予示する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 蛇・忍者・ならず者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660246&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9dc2c323-4e58-498b-85b2-98d44e4b3142\', \'multiverseId\': 660246}, \'multiverseid\': 660246}, {\'name\': \'裂魂蛇人\', \'text\': \'忍术{3}{B}\\n每当由你操控的一个或数个生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，派出一个珍宝衍生物并显化该牌手的牌库顶牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 蛇／忍者／浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660278&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa0b647f-c9d4-402a-a78b-24057f9c6b7d\', \'multiverseId\': 660278}, \'multiverseid\': 660278}]', '[{\'name\': \'Orzhov-Petschaft\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Erzeuge {W}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Das Siegel hat unterschiedliche Bedeutungen, je nach Form und Material. Manche tragen es als Statussymbol, andere als Zeichen ihrer Schuld.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658971&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e53beada-6bfe-4682-a56e-46322f58959e\', \'multiverseId\': 658971}, \'multiverseid\': 658971}, {\'name\': \'Sello orzhov\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Agrega {W}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'El sello tiene distintos significados dependiendo de su forma y presentación. Mientras algunos lo llevan como un símbolo de estatus, en otros indica una deuda.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659237&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'211ce609-0c45-40c0-9a0d-accff7034913\', \'multiverseId\': 659237}, \'multiverseid\': 659237}, {\'name\': "Cachet d\'Orzhov", \'text\': \'{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {W}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "La forme et la présentation du cachet sont aussi importantes que le cachet en lui-même. Pour certains, c\'est un signe extérieur de leur statut. Pour d\'autres, c\'est un signe extérieur de dette.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659503&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8060a417-4575-437b-b6ab-e29a29a6dd59\', \'multiverseId\': 659503}, \'multiverseid\': 659503}, {\'name\': \'オルゾフの印鑑\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}：{W}{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'印章はその形によって異なる意味を持つ。地位の証として身につけるものもいれば、負債の証として身につけるものもいる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659769&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e5c1062-7105-41e4-ad69-72a3a8834962\', \'multiverseId\': 659769}, \'multiverseid\': 659769}, {\'name\': \'欧佐夫印记\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}：加{W}{B}。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'此印记外观样式与佩戴形式不同，其代表涵义也大不一样。有人将其作为地位的象征，而有人则视为负债的标志。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660035&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'063566dc-f5cf-4f24-adbb-176917a0f6d0\', \'multiverseId\': 660035}, \'multiverseid\': 660035}]', '[{\'name\': \'Pfad der Ahnen\', \'text\': \'Der Pfad der Ahnen kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe der Farbidentität deines Commanders. Wenn dieses Mana ausgegeben wird, um einen Kreaturenzauber zu wirken, der einen Kreaturentyp mit deinem Commander gemeinsam hat, wende Hellsicht 1 an. (Schaue dir die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst sie unter deine Bibliothek legen.)\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659020&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfd95d6a-0e28-4d14-885d-59fab31dc47f\', \'multiverseId\': 659020}, \'multiverseid\': 659020}, {\'name\': \'Senda de los ancestros\', \'text\': \'La Senda de los ancestros entra al campo de batalla girada.\\n{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color en la identidad de color de tu comandante. Cuando ese maná se use para lanzar un hechizo de criatura que comparta un tipo de criatura con tu comandante, adivina 1. (Mira la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Puedes poner esa carta en el fondo.)\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659286&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d14f26e-b4cd-43fd-b49d-9e76b46442f8\', \'multiverseId\': 659286}, \'multiverseid\': 659286}, {\'name\': "Voie de l\'Ascendance", \'text\': "La Voie de l\'Ascendance arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix de l\'identité couleur de votre commandant. Quand ce mana est dépensé pour lancer un sort de créature qui partage un type de créature avec votre commandant, regard 1. (Regardez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez mettre cette carte au-dessous.)", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659552&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb45ecd4-432c-457a-b334-2b0e1f6ca1bf\', \'multiverseId\': 659552}, \'multiverseid\': 659552}, {\'name\': \'祖先の道\', \'text\': \'祖先の道はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：あなたの統率者の固有色１色のマナ１点を加える。そのマナが、あなたの統率者と共通のクリーチャー・タイプを持つクリーチャー・呪文を唱えるために支払われたとき、占術１を行う。（あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を見る。そのカードを一番下に置いてもよい。）\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659818&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40e1ca0f-2723-4e75-bca9-3df86e858927\', \'multiverseId\': 659818}, \'multiverseid\': 659818}, {\'name\': \'祖灵径道\', \'text\': \'祖灵径道须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加一点法术力，其颜色为你指挥官标识色中的任一颜色。当该法术力用来施放与你指挥官具共通生物类别的生物咒语时，占卜1。（检视你牌库顶的牌。你可以将该牌置于你的牌库底。）\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660084&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76f1e9a3-034a-4df8-9a0e-8472103cad88\', \'multiverseId\': 660084}, \'multiverseid\': 660084}]', '[{\'name\': \'Pflugscheuche\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn die Pflugscheuche getappt wird, bestimme eines —\\n• Du kannst eine Länderkarte aus deiner Hand getappt ins Spiel bringen.\\n• Bringe eine Länderkarte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof getappt ins Spiel zurück.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Vogelscheuche\', \'flavor\': \'Schlachtfelder werden zu Kornfeldern.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658976&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e296338e-87f5-4888-a700-7cea0f4e4d86\', \'multiverseId\': 658976}, \'multiverseid\': 658976}, {\'name\': \'Espantarado\', \'text\': \'Siempre que el Espantarado se gire, elige uno:\\n• Puedes poner en el campo de batalla girada una carta de tierra de tu mano.\\n• Regresa la carta de tierra objetivo de tu cementerio al campo de batalla girada.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Espantapájaros\', \'flavor\': \'Los campos de batalla se convierten en campos de trigo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659242&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7cf8fce4-a339-4c0e-a89c-031765ab0f96\', \'multiverseId\': 659242}, \'multiverseid\': 659242}, {\'name\': \'Épouvanculteur\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que l\'Épouvanculteur devient engagé, choisissez l\'un —\\n• Vous pouvez mettre sur le champ de bataille, engagée, une carte de terrain de votre main.\\n• Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille, engagée, une carte de terrain ciblée de votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact — épouvantail\', \'flavor\': \'Les champs de bataille deviennent des champs de céréales.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659508&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e7cc0a7-11c2-4a3d-8db7-5413519fb595\', \'multiverseId\': 659508}, \'multiverseid\': 659508}, {\'name\': \'耕しカカシ\', \'text\': \'耕しカカシがタップ状態になるたび、以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n・あなたの手札にある土地・カード１枚をタップ状態で戦場に出してもよい。\\n・あなたの墓地にある土地・カード１枚を対象とする。それをタップ状態で戦場に戻す。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — カカシ\', \'flavor\': \'広大な戦場が広大な農場に変わる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659774&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42981c46-e57e-4190-a277-c329528832ac\', \'multiverseId\': 659774}, \'multiverseid\': 659774}, {\'name\': \'锄犁草人\', \'text\': \'每当锄犁草人成为横置时，选择一项～\\n•你可以将一张地牌从你手上横置放进战场。\\n•将目标地牌从你的坟墓场横置移回战场。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 — 稻草人\', \'flavor\': \'战场变农场。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660040&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5a8698f-d96e-452c-9dbc-1ec583b0e631\', \'multiverseId\': 660040}, \'multiverseid\': 660040}]', '[{\'name\': \'Pionierstiefel\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur hat Nichtstandardlandtarnung. (Sie kann nicht geblockt werden, solange der verteidigende Spieler ein Nichtstandardland kontrolliert.)\\nAusrüsten {2}\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'Es ist einfacher, die Orte aufzuzählen, an denen sie noch nicht waren.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658979&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f58139e0-4b44-4a0e-a292-c1e780ae782b\', \'multiverseId\': 658979}, \'multiverseid\': 658979}, {\'name\': \'Botas del pionero\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada tiene la habilidad de cruzar tierras no básicas. (No puede ser bloqueada mientras el jugador defensor controle una tierra no básica.)\\nEquipar {2}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'Es mucho más fácil listar los lugares donde no han estado.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659245&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e78ddbef-b4f4-4833-90ca-a2692247312e\', \'multiverseId\': 659245}, \'multiverseid\': 659245}, {\'name\': \'Bottes de pionnier\', \'text\': \'La créature équipée a la traversée des terrains non-base. (Elle ne peut pas être bloquée tant que le joueur défenseur contrôle au moins un terrain non-base.)\\nÉquipement {2}\', \'type\': \'Artefact — équipement\', \'flavor\': "Il est plus facile de faire la liste des endroits où elles n\'ont pas été.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659511&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a51db515-a4fe-4fc5-b98c-95738f47a1ba\', \'multiverseId\': 659511}, \'multiverseid\': 659511}, {\'name\': \'先駆者の長靴\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは基本でない土地渡りを持つ。（それは防御プレイヤーが基本でない土地をコントロールしているかぎりブロックされない。）\\n装備{2}\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'彼らにとっては、行ったことのない場所を並べる方が楽だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659777&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f4ab7a79-4616-4281-8932-0a52dcbff302\', \'multiverseId\': 659777}, \'multiverseid\': 659777}, {\'name\': \'开拓者旅靴\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物具有非基本地行者异能。（只要防御牌手操控非基本地，它便不能被阻挡。）\\n佩带{2}\', \'type\': \'神器 — 武具\', \'flavor\': \'列出它们没有去过的地方会简单得多。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660043&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b56de81-73a1-4306-964e-8cb70209f471\', \'multiverseId\': 660043}, \'multiverseid\': 660043}]', '[{\'name\': \'Plasmafang\', \'text\': \'Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl. Erzeuge zu Beginn deiner nächsten Hauptphase vor dem Kampf X Mana in einer beliebigen Kombination von Farben, wobei X gleich dem Manabetrag jenes Zauberspruchs ist.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Alles dient einem Zweck. Auch du."\\n—Vorel von der Hülsenklade\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658947&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'623d4762-1d39-4d31-aca3-4a6e7f4cdf68\', \'multiverseId\': 658947}, \'multiverseid\': 658947}, {\'name\': \'Captura del plasma\', \'text\': \'Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo. Al comienzo de tu próxima fase principal precombate, agrega X manás de cualquier combinación de colores, donde X es el valor de maná de ese hechizo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Todo tiene un propósito. Incluso tú".\\n—Vorel del Clado de la Vaina\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659213&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a7c66e4-bd72-4ec7-afec-a4f953833ed4\', \'multiverseId\': 659213}, \'multiverseid\': 659213}, {\'name\': \'Capture de plasme\', \'text\': \'Contrecarrez un sort ciblé. Au début de votre prochaine première phase principale, ajoutez X manas de la combinaison de mana coloré de votre choix, X étant la valeur de mana de ce sort.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Tout a une fonction. Même toi. »\\n—Vorel du Cladus Coque\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659479&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00196360-b007-48bf-a0da-76ee54fa3028\', \'multiverseId\': 659479}, \'multiverseid\': 659479}, {\'name\': \'原形質捉え\', \'text\': \'呪文１つを対象とする。それを打ち消す。次のあなたの戦闘前メイン・フェイズの開始時に、好きな色の組み合わせのマナＸ点を加える。Ｘはその打ち消した呪文のマナ総量に等しい。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「万物は皆何らかの役目を果たしている。お前でさえな。」\\n――育殻組のヴォレル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659745&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e54a2006-1363-497f-98ed-d93f82ec606f\', \'multiverseId\': 659745}, \'multiverseid\': 659745}, {\'name\': \'原质吸取\', \'text\': \'反击目标咒语。在你下一个战斗前的行动阶段开始时，加X点法术力，其颜色组合由你选择，X为该咒语的法术力值。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「天生我才必有用，包括你这废物。」\\n～壳进化组的沃瑞\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660011&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a1952d5-7cb7-4d99-8b3f-56f361d425ef\', \'multiverseId\': 660011}, \'multiverseid\': 660011}]', "[{'name': 'Prismalinse', 'text': '{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': 'Sie bricht nicht Licht, sondern Mana, und formt dessen chaotische Strömungen in die festen Formen, die beim Zaubern benötigt werden.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658974&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8431cc25-0924-4bcc-b456-2d16f4ebec47', 'multiverseId': 658974}, 'multiverseid': 658974}, {'name': 'Lente prismático', 'text': '{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color.', 'type': 'Artefacto', 'flavor': 'No refracta la luz, sino el maná; alinea sus corrientes caóticas en ángulos necesarios para fines místicos.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659240&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd50187be-dcfb-4675-9c47-eee7725ff335', 'multiverseId': 659240}, 'multiverseid': 659240}, {'name': 'Lentille prismatique', 'text': '{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{1}, {T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix.', 'type': 'Artefact', 'flavor': 'Elle ne canalise pas la lumière, mais le mana, alignant ses courants chaotiques pour obtenir les angles nécessaires aux objectifs du mystique.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659506&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e6e5e12a-3ef0-488e-8672-866aa912f96b', 'multiverseId': 659506}, 'multiverseid': 659506}, {'name': '虹色のレンズ', 'text': '{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{1}, {T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': 'それは光ではなくマナを曲げ、乱れた流れを神秘的な目的のために鋭い角度へと整列させる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659772&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ca420a36-69a4-4251-9d8e-a26a2bbe1dcf', 'multiverseId': 659772}, 'multiverseid': 659772}, {'name': '虹彩透镜', 'text': '{T}：加{C}。\\n{1}，{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力。', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': '它所扭曲者并非光线，而是法术力，依秘教徒之需求将其混沌流向调校至适当锐角。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660038&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '40bf9e61-2b90-4912-955a-143a51682bd1', 'multiverseId': 660038}, 'multiverseid': 660038}]", '[{\'name\': \'Propaganda\', \'text\': \'Kreaturen können dich nicht angreifen, es sei denn, ihr Beherrscher bezahlt {2} für jede Kreatur, die er kontrolliert und die dich angreift.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Kosten deines Widerstands werden aus deinem Verstand extrahiert."\\n—Nekusar der Gedankenreißer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658818&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ade95e7-5340-4b10-9bf1-d139dbc8c29e\', \'multiverseId\': 658818}, \'multiverseid\': 658818}, {\'name\': \'Propaganda\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas no pueden atacarte a menos que su controlador pague {2} por cada criatura que controla que te está atacando.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"El coste de tu oposición se extraerá de tu cordura".\\n—Nekusar, el arrasamentes\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659084&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2ab8380-968c-4060-a0cf-905ae1c3bf3b\', \'multiverseId\': 659084}, \'multiverseid\': 659084}, {\'name\': \'Propagande\', \'text\': "Les créatures ne peuvent pas vous attaquer à moins que leur contrôleur ne paie {2} pour chaque créature qu\'il contrôle qui vous attaque.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Le prix de votre opposition sera prélevé sur votre esprit. »\\n—Nekusar, le terrasseur d\'esprit", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659350&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7afe1df-b37e-4d51-8a40-d23f0cf90936\', \'multiverseId\': 659350}, \'multiverseid\': 659350}, {\'name\': \'プロパガンダ\', \'text\': \'あなたを攻撃する各クリーチャーにつきそれぞれ、そのコントローラーが{2}を支払わないかぎり、それでは攻撃できない。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「敵対したことの対価は、お前の機知から頂くとしよう。」\\n――精神破壊者、ネクサル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659616&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00c1efe5-6227-421c-9e06-8b2cfce3870f\', \'multiverseId\': 659616}, \'multiverseid\': 659616}, {\'name\': \'宣导\', \'text\': \'对每个生物而言，除非其操控者为其支付{2}，否则它不能攻击你。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「你反抗的代价将从你的智慧中萃取。」\\n～毁灵师奈库萨\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659882&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d882469-e5c0-4f5c-bae2-e656389e974c\', \'multiverseId\': 659882}, \'multiverseid\': 659882}]', "[{'name': 'Prunkvoller Palast', 'text': 'Der Prunkvolle Palast kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B}, {G} oder {U}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': 'Der dichte Dschungel macht einer üppigen, großzügigen Weite Platz. In ihrer Mitte ragen die Turmspitzen des Qarsi-Palasts empor.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659017&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5162a89d-823a-4928-a39e-2822498582f6', 'multiverseId': 659017}, 'multiverseid': 659017}, {'name': 'Palacio opulento', 'text': 'El Palacio opulento entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {B}, {G} o {U}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': 'La densa selva deja paso a un claro exuberante y suntuoso. En el centro se alzan los chapiteles del Palacio de Qarsi.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659283&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4eca9b67-7dc0-4d95-afb4-f131746fca3f', 'multiverseId': 659283}, 'multiverseid': 659283}, {'name': 'Palais opulent', 'text': 'Le Palais opulent arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B}, {G} ou {U}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': 'La jungle dense laisse la place à une étendue luxuriante et flamboyante. En son centre se trouvent les tours du Palais de Qarsi.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659549&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a9bb0bc4-5a42-48c9-9478-87b44c8d5a57', 'multiverseId': 659549}, 'multiverseid': 659549}, {'name': '華やかな宮殿', 'text': '華やかな宮殿はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{B}か{G}か{U}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': '鬱蒼としたジャングルは豊穣で豊かな地へと移り変わる。その中心に伸びているのがカルシ宮殿の尖塔である。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659815&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bd693c50-2a99-4452-99b7-599d9aafe130', 'multiverseId': 659815}, 'multiverseid': 659815}, {'name': '奢华宫殿', 'text': '奢华宫殿须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{B}，{G}或{U}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': '茂密丛林当中辟出大片富饶奢绮地域，隐约可见卡尔西宫殿的尖顶耸立中央。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660081&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9c8fe343-4a11-478a-b46c-dae3bb865627', 'multiverseId': 660081}, 'multiverseid': 660081}]", '[{\'name\': \'Präge des Fälschers\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {U}. Wenn du dieses Mana ausgibst, um einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei mit Manabetrag 3 oder weniger zu wirken, kannst du jenen Zauberspruch ins Exil schicken, anstatt ihn auf den Friedhof seines Besitzers zu legen, sowie er verrechnet wird.\\n{3}{U}{U}, {T}: Du kannst eine beliebige Anzahl an Zaubersprüchen, die von der Präge des Fälschers ins Exil geschickt wurden, wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658366&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d59536c2-d32a-496b-8f72-ab1ef1f6f630\', \'multiverseId\': 658366}, \'multiverseid\': 658366}, {\'name\': \'Fundición de falsificador\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {U}. Cuando uses este maná para lanzar un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro con valor de maná de 3 o menos, puedes exiliar ese hechizo en vez de ponerlo en el cementerio de su propietario en cuanto se resuelve.\\n{3}{U}{U}, {T}: Puedes lanzar cualquier cantidad de hechizos de entre las cartas exiliadas con la Fundición de falsificador sin pagar sus costes de maná. Activa esto solo como un conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658398&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c92a0a60-1cd7-4b0d-a9fa-ba90a1285fe1\', \'multiverseId\': 658398}, \'multiverseid\': 658398}, {\'name\': \'Fonderie du faussaire\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {U}. Quand vous dépensez ce mana pour lancer un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à 3, vous pouvez exiler ce sort à la place de le mettre dans le cimetière de son propriétaire au moment où il se résout.\\n{3}{U}{U}, {T} : Vous pouvez lancer n\'importe quel nombre de sorts parmi les cartes exilées par la Fonderie du faussaire sans payer leur coût de mana. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658430&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d64699f-31a3-4c7a-9157-3089e8ad6bda\', \'multiverseId\': 658430}, \'multiverseid\': 658430}, {\'name\': \'偽造者の鋳造所\', \'text\': \'{T}：{U}を加える。あなたがこのマナを支払ってマナ総量が３以下でありインスタントやソーサリーである呪文１つを唱えたとき、その呪文を解決するに際しそれをオーナーの墓地に置く代わりに、それを追放してもよい。\\n{3}{U}{U}, {T}：偽造者の鋳造所により追放されているカードの中から、望む数の呪文をマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658462&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5803dc2a-0201-4290-8a0f-47dda6a48c11\', \'multiverseId\': 658462}, \'multiverseid\': 658462}, {\'name\': \'铸匠煅炉\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{U}。当你将此法术力用来施放法术力值等于或小于3的瞬间或法术咒语，于该咒语结算时，你可以改为将它放逐，而非置入其拥有者的坟墓场。\\n{3}{U}{U}，{T}：你可以从以铸匠煅炉放逐的牌之中施放任意数量的咒语，且不需支付其法术力费用。只能于法术时机起动。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658494&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dae079cf-8f94-4813-a009-6c52eb55fb85\', \'multiverseId\': 658494}, \'multiverseid\': 658494}]', '[{\'name\': \'Präge des Fälschers\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {U}. Wenn du dieses Mana ausgibst, um einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei mit Manabetrag 3 oder weniger zu wirken, kannst du jenen Zauberspruch ins Exil schicken, anstatt ihn auf den Friedhof seines Besitzers zu legen, sowie er verrechnet wird.\\n{3}{U}{U}, {T}: Du kannst eine beliebige Anzahl an Zaubersprüchen, die von der Präge des Fälschers ins Exil geschickt wurden, wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660174&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40b5c0cd-6a78-4f72-9830-53e3eae95fee\', \'multiverseId\': 660174}, \'multiverseid\': 660174}, {\'name\': \'Fonderie du faussaire\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {U}. Quand vous dépensez ce mana pour lancer un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à 3, vous pouvez exiler ce sort à la place de le mettre dans le cimetière de son propriétaire au moment où il se résout.\\n{3}{U}{U}, {T} : Vous pouvez lancer n\'importe quel nombre de sorts parmi les cartes exilées par la Fonderie du faussaire sans payer leur coût de mana. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660206&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f71159f-79e3-4a27-8ae7-2cbf4f389718\', \'multiverseId\': 660206}, \'multiverseid\': 660206}, {\'name\': \'偽造者の鋳造所\', \'text\': \'{T}：{U}を加える。あなたがこのマナを支払ってマナ総量が３以下でありインスタントやソーサリーである呪文１つを唱えたとき、その呪文を解決するに際しそれをオーナーの墓地に置く代わりに、それを追放してもよい。\\n{3}{U}{U}, {T}：偽造者の鋳造所により追放されているカードの中から、望む数の呪文をマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660238&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'552898bf-7299-405e-ac95-8236a4ab02e6\', \'multiverseId\': 660238}, \'multiverseid\': 660238}, {\'name\': \'铸匠煅炉\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{U}。当你将此法术力用来施放法术力值等于或小于3的瞬间或法术咒语，于该咒语结算时，你可以改为将它放逐，而非置入其拥有者的坟墓场。\\n{3}{U}{U}，{T}：你可以从以铸匠煅炉放逐的牌之中施放任意数量的咒语，且不需支付其法术力费用。只能于法术时机起动。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660270&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'58d6a520-e51b-4936-9d11-afc9ddf3bc37\', \'multiverseId\': 660270}, \'multiverseid\': 660270}]', '[{\'name\': \'Pteromander\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\n{7}{U}: Adaptieren 4. Diese Fähigkeit kostet beim Aktivieren für jede Spontanzauber- und Hexereikarte in deinem Friedhof {1} weniger. (Falls keine +1/+1-Marken auf dieser Kreatur liegen, lege vier +1/+1-Marken auf sie.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Salamander, Sceada\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658819&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b3e33d3-5e8e-42b1-9cc1-aace37d2c00d\', \'multiverseId\': 658819}, \'multiverseid\': 658819}, {\'name\': \'Pteramandra\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\n{7}{U}: Adaptar 4. Cuesta {1} menos activar esta habilidad por cada carta de instantáneo y de conjuro en tu cementerio. (Si esta criatura no tiene contadores +1/+1 sobre ella, pon cuatro contadores +1/+1 sobre ella.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Draco salamandra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659085&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a79cbfb2-9883-4fb6-a539-fc32be60237d\', \'multiverseId\': 659085}, \'multiverseid\': 659085}, {\'name\': \'Ptéramandre\', \'text\': "Vol\\n{7}{U} : Adaptez 4. Cette capacité coûte {1} de moins à activer pour chaque carte d\'éphémère et de rituel dans votre cimetière. (Si cette créature n\'a pas de marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle, mettez quatre marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle.)", \'type\': \'Créature — salamandre et drakôn\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659351&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc71c50c-e5fb-412f-84a3-22a9b238de44\', \'multiverseId\': 659351}, \'multiverseid\': 659351}, {\'name\': \'プテラマンダー\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n{7}{U}：順応４を行う。この能力を起動するためのコストは、あなたの墓地にありインスタントやソーサリーであるカード１枚につき{1}少なくなる。（このクリーチャーの上に＋１/＋１カウンターがないなら、これの上に＋１/＋１カウンター４個を置く。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — サラマンダー・ドレイク\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659617&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ea8681c-45f4-4393-92d5-a1da4ebdfe30\', \'multiverseId\': 659617}, \'multiverseid\': 659617}, {\'name\': \'翼蜥\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n{7}{U}：演化4。你坟墓场中每有一张瞬间与法术牌，此异能便减少{1}来起动。（如果此生物上没有+1/+1指示物，则在其上放置四个+1/+1指示物。）\', \'type\': \'生物 — 火蜥蜴／龙兽\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659883&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bf0a3e1-40a9-45e1-8821-ffe0603b9488\', \'multiverseId\': 659883}, \'multiverseid\': 659883}]', '[{\'name\': \'Pyretischer Ansturm\', \'text\': \'Wirf deine Hand ab und ziehe dann vier Karten. Für jede auf diese Weise abgeworfene Karte erhalten Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nAushecken {3}{R} (Du kannst {3}{R} bezahlen und diese Karte aus deiner Hand ins Exil schicken. Wirke sie in einem späteren Zug als Hexerei, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Spiele Aushecken wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658381&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c40ab6cc-dcc3-4511-b37d-aad81a2c7df0\', \'multiverseId\': 658381}, \'multiverseid\': 658381}, {\'name\': \'Carga pírica\', \'text\': \'Descarta tu mano y luego roba cuatro cartas. Por cada carta descartada de esta manera, las criaturas que controlas obtienen +1/+0 hasta el final del turno.\\nTramar {3}{R}. (Puedes pagar {3}{R} y exiliar esta carta de tu mano. Lánzala como un conjuro en un turno posterior sin pagar su coste de maná. Activa la habilidad de tramar solo como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658413&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce2fade4-0917-4665-af8d-0742e8b5cee6\', \'multiverseId\': 658413}, \'multiverseid\': 658413}, {\'name\': \'Charge pyrétique\', \'text\': "Défaussez-vous de votre main, puis piochez quatre cartes. Pour chaque carte défaussée de cette manière, les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nComplot {3}{R} (Vous pouvez payer {3}{R} et exiler cette carte depuis votre main. Lancez-la comme un rituel pendant un autre tour sans payer son coût de mana. Ne complotez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658445&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f588061-184a-467e-a13e-35617ae5bdc1\', \'multiverseId\': 658445}, \'multiverseid\': 658445}, {\'name\': \'紅蓮の突撃\', \'text\': \'あなたの手札を捨て、その後、カード４枚を引く。ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは、これにより捨てたカード１枚につき＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\\n計画{3}{R}（{3}{R}を支払って、あなたの手札にあるこのカードを追放してもよい。後のターンに、これをソーサリーとして、マナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。計画はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658477&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2935127-715e-4e07-8512-306fd807f3ea\', \'multiverseId\': 658477}, \'multiverseid\': 658477}, {\'name\': \'火热冲锋\', \'text\': \'弃掉你的手牌，然后抓四张牌。每以此法弃掉一张牌，由你操控的生物便得+1/+0直到回合结束。\\n设谋{3}{R}（你可以支付{3}{R}并从你手上放逐此牌。过了该回合后，便可于法术时机施放之，且不需支付其法术力费用。只能于法术时机设谋。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658509&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bb18623-9c2a-4ff2-85a9-63f2ba83841e\', \'multiverseId\': 658509}, \'multiverseid\': 658509}]', '[{\'name\': \'Pyretischer Ansturm\', \'text\': \'Wirf deine Hand ab und ziehe dann vier Karten. Für jede auf diese Weise abgeworfene Karte erhalten Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nAushecken {3}{R}\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660189&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c4bdade-ad05-4477-9504-0ab32f8b80f6\', \'multiverseId\': 660189}, \'multiverseid\': 660189}, {\'name\': \'Charge pyrétique\', \'text\': "Défaussez-vous de votre main, puis piochez quatre cartes. Pour chaque carte défaussée de cette manière, les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nComplot {3}{R}", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660221&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d89a29c6-aeef-4107-bde7-5e6a14f57553\', \'multiverseId\': 660221}, \'multiverseid\': 660221}, {\'name\': \'紅蓮の突撃\', \'text\': \'あなたの手札を捨て、その後、カード４枚を引く。ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは、これにより捨てたカード１枚につき＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\\n計画{3}{R}\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660253&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fda19440-9817-4f9d-8ea8-b354ece49f18\', \'multiverseId\': 660253}, \'multiverseid\': 660253}, {\'name\': \'火热冲锋\', \'text\': \'弃掉你的手牌，然后抓四张牌。每以此法弃掉一张牌，由你操控的生物便得+1/+0直到回合结束。\\n设谋{3}{R}\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660285&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1f7dfd8-7cbf-4b7c-88b2-373ee3905093\', \'multiverseId\': 660285}, \'multiverseid\': 660285}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rachsüchtiger Nachwuchs\', \'text\': \'Bringe bis zu drei Länderkarten deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof getappt ins Spiel zurück. Erzeuge entsprechend viele 4/2 grüne Pflanze-Krieger-Kreaturenspielsteine mit Reichweite.\\nRückblende {6}{G}{G} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658387&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b287855e-17b3-4542-bfb2-768e6e25d588\', \'multiverseId\': 658387}, \'multiverseid\': 658387}, {\'name\': \'Reverdecimiento vengativo\', \'text\': \'Regresa hasta tres cartas de tierra objetivo de tu cementerio al campo de batalla giradas. Crea esa misma cantidad de fichas de criatura Guerrero Planta verdes 4/2 con la habilidad de alcance.\\nRetrospectiva {6}{G}{G}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658419&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81a04abb-f12c-4cad-904d-a069dcf39d25\', \'multiverseId\': 658419}, \'multiverseid\': 658419}, {\'name\': \'Recroissance vengeresse\', \'text\': "Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille, engagées, jusqu\'à trois cartes de terrain ciblées depuis votre cimetière. Créez autant de jetons de créature 4/2 verte Plante et Guerrier avec la portée.\\nFlashback {6}{G}{G} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658451&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2817664-85ef-44db-bfe9-c865c923d4c4\', \'multiverseId\': 658451}, \'multiverseid\': 658451}, {\'name\': \'復讐に燃えた芽吹き\', \'text\': \'あなたの墓地にある土地・カード最大３枚を対象とする。それらをタップ状態で戦場に戻す。その枚数に等しい数の、到達を持つ緑の４/２の植物・戦士・クリーチャー・トークンを生成する。\\nフラッシュバック{6}{G}{G}（あなたの墓地にあるこのカードを、これのフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658483&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb28ebf6-2b81-4a22-8646-d8ec5ad896af\', \'multiverseId\': 658483}, \'multiverseid\': 658483}, {\'name\': \'怨仇怒放\', \'text\': \'将至多三张目标地牌从你的坟墓场横置移回战场。派出等量的4/2绿色，具延势异能的植物／战士衍生生物。\\n返照{6}{G}{G}（你可以从你坟墓场中施放此牌，并支付其返照费用，然后将它放逐。）\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658515&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1736c5f7-e7d5-499a-ac72-3aef2944a09b\', \'multiverseId\': 658515}, \'multiverseid\': 658515}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rachsüchtiger Nachwuchs\', \'text\': \'Bringe bis zu drei Länderkarten deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof getappt ins Spiel zurück. Erzeuge entsprechend viele 4/2 grüne Pflanze-Krieger-Kreaturenspielsteine mit Reichweite.\\nRückblende {6}{G}{G}\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660195&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86feb876-9e37-4b3e-bef7-f22280979085\', \'multiverseId\': 660195}, \'multiverseid\': 660195}, {\'name\': \'Recroissance vengeresse\', \'text\': "Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille, engagées, jusqu\'à trois cartes de terrain ciblées depuis votre cimetière. Créez autant de jetons de créature 4/2 verte Plante et Guerrier avec la portée.\\nFlashback {6}{G}{G}", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660227&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5febbe45-4ead-4bba-889b-43551bf55342\', \'multiverseId\': 660227}, \'multiverseid\': 660227}, {\'name\': \'復讐に燃えた芽吹き\', \'text\': \'あなたの墓地にある土地・カード最大３枚を対象とする。それらをタップ状態で戦場に戻す。その枚数に等しい数の、到達を持つ緑の４/２の植物・戦士・クリーチャー・トークンを生成する。\\nフラッシュバック{6}{G}{G}\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660259&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb6a6f23-232d-49c8-b1eb-0f844d3e38e7\', \'multiverseId\': 660259}, \'multiverseid\': 660259}, {\'name\': \'怨仇怒放\', \'text\': \'将至多三张目标地牌从你的坟墓场横置移回战场。派出等量的4/2绿色，具延势异能的植物／战士衍生生物。\\n返照{6}{G}{G}\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660291&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d3b6cf2-8f82-4469-bb84-546d4d4dfcb3\', \'multiverseId\': 660291}, \'multiverseid\': 660291}]', '[{\'name\': \'Radikale Idee\', \'text\': \'Ziehe eine Karte.\\nKatalyse (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof wirken, indem du zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Kosten eine Karte abwirfst. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Genialität bedeutet, die Grenzen des Möglichen auszuloten und diese dann zu überwinden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658820&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96765599-95c7-4b01-88cc-24db7796b051\', \'multiverseId\': 658820}, \'multiverseid\': 658820}, {\'name\': \'Idea radical\', \'text\': \'Roba una carta.\\nRecargar. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio descartando una carta además de pagar sus otros costes. Luego, exilia esta carta.)\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'La genialidad es hallar el límite de lo posible y después saltárselo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659086&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af38fe38-23f9-4435-80f5-f430365bb6cd\', \'multiverseId\': 659086}, \'multiverseid\': 659086}, {\'name\': \'Idée radicale\', \'text\': "Piochez une carte.\\nRelancez (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière en vous défaussant d\'une carte en plus de payer ses autres coûts. Puis exilez cette carte.)", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'Le génie revient à aller aux frontières du possible et à les dépasser.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659352&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8204e08a-4058-4f47-899c-9202163a9257\', \'multiverseId\': 659352}, \'multiverseid\': 659352}, {\'name\': \'急進思想\', \'text\': \'カード１枚を引く。\\n再活（あなたの墓地にあるこのカードを、他のコストの支払いに加えてカード１枚を捨てることで唱えてもよい。その後、このカードを追放する。）\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'天才とは可能性の限界を見つけ、それを飛び越えることだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659618&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92d0072f-e69b-485e-aefc-d74fa6ad7d6e\', \'multiverseId\': 659618}, \'multiverseid\': 659618}, {\'name\': \'激进创想\', \'text\': \'抓一张牌。\\n再起（你可以从你的坟墓场施放此牌，但必须支付其所需费用并额外弃一张牌。然后放逐此牌。）\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'所谓天才之举，便是发现可能的边界，然后一跃而过。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659884&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8127d1cf-f659-471f-aa0c-ef091dd45e68\', \'multiverseId\': 659884}, \'multiverseid\': 659884}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rakdos-Petschaft\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Erzeuge {B}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Es wird aus Knochen gefertigt und in Blut gesiedet, aber ein Rakdos-Petschaft gilt erst dann als vollkommen, wenn es als Mordwaffe verwendet wurde.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658975&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'582ea2ff-100c-4432-8590-578e392f29b0\', \'multiverseId\': 658975}, \'multiverseid\': 658975}, {\'name\': \'Sello rakdos\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Agrega {B}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Hecho de hueso y hervido en sangre, el sello rakdos no está terminado hasta que no se usa como un arma homicida.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659241&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c96021d-86a3-4be3-bbb3-9188346330ae\', \'multiverseId\': 659241}, \'multiverseid\': 659241}, {\'name\': \'Cachet de Rakdos\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {B}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Fait d\'os bouilli dans le sang, un cachet de Rakdos est considéré comme terminé lorsqu\'il a été utilisé comme arme pour un meurtre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659507&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29734383-7e9a-48c0-bcf2-7be6ea08460a\', \'multiverseId\': 659507}, \'multiverseid\': 659507}, {\'name\': \'ラクドスの印鑑\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}：{B}{R}を加える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'骨から作られ血で煮られるラクドスの印鑑は、さらに殺しの武器として用いられるまでは完成したとみなされない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659773&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4208fdbc-df11-49de-a2b7-18bd97b883ce\', \'multiverseId\': 659773}, \'multiverseid\': 659773}, {\'name\': \'拉铎司印记\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}：加{B}{R}。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'拉铎司印记以白骨制成，要拿鲜血煮过，并且用来杀生之后才能算是大功告成。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660039&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d2c8453c-a4be-43f8-874a-22a8d3ee174f\', \'multiverseId\': 660039}, \'multiverseid\': 660039}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rampenlicht stehlen\', \'text\': \'Jeder Gegner bestimmt Ruhm oder Reichtum. Für jeden Spieler, der Ruhm bestimmt hat, übernimmst du bis zum Ende des Zuges die Kontrolle über eine Kreatur, die der Spieler kontrolliert. Enttappe die Kreaturen. Sie erhalten Eile bis zum Ende des Zuges. Für jeden Spieler, der Reichtum bestimmt hat, ziehst du eine Karte und erzeugst einen Schatz-Spielstein.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658889&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c75eed52-ee47-47a3-a00f-fdc99a773c03\', \'multiverseId\': 658889}, \'multiverseid\': 658889}, {\'name\': \'Acaparar la atención\', \'text\': \'Cada oponente elige fama o fortuna. Por cada jugador que eligió fama, ganas el control de una criatura que controla ese jugador hasta el final del turno. Endereza esas criaturas y ganan la habilidad de prisa hasta el final del turno. Por cada jugador que eligió fortuna, robas una carta y creas una ficha de Tesoro.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659155&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd40fa0b-7117-4b88-94f2-0d69d7b63142\', \'multiverseId\': 659155}, \'multiverseid\': 659155}, {\'name\': "Saisir l\'occasion", \'text\': "Chaque adversaire choisit célébrité ou fortune. Pour chaque joueur qui a choisi célébrité, acquérez le contrôle d\'une créature que ce joueur contrôle jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Dégagez ces créatures et elles acquièrent la célérité jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Pour chaque joueur qui a choisi fortune, vous piochez une carte et vous créez un jeton Trésor.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659421&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5adc338-ac3c-45b6-9076-54e7b59059dc\', \'multiverseId\': 659421}, \'multiverseid\': 659421}, {\'name\': \'注目の捕縛\', \'text\': \'各対戦相手はそれぞれ「名声」か「富」を選ぶ。「名声」を選んだ各プレイヤーにつきそれぞれ、ターン終了時まで、あなたはそのプレイヤーがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体のコントロールを得る。それらのクリーチャーをアンタップする。ターン終了時まで、それらは速攻を得る。「富」を選んだ各プレイヤーにつきそれぞれ、あなたはカード１枚を引き宝物・トークン１つを生成する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659687&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'090b1421-ff14-4bf4-bc1a-579ff947320f\', \'multiverseId\': 659687}, \'multiverseid\': 659687}, {\'name\': \'夺取焦点\', \'text\': \'每位对手各选择「名誉」或「财富」。对每位选择「名誉」的牌手而言，你获得一个由该牌手操控的生物之操控权直到回合结束。重置这些生物，且它们获得敏捷异能直到回合结束。每有一位选择「财富」的牌手，你便抓一张牌并派出一个珍宝衍生物。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659953&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9aa6df7-a64d-409d-b6d7-c5b64a65ec2f\', \'multiverseId\': 659953}, \'multiverseid\': 659953}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ramunap-Ausgräberin\', \'text\': \'Du kannst Länder aus deinem Friedhof spielen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Naga, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Welt endet nicht mit dem Untergang Naktamuns."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658912&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91690b87-ddf4-44f2-a741-f40e7ced4cc5\', \'multiverseId\': 658912}, \'multiverseid\': 658912}, {\'name\': \'Excavadora de Ramunap\', \'text\': \'Puedes jugar tierras desde tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo naga\', \'flavor\': \'"En el pasado, este mundo era mucho más que los confines de Naktamun".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659178&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57ac9e82-73b3-4a16-9e99-36813f7ac542\', \'multiverseId\': 659178}, \'multiverseid\': 659178}, {\'name\': \'Excavatrice de Ramunap\', \'text\': \'Vous pouvez jouer des terrains depuis votre cimetière.\', \'type\': \'Créature — naga et clerc\', \'flavor\': \'« Autrefois, ce monde ne se limitait pas à Naktamon. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659444&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44ae46dd-e011-49df-bd41-c9dec3f9660f\', \'multiverseId\': 659444}, \'multiverseid\': 659444}, {\'name\': \'ラムナプの採掘者\', \'text\': \'あなたの墓地から土地をプレイしてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ナーガ・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'「かつてのこの世界は、ナクタムンの境域よりも遥かに広かったんだわ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659710&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b2f2759-05fd-468a-90ab-64ec5da57a4e\', \'multiverseId\': 659710}, \'multiverseid\': 659710}, {\'name\': \'拉慕拿开挖人\', \'text\': \'你可以从你的坟墓场中使用地。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 那伽／僧侣\', \'flavor\': \'「这个世界曾在拿塔蒙屏障之外也有广阔天地。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659976&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'373d60ca-f773-4b84-9f4c-892e412e61d2\', \'multiverseId\': 659976}, \'multiverseid\': 659976}]', "[{'name': 'Ramunap-Ruinen', 'text': '{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}, bezahle 1 Lebenspunkt: Erzeuge {R}.\\n{2}{R}{R}, {T}, opfere eine Wüste: Die Ramunap-Ruinen fügen jedem Gegner 2 Schadenspunkte zu.', 'type': 'Land — Wüste', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659021&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '621e7c2e-020d-4fa2-b24e-f92f3a32fa2b', 'multiverseId': 659021}, 'multiverseid': 659021}, {'name': 'Ruinas de Ramunap', 'text': '{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{T}, pagar 1 vida: Agrega {R}.\\n{2}{R}{R}, {T}, sacrificar un Desierto: Las Ruinas de Ramunap hacen 2 puntos de daño a cada oponente.', 'type': 'Tierra — Desierto', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659287&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a6b6b756-f0dc-4a23-a6f3-5b712ce714c9', 'multiverseId': 659287}, 'multiverseid': 659287}, {'name': 'Ruines de Ramunap', 'text': '{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T}, payez 1 point de vie : Ajoutez {R}.\\n{2}{R}{R}, {T}, sacrifiez un désert : Les Ruines de Ramunap infligent 2 blessures à chaque adversaire.', 'type': 'Terrain — désert', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659553&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e1e97466-744d-4350-88e3-19f639c18648', 'multiverseId': 659553}, 'multiverseid': 659553}, {'name': 'ラムナプの遺跡', 'text': '{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}, １点のライフを支払う：{R}を加える。\\n{2}{R}{R}, {T}, 砂漠１つを生け贄に捧げる：ラムナプの遺跡は各対戦相手にそれぞれ２点のダメージを与える。', 'type': '土地 — 砂漠', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659819&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b5f9ee59-ddf8-45f5-a6fd-15c882244f3d', 'multiverseId': 659819}, 'multiverseid': 659819}, {'name': '拉慕拿遗迹', 'text': '{T}：加{C}。\\n{T}，支付1点生命：加{R}。\\n{2}{R}{R}，{T}，牺牲一个沙漠：拉慕拿遗迹向每位对手各造成2点伤害。', 'type': '地 — 沙漠', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660085&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '61e0a583-f12d-4c0d-a916-eb7ba23cd691', 'multiverseId': 660085}, 'multiverseid': 660085}]", '[{\'name\': \'Rankel, Meister der Streiche\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Eile\\nImmer wenn Rankel, Meister der Streiche, einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, bestimme eine beliebige Anzahl —\\n• Jeder Spieler wirft eine Karte ab.\\n• Jeder Spieler verliert 1 Lebenspunkt und zieht eine Karte.\\n• Jeder Spieler opfert eine Kreatur.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Feenwesen, Räuber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658858&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5fafcd36-4206-47d8-bfe2-fa45bbffb483\', \'multiverseId\': 658858}, \'multiverseid\': 658858}, {\'name\': \'Rankle, Maestro de las Bromas\', \'text\': \'Vuela, prisa.\\nSiempre que Rankle, Maestro de las Bromas haga daño de combate a un jugador, elige cualquier cantidad de opciones:\\n• Cada jugador descarta una carta.\\n• Cada jugador pierde 1 vida y roba una carta.\\n• Cada jugador sacrifica una criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Bribón hada\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659124&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d4c1839-3711-4617-86a6-2ea43c1e8616\', \'multiverseId\': 659124}, \'multiverseid\': 659124}, {\'name\': \'Turlupin, Maître farceur\', \'text\': "Vol, célérité\\nÀ chaque fois que Turlupin, Maître farceur inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, choisissez n\'importe quel nombre —\\n• Chaque joueur se défausse d\'une carte.\\n• Chaque joueur perd 1 point de vie et pioche une carte.\\n• Chaque joueur sacrifie une créature.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — peuple fée et gredin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659390&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29851b20-2957-4911-b3d8-6730a2799587\', \'multiverseId\': 659390}, \'multiverseid\': 659390}, {\'name\': \'悪ふざけの名人、ランクル\', \'text\': \'飛行、速攻\\n悪ふざけの名人、ランクルがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、以下から望む数だけ選ぶ。\\n・各プレイヤーはそれぞれカード１枚を捨てる。\\n・各プレイヤーはそれぞれ１点のライフを失い、カード１枚を引く。\\n・各プレイヤーはそれぞれクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — フェアリー・ならず者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659656&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3d0fdd6-8676-4929-bb2f-00bf5e18b435\', \'multiverseId\': 659656}, \'multiverseid\': 659656}, {\'name\': \'恶戏之王兰卡\', \'text\': \'飞行，敏捷\\n每当恶戏之王兰卡对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，选择任意数量的模式～\\n•每位牌手各弃一张牌。\\n•每位牌手失去1点生命且各抓一张牌。\\n•每位牌手各牺牲一个生物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 仙灵／浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659922&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f66bdf5c-b787-4a4d-8c6c-b9820290d6e8\', \'multiverseId\': 659922}, \'multiverseid\': 659922}]', '[{\'name\': \'Regen des Reichtums\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Regen des Reichtums ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge zwei Schatz-Spielsteine.\\nDer erste Zauberspruch, den du pro Zug wirkst und für den Mana von einem Schatz ausgegeben wurde, hat Kaskade. (Wenn du den Zauberspruch wirkst, schicke Karten oben von deiner Bibliothek ins Exil, bis du eine Nichtland-Karte ins Exil schickst, die weniger kostet. Du kannst sie wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Lege die so ins Exil geschickten Karten in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter die Bibliothek.)\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658887&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d15db950-2ecb-4c42-ae12-46ba1ca8799d\', \'multiverseId\': 658887}, \'multiverseid\': 658887}, {\'name\': \'Lluvia de riquezas\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Lluvia de riquezas entre al campo de batalla, crea dos fichas de Tesoro.\\nEl primer hechizo que lances cada turno usando maná de un Tesoro tiene la habilidad de cascada. (Cuando lances el hechizo, exilia cartas de la parte superior de tu biblioteca hasta que exilies una carta que no sea tierra y que cueste menos. Puedes lanzarla sin pagar su coste de maná. Pon las cartas exiliadas en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.)\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659153&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e409ca37-bdee-4192-9d5a-828d0dc1f40a\', \'multiverseId\': 659153}, \'multiverseid\': 659153}, {\'name\': \'Pluie de richesses\', \'text\': "Quand la Pluie de richesses arrive sur le champ de bataille, créez deux jetons Trésor.\\nLe premier sort que vous lancez à chaque tour pour lequel du mana d\'un trésor a été dépensé pour le lancer a la cascade. (Quand vous lancez le sort, exilez les cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce que vous exiliez une carte non-terrain d\'un coût inférieur. Vous pouvez la lancer sans payer son coût de mana. Mettez les cartes exilées au-dessous de la bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.)", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659419&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a80c7f0d-be34-42d7-9f48-a447b0307538\', \'multiverseId\': 659419}, \'multiverseid\': 659419}, {\'name\': \'降り注ぐ富\', \'text\': \'降り注ぐ富が戦場に出たとき、宝物・トークン２つを生成する。\\nあなたが各ターンに宝物からのマナを支払って唱えた最初の呪文は続唱を持つ。（あなたがその呪文を唱えたとき、コストがそれより低く土地でないカード１枚が追放されるまで、あなたのライブラリーの一番上から１枚ずつ追放していく。それをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。それらの追放したカードを、無作為の順番で一番下に置く。）\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659685&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7910f610-412a-4c2b-bf4a-6487f59e25aa\', \'multiverseId\': 659685}, \'multiverseid\': 659685}, {\'name\': \'金如雨下\', \'text\': \'当金如雨下进战场时，派出两个珍宝衍生物。\\n你每回合第一个施放时支付过来自珍宝之法术力的咒语具有倾曳异能。（当你施放该咒语时，从你的牌库顶开始放逐牌，直到放逐一张费用比其低的非地牌为止。你可以施放该牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。将所放逐的牌以随机顺序置于牌库底。）\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659951&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a932094-4ab8-434a-af82-c294ff012340\', \'multiverseId\': 659951}, \'multiverseid\': 659951}]', '[{\'name\': \'Richtspruch des Konzils\', \'text\': \'Wille des Konzils — Beginnend mit dir stimmt jeder Spieler für ein Nichtland-Permanent, das du nicht kontrollierst. Schicke jedes Permanent mit den meisten Stimmen ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn seine Macht bedroht ist, spricht das Konzil mit vereinter Stimme.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658789&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'971ddac8-51e2-49a1-b5d9-9a8aea9e14ca\', \'multiverseId\': 658789}, \'multiverseid\': 658789}, {\'name\': \'Juicio del consejo\', \'text\': \'Voluntad del consejo — Comenzando contigo, cada jugador vota por un permanente que no sea tierra que no controlas. Exilia cada permanente con más votos o los que empaten con más votos.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando se amenaza su poder, el consejo habla con una sola voz.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659055&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3c546c5-bc7b-4317-835c-16465422e177\', \'multiverseId\': 659055}, \'multiverseid\': 659055}, {\'name\': \'Jugement selon le Conseil\', \'text\': \'Volonté du conseil — En commençant par vous, chaque joueur vote pour un permanent non-terrain que vous ne contrôlez pas. Exilez chaque permanent avec le plus de votes ou qui partage le plus de votes.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Lorsque sa souveraineté est menacée, le conseil parle d\'une voix unanime.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659321&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01f48635-3b10-4034-9d6f-2c32a39d90b2\', \'multiverseId\': 659321}, \'multiverseid\': 659321}, {\'name\': \'議会の採決\', \'text\': \'議決 ― あなたから始めて各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、あなたがコントロールしておらず土地でもないパーマネント１つに投票する。最多あるいは最多と同数の票を獲得したすべてのパーマネントを追放する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'その権限が脅かされたとき、議会は統一された見解をもって声明を出す。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659587&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b31379e-5298-40d9-a2d2-bc2e7062c433\', \'multiverseId\': 659587}, \'multiverseid\': 659587}, {\'name\': \'众议裁定\', \'text\': \'议定～由你开始，每位牌手各投票选择一个不由你操控的非地永久物。放逐票数最多或与他者同为最多的所有永久物。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'当议会威权受到挑战时，其间众口会以同声回敬。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659853&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3eaaddb5-2bca-4b4e-b2f9-44f287f27566\', \'multiverseId\': 659853}, \'multiverseid\': 659853}]', "[{'name': 'Rostwasser-See', 'text': '{1}, {T}: Erzeuge {U}{R}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': 'Stabilität und Unbeständigkeit wirbeln zusammen und erschaffen Schönheit ebenso wie Gefahr.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659004&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bd15f077-d208-4062-9a5c-5517bd78b7a7', 'multiverseId': 659004}, 'multiverseid': 659004}, {'name': 'Lago férrico', 'text': '{1}, {T}: Agrega {U}{R}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': 'La estabilidad y la volatilidad, juntas, con un resultado tan bello como peligroso.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659270&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6cc9230f-ea04-4ca3-b112-c5c92d045c8a', 'multiverseId': 659270}, 'multiverseid': 659270}, {'name': 'Lac ferrique', 'text': '{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {U}{R}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': 'Stabilité et volatilité mélangées, créant à la fois beauté et danger.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659536&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '631126e8-9279-4403-beca-993592c097c7', 'multiverseId': 659536}, 'multiverseid': 659536}, {'name': '蝕む池', 'text': '{1}, {T}：{U}{R}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': '安定と不安定が混ざり合い、美と危険の両方を生み出す。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659802&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '73adcb3b-3a9a-41fd-a6bd-f5dfe530c32a', 'multiverseId': 659802}, 'multiverseid': 659802}, {'name': '褐锈深湖', 'text': '{1}，{T}：加{U}{R}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': '静动交融，险中生艳。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660068&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '20072751-e255-4e0d-a04b-028f164ffff6', 'multiverseId': 660068}, 'multiverseid': 660068}]", '[{\'name\': \'Ruchloser Reichtum\', \'text\': \'Ein Gegner deiner Wahl schickt die obersten X Karten seiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Du kannst davon eine beliebige Anzahl an Zaubersprüchen mit Manabetrag X oder weniger wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Gold kauft Tod. Tod verdient Gold.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658959&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'565fdb40-d217-4acd-83e2-0a00ff6c5d55\', \'multiverseId\': 658959}, \'multiverseid\': 658959}, {\'name\': \'Riqueza vil\', \'text\': \'El oponente objetivo exilia las X primeras cartas de su biblioteca. Puedes lanzar cualquier cantidad de hechizos con valor de maná de X o menos de entre ellas sin pagar sus costes de maná.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'El oro compra la muerte. La muerte hace ganar oro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659225&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb359b7e-52f0-4b3d-b4fa-f2e4d7c52717\', \'multiverseId\': 659225}, \'multiverseid\': 659225}, {\'name\': \'Richesse abominable\', \'text\': "Un adversaire ciblé exile les X cartes du dessus de sa bibliothèque. Vous pouvez lancer n\'importe quel nombre de sorts avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à X parmi elles sans payer leur coût de mana.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "La mort coûte autant qu\'elle rapporte.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659491&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'307e868b-45e7-44a9-8ed4-38d4ef38fe47\', \'multiverseId\': 659491}, \'multiverseid\': 659491}, {\'name\': \'悪逆な富\', \'text\': \'対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは自分のライブラリーの一番上にあるカードＸ枚を追放する。あなたはその中から、マナ総量がＸ以下である望む数の呪文を、マナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'金は死を買う。死は金を稼ぐ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659757&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d769a3a-062d-438d-900a-c8cbfe066342\', \'multiverseId\': 659757}, \'multiverseid\': 659757}, {\'name\': \'不义之财\', \'text\': \'目标对手放逐其牌库顶的X张牌。你可以从其中施放任意数量法术力值等于或小于X的咒语，且不需支付其法术力费用。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'钱能买凶。死能生钱。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660023&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49150bed-3b88-41dc-a8d4-3920a0429622\', \'multiverseId\': 660023}, \'multiverseid\': 660023}]', '[{\'name\': \'Rückkehr des Wildsprechers\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Ziehe so viele Karten, wie die höchste Stärke unter den Nicht-Mensch-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, beträgt.\\n• Nicht-Mensch-Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +3/+3 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Der Fluch ist gebrochen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658913&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31797410-24e0-40f1-8a75-7bf4017af4ba\', \'multiverseId\': 658913}, \'multiverseid\': 658913}, {\'name\': \'Regreso del Portavoz Salvaje\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• Roba una cantidad de cartas igual a la mayor fuerza entre las criaturas que no sean Humano que controlas.\\n• Las criaturas que no sean Humano que controlas obtienen +3/+3 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Se ha roto la maldición".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659179&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82c4fc2c-186f-4195-bdc4-df901369a57f\', \'multiverseId\': 659179}, \'multiverseid\': 659179}, {\'name\': \'Retour du Languebestion\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Piochez un nombre de cartes égal à la force la plus élevée parmi les créatures non-Humain que vous contrôlez.\\n• Les créatures non-Humain que vous contrôlez gagnent +3/+3 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« La malédiction est brisée. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659445&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ebca209-815a-4bf3-9830-26ffe50bb965\', \'multiverseId\': 659445}, \'multiverseid\': 659445}, {\'name\': \'野生語りの帰還\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n・あなたがコントロールしていて人間でないクリーチャーの中のパワーの最大値に等しい枚数のカードを引く。\\n・ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしていて人間でないすべてのクリーチャーは＋３/＋３の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「呪いは解けた。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659711&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a3ca058-d115-4e8a-9d34-7281fb615d64\', \'multiverseId\': 659711}, \'multiverseid\': 659711}, {\'name\': \'召兽使复归\', \'text\': \'选择一项～\\n•抓若干牌，其数量等同于由你操控之非人类生物中的最大力量。\\n•由你操控的非人类生物得+3/+3直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「诅咒失效了。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659977&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d811bd65-12e7-4db2-9880-e07c18fc1c0b\', \'multiverseId\': 659977}, \'multiverseid\': 659977}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sandkundschafterin\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Sandkundschafterin ins Spiel kommt und falls ein Gegner mehr Länder kontrolliert als du, durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Wüste-Karte, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach.\\nImmer wenn eine oder mehrere Länderkarten von irgendwoher auf deinen Friedhof gelegt werden, erzeuge einen 1/1 roten, grünen und weißen Sand-Krieger-Kreaturenspielstein. Diese Fähigkeit wird nur einmal pro Zug ausgelöst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Späher\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658363&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a6c5342-cd15-4d06-ace3-9f066fcd4be7\', \'multiverseId\': 658363}, \'multiverseid\': 658363}, {\'name\': \'Exploradora de las arenas\', \'text\': \'Cuando la Exploradora de las arenas entre al campo de batalla, si un oponente controla más tierras que tú, busca en tu biblioteca una carta de Desierto, ponla en el campo de batalla girada y luego baraja.\\nSiempre que una o más cartas de tierra vayan a tu cementerio desde cualquier parte, crea una ficha de criatura Guerrero Arena roja, verde y blanca 1/1. Esta habilidad solo se dispara una vez por turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Explorador humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658395&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd065edf-7448-44df-bc94-67bbbbdaf351\', \'multiverseId\': 658395}, \'multiverseid\': 658395}, {\'name\': \'Éclaireuse des dunes\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Éclaireuse des dunes arrive sur le champ de bataille, si un adversaire contrôle plus de terrains que vous, cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de désert, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille engagée, puis mélangez.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'au moins une carte de terrain est mise dans votre cimetière d\'où qu\'elle vienne, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 rouge, verte et blanche Sable et Guerrier. Cette capacité ne se déclenche qu\'une seule fois par tour.", \'type\': \'Créature — humain et éclaireur\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658427&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab155b9c-36cf-474c-bb54-3c93c5fda8f9\', \'multiverseId\': 658427}, \'multiverseid\': 658427}, {\'name\': \'砂の斥候\', \'text\': \'砂の斥候が戦場に出たとき、対戦相手１人があなたよりも多くの土地をコントロールしている場合、あなたのライブラリーから砂漠・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\\n１枚以上の土地・カードがいずこかからあなたの墓地に置かれるたび、赤緑白の１/１の砂漠の民・戦士・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。この能力は、毎ターン１回しか誘発しない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・スカウト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658459&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d8f2178-c1fc-45a4-bf92-5356b2ee14e1\', \'multiverseId\': 658459}, \'multiverseid\': 658459}, {\'name\': \'探沙斥候\', \'text\': \'当探沙斥候进战场时，若某对手操控的地比你多，则从你的牌库中搜寻一张沙漠牌，将之横置放进战场，然后洗牌。\\n每当一张或数张地牌从任何区域进入你的坟墓场时，派出一个1/1，红绿白三色的砂／战士衍生生物。此异能每回合只会触发一次。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／斥候\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658491&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6faf7b3-13c8-42fb-af3f-feff72c302b4\', \'multiverseId\': 658491}, \'multiverseid\': 658491}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sandkundschafterin\', \'text\': \'Wenn die Sandkundschafterin ins Spiel kommt und falls ein Gegner mehr Länder kontrolliert als du, durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Wüste-Karte, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach.\\nImmer wenn eine oder mehrere Länderkarten von irgendwoher auf deinen Friedhof gelegt werden, erzeuge einen 1/1 roten, grünen und weißen Sand-Krieger-Kreaturenspielstein. Diese Fähigkeit wird nur einmal pro Zug ausgelöst.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Späher\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660171&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e582a94-e9b3-41a7-8dda-8d05f644134a\', \'multiverseId\': 660171}, \'multiverseid\': 660171}, {\'name\': \'Éclaireuse des dunes\', \'text\': "Quand l\'Éclaireuse des dunes arrive sur le champ de bataille, si un adversaire contrôle plus de terrains que vous, cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de désert, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille engagée, puis mélangez.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'au moins une carte de terrain est mise dans votre cimetière d\'où qu\'elle vienne, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 rouge, verte et blanche Sable et Guerrier. Cette capacité ne se déclenche qu\'une seule fois par tour.", \'type\': \'Créature — humain et éclaireur\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660203&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a276ff3-dda4-489f-89ac-a75763e4e041\', \'multiverseId\': 660203}, \'multiverseid\': 660203}, {\'name\': \'砂の斥候\', \'text\': \'砂の斥候が戦場に出たとき、対戦相手１人があなたよりも多くの土地をコントロールしている場合、あなたのライブラリーから砂漠・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\\n１枚以上の土地・カードがいずこかからあなたの墓地に置かれるたび、赤緑白の１/１の砂漠の民・戦士・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。この能力は、毎ターン１回しか誘発しない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・スカウト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660235&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0153e50-4d1b-4d47-9203-6285c8d82c8a\', \'multiverseId\': 660235}, \'multiverseid\': 660235}, {\'name\': \'探沙斥候\', \'text\': \'当探沙斥候进战场时，若某对手操控的地比你多，则从你的牌库中搜寻一张沙漠牌，将之横置放进战场，然后洗牌。\\n每当一张或数张地牌从任何区域进入你的坟墓场时，派出一个1/1，红绿白三色的砂／战士衍生生物。此异能每回合只会触发一次。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／斥候\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660267&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2dac61e8-b4b6-42c4-8d4d-1ebf3c438285\', \'multiverseId\': 660267}, \'multiverseid\': 660267}]', '[{\'name\': \'Satyr-Pfadfinder\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Satyr-Pfadfinder ins Spiel kommt, decke die obersten vier Karten deiner Bibliothek auf. Du kannst davon eine Länderkarte auf deine Hand nehmen. Lege den Rest auf deinen Friedhof.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Satyr\', \'flavor\': \'Der erste Satyr, der nach einem rauschenden Fest wieder das Bewusstsein erlangt, muss einen Ort für die nächste Feier ausfindig machen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658914&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'903ee300-f310-4dfd-aafb-86a1a2b276c2\', \'multiverseId\': 658914}, \'multiverseid\': 658914}, {\'name\': \'Sátiro buscacaminos\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Sátiro buscacaminos entre al campo de batalla, muestra las cuatro primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Puedes poner en tu mano una carta de tierra de entre ellas. Pon el resto en tu cementerio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sátiro\', \'flavor\': \'El sátiro que se despierte primero después de un festín tiene que buscar el lugar del siguiente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659180&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'794bdef3-36f3-4cf2-b0c5-8ea6fa2aaaf0\', \'multiverseId\': 659180}, \'multiverseid\': 659180}, {\'name\': \'Guidevoie satyre\', \'text\': \'Quand le Guidevoie satyre arrive sur le champ de bataille, révélez les quatre cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez mettre une carte de terrain parmi elles dans votre main. Mettez le reste dans votre cimetière.\', \'type\': \'Créature — satyre\', \'flavor\': "Le premier satyre qui s\'éveille après une orgie doit trouver le lieu de la suivante.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659446&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'775c394d-4661-47de-b78e-6603d5e036b2\', \'multiverseId\': 659446}, \'multiverseid\': 659446}, {\'name\': \'サテュロスの道探し\', \'text\': \'サテュロスの道探しが戦場に出たとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード４枚を公開する。その中から土地・カード１枚をあなたの手札に加えてもよい。残りをあなたの墓地に置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — サテュロス\', \'flavor\': \'お祭りの後に目覚めた最初のサテュロスは、次のお祭りの現場を探さなければならない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659712&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'490aaef1-dd91-4fcf-b2ff-468603646fa5\', \'multiverseId\': 659712}, \'multiverseid\': 659712}, {\'name\': \'引路羊蹄人\', \'text\': \'当引路羊蹄人进战场时，展示你牌库顶的四张牌。你可以将其中一张地牌置于你手上。将其余的牌置入你的坟墓场。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 羊蹄人\', \'flavor\': \'在欢宴后第一个苏醒的羊蹄人，必须负责寻找下一场欢宴的地点。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659978&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28307781-1417-49a4-8fb6-93abf4e4b90d\', \'multiverseId\': 659978}, \'multiverseid\': 659978}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schattenblut-Grat\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Erzeuge {B}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'In den schattendurchfluteten Abgründen bringen Gnolle finsteren Mächten Opfergaben dar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659027&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6cdd60e-d2ae-4829-8625-af795e92de54\', \'multiverseId\': 659027}, \'multiverseid\': 659027}, {\'name\': \'Cordillera Sangresombra\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Agrega {B}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Los gnolls realizan ofrendas a fuerzas siniestras en los abismos ensombrecidos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659293&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'134bb53d-f5d9-4f8e-89ed-2030ac4e7053\', \'multiverseId\': 659293}, \'multiverseid\': 659293}, {\'name\': "Contreforts d\'Ombresang", \'text\': \'{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {B}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'Les gnolls font des offrandes aux forces sinistres des abysses plongés dans les ténèbres.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659559&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc07bc5e-53a6-4a2b-9847-41eb15dd41b2\', \'multiverseId\': 659559}, \'multiverseid\': 659559}, {\'name\': \'シャドーブラッドの尾根\', \'text\': \'{1},{T}：{B}{R}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'ノールたちは影の満ちた亀裂で悪意の軍団に捧げものをする。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659825&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e8a4c61-7a51-4489-9069-aa0cf0151ad9\', \'multiverseId\': 659825}, \'multiverseid\': 659825}, {\'name\': \'暗血山脊\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}：加{B}{R}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'豺狼人供奉邪恶力量的祭祀仪式，通常都在黯影重重的峡谷中进行。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660091&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd9e11c6-8540-46d7-a752-519c7247c729\', \'multiverseId\': 660091}, \'multiverseid\': 660091}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schildkäferschwarm\', \'text\': \'Landung — Immer wenn ein Land unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erzeuge einen 1/1 grünen Insekt-Kreaturenspielstein. Falls du sechs oder mehr Länder kontrollierst, erzeuge stattdessen einen Spielstein, der eine Kopie des Schildkäferschwarms ist.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Insekt\', \'flavor\': \'„Überlebensregel 782: Es gibt immer noch mehr Schildkäfer."\\n—Zurdi, Goblin-Abkürzer\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658915&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d9c6f23-5ea4-450f-bc10-6a0ad0fc7205\', \'multiverseId\': 658915}, \'multiverseid\': 658915}, {\'name\': \'Horda de escutos\', \'text\': \'Aterrizaje — Siempre que una tierra entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, crea una ficha de criatura Insecto verde 1/1. Si controlas seis o más tierras, en vez de eso, crea una ficha que es una copia de la Horda de escutos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Insecto\', \'flavor\': \'"Regla de supervivencia 782: siempre hay más bichos escuto".\\n—Zurdi, acortacaminos trasgo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659181&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3310512e-ed1d-4517-a14c-d660f6446f90\', \'multiverseId\': 659181}, \'multiverseid\': 659181}, {\'name\': \'Colonie de scalaires\', \'text\': "Toucheterre — À chaque fois qu\'un terrain arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 verte Insecte. Si vous contrôlez au moins six terrains, créez un jeton qui est une copie de la Colonie de scalaires à la place.", \'type\': \'Créature — insecte\', \'flavor\': \'« Règle de survie 782 : Il y a toujours plus de scalaires. »\\n—Zurdi, accourcisseur gobelin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659447&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0465b01-f859-4a1a-a10a-42efc233169f\', \'multiverseId\': 659447}, \'multiverseid\': 659447}, {\'name\': \'硬鎧の大群\', \'text\': \'上陸 ― 土地１つがあなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、緑の１/１の昆虫・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。あなたが６つ以上の土地をコントロールしているなら、代わりに硬鎧の大群のコピーであるトークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 昆虫\', \'flavor\': \'「生き残りの法則 782：硬鎧虫はいつもいつももっといる。」\\n――ゴブリンの近道抜け、ザーディ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659713&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47e9920d-7e40-4158-b5b4-23829a1df230\', \'multiverseId\': 659713}, \'multiverseid\': 659713}, {\'name\': \'硬盔虫聚群\', \'text\': \'地落～每当一个地在你的操控下进战场时，派出一个1/1绿色昆虫衍生生物。若你操控六个或更多地，则改为派出一个为硬盔虫聚群之复制品的衍生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 昆虫\', \'flavor\': \'「生存法则第782项：硬盔虫只会更多。」\\n～抄捷径鬼怪组棣\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659979&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9f550ee-1f0c-4012-b9c2-7d5f1c42c3b3\', \'multiverseId\': 659979}, \'multiverseid\': 659979}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schillernde Sphinx\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn die Schillernde Sphinx einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, schickt jener Spieler Karten oben von seiner Bibliothek ins Exil, bis er eine Spontanzauber- oder Hexereikarte ins Exil schickt. Du kannst die Karte wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Danach legt der Spieler alle Karten, die auf diese Weise ins Exil geschickt und nicht gewirkt wurden, in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter seine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Sphinx\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658803&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a889087-5670-4b3b-871e-e2ad6ab44681\', \'multiverseId\': 658803}, \'multiverseid\': 658803}, {\'name\': \'Esfinge deslumbrante\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que la Esfinge deslumbrante haga daño de combate a un jugador, ese jugador exilia cartas de la parte superior de su biblioteca hasta que exilie una carta de instantáneo o de conjuro. Puedes lanzar esa carta sin pagar su coste de maná. Luego, ese jugador pone las cartas exiliadas que no fueron lanzadas de esta manera en el fondo de su biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Esfinge\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659069&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1a7ad7a-fae9-48bb-a501-4b7fea9c5bcc\', \'multiverseId\': 659069}, \'multiverseid\': 659069}, {\'name\': \'Sphinx éblouissant\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que le Sphinx éblouissant inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, ce joueur exile les cartes du dessus de sa bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce qu\'il exile une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel. Vous pouvez lancer cette carte sans payer son coût de mana. Ce joueur met ensuite les cartes exilées qui n\'ont pas été lancées de cette manière au-dessous de sa bibliothèque, dans un ordre aléatoire.", \'type\': \'Créature — sphinx\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659335&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fc791225-7002-4fec-a5f0-bda392e893da\', \'multiverseId\': 659335}, \'multiverseid\': 659335}, {\'name\': \'幻惑のスフィンクス\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n幻惑のスフィンクスがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、そのプレイヤーは、インスタントやソーサリーであるカード１枚が追放されるまで、自分のライブラリーの一番上から１枚ずつ追放していく。あなたはそのカードをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。その後、そのプレイヤーはこれにより追放されて唱えられなかったすべてのカードを自分のライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スフィンクス\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659601&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9040b3fe-9584-42db-b03c-8a540c36469b\', \'multiverseId\': 659601}, \'multiverseid\': 659601}, {\'name\': \'炫目史芬斯\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当炫目史芬斯对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，该牌手从其牌库顶开始放逐牌，直到放逐一张瞬间或法术牌为止。你可以施放该牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。然后该牌手将所有以此法放逐且未施放的牌以随机顺序置于其牌库底。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 史芬斯\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659867&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57338dc5-0388-4346-aa70-f374e4410c13\', \'multiverseId\': 659867}, \'multiverseid\': 659867}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schleichweg der Diebe\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{4}, {T}: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl kann in diesem Zug nicht geblockt werden.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Unter den Dieben verbreiteten sich rasch Gerüchte von einem Labyrinth ohne Mauern und einem Schatz von unermesslichem Wert.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659023&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ff8874d-a9ee-411f-b0ad-1bf5634e3274\', \'multiverseId\': 659023}, \'multiverseid\': 659023}, {\'name\': \'Pasaje del bribón\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{4}, {T}: La criatura objetivo no puede ser bloqueada este turno.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Entre los ladrones se extendió enseguida el rumor de un laberinto sin muros y de un premio más allá de todas las expectativas de riqueza.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659289&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e971b52-71a0-4788-98d6-eae90f839b53\', \'multiverseId\': 659289}, \'multiverseid\': 659289}, {\'name\': \'Passage des malandrins\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{4}, {T} : Une créature ciblée ne peut pas être bloquée ce tour-ci.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "La rumeur d\'un labyrinthe sans parois et d\'un trésor inestimable se répandit rapidement chez les malandrins.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659555&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9283b9a2-93b4-49ce-abff-d3098476f4ea\', \'multiverseId\': 659555}, \'multiverseid\': 659555}, {\'name\': \'ならず者の道\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{4}, {T}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、それはブロックされない。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'泥棒達の間では、想像を絶する宝が眠るという壁のない迷宮についての噂が瞬く間に広まった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659821&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc6f6683-9f56-40b3-8472-eba9042427c2\', \'multiverseId\': 659821}, \'multiverseid\': 659821}, {\'name\': \'浪客小径\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{4}，{T}：目标生物本回合不能被阻挡。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'这谣言很快在小偷之间传开：有座无墙的迷宫，藏有价值无可计量的宝藏。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660087&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cb3eb461-c523-48f6-969d-47c182614f2b\', \'multiverseId\': 660087}, \'multiverseid\': 660087}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schlitterklinge\', \'text\': \'Die Schlitterklinge kann nicht geblockt werden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Naga, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'Mancher Naga-Geweihte bewegt sich so lautlos wie sein eigener Schatten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658824&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'558e3408-dbf8-4180-81a4-b17fadcdddda\', \'multiverseId\': 658824}, \'multiverseid\': 658824}, {\'name\': \'Filo reptante\', \'text\': \'El Filo reptante no puede ser bloqueado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón naga\', \'flavor\': \'Algunos iniciados naga se mueven tan silenciosamente como los reflejos de los soles en el agua.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659090&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7c9e58dd-7576-4f36-88a0-8979ce08a4bf\', \'multiverseId\': 659090}, \'multiverseid\': 659090}, {\'name\': \'Lame rampante\', \'text\': \'La Lame rampante ne peut pas être bloquée.\', \'type\': \'Créature — naga et gredin\', \'flavor\': "Certains adeptes nagas se déplacent aussi silencieusement que les rayons du soleil à la surface de l\'eau.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659356&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fbadca0-a196-490c-bf5e-7b7bb0141d0a\', \'multiverseId\': 659356}, \'multiverseid\': 659356}, {\'name\': \'這い寄る刃\', \'text\': \'這い寄る刃はブロックされない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ナーガ・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'ナーガの修練者の中には、水に映る双陽のように音もなく動く者がいる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659622&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef03b02f-8b56-4d8c-8193-e327e9dca321\', \'multiverseId\': 659622}, \'multiverseid\': 659622}, {\'name\': \'蛇身刀客\', \'text\': \'蛇身刀客不能被阻挡。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 那伽／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'有些那伽祀徒移动时静如双日水中映影。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659888&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6b0b841-6036-459c-90f9-8d90f0fd51cf\', \'multiverseId\': 659888}, \'multiverseid\': 659888}]', "[{'name': 'Schluchtentümpel', 'text': '({T}: Erzeuge {B} oder {R}.)\\nDer Schluchtentümpel kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nUmwandlung {2} ({2}, wirf diese Karte ab: Ziehe eine Karte.)', 'type': 'Land — Sumpf, Gebirge', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658985&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '40bfe19b-aba9-4122-b86a-15ac7554304a', 'multiverseId': 658985}, 'multiverseid': 658985}, {'name': 'Cenagal del cañón', 'text': '({T}: Agrega {B} o {R}.)\\nEl Cenagal del cañón entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCiclo {2}. ({2}, descartar esta carta: Roba una carta.)', 'type': 'Tierra — Pantano montaña', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659251&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f1649f87-5881-4dd6-b9a7-b083d9f0f797', 'multiverseId': 659251}, 'multiverseid': 659251}, {'name': 'Canyon croupissant', 'text': '({T} : Ajoutez {B} ou {R}.)\\nLe Canyon croupissant arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nRecyclage {2} ({2}, défaussez-vous de cette carte : Piochez une carte.)', 'type': 'Terrain — marais et montagne', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659517&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b0e815f3-eac4-4c85-922f-6b175d03f6d6', 'multiverseId': 659517}, 'multiverseid': 659517}, {'name': '泥濘の峡谷', 'text': '（{T}：{B}か{R}を加える。）\\n泥濘の峡谷はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\nサイクリング{2}（{2}, このカードを捨てる：カード１枚を引く。）', 'type': '土地 — 沼・山', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659783&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4e44bcda-37c7-4a58-a1fd-3385bb8f303e', 'multiverseId': 659783}, 'multiverseid': 659783}, {'name': '峡谷腐沼', 'text': '（{T}：加{B}或{R}。）\\n峡谷腐沼须横置进战场。\\n循环{2}（{2}，弃掉此牌：抓一张牌。）', 'type': '地 — 沼泽／山脉', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660049&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd15f8f67-3481-4ceb-a8d9-b9a170107c5d', 'multiverseId': 660049}, 'multiverseid': 660049}]", '[{\'name\': \'Schlussakt\', \'text\': \'Unverzagt (Dieser Zauberspruch kostet beim Wirken für jeden Gegner {1} weniger.)\\nZerstöre zwei Kreaturen deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Das Publikum soll kriegen, wonach es verlangt."\\n—Juri, Inhaber von Juris Revue\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658840&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f2550ba-e5c7-43cc-a45d-bac769483d0a\', \'multiverseId\': 658840}, \'multiverseid\': 658840}, {\'name\': \'Ovación final\', \'text\': \'Audacia. (Cuesta {1} menos lanzar este hechizo por cada oponente.)\\nDestruye dos criaturas objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Damos al público lo que quiere".\\n—Juri, propietario del elenco de Juri\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659106&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22d5d22c-d98c-4191-92ab-c87e9d1d42f3\', \'multiverseId\': 659106}, \'multiverseid\': 659106}, {\'name\': \'Grand numéro\', \'text\': \'Témérité (Ce sort coûte {1} de moins à lancer pour chaque adversaire.)\\nDétruisez deux créatures ciblées.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Nous donnons au public ce qu\'il veut voir. »\\n—Juri, propriétaire de la Revue de Juri", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659372&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3a5dc53-6756-409f-8463-9f2e4074d292\', \'multiverseId\': 659372}, \'multiverseid\': 659372}, {\'name\': \'幕切れ\', \'text\': \'不抜（この呪文を唱えるためのコストは対戦相手１人につき{1}少なくなる。）\\nクリーチャー２体を対象とする。それらを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「観客が見たがってる演目をやるのさ。」\\n――ジョーリ組の経営者、ジョーリ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659638&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d91ee04-1075-40f8-b4e7-49d395e9be58\', \'multiverseId\': 659638}, \'multiverseid\': 659638}, {\'name\': \'谢幕演出\', \'text\': \'不屈（每有一位对手，此咒语便减少{1}来施放。）\\n消灭两个目标生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「我们要做的就是迎合观众。」\\n～裘里剧团业主裘里\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659904&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a439732-d645-4313-bcfb-05fde0e81365\', \'multiverseId\': 659904}, \'multiverseid\': 659904}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schmerzliche Wahrheit\', \'text\': \'Konvergenz — Du ziehst X Karten und verlierst X Lebenspunkte, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an unterschiedlichen Farben von Mana ist, das ausgegeben wurde, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Als die Eldrazi sich ausbreiteten, scheuten Zendikars Verteidiger auf der Suche nach Geheimnissen, die ihnen einen Vorteil bringen könnten, keine Gefahren.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658856&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6e986bb-ed6a-4114-9836-991d02632237\', \'multiverseId\': 658856}, \'multiverseid\': 658856}, {\'name\': \'Verdades que duelen\', \'text\': \'Converger — Robas X cartas y pierdes X vidas, donde X es la cantidad de colores de maná usados para lanzar este hechizo.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'A medida que los Eldrazi avanzaban, se dejó de pensar en los riesgos de cualquier secreto que otorgara ventaja a los defensores de Zendikar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659122&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'582017d6-0f5d-4250-87c6-0a89c3b3372f\', \'multiverseId\': 659122}, \'multiverseid\': 659122}, {\'name\': \'Vérités douloureuses\', \'text\': \'Convergence — Vous piochez X cartes et vous perdez X points de vie, X étant le nombre de couleurs de mana dépensé pour lancer ce sort.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Avec la multiplication des Eldrazi, aucun périple n\'était trop dangereux s\'il permettait de dénicher un secret pouvant avantager les défenseurs de Zendikar.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659388&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b92fa3fd-3b6a-4554-a2f5-f5f1075d8d51\', \'multiverseId\': 659388}, \'multiverseid\': 659388}, {\'name\': \'苦い真理\', \'text\': \'収斂 ― あなたはカードＸ枚を引き、Ｘ点のライフを失う。Ｘはこの呪文を唱えるために支払われたマナの色の種類数に等しい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'エルドラージが増えるにつれ、ゼンディカー防衛隊を有利にする秘密であれば、探すのに命を惜しむ者は少なくなっていった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659654&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'951ce704-3d03-4194-abe4-ea7d1ef77e79\', \'multiverseId\': 659654}, \'multiverseid\': 659654}, {\'name\': \'痛苦真相\', \'text\': \'聚辉～你抓X张牌且失去X点生命，X为施放此咒语支付的法术力颜色数量。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'由于奥札奇的扩张，任何能让赞迪卡抵抗者获得优势的秘密都值得冒险一寻。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659920&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e1ecfe1-7e34-412c-a04b-4470dec1d94a\', \'multiverseId\': 659920}, \'multiverseid\': 659920}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schreckensflotten-Draufgängerin\', \'text\': \'Erstschlag\\nWenn die Schreckensflotten-Draufgängerin ins Spiel kommt, schicke eine Spontanzauber- oder Hexereikarte deiner Wahl aus dem Friedhof eines Gegners ins Exil. Du kannst sie in diesem Zug wirken, und Mana beliebigen Typs kann ausgegeben werden, um jenen Zauberspruch zu wirken. Falls jener Zauberspruch auf einen Friedhof gelegt würde, schicke ihn stattdessen ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Pirat\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658872&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ba8427a-a356-4b7c-a6cc-de86ee8983e2\', \'multiverseId\': 658872}, \'multiverseid\': 658872}, {\'name\': \'Temeraria de la Flota Arrasadora\', \'text\': \'Daña primero.\\nCuando la Temeraria de la Flota Arrasadora entre al campo de batalla, exilia la carta de instantáneo o de conjuro objetivo del cementerio de un oponente. Puedes lanzarla este turno y puedes usar maná de cualquier tipo para lanzar ese hechizo. Si ese hechizo fuera a ir a un cementerio, en vez de eso, exílialo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Pirata humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659138&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9d890f4-6b58-4484-a90a-dc29c96991a3\', \'multiverseId\': 659138}, \'multiverseid\': 659138}, {\'name\': \'Casse-cou de la Flotte implacable\', \'text\': "Initiative\\nQuand la Casse-cou de la Flotte implacable arrive sur le champ de bataille, exilez une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel ciblée depuis le cimetière d\'un adversaire. Vous pouvez la lancer ce tour-ci, et du mana de n\'importe quel type peut être dépensé pour lancer ce sort. Si ce sort devait être mis dans un cimetière, exilez-le à la place.", \'type\': \'Créature — humain et pirate\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659404&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'766d5083-3df0-4ef7-abbc-14052e0e0dbf\', \'multiverseId\': 659404}, \'multiverseid\': 659404}, {\'name\': \'凶兆艦隊の向こう見ず\', \'text\': \'先制攻撃\\n凶兆艦隊の向こう見ずが戦場に出たとき、対戦相手の墓地にありインスタントやソーサリーであるカード１枚を対象とする。それを追放する。このターン、あなたはそれを唱えてもよく、その呪文を唱えるために任意のタイプのマナを支払ってもよい。その呪文が墓地に置かれるなら、代わりにそれを追放する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・海賊\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659670&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91f1c961-938e-4cff-90f3-c411e975a4af\', \'multiverseId\': 659670}, \'multiverseid\': 659670}, {\'name\': \'焦炬舰队冒险客\', \'text\': \'先攻\\n当焦炬舰队冒险客进战场时，将目标瞬间或法术牌从对手的坟墓场放逐。本回合中，你可以施放它，且能用任意种类的法术力来施放该咒语。若该咒语将进入坟墓场，则改为将它放逐。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 人类／海盗\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659936&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d6e93cd-8444-4a1a-bee0-07b1fe8a6b0b\', \'multiverseId\': 659936}, \'multiverseid\': 659936}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schreckensflotten-Verwüster\', \'text\': \'Bedrohlich, Todesberührung\\nWenn der Schreckensflotten-Verwüster ins Spiel kommt, verliert jeder Spieler ein Drittel seiner Lebenspunkte, aufgerundet.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Ork, Pirat, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'Aus seinen Fäusten qualmt der Rauch des Todes und jeder Schlag erfüllt seine Feinde mit Fäulnis.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658842&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73cf8913-71b7-48ed-9a10-8ff3c5698b7b\', \'multiverseId\': 658842}, \'multiverseid\': 658842}, {\'name\': \'Devastador de la Flota Arrasadora\', \'text\': \'Amenaza, toque mortal.\\nCuando el Devastador de la Flota Arrasadora entre al campo de batalla, cada jugador pierde un tercio de sus vidas, redondeando hacia arriba.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero pirata orco\', \'flavor\': \'Sus puños humean con la putrefacción de la muerte, y cada golpe abre una llaga incurable en el corazón de sus enemigos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659108&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c8560b0-5416-42e2-bd91-f408f5fe5cbf\', \'multiverseId\': 659108}, \'multiverseid\': 659108}, {\'name\': \'Dévastateur de la Flotte implacable\', \'text\': "Menace, contact mortel\\nQuand le Dévastateur de la Flotte implacable arrive sur le champ de bataille, chaque joueur perd un tiers de ses points de vie, arrondi à l\'unité supérieure.", \'type\': \'Créature — orque et pirate et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "Ses poings crachant des volutes de putréfaction s\'abattent tels un fléau sur le cœur de ses ennemis.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659374&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e4598830-8b70-4497-adea-e18ad747e9e3\', \'multiverseId\': 659374}, \'multiverseid\': 659374}, {\'name\': \'凶兆艦隊の荒廃者\', \'text\': \'威迫、接死\\n凶兆艦隊の荒廃者が戦場に出たとき、各プレイヤーはそれぞれ、自分のライフの端数を切り上げた３分の１を失う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — オーク・海賊・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'彼の拳からは腐敗の煙が立ち上る。敵の心臓は一撃で侵される。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659640&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35cecf07-2fff-4514-9860-042a37169f01\', \'multiverseId\': 659640}, \'multiverseid\': 659640}, {\'name\': \'焦炬舰队劫夺客\', \'text\': \'威慑，死触\\n当焦炬舰队劫夺客进战场时，每位牌手各失去三分之一的生命，小数点后进位。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 半兽人／海盗／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'他双手喷出死亡腐息，每一拳都让敌人病入骨髓。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659906&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3550a80-b50a-4f54-a6e8-f45525514501\', \'multiverseId\': 659906}, \'multiverseid\': 659906}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schwarzspaltenklippen\', \'text\': \'Die Schwarzspaltenklippen kommen getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du kontrollierst zwei oder weniger andere Länder.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B} oder {R}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Wo Ehrgeiz auf Fleiß trifft, verdirbt Habgier die Leidenschaft.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658982&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22a19042-9368-41ce-b945-2b6ac430e7b3\', \'multiverseId\': 658982}, \'multiverseid\': 658982}, {\'name\': \'Acantilados Filonegro\', \'text\': \'Los Acantilados Filonegro entran al campo de batalla girados a menos que controles otras dos o menos tierras.\\n{T}: Agrega {B} o {R}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando se unen la ambición y la industria, la avaricia envenena la pasión.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659248&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6135002-b8b1-426a-b863-822294a55bb1\', \'multiverseId\': 659248}, \'multiverseid\': 659248}, {\'name\': \'Falaises de Coupenoire\', \'text\': \'Les Falaises de Coupenoire arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagées à moins que vous ne contrôliez deux autres terrains ou moins.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B} ou {R}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Là où l\'ambition rencontre l\'industrie, la passion est empoisonnée par l\'avidité.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659514&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb3a4c0d-4330-47b8-9686-52fa538acc74\', \'multiverseId\': 659514}, \'multiverseid\': 659514}, {\'name\': \'黒割れの崖\', \'text\': \'あなたがこれでない３つ以上の土地をコントロールしているなら、黒割れの崖はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{B}か{R}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'欲望が産業と出会うところで、熱情は強欲に毒される。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659780&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98fee984-0379-472a-afbc-d18c0f7b221f\', \'multiverseId\': 659780}, \'multiverseid\': 659780}, {\'name\': \'暗峰山崖\', \'text\': \'除非你操控两个或更少其他地，否则暗峰山崖须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{B}或{R}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'在雄心与勤勉交汇之处，贪欲拖累上进激情。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660046&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d73004ac-6321-4ca8-be88-9d407ffb1393\', \'multiverseId\': 660046}, \'multiverseid\': 660046}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schwefelfälle\', \'text\': \'Die Schwefelfälle kommen getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du kontrollierst eine Insel oder ein Gebirge.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U} oder {R}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Uns wurden viele der Mysterien von Thran überliefert, doch nur wenige Antworten."\\n—Jhoira\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659032&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11c37109-5148-4464-a9ff-9f5b13bef235\', \'multiverseId\': 659032}, \'multiverseid\': 659032}, {\'name\': \'Cascada de azufre\', \'text\': \'La Cascada de azufre entra al campo de batalla girada a menos que controles una Isla o una Montaña.\\n{T}: Agrega {U} o {R}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"Hemos heredado los misterios de los thran, pero pocas de sus respuestas".\\n—Jhoira\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659298&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76629427-09f3-417d-bbd9-56d4e89e7419\', \'multiverseId\': 659298}, \'multiverseid\': 659298}, {\'name\': \'Chutes de soufre\', \'text\': \'Les Chutes de soufre arrivent sur le champ de bataille engagées à moins que vous ne contrôliez une île ou une montagne.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U} ou {R}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'« Nous avons hérité de tous les mystères des Thrans, mais de peu de réponses. »\\n—Djoïra\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659564&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'594c8830-49ce-4918-b231-eef83075c960\', \'multiverseId\': 659564}, \'multiverseid\': 659564}, {\'name\': \'硫黄の滝\', \'text\': \'あなたが島や山をコントロールしていないかぎり、硫黄の滝はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{U}か{R}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「私たちはスランの謎を受け継いだけれど、答えはほとんど受け継いでいない。」\\n――ジョイラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659830&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'febf8f21-7a98-4b53-ab3d-f06275442dfb\', \'multiverseId\': 659830}, \'multiverseid\': 659830}, {\'name\': \'硫磺瀑布\', \'text\': \'除非你操控海岛或山脉，否则硫磺瀑布须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{U}或{R}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'「索蓝帝国给我们留下了诸多谜团，却未留下任何答案。」\\n～尤依拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660096&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6599ebd-4ce7-4b71-be08-a6492097b554\', \'multiverseId\': 660096}, \'multiverseid\': 660096}]', "[{'name': 'Schwefelquellen', 'text': '{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B} oder {R}. Die Schwefelquellen fügen dir 1 Schadenspunkt zu.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': 'Auf den Brennenden Inseln ist alles brennbar, sogar das Mana selbst.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659033&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1a4341eb-b470-4e77-a0e4-ee8dea6734c2', 'multiverseId': 659033}, 'multiverseid': 659033}, {'name': 'Manantiales sulfurosos', 'text': '{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{T}: Agrega {B} o {R}. Los Manantiales sulfurosos te hacen 1 punto de daño.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': 'En las Islas Ardientes, incluso el maná puede incendiarse.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659299&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a5a1e051-8e65-442c-82ec-61925edee993', 'multiverseId': 659299}, 'multiverseid': 659299}, {'name': 'Sources sulfureuses', 'text': '{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B} ou {R}. Les Sources sulfureuses vous infligent 1 blessure.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': 'Tout est inflammable dans les Îles Ardentes, même le mana.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659565&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '586921aa-1d77-4f54-83e0-036cfc133254', 'multiverseId': 659565}, 'multiverseid': 659565}, {'name': '硫黄泉', 'text': '{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}：{B}か{R}を加える。硫黄泉はあなたに１点のダメージを与える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': '炎熱の島々では、マナを含めてすべてが可燃性である。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659831&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '05e96c4e-c0bb-4796-ad25-e755b2d4453f', 'multiverseId': 659831}, 'multiverseid': 659831}, {'name': '硫磺温泉', 'text': '{T}：加{C}。\\n{T}：加{B}或{R}。硫磺温泉对你造成1点伤害。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': '燃烧群岛万物皆可燃，包括法术力本身。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660097&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '74cc00a6-1caa-4af0-ab1f-f73365baabf2', 'multiverseId': 660097}, 'multiverseid': 660097}]", '[{\'name\': \'Schwelende Postkutsche\', \'text\': \'Die Stärke der Schwelenden Postkutsche ist gleich der Anzahl an Spontanzauber- und Hexereikarten in deinem Friedhof.\\nImmer wenn die Schwelende Postkutsche angreift, haben der nächste Spontanzauber und die nächste Hexerei, den bzw. die du in diesem Zug wirkst, jeweils Kaskade.\\nBemannen 2\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Fahrzeug\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658382&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2547a7af-09ff-4afa-80f3-9ee72211c2ae\', \'multiverseId\': 658382}, \'multiverseid\': 658382}, {\'name\': \'Diligencia ardiente\', \'text\': \'La fuerza de la Diligencia ardiente es igual a la cantidad de cartas de instantáneo y de conjuro en tu cementerio.\\nSiempre que la Diligencia ardiente ataque, el próximo hechizo de instantáneo y el próximo hechizo de conjuro que lances este turno tienen ambos la habilidad de cascada.\\nTripular 2.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Vehículo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658414&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a6a1f90a-d945-46f1-8fa4-b69f5fb6701f\', \'multiverseId\': 658414}, \'multiverseid\': 658414}, {\'name\': \'Diligence incandescente\', \'text\': "La force de la Diligence incandescente est égale au nombre de cartes d\'éphémère et de rituel dans votre cimetière.\\nÀ chaque fois que la Diligence incandescente attaque, le prochain sort d\'éphémère et le prochain sort de rituel que vous lancez ce tour-ci ont chacun la cascade.\\nPilotage 2", \'type\': \'Artefact — véhicule\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658446&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c62d4679-2261-4526-bd87-31b64f9a505e\', \'multiverseId\': 658446}, \'multiverseid\': 658446}, {\'name\': \'くすぶる駅馬車\', \'text\': \'くすぶる駅馬車のパワーは、あなたの墓地にありインスタントやソーサリーであるカードの枚数に等しい。\\nくすぶる駅馬車が攻撃するたび、このターン、あなたが次に唱えるインスタント・呪文とあなたが次に唱えるソーサリー・呪文はそれぞれ続唱を持つ。\\n搭乗２\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 機体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658478&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f9e233f-7756-41ac-8ddf-a90144b3fed8\', \'multiverseId\': 658478}, \'multiverseid\': 658478}, {\'name\': \'闷燃驿马车\', \'text\': \'闷燃驿马车的力量等同于你坟墓场中瞬间与法术牌的数量加总。\\n每当闷燃驿马车攻击时，你本回合中施放的下一个瞬间咒语和下一个法术咒语均具有倾曳异能。\\n搭载2\', \'type\': \'神器 — 载具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658510&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b300b5d7-732a-4fe2-8ed1-2b015478205a\', \'multiverseId\': 658510}, \'multiverseid\': 658510}]', '[{\'name\': \'Schwelende Postkutsche\', \'text\': \'Die Stärke der Schwelenden Postkutsche ist gleich der Anzahl an Spontanzauber- und Hexereikarten in deinem Friedhof.\\nImmer wenn die Schwelende Postkutsche angreift, haben der nächste Spontanzauber und die nächste Hexerei, den bzw. die du in diesem Zug wirkst, jeweils Kaskade.\\nBemannen 2\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Fahrzeug\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660190&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b597db52-a9f3-4619-973b-fdfe9e8c421b\', \'multiverseId\': 660190}, \'multiverseid\': 660190}, {\'name\': \'Diligence incandescente\', \'text\': "La force de la Diligence incandescente est égale au nombre de cartes d\'éphémère et de rituel dans votre cimetière.\\nÀ chaque fois que la Diligence incandescente attaque, le prochain sort d\'éphémère et le prochain sort de rituel que vous lancez ce tour-ci ont chacun la cascade.\\nPilotage 2", \'type\': \'Artefact — véhicule\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660222&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f0ab3f32-1c65-49e4-9380-83f88f13305b\', \'multiverseId\': 660222}, \'multiverseid\': 660222}, {\'name\': \'くすぶる駅馬車\', \'text\': \'くすぶる駅馬車のパワーは、あなたの墓地にありインスタントやソーサリーであるカードの枚数に等しい。\\nくすぶる駅馬車が攻撃するたび、このターン、あなたが次に唱えるインスタント・呪文とあなたが次に唱えるソーサリー・呪文はそれぞれ続唱を持つ。\\n搭乗２\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 機体\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660254&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa1a94f1-c8cf-4997-b42a-1b2007a7d5c4\', \'multiverseId\': 660254}, \'multiverseid\': 660254}, {\'name\': \'闷燃驿马车\', \'text\': \'闷燃驿马车的力量等同于你坟墓场中瞬间与法术牌的数量加总。\\n每当闷燃驿马车攻击时，你本回合中施放的下一个瞬间咒语和下一个法术咒语均具有倾曳异能。\\n搭载2\', \'type\': \'神器 — 载具\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660286&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0ab26fc-6807-4475-a453-dffd17ffff8f\', \'multiverseId\': 660286}, \'multiverseid\': 660286}]', "[{'name': 'Schwelendes Marschland', 'text': '({T}: Erzeuge {B} oder {R}.)\\nDas Schwelende Marschland kommt getappt ins Spiel, es sei denn, du kontrollierst zwei oder mehr Standardländer.', 'type': 'Land — Sumpf, Gebirge', 'flavor': 'Der Kontinent Guul Draz ist ein geothermisches Sumpfland, in dem die Luft vor Hitze und fauligem Gestank flimmert.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659031&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd3b4e75b-6518-456c-9614-3de6c557ee2c', 'multiverseId': 659031}, 'multiverseid': 659031}, {'name': 'Cenagal ardiente', 'text': '({T}: Agrega {B} o {R}.)\\nEl Cenagal ardiente entra al campo de batalla girado a menos que controles dos o más tierras básicas.', 'type': 'Tierra — Pantano montaña', 'flavor': 'El continente de Guul Draz es una ciénaga geotérmica que respira calor y putrefacción.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659297&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4327b866-44e3-483f-84fb-5e3b6f8875b3', 'multiverseId': 659297}, 'multiverseid': 659297}, {'name': 'Marécage fumant', 'text': '({T} : Ajoutez {B} ou {R}.)\\nLe Marécage fumant arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé à moins que vous ne contrôliez au moins deux terrains de base.', 'type': 'Terrain — marais et montagne', 'flavor': 'Le continent de Guul Draz est un marais géothermique, puant de chaleur et de décomposition.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659563&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cb10625d-4b48-4fab-9276-f14f8278185c', 'multiverseId': 659563}, 'multiverseid': 659563}, {'name': '燻る湿地', 'text': '（{T}：{B}か{R}を加える。）\\nあなたが２つ以上の基本土地をコントロールしていないかぎり、燻る湿地はタップ状態で戦場に出る。', 'type': '土地 — 沼・山', 'flavor': 'グール・ドラズ大陸は温沼地である。地熱による高温と腐敗で燻っている。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659829&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '90526715-b0f6-4837-aa4a-933b3ac25709', 'multiverseId': 659829}, 'multiverseid': 659829}, {'name': '闷燃沼地', 'text': '（{T}：加{B}或{R}。）\\n除非你操控两个或更多基本地，否则闷燃沼地须横置进战场。', 'type': '地 — 沼泽／山脉', 'flavor': '古坠兹大陆这片地热沼泽热气蒸腾，腐臭弥漫。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660095&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b0abb6cb-4790-4c7f-8ab9-a30b739d3976', 'multiverseId': 660095}, 'multiverseid': 660095}]", "[{'name': 'Schädelwinder', 'text': 'Todesberührung\\nWenn der Schädelwinder ins Spiel kommt, bringe eine Karte deiner Wahl aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück und bestimme dann einen Gegner. Der Spieler bringt eine Karte aus seinem Friedhof auf seine Hand zurück.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Ophis', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658917&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4ea74e74-3f11-4e26-8f56-b36220d2b755', 'multiverseId': 658917}, 'multiverseid': 658917}, {'name': 'Crótalo quebrantahuesos', 'text': 'Toque mortal.\\nCuando el Crótalo quebrantahuesos entre al campo de batalla, regresa la carta objetivo de tu cementerio a tu mano y luego elige un oponente. Ese jugador regresa una carta de su cementerio a su mano.', 'type': 'Criatura — Víbora', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659183&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4ec42846-2e3d-4b35-8155-243c60155771', 'multiverseId': 659183}, 'multiverseid': 659183}, {'name': 'Crotale golgothien', 'text': 'Contact mortel\\nQuand le Crotale golgothien arrive sur le champ de bataille, renvoyez une carte ciblée depuis votre cimetière dans votre main, puis choisissez un adversaire. Ce joueur renvoie dans sa main une carte de son cimetière.', 'type': 'Créature — serpent', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659449&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '236e6068-ff17-4b27-9d87-c90a6e087c07', 'multiverseId': 659449}, 'multiverseid': 659449}, {'name': '髑髏蛇', 'text': '接死\\n髑髏蛇が戦場に出たとき、あなたの墓地にあるカード１枚を対象とする。それをあなたの手札に戻す。その後、対戦相手１人を選ぶ。そのプレイヤーは自分の墓地にあるカード１枚を自分の手札に戻す。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — 蛇', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659715&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3e86ff59-b7ea-497f-9e07-177dd06a8340', 'multiverseId': 659715}, 'multiverseid': 659715}, {'name': '颅骨响尾蛇', 'text': '死触\\n当颅骨响尾蛇进战场时，将目标牌从你的坟墓场移回你手上，然后选择一位对手。该牌手将一张牌从其坟墓场移回其手上。', 'type': '生物 — 蛇', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659981&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1f106e0e-7865-4dcd-b994-1677e369cf24', 'multiverseId': 659981}, 'multiverseid': 659981}]", "[{'name': 'Sevinnes Rückgewinnung', 'text': 'Bringe eine Permanent-Karte deiner Wahl mit Manabetrag 3 oder weniger aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück. Falls dieser Zauberspruch aus einem Friedhof gewirkt wurde, kannst du diesen Zauberspruch kopieren und für die Kopie ein neues Ziel bestimmen.\\nRückblende {4}{W} (Du kannst diese Karte aus deinem Friedhof für ihre Rückblendekosten wirken. Schicke sie danach ins Exil.)', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658796&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '05e71ec7-5d41-444a-8166-fa1d00077724', 'multiverseId': 658796}, 'multiverseid': 658796}, {'name': 'Recuperación de Sevinne', 'text': 'Regresa la carta de permanente objetivo con valor de maná de 3 o menos de tu cementerio al campo de batalla. Si este hechizo se lanzó desde un cementerio, puedes copiar este hechizo y puedes elegir un objetivo nuevo para la copia.\\nRetrospectiva {4}{W}. (Puedes lanzar esta carta desde tu cementerio pagando su coste de retrospectiva. Luego exíliala.)', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659062&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6493764b-d9bc-464a-b86a-7fbd26031b92', 'multiverseId': 659062}, 'multiverseid': 659062}, {'name': 'Réappropriation de Sevinne', 'text': 'Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille une carte de permanent ciblée avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à 3 depuis votre cimetière. Si ce sort a été lancé depuis un cimetière, vous pouvez copier ce sort et choisir une nouvelle cible pour cette copie.\\nFlashback {4}{W} (Vous pouvez lancer cette carte depuis votre cimetière pour son coût de flashback. Exilez-la ensuite.)', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659328&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '06cfbbe7-3dc0-4edd-ad21-0e3b34d961ab', 'multiverseId': 659328}, 'multiverseid': 659328}, {'name': 'セヴィンの再利用', 'text': 'あなたの墓地にありマナ総量が３以下であるパーマネント・カード１枚を対象とする。それを戦場に戻す。この呪文が墓地から唱えられたなら、この呪文をコピーしてもよく、そのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。\\nフラッシュバック{4}{W}（あなたの墓地にあるこのカードをフラッシュバック・コストで唱えてもよい。その後、これを追放する。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659594&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '29525b5e-be22-4e61-89b3-79b2a36ec41f', 'multiverseId': 659594}, 'multiverseid': 659594}, {'name': '瑟纹的复还', 'text': '将目标法术力值等于或小于3的永久物牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。如果此咒语是从坟墓场施放，则你可以复制此咒语，且可以为该复制品选择新的目标。\\n返照{4}{W}（你可以从你的坟墓场施放此牌，并支付其返照费用，然后将它放逐。）', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659860&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '77131696-d26b-4549-9f7c-e979b252edb5', 'multiverseId': 659860}, 'multiverseid': 659860}]", '[{\'name\': \'Shefet-Dünen\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}, bezahle 1 Lebenspunkt: Erzeuge {W}.\\n{2}{W}{W}, {T}, opfere eine Wüste: Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.\', \'type\': \'Land — Wüste\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659028&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50a18239-7b1a-4e9c-97c3-caf11ce4bbab\', \'multiverseId\': 659028}, \'multiverseid\': 659028}, {\'name\': \'Dunas del Shefet\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{T}, pagar 1 vida: Agrega {W}.\\n{2}{W}{W}, {T}, sacrificar un Desierto: Las criaturas que controlas obtienen +1/+1 hasta el final del turno. Activa esto solo como un conjuro.\', \'type\': \'Tierra — Desierto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659294&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce18f79c-9e7c-44ba-8c6b-bcc8c742e668\', \'multiverseId\': 659294}, \'multiverseid\': 659294}, {\'name\': \'Dunes de Shefet\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T}, payez 1 point de vie : Ajoutez {W}.\\n{2}{W}{W}, {T}, sacrifiez un désert : Les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.", \'type\': \'Terrain — désert\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659560&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8cf00d8d-bc7b-49ef-8238-ba2ea6205dce\', \'multiverseId\': 659560}, \'multiverseid\': 659560}, {\'name\': \'シェフェトの砂丘\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}, １点のライフを支払う：{W}を加える。\\n{2}{W}{W}, {T}, 砂漠１つを生け贄に捧げる：ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。\', \'type\': \'土地 — 砂漠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659826&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53648ddc-97f8-4af8-b185-e0d32a6e0762\', \'multiverseId\': 659826}, \'multiverseid\': 659826}, {\'name\': \'谢菲沙丘\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{T}，支付1点生命：加{W}。\\n{2}{W}{W}，{T}，牺牲一个沙漠：由你操控的生物得+1/+1直到回合结束。只能于法术时机起动。\', \'type\': \'地 — 沙漠\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660092&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e03b777a-c3e4-4cca-aa1f-a04fe94f9d4d\', \'multiverseId\': 660092}, \'multiverseid\': 660092}]', "[{'name': 'Shivanisches Riff', 'text': '{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U} oder {R}. Das Shivanische Riff fügt dir 1 Schadenspunkt zu.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': 'Das kochende Meer rund um Shiv bot einen willkommenen Schutz für die erneuerte Manabarkasse.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659030&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '508fb3eb-2330-42c8-b54a-25dbf6c12431', 'multiverseId': 659030}, 'multiverseid': 659030}, {'name': 'Arrecife shivano', 'text': '{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{T}: Agrega {U} o {R}. El Arrecife shivano te hace 1 punto de daño.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': 'Los mares hirvientes de Shiv ofrecían una conveniente capa de protección a la instalación de maná reformada.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659296&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1e61ee2f-e6c6-44a0-b54e-62ee9fd1b630', 'multiverseId': 659296}, 'multiverseid': 659296}, {'name': 'Brisants shivâns', 'text': '{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U} ou {R}. Les Brisants shivâns vous infligent 1 blessure.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': 'Les mers bouillonnantes entourant Shiv fournissaient une précieuse barrière de protection pour la Plate-forme de mana récupérée.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659562&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '48b275bc-8d6a-4b4a-ad2f-066e2bbd8212', 'multiverseId': 659562}, 'multiverseid': 659562}, {'name': 'シヴの浅瀬', 'text': '{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{T}：{U}か{R}を加える。シヴの浅瀬はあなたに１点のダメージを与える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': 'シヴ山の周辺にある煮え立つ海は、再生したマナ・リグにとって安全な居場所だった。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659828&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5dd625a1-8e42-45e3-85ed-76dcab85f921', 'multiverseId': 659828}, 'multiverseid': 659828}, {'name': '西瓦暗礁', 'text': '{T}：加{C}。\\n{T}：加{U}或{R}。西瓦暗礁对你造成1点伤害。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': '西瓦周边的沸腾洋面，为重新夺回的魔力钻探机提供了一道不可多得的防御天堑。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660094&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '87586070-ed73-44f9-9e52-50f3d4790bd9', 'multiverseId': 660094}, 'multiverseid': 660094}]", '[{\'name\': \'Sich entfaltende Wildnis\', \'text\': \'{T}, opfere die Sich entfaltende Wildnis: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Standardland-Karte, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Wildnis ist unberechenbar. Flüsse ändern ihren Lauf, Bäume krümmen sich, Felsen splittern und rollen davon. Aber auf eines kannst du zählen, Reisender — was sich am meisten ändert, bist du."\\n—Sturwynn, Waldläufer der Grenzlande\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659002&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aae503d2-cdb0-45f7-85f8-820f5d760bf9\', \'multiverseId\': 659002}, \'multiverseid\': 659002}, {\'name\': \'Terrenos expansivos\', \'text\': \'{T}, sacrificar los Terrenos expansivos: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta de tierra básica, ponla en el campo de batalla girada y luego baraja.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"Las tierras salvajes son impredecibles. Los ríos cambian de curso, los árboles se mueven y se doblan, y las piedras se dividen y escapan. Pero escúchame bien, viajero: lo que más cambiará serás tú".\\n—Sturwynn, arquero de las Tierras Fronterizas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659268&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'634759e5-22f0-4dd8-95c8-11b3644099de\', \'multiverseId\': 659268}, \'multiverseid\': 659268}, {\'name\': \'Étendues sauvages en évolution\', \'text\': \'{T}, sacrifiez les Étendues sauvages en évolution : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte de terrain de base, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille engagée, puis mélangez.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "« Les friches sont imprévisibles. Les rivières changent de lit, les arbres bougent et se penchent, les rochers se brisent et s\'enfuient. Mais rappelle-toi ces paroles, voyageur. Ce qui va le plus changer dans les friches, c\'est toi. »\\n—Sturwynn, ranger des terres frontalières", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659534&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'051001d8-fd14-4295-8f71-bdabea06d50e\', \'multiverseId\': 659534}, \'multiverseid\': 659534}, {\'name\': \'進化する未開地\', \'text\': \'{T}, 進化する未開地を生け贄に捧げる：あなたのライブラリーから基本土地・カード１枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「僻境は常に変化し続けるものだ。川は流れを変え、木は歩いたり曲がったりし、岩は割れたり走り回ったりする。だがこれだけは忘れるな、旅人よ。お前自身こそが、ここで変わる最たるものなのだ。」\\n――境界地のレインジャー、スターウィン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659800&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1029aaa5-4624-4d6c-a960-0233375a6459\', \'multiverseId\': 659800}, \'multiverseid\': 659800}, {\'name\': \'成形野地\', \'text\': \'{T}，牺牲成形野地：从你牌库中搜寻一张基本地牌，将之横置放进战场，然后洗牌。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'「诚然，幻野地势变幻多变：河流忽而改道，树木抽枝弯折，岩石开裂破碎。但旅人啊，请谨记我的话～在外会变的，主要是你自己。」\\n～边境地巡林客斯图温\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660066&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2769ac7d-80c3-406e-8fe1-8b5de5e12116\', \'multiverseId\': 660066}, \'multiverseid\': 660066}]', '[{\'name\': \'Siedefrost-Knoten\', \'text\': \'Sowie der Siedefrost-Knoten ins Spiel kommt, kannst du eine Insel- oder Gebirge-Karte aus deiner Hand offen vorzeigen. Falls du dies nicht tust, kommt der Siedefrost-Knoten getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U} oder {R}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Ein schwelender Sturm aus eiskaltem Feuer.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659008&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b436c74-5ce0-469e-a984-36f27914c2d8\', \'multiverseId\': 659008}, \'multiverseid\': 659008}, {\'name\': \'Maraña hervicongelada\', \'text\': \'En cuanto la Maraña hervicongelada entre al campo de batalla, puedes mostrar una carta de Isla o de Montaña de tu mano. Si no lo haces, la Maraña hervicongelada entra al campo de batalla girada.\\n{T}: Agrega {U} o {R}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Una tormenta ardiente de fuego gélido.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659274&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2cc6ddfc-2b8a-43c4-b109-c3e28d0dbed2\', \'multiverseId\': 659274}, \'multiverseid\': 659274}, {\'name\': \'Lacis pyrogel\', \'text\': "Au moment où le Lacis pyrogel arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez révéler une carte d\'île ou de montagne de votre main. Si vous ne le faites pas, le Lacis pyrogel arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U} ou {R}.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'Une tempête incandescente de feu glacé.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659540&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'616f5a84-81ca-4322-9eed-f44eece83281\', \'multiverseId\': 659540}, \'multiverseid\': 659540}, {\'name\': \'凍沸の交錯\', \'text\': \'凍沸の交錯が戦場に出るに際し、あなたの手札にあり島や山であるカード１枚を公開してもよい。そうしないなら、凍沸の交錯はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{U}か{R}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'凍てつく炎がくすぶる嵐。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659806&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b4ee775-ef20-4bf8-bc9e-ccc0f3bcc6a3\', \'multiverseId\': 659806}, \'multiverseid\': 659806}, {\'name\': \'霜沸魔旋\', \'text\': \'于霜沸魔旋进战场时，你可以从你手上展示一张海岛或山脉牌。如果你未如此作，则霜沸魔旋须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{U}或{R}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'寒冰火焰形成的闷燃风暴。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660072&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a03453e-9e8a-48d4-a55b-34445723b0e4\', \'multiverseId\': 660072}, \'multiverseid\': 660072}]', '[{\'name\': \'Silhana-Simskletterin\', \'text\': \'Fluchsicher (Diese Kreatur kann nicht das Ziel von Zaubersprüchen oder Fähigkeiten sein, die deine Gegner kontrollieren.)\\nDie Silhana-Simskletterin kann außer von fliegenden Kreaturen nicht geblockt werden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'Die Leute auf der Straße nennen sie „Dachmäuse", aber hinter der Neckerei steckt ein unausgesprochener Neid auf das Können der Simskletterer, jedem Ärger aus dem Weg zu gehen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658916&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5da06b8c-b93d-4295-8f04-af36ebbd86fb\', \'multiverseId\': 658916}, \'multiverseid\': 658916}, {\'name\': \'Andarrepisa silhana\', \'text\': \'Antimaleficio. (Esta criatura no puede ser objetivo de hechizos o habilidades que controlan tus oponentes.)\\nLa Andarrepisa silhana no puede ser bloqueada excepto por criaturas que tengan la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón elfo\', \'flavor\': \'En las calles los llaman "ratones de torres", pero las burlas esconden la envidia contenida por la habilidad de los andarrepisa para evitar el daño.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659182&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d226493f-8a21-49b4-b1da-d060d7dce8ca\', \'multiverseId\': 659182}, \'multiverseid\': 659182}, {\'name\': \'Marchesaillie silhana\', \'text\': \'Défense talismanique (Cette créature ne peut pas être la cible de sorts ou de capacités que vos adversaires contrôlent.)\\nLa Marchesaillie silhana ne peut pas être bloquée excepté par des créatures avec le vol.\', \'type\': \'Créature — elfe et gredin\', \'flavor\': \'Les gens de la rue les appellent « les souris des tours », mais en fait, ils envient cette incroyable aptitude des marchesaillies à rester en vie.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659448&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86d412f9-d6e7-4354-9494-3f30c21ef4e5\', \'multiverseId\': 659448}, \'multiverseid\': 659448}, {\'name\': \'シラナの岩礁渡り\', \'text\': \'呪禁（このクリーチャーは、呪文や能力であり対戦相手がコントロールしているものの対象にならない。）\\nシラナの岩礁渡りは飛行を持つクリーチャーにしかブロックされない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'町の人々は彼らを「尖塔ネズミ」と呼んでいるが、その嘲りの影には、災害を避ける技を持つ岩礁渡りに対する声に出されない羨みがある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659714&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04646b0b-0cca-4f76-b63a-409523a6716e\', \'multiverseId\': 659714}, \'multiverseid\': 659714}, {\'name\': \'西哈纳檐行者\', \'text\': \'辟邪（此生物不能成为由对手操控之咒语或异能的目标。）\\n西哈纳檐行者只能被具飞行异能的生物阻挡。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 妖精／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'市街居民称他们「高塔老鼠」，但藏在这谑称后面的，是对他们远灾避祸能力的忌妒。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659980&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5cc6e22-c2d3-43df-9b40-db87ed8bec0a\', \'multiverseId\': 659980}, \'multiverseid\': 659980}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sintflut-Urwesen\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn das Sintflut-Urwesen ins Spiel kommt, kannst du für jeden Gegner bis zu eine Spontanzauber- oder Hexereikarte deiner Wahl aus dessen Friedhof wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Falls ein Zauberspruch, der auf diese Weise gewirkt wurde, auf einen Friedhof gelegt würde, schicke ihn stattdessen ins Exil.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658806&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8e3eb0d-4b00-4dc1-b479-a376f065750b\', \'multiverseId\': 658806}, \'multiverseid\': 658806}, {\'name\': \'Primordial diluviano\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Primordial diluviano entre al campo de batalla, por cada oponente, puedes lanzar hasta una carta de instantáneo o de conjuro objetivo desde el cementerio de ese jugador sin pagar su coste de maná. Si un hechizo lanzado de esta manera fuera a ir a un cementerio, en vez de eso, exílialo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659072&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f4b4986-3935-4e20-be7a-7b63d3e17519\', \'multiverseId\': 659072}, \'multiverseid\': 659072}, {\'name\': \'Primordial diluvien\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand le Primordial diluvien arrive sur le champ de bataille, pour chaque adversaire, vous pouvez lancer jusqu\'à une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel ciblée depuis le cimetière de ce joueur sans payer son coût de mana. Si un sort lancé de cette manière devait être mis dans un cimetière, exilez-le à la place.", \'type\': \'Créature — avatar\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659338&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d54a9609-f98f-4c24-840c-f84cc9e27d31\', \'multiverseId\': 659338}, \'multiverseid\': 659338}, {\'name\': \'氾濫の始源体\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n氾濫の始源体が戦場に出たとき、各対戦相手につきそれぞれ、そのプレイヤーの墓地にありインスタントやソーサリーであるカード最大１枚を対象とする。あなたはそれをマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。これにより唱えた呪文が墓地に置かれるなら、代わりにそれを追放する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — アバター\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659604&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e724b03-18c8-4dbf-993a-da36497f383c\', \'multiverseId\': 659604}, \'multiverseid\': 659604}, {\'name\': \'洪水原祖\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当洪水原祖进战场时，为每位对手各进行以下流程～你可以从其坟墓场中施放至多一张目标瞬间或法术牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。若以此法施放的咒语将进入坟墓场，则改为将它放逐。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 圣者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659870&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27a06033-14a7-4b73-b030-e6a3b3a70fe1\', \'multiverseId\': 659870}, \'multiverseid\': 659870}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sonnen-Titan\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit\\nImmer wenn der Sonnen-Titan ins Spiel kommt oder angreift, kannst du eine Permanent-Karte deiner Wahl mit Manabetrag 3 oder weniger aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurückbringen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Riese\', \'flavor\': \'Eine brennende Sonne, die nie untergeht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658797&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3339984d-9939-4e39-add4-04e3dd084ea9\', \'multiverseId\': 658797}, \'multiverseid\': 658797}, {\'name\': \'Titán solar\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia.\\nSiempre que el Titán solar entre al campo de batalla o ataque, puedes regresar la carta de permanente objetivo con valor de maná de 3 o menos de tu cementerio al campo de batalla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'Un sol ardiente que nunca se pone.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659063&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c80f6e38-7519-4ad0-a8c7-efb35a497762\', \'multiverseId\': 659063}, \'multiverseid\': 659063}, {\'name\': \'Titan solaire\', \'text\': "Vigilance\\nÀ chaque fois que le Titan solaire arrive sur le champ de bataille ou qu\'il attaque, vous pouvez renvoyer sur le champ de bataille, depuis votre cimetière, une carte de permanent ciblée avec une valeur de mana inférieure ou égale à 3.", \'type\': \'Créature — géant\', \'flavor\': \'Un soleil brûlant qui ne se couche jamais.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659329&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa347876-6b6c-47a8-aa15-71c8767d4a76\', \'multiverseId\': 659329}, \'multiverseid\': 659329}, {\'name\': \'太陽のタイタン\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n太陽のタイタンが戦場に出るか攻撃するたび、あなたの墓地にありマナ総量が３以下であるパーマネント・カード１枚を対象とする。それを戦場に戻してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 巨人\', \'flavor\': \'沈まない燃え盛る太陽。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659595&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'898a0bb3-07e1-4381-9a52-53ab9100307d\', \'multiverseId\': 659595}, \'multiverseid\': 659595}, {\'name\': \'旭日泰坦\', \'text\': \'警戒\\n每当旭日泰坦进战场或攻击时，你可以将目标法术力值等于或小于3的永久物牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 巨人\', \'flavor\': \'永不落下的烈日。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659861&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32996505-ee31-4e9c-bff2-7174c38f5ac4\', \'multiverseId\': 659861}, \'multiverseid\': 659861}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sonnenheim, Festung der Legion\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{2}{R}{W}, {T}: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält Doppelschlag bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Sonnenheim — der robuste Schild, der alles überragende Wachposten, der Sitz der Gerechtigkeit.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659034&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39231215-0f0c-4bc5-8cef-1cde468e6142\', \'multiverseId\': 659034}, \'multiverseid\': 659034}, {\'name\': \'Casa Solar, base de la Legión\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{2}{R}{W}, {T}: La criatura objetivo gana la habilidad de dañar dos veces hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Casa Solar. El escudo inquebrantable, el centinela imponente, el trono de la justicia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659300&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74fb2bab-c160-4f39-8f50-3ccd3f2e1ea5\', \'multiverseId\': 659300}, \'multiverseid\': 659300}, {\'name\': \'Solcastel, forteresse de la Légion\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{2}{R}{W}, {T} : Une créature ciblée acquiert la double initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'Solcastel — le bouclier invincible, la sentinelle dominante, le siège de la justice.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659566&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a4b2552-2a9e-4e76-93d2-88c17380e6e8\', \'multiverseId\': 659566}, \'multiverseid\': 659566}, {\'name\': \'軍の要塞、サンホーム\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{2}{R}{W}, {T}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは二段攻撃を得る。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'サンホーム――頑強な盾であり、そびえ立つ歩哨であり、正義の座。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659832&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aff2b47d-8098-4e53-88fa-97936bd97863\', \'multiverseId\': 659832}, \'multiverseid\': 659832}, {\'name\': \'教团要塞阳园\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{2}{R}{W}，{T}：目标生物获得连击异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'阳园～威武的坚盾，耸立的守卫，正义的王座。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660098&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66c0cfde-45df-498b-b5de-1c12403c5463\', \'multiverseId\': 660098}, \'multiverseid\': 660098}]', "[{'name': 'Sonnenring', 'text': '{T}: Erzeuge {C}{C}.', 'type': 'Artefakt', 'flavor': 'Als das große Tresorgewölbe geknackt wurde, verstreute es seine Wunder über Thunder Junction.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658977&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bab40785-1e5a-4ab1-9cc9-ce27153c0ec0', 'multiverseId': 658977}, 'multiverseid': 658977}, {'name': 'Anillo solar', 'text': '{T}: Agrega {C}{C}.', 'type': 'Artefacto', 'flavor': 'Cuando la gran cámara se desmoronó, sus maravillas se esparcieron por Cruce de Truenos.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659243&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '599ee8e3-2b70-45a7-ada5-23b305bd0dab', 'multiverseId': 659243}, 'multiverseid': 659243}, {'name': 'Anneau solaire', 'text': '{T} : Ajoutez {C}{C}.', 'type': 'Artefact', 'flavor': 'Quand la grande chambre forte tomba, toutes ses merveilles furent éparpillées aux quatre coins de Croisetonnerre.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659509&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1809a8c1-d1a1-478f-b1c0-9828be59b036', 'multiverseId': 659509}, 'multiverseid': 659509}, {'name': '太陽の指輪', 'text': '{T}：{C}{C}を加える。', 'type': 'アーティファクト', 'flavor': '大宝物庫が崩落すると、そこに収められていた不思議がサンダー・ジャンクション全域に散り散りになった。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659775&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f4b0ed94-143f-4524-a674-2316724832b7', 'multiverseId': 659775}, 'multiverseid': 659775}, {'name': '阳光戒', 'text': '{T}：加{C}{C}。', 'type': '神器', 'flavor': '巨大宝库坠落时，其间奇珍亦随之散落光雷驿各地。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660041&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd05cf331-fa64-4f70-9308-e3bfb11fdf94', 'multiverseId': 660041}, 'multiverseid': 660041}]", '[{\'name\': \'Sonnenverbrannte Felskluft\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Erzeuge {R}{W}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Herrlichkeit erhebt sich über das trockene Land, ein Bollwerk am Horizont gegen das Banale, eine Felskluft, die Inspiration aus Stillstand schneidet.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659036&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5382f104-3066-428f-8c67-d13713149f93\', \'multiverseId\': 659036}, \'multiverseid\': 659036}, {\'name\': \'Cruce abrasador\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}: Agrega {R}{W}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'La majestuosidad que se alza sobre la árida tierra, un bastión en el horizonte contra lo mundano, una división que separa la inspiración del estancamiento.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659302&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c52167fc-dcb2-4f64-8e35-29316215378d\', \'multiverseId\': 659302}, \'multiverseid\': 659302}, {\'name\': \'Ligne de Partage brûlée par le soleil\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T} : Ajoutez {R}{W}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Une splendeur jaillissant au-dessus des étendues arides, un horizon se dressant en rempart contre l\'ordinaire, une ligne séparant l\'inspiration de la stagnation.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659568&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6bcc4ab5-e3b0-4e40-8d21-5e2af9302eb0\', \'multiverseId\': 659568}, \'multiverseid\': 659568}, {\'name\': \'日照りの渓谷\', \'text\': \'{1}, {T}：{R}{W}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'乾燥した土地を見下ろす威厳。凡庸の中にそびえ立つ地平線のような防壁。それは停滞から刺激を切り出した分割線である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659834&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3d75715-f1dc-4cd0-8fbb-f970d4b2d41a\', \'multiverseId\': 659834}, \'multiverseid\': 659834}, {\'name\': \'日灼分岭\', \'text\': \'{1}，{T}：加{R}{W}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'这是耸立苍茫旱野上的威严高岭，是点缀平凡大地的矗耸视界，是激活停滞思绪的跃动灵感。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660100&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4212c832-ab31-44e1-b3bc-d994ed36f4b8\', \'multiverseId\': 660100}, \'multiverseid\': 660100}]', '[{\'name\': \'Spiegelwesen\', \'text\': \'Wandelwicht (Diese Karte hat alle Kreaturentypen.)\\n{X}: Bis zum Ende des Zuges haben Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft X/X und erhalten alle Kreaturentypen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Gestaltwandler\', \'flavor\': \'Es ist sich der Vielfalt an Arten in Lorwyn nicht bewusst und sieht immer nur sich, tausendfach widergespiegelt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658793&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfaf7a2d-29d7-4b27-943b-3965c3aabca1\', \'multiverseId\': 658793}, \'multiverseid\': 658793}, {\'name\': \'Entidad del espejo\', \'text\': \'Cambiaformas. (Esta carta es de todos los tipos de criatura.)\\n{X}: Hasta el final del turno, las criaturas que controlas tienen una fuerza y resistencia base de X/X y ganan todos los tipos de criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Metamorfo\', \'flavor\': \'Ignorante de la diversidad de Lorwyn, solo se ve a sí mismo, reflejado miles de veces.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659059&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d5a72a2-0dc1-4ff9-ac4b-6c22eee8f981\', \'multiverseId\': 659059}, \'multiverseid\': 659059}, {\'name\': \'Entité miroir\', \'text\': "Changelin (Cette carte a tous les types de créature.)\\n{X} : Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, les créatures que vous contrôlez ont une force et une endurance de base de X/X et acquièrent tous les types de créature.", \'type\': \'Créature — changeforme\', \'flavor\': "Ignorant la diversité de Lorwyn, il ne voit que son propre reflet démultiplié à l\'infini.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659325&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e6a21e9-ac90-4daa-808b-ca6b8c19f8c8\', \'multiverseId\': 659325}, \'multiverseid\': 659325}, {\'name\': \'鏡の精体\', \'text\': \'多相（このカードはすべてのクリーチャー・タイプである。）\\n{X}：ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは、基本のパワーとタフネスがＸ/Ｘになり、すべてのクリーチャー・タイプを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 多相の戦士\', \'flavor\': \'それはローウィンの多様さを気にもかけず、自分自身のみを見て、その反射を何千回も投げかける。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659591&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'919d61a7-0b94-4b0c-81a2-f51adda008cc\', \'multiverseId\': 659591}, \'multiverseid\': 659591}, {\'name\': \'镜身灵\', \'text\': \'化形（此牌是所有生物类别。）\\n{X}：直到回合结束，由你操控的生物之基础力量与防御力为X/X且获得所有生物类别。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 变形兽\', \'flavor\': \'它没察觉洛温的多彩样貌，视线中只有自己投向自己、反射千遍的视线。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659857&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57c6a3c3-40d7-4f04-8704-46ed656c6fd0\', \'multiverseId\': 659857}, \'multiverseid\': 659857}]', '[{\'name\': \'Steckbrief-Anschlagtafel\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\\n{1}, {T}: Lege eine Kopfgeldmarke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur mit Kopfgeldmarke stirbt, zieht jeder Gegner ihres Beherrschers eine Karte und erhält 2 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658389&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14194838-db24-4845-89c7-99a0ee5e7299\', \'multiverseId\': 658389}, \'multiverseid\': 658389}, {\'name\': \'Tablón de recompensas\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color.\\n{1}, {T}: Pon un contador de recompensa sobre la criatura objetivo. Activa esto solo como un conjuro.\\nSiempre que una criatura con un contador de recompensa sobre ella muera, cada uno de los oponentes de su controlador roba una carta y gana 2 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658421&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'898b65e9-7303-4711-903c-c23384a3b840\', \'multiverseId\': 658421}, \'multiverseid\': 658421}, {\'name\': \'Panneau des primes\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix.\\n{1}, {T} : Mettez un marqueur « prime » sur une créature ciblée. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature avec un marqueur « prime » sur elle meurt, chacun des adversaires de son contrôleur pioche une carte et gagne 2 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658453&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa0601fa-2a25-4a3d-81eb-b79f5f8b5d39\', \'multiverseId\': 658453}, \'multiverseid\': 658453}, {\'name\': \'賞金首の掲示板\', \'text\': \'{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\\n{1}, {T}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に賞金カウンター１個を置く。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。\\n賞金カウンターが置かれているクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、それのコントローラーの各対戦相手はそれぞれカード１枚を引き、２点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658485&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea9f1c83-afa1-48b5-82e0-10f73d4d8048\', \'multiverseId\': 658485}, \'multiverseid\': 658485}, {\'name\': \'悬赏板\', \'text\': \'{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力。\\n{1}，{T}：在目标生物上放置一个赏金指示物。只能于法术时机起动。\\n每当一个其上有赏金指示物的生物死去时，其操控者的每位对手各抓一张牌且各获得2点生命。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658517&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f60ac350-8fa8-4107-b982-921ef709d712\', \'multiverseId\': 658517}, \'multiverseid\': 658517}]', '[{\'name\': \'Steckbrief-Anschlagtafel\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\\n{1}, {T}: Lege eine Kopfgeldmarke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit wie eine Hexerei.\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur mit Kopfgeldmarke stirbt, zieht jeder Gegner ihres Beherrschers eine Karte und erhält 2 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660197&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a471aa5a-de79-4133-9966-7f8e040b253d\', \'multiverseId\': 660197}, \'multiverseid\': 660197}, {\'name\': \'Panneau des primes\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix.\\n{1}, {T} : Mettez un marqueur « prime » sur une créature ciblée. N\'activez que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature avec un marqueur « prime » sur elle meurt, chacun des adversaires de son contrôleur pioche une carte et gagne 2 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660229&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c948929-348b-4a62-9cde-9740e382cee6\', \'multiverseId\': 660229}, \'multiverseid\': 660229}, {\'name\': \'賞金首の掲示板\', \'text\': \'{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\\n{1}, {T}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それの上に賞金カウンター１個を置く。起動はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。\\n賞金カウンターが置かれているクリーチャー１体が死亡するたび、それのコントローラーの各対戦相手はそれぞれカード１枚を引き、２点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660261&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4385fef8-7ead-48c5-801b-1fde75845591\', \'multiverseId\': 660261}, \'multiverseid\': 660261}, {\'name\': \'悬赏板\', \'text\': \'{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力。\\n{1}，{T}：在目标生物上放置一个赏金指示物。只能于法术时机起动。\\n每当一个其上有赏金指示物的生物死去时，其操控者的每位对手各抓一张牌且各获得2点生命。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660293&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb13bbc6-5ed0-4de3-acd8-4281c0ca0058\', \'multiverseId\': 660293}, \'multiverseid\': 660293}]', '[{\'name\': \'Stella Lee, Ass im Ärmel\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du deinen zweiten Zauberspruch innerhalb desselben Zuges wirkst, schicke die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek ins Exil. Du kannst sie bis zum Ende deines nächsten Zuges spielen.\\n{T}: Kopiere einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei deiner Wahl, den bzw. die du kontrollierst. Du kannst neue Ziele für die Kopie bestimmen. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls du in diesem Zug drei oder mehr Zaubersprüche gewirkt hast.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Mensch, Räuber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658287&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0666810-efd8-4cb3-8c7b-7dfbce7939af\', \'multiverseId\': 658287}, \'multiverseid\': 658287}, {\'name\': \'Stella Lee, el comodín\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances tu segundo hechizo cada turno, exilia la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Hasta el final de tu próximo turno, puedes jugar esa carta.\\n{T}: Copia el hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro objetivo que controlas. Puedes elegir nuevos objetivos para la copia. Activa esto solo si lanzaste tres o más hechizos este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Bribón humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658291&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbc70a9c-c638-4777-bb3b-a4e017815a4f\', \'multiverseId\': 658291}, \'multiverseid\': 658291}, {\'name\': "Stella Lee, l\'élément imprévisible", \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez votre deuxième sort à chaque tour, exilez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Jusqu\'à la fin de votre prochain tour, vous pouvez jouer cette carte.\\n{T} : Copiez un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel ciblé que vous contrôlez. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour cette copie. N\'activez que si vous avez lancé au moins trois sorts ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — humain et gredin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658295&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e90c5552-05f9-42e2-878c-21a682d22fe3\', \'multiverseId\': 658295}, \'multiverseid\': 658295}, {\'name\': \'破天荒、ステラ・リー\', \'text\': \'あなたが各ターン内のあなたの２つ目の呪文を唱えるたび、あなたのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を追放する。次のあなたのターンの終了時まで、そのカードをプレイしてもよい。\\n{T}：あなたがコントロールしていてインスタントやソーサリーである呪文１つを対象とする。それをコピーする。そのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。このターンにあなたが３つ以上の呪文を唱えていなければ起動できない。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 人間・ならず者\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658299&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d374b177-33a6-47fe-82bc-628140a6e46c\', \'multiverseId\': 658299}, \'multiverseid\': 658299}, {\'name\': \'狂野王牌史黛拉李\', \'text\': \'每当你施放每回合中你的第二个咒语时，放逐你的牌库顶牌。直到你下一个回合的回合结束，你可以使用该牌。\\n{T}：复制目标由你操控的瞬间或法术咒语。你可以为该复制品选择新的目标。只能于你施放过三个或更多咒语的回合中起动。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 人类／浪客\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658303&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8711dd1f-9f01-4b27-ad1b-672f56d954b0\', \'multiverseId\': 658303}, \'multiverseid\': 658303}]', '[{\'name\': \'Stinkende Heide\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}.\\n{W/B}, {T}: Erzeuge {W}{W}, {W}{B} oder {B}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Dies ist kein Ort für dich, mein Kind. Dort tanzen die Gwyllion. Wenn sie dich finden, wirst du für alle Zeiten mit ihnen feiern."\\n—Talara, elfische Sichermacherin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659005&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5614c07-2c85-451f-8a50-949838445b9b\', \'multiverseId\': 659005}, \'multiverseid\': 659005}, {\'name\': \'Brezal fétido\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}.\\n{W/B}, {T}: Agrega {W}{W}, {W}{B} o {B}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"No te detengas en esos lugares, niño. Allí bailan las gwyllion. Si te encuentran, te unirás a su danza por toda la eternidad".\\n—Talara, refugiante élfica\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659271&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c74b8eb-fcb2-4738-a1ed-4f44248d8947\', \'multiverseId\': 659271}, \'multiverseid\': 659271}, {\'name\': \'Lande fétide\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {C}.\\n{W/B}, {T} : Ajoutez {W}{W}, {W}{B} ou {B}{B}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "« Ne t\'attarde pas en ces lieux, mon enfant. C\'est là que dansent les gwyllion. S\'ils te trouvent, tu devras les joindre dans leurs célébrations pour l\'éternité. »\\n—Talara, protecturge elfe", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659537&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec29374a-ddff-431b-b6cc-e9af16eb9160\', \'multiverseId\': 659537}, \'multiverseid\': 659537}, {\'name\': \'悪臭の荒野\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}を加える。\\n{W/B}, {T}：{W}{W}か{W}{B}か{B}{B}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「こんな場所にいつまでもいてはいけないよ、坊や。あそこでグウィリオンが踊っているだろう。見つかったら、お前も永遠の大騒ぎの仲間になるのだよ。」\\n――エルフの守美者、タララ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659803&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07dee111-e222-4e13-a1df-1ac9d3a8efa9\', \'multiverseId\': 659803}, \'multiverseid\': 659803}, {\'name\': \'恶臭荒原\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}。\\n{W/B}，{T}：加{W}{W}，{W}{B}或{B}{B}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'「孩子，别到这种地方逗留。山妪在此狂舞，如果给她们发现，就永远无法脱离这场欢宴。」\\n～妖精美境卫塔萝拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660069&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f5f3372-f413-404f-b147-95ae2f094df9\', \'multiverseId\': 660069}, \'multiverseid\': 660069}]', '[{\'name\': \'Stunde der Verheißung\', \'text\': \'Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach bis zu zwei Länderkarten, bringe sie getappt ins Spiel und mische danach. Falls du dann drei oder mehr Wüsten kontrollierst, erzeuge zwei 2/2 schwarze Zombie-Kreaturenspielsteine.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Das Hekma fiel und die Schrecken der Splitterwüste erhoben sich.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658905&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e38e48d-fe63-4f9a-a5ec-8f9a3bcf4c41\', \'multiverseId\': 658905}, \'multiverseid\': 658905}, {\'name\': \'La Hora de la Promesa\', \'text\': \'Busca en tu biblioteca hasta dos cartas de tierra, ponlas en el campo de batalla giradas y luego baraja. Luego, si controlas tres o más Desiertos, crea dos fichas de criatura Zombie negras 2/2.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Con la Hekma quebrada y su protección anulada, los desiertos lo barrieron todo a su paso.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659171&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e58148a-f419-430f-be31-6aa292639b0b\', \'multiverseId\': 659171}, \'multiverseid\': 659171}, {\'name\': "L\'Âge de la Promesse", \'text\': "Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque jusqu\'à deux cartes de terrain, mettez-les sur le champ de bataille engagées, puis mélangez. Ensuite, si vous contrôlez au moins trois déserts, créez deux jetons de créature 2/2 noire Zombie.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "La protection de l\'Hekma dissipée suite à l\'ouverture de la brèche, le désert fit irruption dans la ville.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659437&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ff3a032b-9c65-44b7-8584-01b08f98fd8d\', \'multiverseId\': 659437}, \'multiverseid\': 659437}, {\'name\': \'約束の刻\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーから土地・カード最大２枚を探し、タップ状態で戦場に出す。その後、ライブラリーを切り直す。その後、あなたが３つ以上の砂漠をコントロールしているなら、黒の２/２のゾンビ・クリーチャー・トークン２体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'ヘクマが破れ保護が失われると、砂漠が襲来した。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659703&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13b196b0-6b0b-4676-9cda-1d3dc616285b\', \'multiverseId\': 659703}, \'multiverseid\': 659703}, {\'name\': \'允诺时刻\', \'text\': \'从你牌库中搜寻至多两张地牌，将它们横置放进战场，然后洗牌。然后如果你操控三个或更多沙漠，则派出两个2/2黑色灵俑衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'避世帘消失，屏障不复存在，沙漠席卷而入。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659969&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6bd6b742-f0ee-4c0b-a27b-be1ac1175f67\', \'multiverseId\': 659969}, \'multiverseid\': 659969}]', '[{\'name\': \'Stunde des Raubtiers\', \'text\': \'Bis zum Ende des Zuges erhalten Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, Bedrohlichkeit und „Immer wenn diese Kreatur einem Spieler Kampfschaden zufügt, schicke die oberste Karte der Bibliothek jenes Spielers verdeckt ins Exil. Solange die Karte im Exil bleibt, kannst du sie anschauen und sie spielen, und um den Zauberspruch zu wirken, kannst du Mana ausgeben, als wäre es Mana beliebiger Farbe."\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658857&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'880deb94-630b-4309-90ac-5cacc4bcb3d2\', \'multiverseId\': 658857}, \'multiverseid\': 658857}, {\'name\': \'Hora de los depredadores\', \'text\': \'Hasta el final del turno, las criaturas que controlas ganan la habilidad de amenaza y "Siempre que esta criatura haga daño de combate a un jugador, exilia boca abajo la primera carta de la biblioteca de ese jugador. Mientras esa carta permanezca exiliada, puedes mirarla, jugarla y usar maná como si fuera maná de cualquier color para lanzar ese hechizo".\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659123&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cacef742-d0ec-4a62-b1c1-a2983addfd06\', \'multiverseId\': 659123}, \'multiverseid\': 659123}, {\'name\': \'Heure du prédateur\', \'text\': "Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, les créatures que vous contrôlez acquièrent la menace et « À chaque fois que cette créature inflige des blessures de combat à un joueur, exilez la carte du dessus de la bibliothèque de ce joueur face cachée. Vous pouvez regarder et jouer cette carte tant qu\'elle reste exilée, et vous pouvez dépenser du mana comme s\'il s\'agissait de mana de n\'importe quelle couleur pour lancer ce sort. »", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659389&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8453c839-09ac-4911-81d8-79c3fe0d53fa\', \'multiverseId\': 659389}, \'multiverseid\': 659389}, {\'name\': \'捕食者の刻\', \'text\': \'ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているすべてのクリーチャーは威迫と「このクリーチャーがプレイヤー１人に戦闘ダメージを与えるたび、そのプレイヤーのライブラリーの一番上にあるカード１枚を裏向きで追放する。そのカードが追放され続けているかぎり、あなたはそれを見てもプレイしてもよく、あなたはその呪文を唱えるためのマナを任意の色のマナであるかのように支払って唱えてもよい。」を得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659655&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2a425ad-a0ee-44b4-a98a-a1acdbcacd6e\', \'multiverseId\': 659655}, \'multiverseid\': 659655}, {\'name\': \'掠食时刻\', \'text\': \'直到回合结束，由你操控的生物获得威慑与「每当此生物对任一牌手造成战斗伤害时，牌面朝下地放逐该牌手的牌库顶牌。于该牌持续放逐的时段内，你可以检视并使用该牌，且你可以将法术力视同任意颜色的法术力来施放该咒语。」\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659921&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7def9d5-16ca-4551-9edf-404f96291574\', \'multiverseId\': 659921}, \'multiverseid\': 659921}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sturmofenkünstler\', \'text\': \'Der Sturmofenkünstler erhält +1/+0 für jedes Artefakt, das du kontrollierst.\\nMagiefertigkeit — Immer wenn du einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkst oder kopierst, erzeuge einen Schatz-Spielstein.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zwerg, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'Ein gefangenes Elementarwesen ist eine starke, wenn auch instabile, Energiequelle.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658891&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2fda774a-705c-4a52-bce5-ce3062dd0eff\', \'multiverseId\': 658891}, \'multiverseid\': 658891}, {\'name\': \'Artesano hornotormenta\', \'text\': \'El Artesano hornotormenta obtiene +1/+0 por cada artefacto que controlas.\\nHechicería — Siempre que lances o copies un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro, crea una ficha de Tesoro.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán enano\', \'flavor\': \'Un elemental capturado es una fuente de energía potente, pero inestable.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659157&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07629aa2-803b-40e0-acbd-8b51cc386896\', \'multiverseId\': 659157}, \'multiverseid\': 659157}, {\'name\': \'Artiste au four à tempête\', \'text\': "L\'Artiste au four à tempête gagne +1/+0 pour chaque artefact que vous contrôlez.\\nSorcellerie — À chaque fois que vous lancez ou copiez un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel, créez un jeton Trésor.", \'type\': \'Créature — nain et shamane\', \'flavor\': "Un élémental capturé peut devenir une source d\'énergie puissante, mais instable.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659423&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb410cce-3679-4d20-a17b-d0150db64a02\', \'multiverseId\': 659423}, \'multiverseid\': 659423}, {\'name\': \'嵐窯の芸術家\', \'text\': \'嵐窯の芸術家は、あなたがコントロールしているアーティファクト１つにつき＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\\n魔技 ― あなたがインスタントやソーサリーである呪文１つを唱えるかコピーするたび、宝物・トークン１つを生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドワーフ・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'捕らえた精霊は不安定ながら良好な魔法資源になる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659689&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21b39fa5-7a15-4018-afd3-a04ca0c7ad76\', \'multiverseId\': 659689}, \'multiverseid\': 659689}, {\'name\': \'暴风窑艺家\', \'text\': \'你每操控一个神器，暴风窑艺家便得+1/+0。\\n魔艺～每当你施放或复制瞬间或法术咒语时，派出一个珍宝衍生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 矮人／祭师\', \'flavor\': \'捕捉到的元素虽不稳定，但能够成为强大的能量来源。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659955&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ce0e449f-6d70-4015-91bf-35d5fb8f49ac\', \'multiverseId\': 659955}, \'multiverseid\': 659955}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sturzflug auf die Sünder\', \'text\': \'Schicke alle Kreaturen ins Exil.\\nDelirium — Erzeuge einen 4/4 weißen Engel-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit, falls dein Friedhof vier oder mehr unterschiedliche Kartentypen enthält.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Ein Ausruf übertönte all die Schreie: „Ihr werdet alle errettet."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658790&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dadc711d-6246-4ec2-a262-52e9d0908707\', \'multiverseId\': 658790}, \'multiverseid\': 658790}, {\'name\': \'Descender sobre los pecadores\', \'text\': \'Exilia todas las criaturas.\\nDelirio — Crea una ficha de criatura Ángel blanca 4/4 con la habilidad de volar si entre las cartas de tu cementerio hay cuatro o más tipos de cartas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Por encima de los gritos se escuchó una frase: "La salvación les llegará a todos".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659056&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8975744f-2349-4805-93fd-30109a648d60\', \'multiverseId\': 659056}, \'multiverseid\': 659056}, {\'name\': \'Fondre sur les pécheurs\', \'text\': "Exilez toutes les créatures.\\nDélire — Créez un jeton de créature 4/4 blanche Ange avec le vol s\'il y a au moins quatre types de carte parmi les cartes de votre cimetière.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Une phrase s\'élevait au-dessus des cris : « Vous serez tous sauvés. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659322&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22521856-05cb-4f7f-bfc9-ea34135b0d10\', \'multiverseId\': 659322}, \'multiverseid\': 659322}, {\'name\': \'罪人への急襲\', \'text\': \'すべてのクリーチャーを追放する。\\n昂揚 ― あなたの墓地にあるカードの中に４種類以上のカード・タイプがあるなら、飛行を持つ白の４/４の天使・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'悲鳴の上から声が聞こえた。「汝らはみな救われるであろう。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659588&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c309624e-9117-4106-9f5f-7fc6a6bff322\', \'multiverseId\': 659588}, \'multiverseid\': 659588}, {\'name\': \'天降惩恶\', \'text\': \'放逐所有生物。\\n躁狂～如果你坟墓场中牌的牌张类别有四种或更多，则派出一个4/4白色，具飞行异能的天使衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'喧闹之中，天上传来贯耳明音：「尔等都将得救赎。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659854&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9153822b-01ca-4d9f-923f-4e082b311218\', \'multiverseId\': 659854}, \'multiverseid\': 659854}]', '[{\'name\': \'Sumpfland-Blutmagierin\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\n{1}{B}, {T}: Statt die Manakosten des nächsten Zauberspruchs zu bezahlen, den du in diesem Zug wirkst, kannst du Lebenspunkte in Höhe des Manabetrags des Zauberspruchs bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir, Hexenmeister\', \'flavor\': \'Blutmagie ist mehr Aderlass als Wissenschaft.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658849&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47fbb4c8-6e43-47b8-8648-c9165c2b18cc\', \'multiverseId\': 658849}, \'multiverseid\': 658849}, {\'name\': \'Conjurasangre del pantano\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\n{1}{B}, {T}: En lugar de pagar el coste de maná del siguiente hechizo que lances este turno, puedes pagar una cantidad de vidas igual al valor de maná de ese hechizo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Brujo vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'La magia de sangre mana más que la ciencia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659115&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d616c40-66bb-4e50-a143-ce2aa12fe8a5\', \'multiverseId\': 659115}, \'multiverseid\': 659115}, {\'name\': \'Magesang des marais\', \'text\': \'Vol\\n{1}{B}, {T} : Plutôt que payer le coût de mana du prochain sort que vous lancez ce tour-ci, vous pouvez payer un nombre de points de vie égal à la valeur de mana de ce sort.\', \'type\': \'Créature — vampire et psychagogue\', \'flavor\': "La magie du sang est plus une question d\'artère que de science.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659381&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e3f0b5d-bf6f-4597-9b35-afbc16f0e77b\', \'multiverseId\': 659381}, \'multiverseid\': 659381}, {\'name\': \'湿地帯の血唱え\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n{1}{B}, {T}：このターン次にあなたが唱える呪文のマナ・コストを支払うのではなく、その呪文のマナ総量に等しい点数のライフを支払ってもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・邪術師\', \'flavor\': \'血の魔法は術というよりも脈である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659647&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6bd1c95-b8d2-4c70-a5db-c46cafb7eba0\', \'multiverseId\': 659647}, \'multiverseid\': 659647}, {\'name\': \'沼地鲜血法师\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n{1}{B}，{T}：对你本回合施放的下一个咒语而言，你可以支付等同于其法术力值的生命，而不支付其法术力费用。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 吸血鬼／邪术师\', \'flavor\': \'鲜血魔法比自然科学更令人血脉贲张。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659913&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c452bfbe-f35e-4ad5-8dc4-fd1bf41bf45a\', \'multiverseId\': 659913}, \'multiverseid\': 659913}]', '[{\'name\': \'Säer des Vergessens\', \'text\': \'Wenn du diesen Zauberspruch wirkst, schickt ein Gegner deiner Wahl die obersten vier Karten seiner Bibliothek ins Exil, dann kannst du eine beliebige Anzahl an Länderkarten, die jener Spieler besitzt, aus dem Exil unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel bringen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Die Eldrazi gieren ohne jedes Maß und verzehren ohne jedes Zögern.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658787&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8aadc245-3be9-4836-ae72-9c0a448a16e7\', \'multiverseId\': 658787}, \'multiverseid\': 658787}, {\'name\': \'Sembrador del olvido\', \'text\': \'Cuando lances este hechizo, el oponente objetivo exilia las cuatro primeras cartas de su biblioteca y luego puedes poner en el campo de batalla bajo tu control cualquier cantidad de cartas de tierra del exilio de las que ese jugador sea propietario.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Los Eldrazi padecen un hambre sin medida y devoran sin cesar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659053&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b9c288c-81cc-4a04-b197-3b1a5b978393\', \'multiverseId\': 659053}, \'multiverseid\': 659053}, {\'name\': "Semeur de l\'oubli", \'text\': "Quand vous lancez ce sort, un adversaire ciblé exile les quatre cartes du dessus de sa bibliothèque, puis vous pouvez mettre sur le champ de bataille depuis l\'exil, sous votre contrôle, n\'importe quel nombre de cartes de terrain que ce joueur possède.", \'type\': \'Créature — eldrazi\', \'flavor\': \'Les Eldrazi ont une faim sans limites et dévorent sans répit.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659319&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca01e547-4118-4fc2-a344-401809cbbe03\', \'multiverseId\': 659319}, \'multiverseid\': 659319}, {\'name\': \'忘却蒔き\', \'text\': \'あなたがこの呪文を唱えたとき、対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは自分のライブラリーの一番上にあるカード４枚を追放する。その後、あなたは追放領域にありそのプレイヤーがオーナーである望む枚数の土地・カードを、あなたのコントロール下で戦場に出してもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルドラージ\', \'flavor\': \'エルドラージの飢餓は底なし。矢継ぎ早に食らい尽くす。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659585&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'489a82ba-f20f-4f0e-85f4-e002c3145341\', \'multiverseId\': 659585}, \'multiverseid\': 659585}, {\'name\': \'夺忆恶体\', \'text\': \'当你施放此咒语时，目标对手放逐其牌库顶的四张牌，然后你可以将任意数量由该牌手拥有的地牌在你操控下从放逐区放进战场。\', \'type\': \'生物 — 奥札奇\', \'flavor\': \'奥札奇饥渴无度，吞噬不绝。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659851&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1a292c6-e1e5-4fdd-bb86-14f497b69ea4\', \'multiverseId\': 659851}, \'multiverseid\': 659851}]', '[{\'name\': \'Talrand der Himmelsbeschwörer\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkst, erzeuge einen 2/2 blauen Sceada-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Meervolk, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Ozeane sind riesig, doch der Himmel ist noch größer. Warum sollte ich mich mit einem Königreich zufrieden geben, wo ich doch über beide herrschen kann?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658826&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfd6500d-2cfa-4b91-a76d-d8912f10e616\', \'multiverseId\': 658826}, \'multiverseid\': 658826}, {\'name\': \'Talrand, invocador celeste\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro, crea una ficha de criatura Draco azul 2/2 con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Hechicero tritón\', \'flavor\': \'"Los mares son vastos, pero los cielos lo son más todavía. ¿Por qué contentarse con un reino si puedes dominar ambos?".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659092&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'211300da-ca34-46e0-abb5-b0a81d8ad71f\', \'multiverseId\': 659092}, \'multiverseid\': 659092}, {\'name\': \'Talrand, invocateur céleste\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel, créez un jeton de créature 2/2 bleue Drakôn avec le vol.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire — ondin et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« La mer est vaste, mais bien moins que le ciel. Pourquoi se contenter d\'un royaume quand je peux régner sur les deux ? »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659358&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'044371ea-d478-4de4-af85-c483d0eb64f6\', \'multiverseId\': 659358}, \'multiverseid\': 659358}, {\'name\': \'空召喚士ターランド\', \'text\': \'あなたがインスタントやソーサリーである呪文１つを唱えるたび、飛行を持つ青の２/２のドレイク・クリーチャー・トークン１体を生成する。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — マーフォーク・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「海は広大だが、空はそれ以上に広大だ。その両方を統べることができるなら、なぜひとつの王国に満足しようか？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659624&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14f8c5ad-9244-4270-b813-67c9a6812b3d\', \'multiverseId\': 659624}, \'multiverseid\': 659624}, {\'name\': \'空召师陶岚\', \'text\': \'每当你施放瞬间或法术咒语时，派出一个2/2蓝色，具飞行异能的龙兽衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 — 人鱼／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「大海浩瀚，但天空更加无际。如果我能同时统治两者，又何必只安于其一？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659890&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3b5e060-7816-49f5-9886-2959a5485a63\', \'multiverseId\': 659890}, \'multiverseid\': 659890}]', '[{\'name\': \'Tapfere Haltung\', \'text\': \'Bestimme eines —\\n• Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält Unzerstörbarkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges. (Schaden und Effekte, die „zerstören", zerstören sie nicht.)\\n• Zerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl mit Widerstandskraft 4 oder mehr.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Jede Entscheidung beeinflusst den Pfad des Schicksals."\\n—Sarkhan Vol\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=658798&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e34daa2-a6eb-43df-b179-4935f8a0b943\', \'multiverseId\': 658798}, \'multiverseid\': 658798}, {\'name\': \'Postura valerosa\', \'text\': \'Elige uno:\\n• La criatura objetivo gana la habilidad de indestructible hasta el final del turno. (El daño y los efectos que dicen "destruir" no la destruyen.)\\n• Destruye la criatura objetivo con resistencia de 4 o más.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Cada elección altera la senda del destino".\\n—Sarkhan Vol\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659064&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ebf85a99-94b3-4044-9624-977d118d5da4\', \'multiverseId\': 659064}, \'multiverseid\': 659064}, {\'name\': \'Posture valeureuse\', \'text\': "Choisissez l\'un —\\n• Une créature ciblée acquiert l\'indestructible jusqu\'à la fin du tour. (Les blessures et les effets qui disent « détruisez » ne la détruisent pas.)\\n• Détruisez une créature ciblée d\'endurance supérieure ou égale à 4.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Chaque décision modifie le cours du destin. »\\n—Sarkhan Vol\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659330&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75f5b183-5d4e-4ddf-b9de-7597a3bff0b4\', \'multiverseId\': 659330}, \'multiverseid\': 659330}, {\'name\': \'勇敢な姿勢\', \'text\': \'以下から１つを選ぶ。\\n・クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは破壊不能を得る。（ダメージや「破壊」と書かれた効果では、それは破壊されない。）\\n・タフネスが４以上であるクリーチャー１体を対象とする。それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「すべての選択は、運命の道筋を変える。」\\n――サルカン・ヴォル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659596&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ff72a03-a6d4-4fa6-bddc-b8f71bc66a01\', \'multiverseId\': 659596}, \'multiverseid\': 659596}, {\'name\': \'英勇以对\', \'text\': \'选择一项～\\n•目标生物获得不灭异能直到回合结束。（伤害与注明「消灭」的效应不会将它消灭。）\\n•消灭目标防御力等于或大于4的生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「每个选择都会影响命途走向。」\\n～萨坎沃\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659862&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f309a2b-6e27-49ac-9c64-58b4f6452362\', \'multiverseId\': 659862}, \'multiverseid\': 659862}]', "[{'name': 'Tempel der Bosheit', 'text': 'Der Tempel der Bosheit kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn der Tempel der Bosheit ins Spiel kommt, wende Hellsicht 1 an.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B} oder {R}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659041&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ed495aac-50d5-4114-b675-640f6cbd0772', 'multiverseId': 659041}, 'multiverseid': 659041}, {'name': 'Templo de la malicia', 'text': 'El Templo de la malicia entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Templo de la malicia entre al campo de batalla, adivina 1.\\n{T}: Agrega {B} o {R}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659307&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dd64bde0-68af-412e-bd78-bbc5f5377811', 'multiverseId': 659307}, 'multiverseid': 659307}, {'name': 'Temple de la malice', 'text': 'Le Temple de la malice arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Temple de la malice arrive sur le champ de bataille, regard 1.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B} ou {R}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659573&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '24edbf18-bf2c-4fd6-87fd-8796f934adc6', 'multiverseId': 659573}, 'multiverseid': 659573}, {'name': '悪意の神殿', 'text': '悪意の神殿はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n悪意の神殿が戦場に出たとき、占術１を行う。\\n{T}：{B}か{R}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659839&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'df53c5be-d74f-4ca9-b44d-11a517cfa0af', 'multiverseId': 659839}, 'multiverseid': 659839}, {'name': '恶意殿堂', 'text': '恶意殿堂须横置进战场。\\n当恶意殿堂进战场时，占卜1。\\n{T}：加{B}或{R}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660105&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5b92affd-903d-44a5-bb07-3d63799a40ac', 'multiverseId': 660105}, 'multiverseid': 660105}]", "[{'name': 'Tempel der Eingebung', 'text': 'Der Tempel der Eingebung kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn der Tempel der Eingebung ins Spiel kommt, wende Hellsicht 1 an.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U} oder {R}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659039&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5834e2e2-4851-4a94-bef0-c3e79dead49b', 'multiverseId': 659039}, 'multiverseid': 659039}, {'name': 'Templo de la epifanía', 'text': 'El Templo de la epifanía entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Templo de la epifanía entre al campo de batalla, adivina 1.\\n{T}: Agrega {U} o {R}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659305&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '34771a14-923f-4440-b2c5-8f1a47130613', 'multiverseId': 659305}, 'multiverseid': 659305}, {'name': 'Temple de la révélation', 'text': 'Le Temple de la révélation arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Temple de la révélation arrive sur le champ de bataille, regard 1.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U} ou {R}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659571&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd0c196ac-e383-4880-9430-7d244d908d65', 'multiverseId': 659571}, 'multiverseid': 659571}, {'name': '天啓の神殿', 'text': '天啓の神殿はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n天啓の神殿が戦場に出たとき、占術１を行う。\\n{T}：{U}か{R}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659837&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '21fbd047-3e9c-424a-92b4-3dada9facdd7', 'multiverseId': 659837}, 'multiverseid': 659837}, {'name': '顿悟殿堂', 'text': '顿悟殿堂须横置进战场。\\n当顿悟殿堂进战场时，占卜1。\\n{T}：加{U}或{R}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660103&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4e5e8021-1aae-409b-ad65-42eee4377155', 'multiverseId': 660103}, 'multiverseid': 660103}]", "[{'name': 'Tempel der Geheimnisse', 'text': 'Der Tempel der Geheimnisse kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn der Tempel der Geheimnisse ins Spiel kommt, wende Hellsicht 1 an.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {G} oder {U}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659042&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ca704c85-e0b6-4297-82e7-fe96e7648d46', 'multiverseId': 659042}, 'multiverseid': 659042}, {'name': 'Templo del misterio', 'text': 'El Templo del misterio entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Templo del misterio entre al campo de batalla, adivina 1.\\n{T}: Agrega {G} o {U}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659308&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7192f23b-9c22-4c75-8a56-ed30d5a31b02', 'multiverseId': 659308}, 'multiverseid': 659308}, {'name': 'Temple du mystère', 'text': 'Le Temple du mystère arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Temple du mystère arrive sur le champ de bataille, regard 1.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {G} ou {U}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659574&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b1b4c3c8-3345-4b24-a682-e851f4c0cc6b', 'multiverseId': 659574}, 'multiverseid': 659574}, {'name': '神秘の神殿', 'text': '神秘の神殿はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n神秘の神殿が戦場に出たとき、占術１を行う。\\n{T}：{G}か{U}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659840&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1eb99d74-01be-4788-9418-dcee4b5e01b0', 'multiverseId': 659840}, 'multiverseid': 659840}, {'name': '神秘殿堂', 'text': '神秘殿堂须横置进战场。\\n当神秘殿堂进战场时，占卜1。\\n{T}：加{G}或{U}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660106&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cc69b280-5cec-4a68-acbe-2b31072b9810', 'multiverseId': 660106}, 'multiverseid': 660106}]", "[{'name': 'Tempel der Täuschung', 'text': 'Der Tempel der Täuschung kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn der Tempel der Täuschung ins Spiel kommt, wende Hellsicht 1 an.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {U} oder {B}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659038&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f8a7437e-9219-46c8-9a0f-4d2903611e61', 'multiverseId': 659038}, 'multiverseid': 659038}, {'name': 'Templo del engaño', 'text': 'El Templo del engaño entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Templo del engaño entre al campo de batalla, adivina 1.\\n{T}: Agrega {U} o {B}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659304&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e72de9fd-81f2-4532-a4dc-dc25df762ea9', 'multiverseId': 659304}, 'multiverseid': 659304}, {'name': 'Temple de la tromperie', 'text': 'Le Temple de la tromperie arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Temple de la tromperie arrive sur le champ de bataille, regard 1.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {U} ou {B}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659570&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ff4cf598-5e4a-49bd-ad13-75382f8972c8', 'multiverseId': 659570}, 'multiverseid': 659570}, {'name': '欺瞞の神殿', 'text': '欺瞞の神殿はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n欺瞞の神殿が戦場に出たとき、占術１を行う。\\n{T}：{U}か{B}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659836&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1b74e0d5-18b1-4bc1-babb-0b2c8e44f829', 'multiverseId': 659836}, 'multiverseid': 659836}, {'name': '诡诈殿堂', 'text': '诡诈殿堂须横置进战场。\\n当诡诈殿堂进战场时，占卜1。\\n{T}：加{U}或{B}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660102&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a025e900-ad37-4e91-85eb-780ae7ef0ae5', 'multiverseId': 660102}, 'multiverseid': 660102}]", '[{\'name\': \'Tempel der falschen Göttin\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {C}{C}. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur, falls du fünf oder mehr Länder kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn die Götter teilnahmslos werden, beginnen die Leute jeden anzubeten, der sie erhört."\\n—Kiora\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659044&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'206703b6-8c78-43ad-94b6-24c6491751c4\', \'multiverseId\': 659044}, \'multiverseid\': 659044}, {\'name\': \'Templo de la diosa falsa\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {C}{C}. Activa esto solo si controlas cinco o más tierras.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"Cuando los dioses caen en la apatía, la gente venera a quienquiera que responda a sus plegarias".\\n—Kiora\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659310&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6177f746-73c7-4640-80a7-8710f66c4894\', \'multiverseId\': 659310}, \'multiverseid\': 659310}, {\'name\': \'Temple de la fausse divinité\', \'text\': "{T} : Ajoutez {C}{C}. N\'activez que si vous contrôlez au moins cinq terrains.", \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'« Quand les dieux deviennent indifférents, les gens vénèrent quiconque répond à leurs supplications. »\\n—Kiora\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659576&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d4ba5ff-adaf-4f6e-a2fd-17ac16cefe4a\', \'multiverseId\': 659576}, \'multiverseid\': 659576}, {\'name\': \'邪神の寺院\', \'text\': \'{T}：{C}{C}を加える。あなたが５つ以上の土地をコントロールしていなければ起動できない。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「神々が無関心となった時、人々は自分たちの嘆願を聞き入れてくれる者ならば何でも崇拝するようになるのね。」\\n――キオーラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659842&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d09f7858-9c17-4070-8cd9-908011942a01\', \'multiverseId\': 659842}, \'multiverseid\': 659842}, {\'name\': \'伪神殿堂\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{C}{C}。只能于你操控五个或更多地时起动。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'「当神灵没有回应时，凡人会把任何能够应答其祈求者当作神。」\\n～奇奥拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=660108&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2fdda3c9-b135-4bcd-8fc5-fa45c663e3cc\', \'multiverseId\': 660108}, \'multiverseid\': 660108}]', "[{'name': 'Tempel des Schweigens', 'text': 'Der Tempel des Schweigens kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\nWenn der Tempel des Schweigens ins Spiel kommt, wende Hellsicht 1 an.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {W} oder {B}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659043&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '21f81179-df0c-4c7f-800a-6190323c8b51', 'multiverseId': 659043}, 'multiverseid': 659043}, {'name': 'Templo del silencio', 'text': 'El Templo del silencio entra al campo de batalla girado.\\nCuando el Templo del silencio entre al campo de batalla, adivina 1.\\n{T}: Agrega {W} o {B}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659309&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '186ae67f-9fc1-42fd-85e9-07f93efaa505', 'multiverseId': 659309}, 'multiverseid': 659309}, {'name': 'Temple du silence', 'text': 'Le Temple du silence arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\nQuand le Temple du silence arrive sur le champ de bataille, regard 1.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {W} ou {B}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659575&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7787d10e-e738-4b97-a478-152f5f5ce1b0', 'multiverseId': 659575}, 'multiverseid': 659575}, {'name': '静寂の神殿', 'text': '静寂の神殿はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n静寂の神殿が戦場に出たとき、占術１を行う。\\n{T}：{W}か{B}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=659841&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2b49aa78-d5e2-4373-a102-8051f6c60712', 'multiverseId': 659841}, 'multiverseid': 659841}, {'name': '静寂殿堂', 'text': '静寂殿堂须横置进战场。\\n当静寂殿堂进战场时，占卜1。\\n{T}：加{W}或{B}。', 'type': 